":"מיזוטאקי: עוף מבושל במרק עוף לבן וסמיך עם ירקות, טובלים בפונזו, ובסוף דייסת אורז במרק.","dishes":["מיזוטאקי","זוסוי (דייסת אורז לסיום)"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher":"friendly","kosher_note":"סיר עוף בלי חזיר, לבדוק שאין פירות ים במנות הצד.","address":"1-1 Hakataekichuogai, Hakata-ku, Fukuoka","opens":"11:00","closes":"22:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":75,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"קומה 10 בקואוטן של JR Hakata City, צהריים זולים","baby_block":null,"tags":["mizutaki","chicken hot pot","hot pot","chicken soup","nabe","zosui","ponzu","chicken","מיזוטאקי","סיר עוף","סיר חם","מרק עוף","נאבה","זוסוי","פונזו","עוף"],"en":{"hype":"Mizutaki, chicken hot pot in a thick white broth, on the top floor of Hakata Station.","reality":"Good mizutaki with no hunting around, open all day and easy before a train. Less atmosphere than the old houses.","tip":"Drink the broth first on its own with a little salt, then eat the chicken.","baby_notes":"Kids welcome, on the station building's restaurant floor with lifts.","price":"Lunch ¥2,000-3,000, dinner ¥4,000-5,000 per person","serves":"Mizutaki: chicken simmered in thick white chicken broth with vegetables, dipped in ponzu, rice porridge at the end.","dishes":["Mizutaki","Zosui (rice porridge to finish)"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":"A chicken pot with no pork, check side dishes for seafood.","plan_line":"10F Kuuten, JR Hakata City, lunch is cheaper","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
