ic and original cocktails.","dishes":["Cocktails"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Sundays, cards JCB/AMEX/Diners only","baby_block":"Smoky, adults-only bar"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kushida Shrine","name_ja":"櫛田神社","city":"fukuoka","area":"Hakata","category":"sight","lat":33.593,"lng":130.4106,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המקדש הראשי של האקאטה, הבית של פסטיבל יאמאקאסה, ועומד בו כל השנה מצוף ענק ומקושט.","reality":"מקדש קטן וחמוד באמצע העיר, עוברים בו בעשרים דקות. המצוף המקושט, בגובה של כמה קומות, הוא הסיבה האמיתית לבוא.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כניסה חינם","tip":"לשלב עם טוצ׳וג׳י, שופוקוג׳י ובית המוזיאון הסמוך באותו סיבוב רגלי.","sources":["https://www.crossroadfukuoka.jp/en/spot/12510","https://www.gltjp.com/en/directory/item/12747/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חצר שטוחה ופתוחה, אפשר להסתובב עם עגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kushida%20Shrine%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים מהשער, עוברים בין מבני המקדש ונעצרים מול מצוף היאמאקאסה המקושט. מסתכלים על עץ הגינקו הישן ושותים מהבאר של המקדש.","special":"המצוף המקושט נשאר מוצג במקדש רוב השנה, גם מחוץ לפסטיבל של יולי.","highlights":["מצוף יאמאקאסה מקושט","עץ גינקו עתיק","הבאר של המקדש"],"time_needed":"20-30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-41 Kamikawabatamachi, Hakata-ku, Fukuoka","opens":"04:00","closes":"22:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לראות את מצוף היאמאקאסה הענק שעומד בחצר רוב השנה","baby_block":null,"tags":["shrine","shinto","yamakasa","festival float","float","ginkgo","מקדש","מקדשים","שינטו","יאמאקאסה","מצוף","פסטיבל","גינקו","torii","טורי"],"en":{"hype":"Hakata's main shrine, home of the Yamakasa festival, with a towering decorated float on show most of the year.","reality":"A small, pleasant shrine in the middle of town, done in twenty minutes. The decorated float, several storeys high, is the real reason to come.","tip":"Pair it with Tochoji, Shofukuji and the folk museum next door on one walk.","baby_notes":"Flat open grounds, fine with a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk in through the gate, past the shrine halls, and stop in front of the decorated Yamakasa float. Look at the old ginkgo and drink from the shrine well.","special":"The decorated float stays on display most of the year, not just during the July festival.","highlights":["Decorated Yamakasa float","Old ginkgo tree","Shrine well"],"time_needed":"20-30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Don't miss the giant Yamakasa float in the grounds","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Tochoji Temple","name_ja":"東長寺","city":"fukuoka","area":"Hakata","category":"sight","lat":33.596,"lng":130.413,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש בודהיסטי עתיק עם פסל הבודהה הישוב העשוי עץ הגדול ביפן, 16 מטר.","reality":"הבודהה באולם מרשים באמת. מתחתיו יש מסדרון חשוך לגמרי של \"גיהנום וגן עדן\" שהולכים בו ביד על המעקה, קצר ומפתיע.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"החצר חינם, אולם הבודהה בתשלום סמלי","tip":"אסור לצלם באולם הבודהה ובמסדרון.","sources":["https://www.crossroadfukuoka.jp/en/spot/12556","https://japancheapo.com/place/tocho-ji-temple/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"המסדרון מתחת לבודהה חשוך וצר, עדיף לעבור בו עם התינוק במנשא ולא בעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tochoji%20Temple%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בחצר עם הפגודה האדומה, עולים לאולם של הבודהה הגדול ויורדים למסדרון החשוך שמתחתיו.","special":"פסל הבודהה הישוב העשוי עץ הגדול ביפן, והמקדש נחשב לוותיק מסוגו ביפן, מתחילת המאה ה-9.","highlights":["הבודהה הגדול מעץ","מסדרון הגיהנום וגן העדן","הפגודה האדומה"],"time_needed":"30-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-4 Gokushomachi, Hakata-ku, Fukuoka","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"אולם הבודהה נסגר ב-16:45, להגיע לפני","baby_block":null,"tags":["temple","buddhist","buddha","great buddha","pagoda","statue","מקדש בודהיסטי","בודהה","פסל","פגודה","מקדשים","daibutsu","דאיבוטסו","שינגון","shingon"],"en":{"hype":"An old Buddhist temple with Japan's largest seated wooden Buddha, 16 metres tall.","reality":"The Buddha hall is genuinely impressive. Under it is a pitch-black \"hell and paradise\" corridor you walk with a hand on the rail, short and surprising.","tip":"No photos in the Buddha hall or the corridor.","baby_notes":"The corridor under the Buddha is dark and narrow, better with the baby in a carrier than a stroller.","price":"Grounds free, small fee for the Buddha hall","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk past the red pagoda, go up to the Great Buddha hall and down into the dark corridor beneath it.","special":"Japan's largest seated wooden Buddha, at a temple dating to the early 800s.","highlights":["Great wooden Buddha","Hell and paradise corridor","Red pagoda"],"time_needed":"30-45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"The Buddha hall closes at 16:45, arrive before","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Shofukuji Temple","name_ja":"聖福寺","city":"fukuoka","area":"Hakata","category":"sight","lat":33.5985,"lng":130.414,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש הזן הראשון ביפן, מתחם גדול ושקט של שבילי אבן וחומות ישנות.","reality":"רוב המבנים סגורים למבקרים, אז מסתובבים בעיקר בשבילים מבחוץ. השקט והירוק באמצע העיר שווים את ההליכה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"להגיע מצד ג׳וטנג׳י וללכת דרך הסמטאות שבין המקדשים.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4804.html","https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/聖福寺_(福岡市)"],"audience":"