ll,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"סירות הברבור עובדות רק ממרץ עד תחילת נובמבר, בדצמבר אין.","sources":["https://www.ohorikouen.jp/en/","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4805.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שביל סלול ושטוח סביב האגם, ויש גן שעשועים מוצל לפעוטות בצד המערבי.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ohori%20Park%20Fukuoka","website_url":"https://www.ohorikouen.jp/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים את הסיבוב סביב האגם או חוצים אותו על הגשרים דרך האיים, עוצרים לקפה על המים וממשיכים לגן היפני או למוזיאון האמנות שבצד הדרומי.","special":"שביל ההליכה עובר על המים דרך האיים, ככה שאפשר לחצות את האגם באמצע ולא רק להקיף.","highlights":["הגשרים דרך האיים","שביל ההליכה סביב האגם","גן השעשועים הצפוני והמערבי"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-2 Ohorikoen, Chuo-ku, Fukuoka","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"תחנת סאבווי Ohori-koen ממש ליד, לבוא בבוקר","baby_block":null,"tags":["park","lake","pond","walk","walking path","jogging","bridges","playground","פארק","אגם","הליכה","שביל הליכה","גשרים","גן שעשועים","טבע","ריצה"],"en":{"hype":"A big lake in the middle of the city with a 2 km path around it and little islands joined by bridges.","reality":"The locals' favourite park, not an attraction but a place to walk. On a sunny morning with a coffee it's exactly what you need after days of city.","tip":"The swan boats only run March to early November, none in December.","baby_notes":"Paved flat path around the lake, and a shaded playground for toddlers on the west side.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the loop or cross the lake on the bridges through the islands, stop for coffee by the water, then on to the Japanese garden or the art museum on the south side.","special":"The path runs across the water through the islands, so you can cut through the middle instead of just going round.","highlights":["Bridges through the islands","Lakeside path","Children's playgrounds"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Ohori-koen subway station is right there, come in the morning","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Ohori Park Japanese Garden","name_ja":"大濠公園日本庭園","city":"fukuoka","area":"Ohori & Momochi","category":"sight","lat":33.583,"lng":130.377,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גן יפני מסורתי עם בריכה, מפל וגן אבנים יבש, בפינה הדרומית של פארק אוהורי.","reality":"גן יפה ושקט, ומכיוון שהוא חדש יחסית הוא פחות עמוק מגנים בקיוטו. במחיר ¥250 הוא שווה עצירה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥250 למבוגר","tip":"בסוף נובמבר ובתחילת דצמבר המייפלים אדומים, זה הזמן הכי יפה.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4805.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים של חצץ ואבנים, עגלה עוברת בחלק מהם, עדיף מנשא.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ohori%20Park%20Japanese%20Garden%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים בשביל סביב הבריכה, עוברים על אבני המעבר ליד המפל ויושבים מול גן האבנים היבש.","special":"שלושה סוגי גנים במקום אחד: גן בריכה, גן אבנים יבש וגן תה.","highlights":["בריכה עם קוי","מפל","גן אבנים יבש"],"time_needed":"30-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-7 Ohorikoen, Chuo-ku, Fukuoka","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני, לשלב עם הסיבוב סביב האגם","baby_block":null,"tags":["garden","japanese garden","zen garden","rock garden","pond","koi","waterfall","maple","גן","גן יפני","גן זן","גן אבנים","בריכה","קוי","מפל","מייפל","שלכת"],"en":{"hype":"A traditional Japanese garden with a pond, waterfall and dry stone garden, at the south corner of Ohori Park.","reality":"Pretty and quiet, and since it's fairly new it feels less deep than Kyoto gardens. At ¥250 it's worth a stop.","tip":"Late November and early December the maples are red, the best time.","baby_notes":"Gravel and stone paths, a stroller gets through some of it, a carrier is better.","price":"¥250 per adult","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the path around the pond, cross the stepping stones by the waterfall and sit facing the dry garden.","special":"Three garden types in one: pond garden, dry stone garden and tea garden.","highlights":["Koi pond","Waterfall","Dry stone garden"],"time_needed":"30-45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays, pair it with the lake loop","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Fukuoka Art Museum","name_ja":"福岡市美術館","city":"fukuoka","area":"Ohori & Momochi","category":"sight","lat":33.584,"lng":130.379,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון האמנות של העיר על שפת אגם אוהורי, עם דאלי, מירו, וורהול ואמנות יפנית ישנה.","reality":"אוסף טוב ומגוון בבניין מודרני ונעים, והאוסף הקבוע זול מאוד. גם הדלעת של קוסאמה יאיוי בחוץ שווה תמונה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"האוסף הקבוע ¥200","tip":"בבית הקפה של המוזיאון יש חלונות גדולים מול האגם.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4805.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"בניין מונגש עם מעליות, נוח עם עגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fukuoka%20Art%20Museum%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין הגלריות של האמנות המודרנית והיפנית, ויוצאים לרחבה עם הפסלים מול האגם.","special":"שילוב של יצירות מערביות מוכרות לצד אוסף של אמנות בודהיסטית ויפנית עתיקה, במחיר סמלי.","highlights":["דאלי ומירו","הדלעת של קוסאמה","אמנות בודהיסטית"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-6 Ohorikoen, Chuo-ku, Fukuoka","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:30","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-28","2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני ומ-28 בדצמבר, טוב ליום גשום","baby_block":null,"tags":["museum","art museum","modern art","dali","warhol","kusama","pumpkin","gallery","rainy day","מוזיאון","מוזיאון אמנות","אמנות","אמנות מודרנית","דאלי","קוסאמה","דלעת","גלריה","יום גשום"],"en":{"hype":"The city art museum on Ohori lake, with Dali, Miro, Warhol and old Japanese art.","reality":"A good, varied collection in a pleasant modern building, and the permanent collection is very cheap. Kusama Yayoi's pumpkin outside is worth a photo too.","tip":"The museum cafe has big windows over the lake.","baby_notes":"Accessible building with lifts, easy with a stroller.","price":"Permanent collection ¥200","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the modern and Japanese galleries, then out to the sculpture terrace facing the lake.","special":"Well-known Western works next to old Buddhist and Japanese art, for a token price.","highlights":["Dali and Miro","Kusama pumpkin","Buddhist art"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays and from Dec 28, good on a rainy day","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Fukuoka Castle Ruins","name_ja":"福岡城跡","city":"fukuoka","area":"Ohori & Momochi","category":"sight","lat":33.585,"lng":130.383,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"חומות האבן הענקיות של הטירה של שליטי פוקואוקה, על גבעה ליד פארק אוהורי.","reality":"אין כאן טירה, רק חומות, שערים ומגדל שמירה אחד. מי שמצפה לטירה כמו באוסקה יתאכזב, אבל העלייה לבסיס המגדל הראשי נותנת נוף יפה על העיר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"לעלות עד בסיס המגדל הראשי (טנשוּדאי), שם התצפית.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4806.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"הרבה מדרגות אבן בעלייה לבסיס המגדל, עם עגלה אפשר רק בחלק התחתון.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fukuoka%20Castle%20Ruins%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים בין החומות, עוברים ליד מגדל השמירה ועולים במדרגות לבסיס המגדל הראשי לתצפית על פוקואוקה.","special":"החומות עצומות ושלמות, ומלמעלה רואים את העיר, את אגם אוהורי ואת הים.","highlights":["חומות האבן","בסיס המגדל הראשי","נוף על העיר"],"time_needed":"45 דקות-שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1 Jonai, Chuo-ku, Fukuoka","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":50,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לא לצפות לטירה, באים בשביל החומות והנוף מלמעלה","baby_block":"מדרגות אבן לתצפית, אין דרך עם עגלה","tags":["castle","castle ruins","stone walls","history","samurai","view","park","טירה","חורבות","חומות","היסטוריה","סמוראים","תצפית","נוף","פארק"],"en":{"hype":"The huge stone walls of the Fukuoka lords' castle, on a hill next to Ohori Park.","reality":"No castle here, just walls, gates and one turret. Anyone expecting an Osaka-style castle will be let down, but the climb to the keep base gives a good city view.","tip":"Climb to the main keep base (tenshudai), that's where the view is.","baby_notes":"Lots of stone steps up to the keep base, a stroller only works on the lower part.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk in between the walls, past the turret, and up the steps to the keep base for a view over Fukuoka.","special":"The walls are massive and intact, and from the top you see the city, Ohori lake and the sea.","highlights":["Stone walls","Main keep base","City view"],"time_needed":"45 minutes-1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Don't expect a castle, come for the walls and the view from the top","baby_block":"Stone steps to the lookout, no stroller route"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Fukuoka Tower","name_ja":"福岡タワー","city":"fukuoka","area":"Ohori & Momochi","category":"sight","lat":33.5933,"lng":130.3515,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מגדל זכוכית של 234 מטר על חוף מומוצ׳י, עם תצפית בגובה 123 מטר על העיר והים.","reality":"הנוף טוב, בעיקר בשקיעה כשהשמש יורדת לים. אבל זה רחוק מהמרכז ולא שווה נסיעה רק בשבילו, לשלב עם החוף.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,000 למבוגר","tip":"להגיע לפני השקיעה ולהישאר עד שהעיר נדלקת.","sources":["https://www.fukuokatower.co.jp/en/","https://www.fukuokatower.co.jp/charge/","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4801.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעליות עד התצפית, נוח עם עגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fukuoka%20Tower%20Fukuoka","website_url":"https://www.fukuokatower.co.jp/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במעלית לקומת התצפית, מקיפים את 360 המעלות ויורדים לחוף מומוצ׳י שלמטה.","special":"המגדל הכי גבוה ביפן על חוף ים, ובערב החזית שלו מוארת בתאורה מתחלפת.","highlights":["שקיעה על הים","נוף לילה על העיר","חוף מומוצ׳י למטה"],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-3-26 Momochihama, Sawara-ku, Fukuoka","opens":"09:30","closes":"22:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לבוא לשקיעה, ולשלב עם הליכה בחוף מומוצ׳י","baby_block":null,"tags":["tower","observation deck","view","night view","sunset","skyline","beach","מגדל","תצפית","נוף","נוף לילה","שקיעה","קו רקיע","חוף","ים"],"en":{"hype":"A 234 m glass tower on Momochi beach, with an observation deck at 123 m over the city and sea.","reality":"The view is good, especially at sunset over the sea. But it's far from the centre and not worth the trip on its own, do it with the beach.","tip":"Come before sunset and stay until the city lights up.","baby_notes":"Lifts all the way up, easy with a stroller.","price":"¥1,000 per adult","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Take the lift to the deck, walk the full 360 degrees and head down to Momochi beach below.","special":"Japan's tallest seaside tower, and at night its face lights up in changing colours.","highlights":["Sunset over the sea","Night city view","Momochi beach below"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Come for sunset, pair it with a walk on Momochi beach","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Momochi Seaside Park","name_ja":"シーサイドももち海浜公園","city":"fukuoka","area":"Ohori & Momochi","category":"sight","lat":33.595,"lng":130.353,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"חוף חול מלאכותי מתחת למגדל פוקואוקה, עם טיילת ומבנה מסעדות על אי קטן.","reality":"בחורף זה לא מקום לשחות אלא לטייל בשקיעה. נעים, אבל לא שווה נסיעה רק בשבילו.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"מהאי מאריזון יוצאת מעבורת לאומינונאקאמיצ׳י, 20 דקות. בדצמבר-פברואר רק בסופי שבוע.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4801.html","https://rurubu.jp/andmore/spot/80038327"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"טיילת סלולה לאורך החוף, נוח עם עגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Momochi%20Seaside%20Park%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים בטיילת לאורך החוף, נכנסים לאי מאריזון עם המסעדות, ובסוף עולים למגדל לשקיעה.","special":"חוף עירוני שקט עם מגדל פוקואוקה ברקע, עשר דקות ממרכז העיר באוטובוס.","highlights":["טיילת החוף","האי מאריזון","שקיעה עם המגדל"],"time_needed":"45 דקות-שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-902-1 Jigyohama, Chuo-ku, Fukuoka","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":50,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לבוא לפני השקיעה ולסיים במגדל פוקואוקה","baby_block":null,"tags":["beach","seaside","promenade","sunset","sand","sea","park","חוף","חוף ים","טיילת","שקיעה","חול","ים","פארק"],"en":{"hype":"A man-made sand beach below Fukuoka Tower, with a promenade and a small island of restaurants.","reality":"In winter it's not for swimming but for a sunset walk. Pleasant, but not worth a trip on its own.","tip":"A ferry runs from Marizon island to Uminonakamichi, 20 minutes. Dec-Feb weekends only.","baby_notes":"Paved promenade along the beach, easy with a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the beach promenade, go over to Marizon island with its restaurants, and finish up the tower for sunset.","special":"A calm city beach with Fukuoka Tower behind it, ten minutes from the centre by bus.","highlights":["Beach promenade","Marizon island","Sunset with the tower"],"time_needed":"45 minutes-1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Come before sunset and end at Fukuoka Tower","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Fukuoka City Museum","name_ja":"福岡市博物館","city":"fukuoka","area":"Ohori & Momochi","category":"sight","lat":33.589,"lng":130.35,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון ההיסטוריה של העיר, שבו מוצג חותם הזהב, אוצר לאומי מלפני כאלפיים שנה.","reality":"האוסף הקבוע מסודר טוב וזול, וחותם הזהב קטן מאוד אבל מרתק. לאוהבי היסטוריה, וטוב ליום גשום.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"האוסף הקבוע ¥200","tip":"עשר דקות הליכה ממגדל פוקואוקה, לשלב באותו יום.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4801.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"בניין גדול ומונגש, נוח עם עגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fukuoka%20City%20Museum%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בתערוכה הקבועה לפי התקופות, עוצרים מול חותם הזהב ומסתכלים על החנית המפורסמת של שליטי פוקואוקה.","special":"חותם הזהב שנמצא באי שיקאנושימה הוא מהעדויות הראשונות לקשר בין יפן לסין, ומוצג כאן במקור.","highlights":["חותם הזהב","החנית ניהונגו","היסטוריה של האקאטה"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-1-1 Momochihama, Sawara-ku, Fukuoka","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:30","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-28","2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני ומ-28 בדצמבר","baby_block":null,"tags":["museum","history museum","history","gold seal","national treasure","samurai","spear","rainy day","מוזיאון","מוזיאון היסטוריה","היסטוריה","חותם הזהב","אוצר לאומי","סמוראים","יום גשום"],"en":{"hype":"The city history museum, home of the Gold Seal, a national treasure from about 2,000 years ago.","reality":"The permanent show is well laid out and cheap, and the Gold Seal is tiny but fascinating. For history fans, and good on a rainy day.","tip":"Ten minutes on foot from Fukuoka Tower, do both the same day.","baby_notes":"Large accessible building, easy with a stroller.","price":"Permanent collection ¥200","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the permanent show by period, stop at the Gold Seal and see the famous spear of the Fukuoka lords.","special":"The Gold Seal found on Shikanoshima island is among the earliest evidence of Japan-China ties, shown here in the original.","highlights":["Gold Seal","Nihongo spear","Hakata history"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays and from Dec 28","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Yusentei Park","name_ja":"友泉亭公園","city":"fukuoka","area":"Ohori & Momochi","category":"sight","lat":33.573,"lng":130.36,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"וילה לשעבר של שליטי פוקואוקה מ-1754, היום גן יפני עם בריכה ובתי תה.","reality":"גן יפה ושקט, ומי שמגיע לכאן מוצא את עצמו כמעט לבד. אבל הוא רחוק מהסאבווי, 20 דקות הליכה או אוטובוס.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥200 למבוגר","tip":"מתחנת צ׳איאמה הולכים כ-20 דקות, נוח יותר באוטובוס 12 עד התחנה Yusentei.","sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/友泉亭公園"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים סביב הבריכה, חלקם אבנים, עדיף מנשא.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Yusentei%20Park%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מקיפים את הבריכה הגדולה בשביל, עוברים בין פנסי האבן והעצים הישנים וליד שני בתי התה.","special":"פנסי האבן, הסלעים והעצים הישנים נשארו מהווילה של משפחת קורודה, וכמעט אין בו תיירים.","highlights":["בריכה גדולה","פנסי אבן ועצים ישנים","שלכת בתחילת דצמבר"],"time_needed":"45 דקות-שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-46 Yusentei, Johnan-ku, Fukuoka","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":50,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני, להגיע באוטובוס 12 עד התחנה Yusentei","baby_block":null,"tags":["garden","japanese garden","tea house","pond","maple","autumn leaves","stone lanterns","quiet","גן","גן יפני","בית תה","בריכה","מייפל","שלכת","פנסי אבן","שקט"],"en":{"hype":"A former villa of the Fukuoka lords from 1754, now a Japanese garden with a pond and tea houses.","reality":"A lovely quiet garden, you'll likely have it nearly to yourselves. But it's far from the subway, 20 minutes on foot or a bus.","tip":"From Chayama station it's about 20 minutes on foot, easier by bus 12 to the Yusentei stop.","baby_notes":"Paths around the pond, some stone, a carrier is better.","price":"¥200 per adult","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the path around the big pond, between the stone lanterns and old trees, past the two tea houses.","special":"The stone lanterns, rocks and old trees remain from the Kuroda family villa, and there are almost no tourists.","highlights":["Big pond","Stone lanterns and old trees","Maples in early December"],"time_needed":"45 minutes-1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays, take bus 12 to the Yusentei stop","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Dazaifu Tenmangu","name_ja":"太宰府天満宮","city":"fukuoka","area":"Around Fukuoka","category":"sight","lat":33.5215,"lng":130.535,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המקדש הגדול של מלומד מהמאה ה-9 שהפך לאל הלימודים, עם גשרים אדומים מעל בריכה ורחוב מקדש מלא חנויות.","reality":"יפה ושווה, אבל עמוס מאוד בסופי שבוע ובשעות הצהריים. כשמגיעים מוקדם בבוקר זה מקום אחר לגמרי.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כניסה חינם","tip":"להגיע לפני 9:00 ולהתחיל ברחוב המקדש לפני שהאוטובוסים מגיעים.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4851.html","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4850.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים רחבים וסלולים, הגשרים המקושתים תלולים קצת עם עגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Dazaifu%20Tenmangu%20Fukuoka","website_url":"https://www.dazaifutenmangu.or.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים ברחוב המקדש מהתחנה, חוצים את שלושת הגשרים האדומים מעל הבריכה ומגיעים לאולם הראשי. מסיימים בחורשת עצי השזיף מאחור.","special":"כ-6,000 עצי שזיף במתחם, והאולם הראשי חזר לפעול אחרי שיפוץ גדול שהסתיים במאי 2026.","highlights":["שלושת הגשרים האדומים","האולם הראשי המשופץ","שור הברונזה למזל"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"4-7-1 Saifu, Dazaifu, Fukuoka","opens":"06:30","closes":"18:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"להגיע לפני 9:00, אחר כך מתמלא בקבוצות","baby_block":null,"tags":["shrine","tenmangu","shinto","plum","plum trees","bridges","students","day trip","מקדש","שינטו","שזיף","עצי שזיף","גשרים","סטודנטים","טיול יום","דזאיפו","dazaifu"],"en":{"hype":"The great shrine of a 9th-century scholar who became the god of learning, with red bridges over a pond and a busy shrine street.","reality":"Beautiful and worth it, but very crowded on weekends and around midday. Come early morning and it's a different place.","tip":"Arrive before 9:00 and do the shrine street before the tour buses.","baby_notes":"Wide paved paths, the arched bridges are a bit steep with a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the shrine street from the station, cross the three red bridges over the pond to the main hall, and finish in the plum grove behind it.","special":"About 6,000 plum trees in the grounds, and the main hall reopened after a big renovation finished in May 2026.","highlights":["Three red bridges","Renovated main hall","Bronze lucky ox"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Arrive before 9:00, tour groups fill it after","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kyushu National Museum","name_ja":"九州国立博物館","city":"fukuoka","area":"Around Fukuoka","category":"sight","lat":33.519,"lng":130.538,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בניין זכוכית גלי ענק על הגבעה מאחורי דזאיפו טנמנגו, על הקשרים של יפן עם אסיה לאורך ההיסטוריה.","reality":"הבניין עצמו מרשים, והתערוכה הקבועה טובה אבל ארוכה. מי שלא חובב היסטוריה יסתפק במנהרה, בלובי ובשעה בתערוכה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"מגיעים מהמקדש דרך מנהרה עם מסוע נע ותאורה בצבעים, חלק מהכיף.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4850.html","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4851.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מסוע נע ומעליות מהמקדש עד המוזיאון, נוח מאוד עם עגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kyushu%20National%20Museum%20Fukuoka","website_url":"https://www.kyuhaku.jp/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים מהמקדש במנהרה הצבעונית, עוברים בלובי הענק ונכנסים לתערוכה הקבועה בקומה הרביעית.","special":"התערוכה מספרת את ההיסטוריה של יפן דרך הקשרים עם קוריאה, סין ודרום מזרח אסיה, ואפשר לקנות כרטיס משולב עם מוזיאוני המקדש.","highlights":["מנהרת המסוע הצבעונית","הבניין הגלי מזכוכית","התערוכה הקבועה"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"4-7-2 Ishizaka, Dazaifu, Fukuoka","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לשלב עם דזאיפו טנמנגו, המנהרה יוצאת ממש מהמקדש","baby_block":null,"tags":["museum","national museum","history","asia","archaeology","architecture","rainy day","מוזיאון","מוזיאון לאומי","היסטוריה","אסיה","ארכאולוגיה","ארכיטקטורה","יום גשום","דזאיפו"],"en":{"hype":"A huge wavy glass building on the hill behind Dazaifu Tenmangu, about Japan's ties with Asia through history.","reality":"The building is impressive, and the permanent show is good but long. Non-history fans can stop at the tunnel, the lobby and an hour inside.","tip":"You get there from the shrine through a tunnel with a moving walkway and colour lights, part of the fun.","baby_notes":"Moving walkway and lifts from the shrine to the museum, very easy with a stroller.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Ride up from the shrine through the colour tunnel, cross the huge lobby and go into the permanent show on the 4th floor.","special":"It tells Japan's history through its links with Korea, China and Southeast Asia, with a combo ticket for the shrine museums.","highlights":["Colour walkway tunnel","Wavy glass building","Permanent show"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Pair it with Dazaifu Tenmangu, the tunnel starts at the shrine","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kamado Shrine","name_ja":"竈門神社","city":"fukuoka","area":"Around Fukuoka","category":"sight","lat":33.54,"lng":130.544,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש ביער לרגלי הר הומאן מעל דזאיפו, ידוע בברכות לזוגיות ומקום עלייה לרגל של אוהדי \"קוטל השדים\".","reality":"שקט ויפה בהרבה מדזאיפו טנמנגו, עם שבילי אבן ביער. צריך אוטובוס מקומי, אבל מי שמגיע נהנה מהשקט.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כניסה חינם","tip":"אוטובוס הקהילה Mahoroba מתחנת דזאיפו עד התחנה האחרונה Uchiyama.","sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/竈門神社"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"הרבה מדרגות אבן בין המבנים, עדיף מנשא.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kamado%20Shrine%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במדרגות האבן בין העצים לאולם הראשי, תולים לוח תפילה ומסתכלים על לוחות האוהדים של \"קוטל השדים\".","special":"השם זהה לשם המשפחה של טנג׳ירו, גיבור \"קוטל השדים\", והמחבר מפוקואוקה. אלפי אוהדים משאירים כאן לוחות תפילה מצוירים.","highlights":["מדרגות אבן ביער","לוחות תפילה מצוירים של אוהדים","שלכת בסתיו"],"time_needed":"45 דקות-שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"883 Uchiyama, Dazaifu, Fukuoka","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":50,"booking":"no","plan_line":"אוטובוס Mahoroba מתחנת דזאיפו לתחנה האחרונה, כמה דקות נסיעה","baby_block":null,"tags":["shrine","shinto","forest","mountain","matchmaking","love","anime","demon slayer","kimetsu no yaiba","ema","מקדש","שינטו","יער","הר","זוגיות","אהבה","אנימה","קוטל השדים","לוחות תפילה","דזאיפו"],"en":{"hype":"A forest shrine at the foot of Mt Homan above Dazaifu, known for blessings for love and as a pilgrimage spot for Demon Slayer fans.","reality":"Much quieter and prettier than Dazaifu Tenmangu, with stone paths in the forest. It needs a local bus, but it pays off.","tip":"Take the Mahoroba community bus from Dazaifu Station to the last stop, Uchiyama.","baby_notes":"Lots of stone steps between the halls, a carrier is better.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Climb the stone steps between the trees to the main hall, hang a wish plaque and look at the Demon Slayer fan plaques.","special":"It shares the surname of Tanjiro, the Demon Slayer hero, and the author is from Fukuoka. Thousands of fans leave hand-drawn plaques here.","highlights":["Stone steps in the forest","Fan-drawn wish plaques","Autumn leaves"],"time_needed":"45 minutes-1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Mahoroba bus from Dazaifu Station to the last stop, a few minutes","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kanzeonji Temple","name_ja":"観世音寺","city":"fukuoka","area":"Around Fukuoka","category":"sight","lat":33.518,"lng":130.518,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש מ-746 שהיה פעם המקדש החשוב בקיושו, עם הפעמון הוותיק ביפן ואולם פסלים ענקיים מעץ.","reality":"שקט וכמעט ריק, בניגוד גמור לטנמנגו. אולם האוצרות עם פסלי עץ של חמישה מטר הוא הסיבה לבוא.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"החצר חינם, אולם האוצרות ¥600","tip":"20 דקות הליכה מתחנת דזאיפו בשבילים בין שדות, או 15 מתחנת גוג׳ו.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4853.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חצר שטוחה, אפשר עם עגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kanzeonji%20Temple%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים לאולם האוצרות לראות את פסלי העץ הענקיים, עוברים ליד הפעמון העתיק וממשיכים לאולם הקאידאן-אין הסמוך.","special":"פסלי עץ מתקופות נארה והייאן בגובה של יותר מחמישה מטרים, ופעמון מהמאה ה-7 שנחשב לוותיק ביפן.","highlights":["אולם האוצרות","הפעמון מהמאה ה-7","אולם קאידאן-אין"],"time_needed":"45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"5-6-1 Kanzeonji, Dazaifu, Fukuoka","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"אולם האוצרות פתוח 9:00-17:00, כניסה אחרונה 16:30","baby_block":null,"tags":["temple","buddhist","statues","wooden statues","bell","history","nara period","quiet","מקדש","בודהיסטי","פסלים","פסלי עץ","פעמון","היסטוריה","שקט","דזאיפו"],"en":{"hype":"A temple from 746, once the most important in Kyushu, with Japan's oldest bell and a hall of huge wooden statues.","reality":"Quiet and nearly empty, the opposite of Tenmangu. The treasure hall with five-metre wooden statues is the reason to come.","tip":"20 minutes on foot from Dazaifu Station along paths between fields, or 15 from Gojo Station.","baby_notes":"Flat grounds, fine with a stroller.","price":"Grounds free, treasure hall ¥600","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go into the treasure hall for the giant wooden statues, pass the ancient bell and continue to Kaidanin hall next door.","special":"Nara and Heian period wooden statues over five metres tall, and a 7th-century bell said to be Japan's oldest.","highlights":["Treasure hall","7th-century bell","Kaidanin hall"],"time_needed":"45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Treasure hall open 9:00-17:00, last entry 16:30","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Sakurai Futamigaura","name_ja":"桜井二見ヶ浦","city":"fukuoka","area":"Around Fukuoka","category":"sight","lat":33.642,"lng":130.196,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שני סלעים בים קשורים בחבל קדוש, עם שער טורי לבן שעומד במים, בחוף של איטושימה.","reality":"אחד הנופים היפים באזור, בעיקר בשקיעה. בלי רכב זה מסובך, אוטובוס מקומי עם החלפה.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"לבוא לשקיעה, השמש יורדת לים מאחורי הסלעים.","sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/桜井二見ヶ浦"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מסתכלים מהטיילת שליד הכביש, אפשר עם עגלה. הירידה לחול לא מתאימה לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sakurai%20Futamigaura%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עומדים בטיילת מול הטורי הלבן והסלעים, יורדים לחוף לתמונה ונשארים לשקיעה. בקפה שלאורך הכביש אפשר לשבת מול הנוף.","special":"חבל של 30 מטר שוקל טון מחבר בין שני הסלעים, והטורי הלבן עומד כ-150 מטר בתוך הים.","highlights":["הטורי הלבן בים","הסלעים הנשואים","שקיעה"],"time_needed":"30-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Shimasakurai, Itoshima, Fukuoka","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לבוא לשקיעה, ובלי רכב לבדוק מראש את האוטובוס מתחנת Kyudaigakken","baby_block":null,"tags":["beach","sea","torii","white torii","rocks","wedded rocks","sunset","coast","itoshima","חוף","ים","טורי","טורי לבן","סלעים","שקיעה","חוף ים","איטושימה","טיול יום"],"en":{"hype":"Two rocks in the sea tied with a sacred rope, with a white torii standing in the water, on the Itoshima coast.","reality":"One of the best views in the area, especially at sunset. Without a car it's a hassle, a local bus with a change.","tip":"Come for sunset, the sun drops into the sea behind the rocks.","baby_notes":"You see it from the walkway by the road, fine with a stroller. Getting down to the sand isn't.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Stand on the walkway facing the white torii and rocks, go down to the beach for a photo and stay for sunset. Cafes along the road face the view.","special":"A 30 m, one-tonne rope ties the rocks together, and the white torii stands about 150 m out in the sea.","highlights":["White torii in the sea","Wedded rocks","Sunset"],"time_needed":"30-45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Come for sunset, without a car check the bus from Kyudaigakken first","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Keya no Oto","name_ja":"芥屋の大門","city":"fukuoka","area":"Around Fukuoka","category":"sight","lat":33.596,"lng":130.095,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מערת הבזלת הגדולה ביפן, צוק של עמודי אבן משושים בגובה 64 מטר שנכנס לים, בקצה איטושימה.","reality":"מרשים באמת, אבל רואים אותו כמו שצריך רק מסירה. שביל ההליכה מלמעלה נותן בעיקר נוף לים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"הסירות למערה יוצאות מנמל הדייגים Keya ממרץ עד דצמבר, ומבוטלות בים סוער.","sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/芥屋の大門"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"שביל ביער עם מדרגות לתצפית, ובסירה קטנה בים פתוח לא כדאי עם תינוק.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Keya%20no%20Oto%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים על סירה קטנה מנמל Keya, מפליגים לאורך הצוק ונכנסים קרוב לפתח המערה. מי שלא בסירה הולך בשביל ביער עד התצפית למעלה.","special":"עמודי בזלת משושים וסדירים כמו חלת דבש, 64 מטר גובה ו-90 מטר עומק.","highlights":["סירה לפתח המערה","עמודי הבזלת המשושים","תצפית מהצוק"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Keya, Shima, Itoshima, Fukuoka","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"הסירות רק עד סוף דצמבר ובים רגוע, לבדוק לפני הנסיעה","baby_block":"סירה קטנה בים פתוח, לא מתאים לתינוק","tags":["cave","sea cave","basalt","rock formation","cliff","boat","boat tour","coast","itoshima","מערה","מערת ים","בזלת","צוק","סלעים","סירה","שייט","חוף","איטושימה","טיול יום"],"en":{"hype":"Japan's largest basalt cave, a 64 m cliff of hexagonal stone columns running into the sea at the tip of Itoshima.","reality":"Really impressive, but you only see it properly from a boat. The trail above mostly gives a sea view.","tip":"Boats to the cave leave Keya fishing port from March to December and cancel in rough seas.","baby_notes":"Forest trail with steps to the lookout, and a small boat on open sea isn't a good idea with a baby.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Board a small boat at Keya port, cruise along the cliff and get close to the cave mouth. Without the boat, walk the forest trail to the lookout above.","special":"Neat hexagonal basalt columns like a honeycomb, 64 m high and 90 m deep.","highlights":["Boat to the cave mouth","Hexagonal basalt columns","Cliff-top lookout"],"time_needed":"An hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Boats only until end of December and in calm seas, check first","baby_block":"Small boat on open sea, not for a baby"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Yanagawa Ohana","name_ja":"柳川藩主立花邸 御花","city":"fukuoka","area":"Around Fukuoka","category":"sight","lat":33.156,"lng":130.405,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"האחוזה של שליטי יאנאגאווה, עם בית מערבי לבן מ-1910 וגן של 280 עצי אורן סביב בריכה.","reality":"שווה כחלק מיום ביאנאגאווה עם השייט בתעלות, לא כנסיעה בפני עצמה. הגן היפה ביותר נראה מהאולם הגדול.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"שייט התעלות נגמר ממש ליד, אפשר לסיים אותו כאן.","sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/御花","https://www.ohana.co.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חלק מהבית עם טטאמי וחליצת נעליים, את העגלה משאירים בכניסה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Yanagawa%20Ohana%20Fukuoka","website_url":"https://www.ohana.co.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים לבית המערבי הלבן, עוברים לאולם היפני הגדול ויושבים מול גן האורנים שליד הבריכה.","special":"גן שוטואן הוא נכס נוף לאומי, הבריכה מחוברת לתעלות הטירה ובחורף מגיעים אליה ברווזי בר.","highlights":["הבית המערבי מ-1910","גן האורנים שוטואן","ברווזי בר בחורף"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-1 Shinhokamachi, Yanagawa, Fukuoka","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לשלב עם שייט התעלות של יאנאגאווה, 45 דקות ברכבת מטנג׳ין","baby_block":null,"tags":["villa","samurai residence","garden","japanese garden","pine","western building","history","yanagawa","וילה","אחוזה","גן","גן יפני","אורנים","בית מערבי","היסטוריה","יאנאגאווה","טיול יום"],"en":{"hype":"The Yanagawa lords' estate, with a white Western house from 1910 and a garden of 280 pines around a pond.","reality":"Worth it as part of a Yanagawa day with the canal boat, not as a trip on its own. The garden looks best from the big hall.","tip":"The canal boat ride ends right nearby, finish it here.","baby_notes":"Part of the house is tatami and shoes-off, the stroller stays at the entrance.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk through the white Western house, on to the big Japanese hall, and sit facing the pine garden by the pond.","special":"The Shotoen garden is a national scenic site, its pond joins the castle moat, and wild ducks come in winter.","highlights":["1910 Western house","Shotoen pine garden","Wild ducks in winter"],"time_needed":"An hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Pair it with the Yanagawa canal boat, 45 minutes by train from Tenjin","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Nanzoin Temple","name_ja":"南蔵院","city":"fukuoka","area":"Around Fukuoka","category":"sight","lat":33.625,"lng":130.548,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פסל בודהה שוכב מברונזה באורך 41 מטר, מהגדולים בעולם, במקדש בהרים של ססאגורי.","reality":"הפסל ענק ומפתיע, ממש מחוץ לעיר. הדרך אליו עוברת ביער עם מאות פסלים קטנים, ומקומות כאלה כמעט לא רואים בטיולים רגילים.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"הכניסה חינם","tip":"רכבת JR מהאקאטה לתחנת Kido-Nanzoin-mae, משם הולכים כמה דקות.","sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/南蔵院_(福岡県篠栗町)"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"עלייה במדרגות ובשבילים תלולים עד הפסל, עגלה קשה. עדיף מנשא.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nanzoin%20Temple%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים מהתחנה בשביל ביער, עוברים בין מאות פסלי אבן קטנים ומגיעים לבודהה השוכב.","special":"בודהה שוכב באורך 41 מטר ובגובה 11, באמצע יער בהרים, וכמעט בלי תיירים מחו״ל.","highlights":["הבודהה השוכב","מאות פסלי אבן קטנים","השביל ביער"],"time_needed":"1.5-2 שעות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1035 Sasaguri, Sasaguri, Kasuya District, Fukuoka","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"רכבת JR קו ססאגורי מהאקאטה, תחנת Kido-Nanzoin-mae","baby_block":null,"tags":["temple","buddhist","reclining buddha","buddha","bronze statue","statues","forest","pilgrimage","מקדש","בודהיסטי","בודהה שוכב","בודהה","פסל","פסלים","יער","עלייה לרגל","טיול יום"],"en":{"hype":"A 41 m bronze reclining Buddha, among the largest in the world, at a mountain temple in Sasaguri.","reality":"The statue is huge and surprising, just outside the city. The way up runs through a forest of hundreds of small statues, the kind of place most trips miss.","tip":"JR from Hakata to Kido-Nanzoin-mae station, then a few minutes on foot.","baby_notes":"Steps and steep paths up to the statue, hard with a stroller. A carrier is better.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk up from the station through the forest, past hundreds of small stone statues, to the reclining Buddha.","special":"A 41 m long, 11 m high reclining Buddha in a mountain forest, with hardly any foreign tourists.","highlights":["Reclining Buddha","Hundreds of small stone statues","Forest path"],"time_needed":"1.5-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"JR Sasaguri line from Hakata, Kido-Nanzoin-mae station","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Miyajidake Shrine","name_ja":"宮地嶽神社","city":"fukuoka","area":"Around Fukuoka","category":"sight","lat":33.779,"lng":130.488,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש עם חבל השימנאווה הגדול ביפן, 13.5 מטר אורך וחמישה טון, ושדרת מדרגות שמשקיפה עד הים.","reality":"החבל הענק מרשים מאוד מקרוב. הנוף המפורסם, השמש שוקעת בדיוק בקו השדרה, קורה רק בסוף פברואר ובסוף אוקטובר, אבל הנוף לים יפה גם בדצמבר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כניסה חינם","tip":"לעלות לראש המדרגות בשקיעה ולהסתכל אחורה על השדרה שיורדת לים.","sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/宮地嶽神社"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מדרגות רבות מהשדרה לאולם, עדיף מנשא.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Miyajidake%20Shrine%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במדרגות מהשדרה לאולם הראשי ועומדים מתחת לחבל הענק. בסוף מסתובבים אחורה לתצפית על השדרה הישרה שיורדת עד הים.","special":"החבל הקדוש הגדול ביפן, בקוטר 2.5 מטר, מוחלף כל שנה מאורז של שדה קדוש של המקדש.","highlights":["החבל הקדוש הענק","תצפית על השדרה עד הים","שקיעה בראש המדרגות"],"time_needed":"45 דקות-שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"7-1 Miyajimotomachi, Fukutsu, Fukuoka","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":50,"booking":"no","plan_line":"25 דקות הליכה מתחנת JR Fukuma או אוטובוס עד Miyajidake-jinja-mae","baby_block":null,"tags":["shrine","shinto","shimenawa","sacred rope","sunset","sea view","stairs","day trip","מקדש","שינטו","שימנאווה","חבל קדוש","שקיעה","נוף לים","מדרגות","טיול יום"],"en":{"hype":"A shrine with Japan's largest shimenawa rope, 13.5 m long and five tonnes, and a stair avenue looking down to the sea.","reality":"The giant rope is very impressive up close. The famous shot, sunset right down the avenue, only happens in late February and late October, but the sea view is good in December too.","tip":"Climb to the top of the stairs at sunset and look back down the avenue to the sea.","baby_notes":"Many stairs from the avenue to the hall, a carrier is better.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Climb from the avenue to the main hall and stand under the giant rope. Then turn round for the view of the straight avenue running to the sea.","special":"Japan's largest sacred rope, 2.5 m across, remade every year from rice grown in the shrine's own field.","highlights":["Giant sacred rope","View down the avenue to the sea","Sunset from the top step"],"time_needed":"45 minutes-1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"25 min walk from JR Fukuma or bus to Miyajidake-jinja-mae","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Munakata Taisha","name_ja":"宗像大社","city":"fukuoka","area":"Around Fukuoka","category":"sight","lat":33.832,"lng":130.515,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש עתיק שהוא חלק מאתר מורשת עולמית של אונסק״ו, עם אוסף של כ-80,000 מנחות עתיקות מאי קדוש סגור.","reality":"מקדש יער שקט ומטופח, כמעט בלי תיירים מחו״ל. המוזיאון מרתק, אבל ההסברים באנגלית מעטים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"המקדש חינם, המוזיאון שינפוקאן ¥800","tip":"רכבת JR מהאקאטה לתחנת Togo ואוטובוס של 10 דקות למקדש.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4840.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מתחם שטוח ורחב, נוח עם עגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Munakata%20Taisha%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בשער לאולם הראשי, ממשיכים בשביל ביער לאתר הפולחן העתיק בפתוח, ונכנסים למוזיאון של אוצרות האי אוקינושימה.","special":"אוקינושימה, האי הקדוש שהמקדש שומר עליו, סגור לגמרי לציבור, והאוצרות שלו, חלקם מפרס, מוצגים רק כאן.","highlights":["מוזיאון שינפוקאן","אתר הפולחן הפתוח ביער","האולם הראשי"],"time_needed":"1.5-2 שעות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2331 Tashima, Munakata, Fukuoka","opens":"06:00","closes":"19:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"המוזיאון נסגר ב-16:30, רכבת JR לתחנת Togo ואוטובוס","baby_block":null,"tags":["shrine","shinto","unesco","world heritage","museum","treasures","forest","okinoshima","day trip","מקדש","שינטו","אונסקו","אתר מורשת עולמית","מוזיאון","אוצרות","יער","טיול יום"],"en":{"hype":"An ancient shrine that is part of a UNESCO World Heritage site, with a collection of about 80,000 ancient offerings from a closed sacred island.","reality":"A calm, well-kept forest shrine with almost no foreign tourists. The museum is fascinating, but English info is thin.","tip":"JR from Hakata to Togo station, then a 10-minute bus to the shrine.","baby_notes":"Flat wide grounds, easy with a stroller.","price":"Shrine free, Shinpokan museum ¥800","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk through the gate to the main hall, follow the forest path to the ancient open-air worship site, and visit the museum of Okinoshima treasures.","special":"Okinoshima, the sacred island the shrine guards, is fully closed to the public, and its treasures, some from Persia, are shown only here.","highlights":["Shinpokan museum","Open-air worship site in the forest","Main hall"],"time_needed":"1.5-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Museum closes 16:30, JR to Togo station then bus","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
where not exists (select 1 from place_library p where p.city = x.city and lower(p.name) = lower(x.name));
insert into place_library (name, name_ja, city, area, category, lat, lng, coord_precision, hype, reality, verdict, tabelog_score, google_score, price, tip, sources, audience, baby_notes, local_pick, maps_url, website_url, serves, dishes, todo, special, highlights, time_needed, kosher, kosher_note, address, opens, closes, closed_weekdays, closed_dates, open_dates, best_time, visit_mins, booking, plan_line, baby_block, tags, en, facts_at, facts_sure, active)
select x.name, x.name_ja, x.city, x.area, x.category, x.lat, x.lng, x.coord_precision, x.hype, x.reality, x.verdict, x.tabelog_score, x.google_score, x.price, x.tip, x.sources, x.audience, x.baby_notes, x.local_pick, x.maps_url, x.website_url, x.serves, x.dishes, x.todo, x.special, x.highlights, x.time_needed, x.kosher, x.kosher_note, x.address, x.opens, x.closes, x.closed_weekdays, x.closed_dates, x.open_dates, x.best_time, x.visit_mins, x.booking, x.plan_line, x.baby_block, x.tags, x.en, x.facts_at, x.facts_sure, false from jsonb_populate_recordset(null::place_library, $cards$[{"name":"Nokonoshima Island Park","name_ja":"のこのしまアイランドパーク","city":"fukuoka","area":"Around Fukuoka","category":"sight","lat":33.633,"lng":130.301,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פארק פרחים בקצה אי קטן במפרץ האקאטה, עשר דקות במעבורת מהעיר, עם נוף לים מכל צד.","reality":"יפה במיוחד באביב ובסתיו. בדצמבר-ינואר פורחים נרקיסים, מספיק בשביל טיול נעים, אבל זו לא העונה החזקה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,500 למבוגר, ¥500 לילדים מגיל 3","tip":"מעבורת מנמל Meinohama ומשם אוטובוס לפארק, לבדוק שעות חזרה מראש.","sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/のこのしまアイランドパーク","https://nokonoshima.com/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים סלולים ברובם, אבל יש עליות. נוח עם עגלה ברוב הפארק.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nokonoshima%20Island%20Park%20Fukuoka","website_url":"https://nokonoshima.com/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"שטים במעבורת לאי, עולים באוטובוס לפארק ומטיילים בין ערוגות הפרחים מול הים. אפשר לשבת לארוחה פשוטה עם נוף.","special":"שדות פרחים מול הים והעיר באופק, ובחורף נרקיסים יפניים, קמליות וססנקווה.","highlights":["שדות פרחים מול הים","נרקיסים בחורף","שייט המעבורת"],"time_needed":"חצי יום","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Nokonoshima, Nishi-ku, Fukuoka","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":180,"booking":"no","plan_line":"חצי יום עם המעבורת, לבדוק את האוטובוס האחרון חזרה לנמל","baby_block":null,"tags":["island","flower park","flowers","narcissus","ferry","sea view","nature","park","day trip","אי","פארק פרחים","פרחים","נרקיסים","מעבורת","נוף לים","טבע","פארק","טיול יום"],"en":{"hype":"A flower park at the tip of a small island in Hakata Bay, ten minutes by ferry from the city, with sea views on every side.","reality":"Prettiest in spring and autumn. In December-January the narcissus bloom, enough for a nice outing, but not the best season.","tip":"Ferry from Meinohama port then a bus to the park, check return times first.","baby_notes":"Mostly paved paths, with some slopes. Fine with a stroller for most of the park.","price":"¥1,500 adults, ¥500 kids from age 3","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Ride the ferry to the island, take the bus up to the park and walk among the flower beds facing the sea. You can sit for a simple meal with a view.","special":"Flower fields facing the sea with the city on the horizon, and in winter Japanese narcissus, camellias and sasanqua.","highlights":["Flower fields over the sea","Winter narcissus","Ferry ride"],"time_needed":"Half a day","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Half a day with the ferry, check the last bus back to the port","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Uminonakamichi Seaside Park","name_ja":"海の中道海浜公園","city":"fukuoka","area":"Around Fukuoka","category":"sight","lat":33.66,"lng":130.356,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פארק ענק על לשון יבשה בין מפרץ האקאטה לים הפתוח, עם שדות פרחים, גני משחקים ושבילי אופניים.","reality":"מקום מעולה למשפחות, אבל הוא ענק ובחורף הפרחים מעטים. בלי אופניים רואים רק חלק קטן.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥450 למבוגר, השכרת אופניים ¥500 ליום בחורף","tip":"בסוף שבוע אפשר להגיע במעבורת ממומוצ׳י, 20 דקות. בימי חול בחורף היא לא שטה, אז ברכבת JR.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4810.html","https://rurubu.jp/andmore/spot/80038327"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים סלולים ורחבים בכל הפארק, אזורי משחק לילדים קטנים.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Uminonakamichi%20Seaside%20Park%20Fukuoka","website_url":"https://uminaka-park.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"שוכרים אופניים בכניסה ורוכבים בשבילים בין הדשאים, אזורי המשחק והחוף. בשילוב עם מרין וורלד שליד יוצא יום שלם.","special":"שטח של לשון יבשה שלמה, עם ים משני הצדדים ונוף לעיר מעבר למפרץ.","highlights":["רכיבה על אופניים","אזורי משחק לילדים","נוף לעיר מעבר למפרץ"],"time_needed":"חצי יום","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"18-25 Saitozaki, Higashi-ku, Fukuoka","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":180,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לשלב עם מרין וורלד הסמוך, יום שלם לשניהם","baby_block":null,"tags":["park","seaside park","flowers","cycling","bike rental","playground","beach","family","kids","פארק","פארק חוף","פרחים","אופניים","השכרת אופניים","גן שעשועים","חוף","משפחות","ילדים"],"en":{"hype":"A huge park on a sandbar between Hakata Bay and the open sea, with flower fields, playgrounds and bike paths.","reality":"Great for families, but it's huge and in winter there are few flowers. Without a bike you see only a small part.","tip":"On weekends take the ferry from Momochi, 20 minutes. It doesn't run on winter weekdays, so take JR.","baby_notes":"Wide paved paths throughout, with play areas for small kids.","price":"¥450 adults, bike hire ¥500 a day in winter","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Rent a bike at the gate and ride between the lawns, play areas and beach. With Marine World next door it fills a whole day.","special":"A whole sandbar with sea on both sides and a view of the city across the bay.","highlights":["Cycling","Kids' play areas","City view across the bay"],"time_needed":"Half a day","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Pair it with Marine World next door, a full day for both","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Canal City Hakata","name_ja":"キャナルシティ博多","city":"fukuoka","area":"Nakasu & Canal City","category":"shopping","lat":33.5897,"lng":130.411,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"קניון צבעוני ענק סביב תעלת מים, עם מופעי מזרקות, תיאטרון וקומת ראמן.","reality":"הבניין מצטלם יפה ומופע המזרקות חמוד, אבל החנויות הן הרשתות הרגילות. שווה לעבור, לא לבנות עליו יום.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"מופע המים על התעלה רץ כמה פעמים ביום, כדאי לבדוק את השעות באתר.","sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/キャナルシティ博多"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעליות, שירותים עם החתלה וחדרי הנקה, נוח מאוד עם עגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Canal%20City%20Hakata%20Fukuoka","website_url":"https://canalcity.co.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מסתובבים לאורך התעלה בין הבניינים הצבעוניים, עוצרים למופע המזרקות ונכנסים לחנויות. קומה 5 היא קומת הראמן.","special":"התכנון של הבניינים המעוגלים סביב התעלה הוא סיבה לבוא בפני עצמה, והבניין המזרחי נפתח מחדש בספטמבר 2026.","highlights":["מופע המזרקות","הבניינים הצבעוניים","ראמן סטדיום"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-2 Sumiyoshi, Hakata-ku, Fukuoka","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לבדוק באתר את שעות מופע המים ולהגיע בשבילו","baby_block":null,"tags":["mall","shopping mall","shopping","fountain","water show","canal","ramen","theater","מרכז קניות","קניון","קניות","מזרקה","מופע מים","תעלה","ראמן","תיאטרון"],"en":{"hype":"A huge colourful mall around a water canal, with fountain shows, a theatre and a ramen floor.","reality":"The building photographs well and the fountain show is cute, but the shops are the usual chains. Worth a walk through, not a day.","tip":"The water show on the canal runs several times a day, check times on the site.","baby_notes":"Lifts, changing rooms and nursing rooms, very easy with a stroller.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk along the canal between the colourful buildings, stop for the fountain show and browse. Floor 5 is the ramen floor.","special":"The curved buildings around the canal are a reason to come on their own, and the East Building reopened in September 2026.","highlights":["Fountain show","Colourful buildings","Ramen Stadium"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Check the water show times on the site and come for it","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kawabata Shopping Arcade","name_ja":"上川端商店街","city":"fukuoka","area":"Nakasu & Canal City","category":"shopping","lat":33.5945,"lng":130.407,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רחוב קניות מקורה וישן של 400 מטר בין נאקאסו לריברין, עם כמאה חנויות קטנות.","reality":"חנויות משפחתיות, מזכרות ומתוקים, אווירה של האקאטה הישנה. נחמד לעבור בו בדרך לקושידה, לא יעד בפני עצמו.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"ללכת בו מריברין ועד קושידה, ככה מחברים שלושה מקומות בהליכה אחת.","sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/川端通商店街"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"רחוב מקורה ושטוח, נוח עם עגלה וגם בגשם.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kawabata%20Shopping%20Arcade%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים לאורך הרחוב המקורה, מציצים בחנויות הישנות ועוצרים לקערה של זנזאי (מרק שעועית אדומה מתוק).","special":"שומר על האופי של רחוב קניות של פעם, עם חנויות לכלי פולחן בודהיסטי ליד המקדשים.","highlights":["זנזאי של קוואבאטה","חנויות משפחתיות ישנות","הליכה מקורה בגשם"],"time_needed":"30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Kamikawabatamachi, Hakata-ku, Fukuoka","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"להתחיל בריברין ולסיים במקדש קושידה","baby_block":null,"tags":["shopping street","arcade","covered arcade","souvenirs","old shops","zenzai","sweets","רחוב קניות","ארקייד","רחוב מקורה","מזכרות","חנויות ישנות","זנזאי","מתוקים","קניות"],"en":{"hype":"An old 400 m covered shopping street between Nakasu and Riverain, with about a hundred small shops.","reality":"Family shops, souvenirs and sweets, old Hakata feel. Nice to walk through on the way to Kushida, not a destination.","tip":"Walk it from Riverain to Kushida Shrine and you link three places in one walk.","baby_notes":"Covered and flat, easy with a stroller, even in rain.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the covered street, look into the old shops and stop for a bowl of zenzai (sweet red bean soup).","special":"It keeps the feel of an old-style shopping street, with Buddhist altar shops near the temples.","highlights":["Kawabata zenzai","Old family shops","A dry walk in the rain"],"time_needed":"30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Start at Riverain and end at Kushida Shrine","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Tenjin Underground Mall","name_ja":"天神地下街","city":"fukuoka","area":"Tenjin & Daimyo","category":"shopping","lat":33.59,"lng":130.399,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רחוב קניות תת קרקעי של 590 מטר עם כ-150 חנויות, מעוצב כמו רחוב אירופאי מהמאה ה-19 עם לבנים ואבני ריצוף.","reality":"נוח מאוד ביום גשום או קר, ומחבר את כל הקניונים והתחנות. החנויות בעיקר אופנה ואקססוריז לצעירים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"הדרך הכי נוחה לעבור בין התחנות והקניונים בטנג׳ין בלי לצאת לרחוב.","sources":["https://www.city.fukuoka.lg.jp/keizai/c_kanko/business/documents/tenpushiryou.pdf","https://www.mec-h.com/town/mh-fukuoka/115"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שטוח ומקורה, יש מעליות לרחוב בכמה יציאות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tenjin%20Underground%20Mall%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים לאורך המסדרון התת קרקעי מקצה לקצה, נכנסים לחנויות הקטנות ויוצאים ישר לקניונים שמעל.","special":"החלק הצפוני מעוצב בסגנון מרכז אירופה והדרומי בסגנון דרום אירופה, עם לבנים, אבני ריצוף ותאורה חמימה.","highlights":["העיצוב האירופאי","חיבור לכל הקניונים","מקלט ביום גשום"],"time_needed":"30 דקות-שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-1-1 Tenjin, Chuo-ku, Fukuoka","opens":"10:00","closes":"20:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לבחור בו ביום גשום, מחבר את כל טנג׳ין מתחת לאדמה","baby_block":null,"tags":["underground mall","shopping","fashion","accessories","rainy day","shopping street","מרכז קניות תת קרקעי","קניות","אופנה","אקססוריז","יום גשום","רחוב קניות","קניון"],"en":{"hype":"A 590 m underground shopping street with about 150 shops, designed like a 19th-century European street with brick and cobbles.","reality":"Very handy on a rainy or cold day, and it links all the malls and stations. Shops are mostly young fashion and accessories.","tip":"The easiest way between Tenjin's stations and malls without going outside.","baby_notes":"Flat and covered, with lifts to the street at several exits.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the underground corridor end to end, pop into the small shops and come up straight into the malls above.","special":"The north end is styled on central Europe and the south on southern Europe, with brick, cobbles and warm lighting.","highlights":["European-style design","Links every mall","Shelter on a rainy day"],"time_needed":"30 minutes-1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Use it on a rainy day, it links all of Tenjin underground","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Daimyo","name_ja":"大名","city":"fukuoka","area":"Tenjin & Daimyo","category":"shopping","lat":33.588,"lng":130.394,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שכונת הרחובות הקטנים ליד טנג׳ין, עם חנויות בוטיק, סניקרס ומעצבים ובתי קפה קטנים.","reality":"הכיף הוא לשוטט בלי מטרה. מי שמחפש מותגים גדולים יעדיף את טנג׳ין, מי שאוהב חנויות קטנות ייהנה כאן.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"לבוא אחרי 12:00, רוב החנויות הקטנות לא פותחות בבוקר.","sources":["https://www.fashion-press.net/maps/pref_40/area_71/fashion/fashion","https://www.shift.jp.org/guide/?p=17345"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מדרכות צרות וחנויות קטנות, עגלה עוברת ברחובות אבל לא בתוך כל חנות.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Daimyo%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"משוטטים בסמטאות בין חנויות הבוטיק והסניקרס, ויושבים בבית קפה קטן באמצע.","special":"כאן נמצאות החנויות העצמאיות של פוקואוקה, צעד מהקניונים הגדולים של טנג׳ין.","highlights":["חנויות בוטיק","חנויות סניקרס","בתי קפה קטנים"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Daimyo, Chuo-ku, Fukuoka","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לבוא אחרי הצהריים, החנויות הקטנות פותחות מאוחר","baby_block":null,"tags":["shopping district","boutiques","vintage","second hand","fashion","design","cafes","neighborhood","אזור קניות","בוטיקים","וינטג׳","יד שנייה","אופנה","עיצוב","בתי קפה","שכונה"],"en":{"hype":"The neighbourhood of small streets next to Tenjin, with boutiques, sneaker and designer shops and small cafes.","reality":"The fun is wandering without a plan. If you want big brands, Tenjin is better; if you like small shops, you'll love it here.","tip":"Come after 12:00, most small shops don't open in the morning.","baby_notes":"Narrow pavements and small shops, a stroller fits the streets but not every shop.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Wander the lanes between the boutiques and sneaker shops, and sit in a small cafe halfway.","special":"This is where Fukuoka's independent shops are, a step from Tenjin's big malls.","highlights":["Boutiques","Sneaker shops","Small cafes"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Come in the afternoon, small shops open late","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Iwataya Main Store","name_ja":"岩田屋本店","city":"fukuoka","area":"Tenjin & Daimyo","category":"shopping","lat":33.589,"lng":130.3985,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"חנות הכלבו הוותיקה של פוקואוקה, עם מותגי יוקרה וקומת אוכל מפורסמת במרתף.","reality":"חנות כלבו יפנית קלאסית ואיכותית. בשביל קניות יוקרה או מזכרות אוכל מוקפדות, פחות בשביל מציאות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"בקומה 7 של הבניין הראשי יש חנות ספרים ובית קפה, טוב להפסקה.","sources":["https://www.fashion-press.net/tenants/287","https://www.walkerplus.com/spot/ar1040s12205/data.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעליות, חדרי הנקה והחתלה, נוח מאוד עם עגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Iwataya%20Main%20Store%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יורדים לשתי קומות המרתף של הבניין הראשי לדוכני המתוקים והאוכל, ועולים לקומות האופנה. הבניין החדש צמוד ובו מותגי יוקרה ומסעדות.","special":"מרתף האוכל מלא בממתקים ומזכרות של פוקואוקה ארוזים יפה, מתאים למתנות.","highlights":["מרתף האוכל","מזכרות ארוזות למתנה","מותגי יוקרה"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-5-35 Tenjin, Chuo-ku, Fukuoka","opens":"10:00","closes":"20:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לבוא למרתף האוכל אחרי 18:00, חלק מהדברים בהנחה","baby_block":null,"tags":["department store","depachika","luxury","fashion","souvenirs","gifts","food hall","tax free","חנות כלבו","מרתף אוכל","יוקרה","אופנה","מזכרות","מתנות","פטור ממס"],"en":{"hype":"Fukuoka's long-running department store, with luxury brands and a well-known basement food floor.","reali