ke the Ippudo and Menbei goods.","baby_notes":"Inside a mall with lifts, but crowded on weekends.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Browse the plush, cards and souvenirs and find the Fukuoka-only corner. There is also a spot to play the card game.","special":"Local Fukuoka goods you won't find in the Tokyo or Osaka Pokemon stores.","highlights":["Fukuoka-only goods","Pokemon card corner","Giant plush"],"time_needed":"30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"It's on Hakata Marui 2F now, not Amu Plaza as old guides say","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hakata Deitos Miyagemon Ichiba","name_ja":"博多デイトス みやげもん市場","city":"fukuoka","area":"Hakata","category":"shopping","lat":33.59,"lng":130.4215,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שוק המזכרות של תחנת האקאטה, עם כשישים חנויות של מנטאיקו, עוגיות ומתוקים מקומיים במקום אחד.","reality":"המקום הכי נוח לקנות מתנות אוכל רגע לפני הרכבת או השדה. המחירים כמו בחנויות בעיר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"מנטאיקו מקורר מחזיק בדרך כלל כמה ימים, לבקש קרח לאריזה.","sources":["https://rurubu.jp/andmore/article/18903","https://www.crossroadfukuoka.jp/inbound-shop/16148"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"בתוך התחנה עם מעליות, אבל עמוס בשעות הערב.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hakata%20Deitos%20Miyagemon%20Ichiba%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין הדוכנים, טועמים דוגמיות של מנטאיקו ומתוקים וקונים מתנות ארוזות.","special":"כל מזכרות האוכל של פוקואוקה וקיושו במסדרון אחד, ישר מהרציף.","highlights":["מנטאיקו ארוז למתנה","עוגיות ומתוקים של האקאטה","דוגמיות טעימה"],"time_needed":"30-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-1 Hakataekichuogai, Hakata-ku, Fukuoka","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"להשאיר את קניות המזכרות לכאן, רגע לפני הרכבת","baby_block":null,"tags":["souvenirs","gifts","mentaiko","sweets","cookies","food souvenirs","station","omiyage","מזכרות","מתנות","מנטאיקו","מתוקים","עוגיות","מזכרות אוכל","תחנה","אומיאגה"],"en":{"hype":"Hakata Station's souvenir market, with about sixty shops of mentaiko, cookies and local sweets in one place.","reality":"The easiest place to buy food gifts right before the train or flight. Prices are the same as in town.","tip":"Chilled mentaiko usually keeps a few days, ask for ice in the packing.","baby_notes":"Inside the station with lifts, but busy in the evening.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the stalls, taste the mentaiko and sweets samples and buy boxed gifts.","special":"All of Fukuoka and Kyushu's food souvenirs in one corridor, straight from the platforms.","highlights":["Boxed mentaiko gifts","Hakata cookies and sweets","Tasting samples"],"time_needed":"30-45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Save souvenir shopping for here, right before your train","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Yanagibashi Rengo Market","name_ja":"柳橋連合市場","city":"fukuoka","area":"Nakasu & Canal City","category":"shopping","lat":33.585,"lng":130.404,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"\"המטבח של האקאטה\", סמטה צרה של דוכני דגים, ירקות ומוצרים יבשים שהשפים של העיר קונים בה.","reality":"שוק אמיתי של מקומיים, קטן ולא מתויר. מעניין לראות ולטעום, אבל אין כאן הרבה לקנות לתיירים.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"לבוא בבוקר, הרבה דוכנים סוגרים אחר הצהריים.","sources":["https://www.crossroadfukuoka.jp/spot/12640","https://watabi.org/articles/fukuoka-yanagibashi-market-guide"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"הסמטה ברוחב של מטר בערך, אין מקום לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Yanagibashi%20Rengo%20Market%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים לאורך הסמטה בין דוכני הדגים, המנטאיקו והירקות, וע