","sources":["https://www.walkerplus.com/spot/ar1040s80336/price.html","https://iko-yo.net/facilities/23635"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חדרי הנקה, פינות החתלה ומקום לעגלות בכניסה, הכל בנוי לתינוקות ופעוטות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fukuoka%20Anpanman%20Children's%20Museum%20in%20Mall%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים לעולם של אנפנמן עם המגלשות ומתקני המשחק, רואים מופע על הבמה ומסיימים בקומת החנויות והמאפייה של ג׳אם אוג׳יסאן.","special":"מותאם לגמרי לגיל הרך, ויש בו מאפייה עם לחמניות בצורת הדמויות.","highlights":["מופע על הבמה","מתקני משחק לפעוטות","לחמניות בצורת אנפנמן"],"time_needed":"2-3 שעות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Hakata Riverain Mall 5F-6F, 3-1 Shimokawabatamachi, Hakata-ku, Fukuoka","opens":"10:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":150,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"לקנות כרטיס מראש, כניסה אחרונה 16:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["anpanman","kids museum","toddlers","children","playground","indoor play","character","bakery","rainy day","אנפנמן","מוזיאון ילדים","פעוטות","ילדים","משחקייה","מתקני משחק","דמויות","מאפייה","יום גשום"],"en":{"hype":"An Anpanman museum for toddlers on floors 5-6 of Riverain, with slides, a puppet theatre and stage shows.","reality":"Heaven for kids aged 1-5 and very easy with a baby. Adults without kids have no reason to go in.","tip":"Buy tickets ahead online, weekends and holidays fill up.","baby_notes":"Nursing rooms, changing areas and stroller parking at the entrance, all built for babies and toddlers.","price":"¥2,000-2,200 from age 1, price varies by day. Under 1 free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Step into the Anpanman world with its slides and play gear, catch a stage show and finish at the shops and Uncle Jam's bakery.","special":"Fully built for little ones, with a bakery selling buns shaped like the characters.","