um, with a dolphin and sea lion show facing the sea and a giant tank of Kyushu sea life.","reality":"A good aquarium, smaller than Osaka's Kaiyukan. The seaside show is the most fun part, and a new forest zone opened in March 2026.","tip":"Online tickets are cheaper than at the gate.","baby_notes":"Accessible building with lifts, easy with a stroller. At the show skip the front rows, they get splashed.","price":"¥2,500 adults, ¥700 kids from 3","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the tanks by Kyushu sea zone, stop at the big shark tank and sit down for the dolphin and sea lion show.","special":"The show arena faces the open sea, so the dolphins jump with the ocean behind them.","highlights":["Dolphin and sea lion show","Big tank","New forest zone"],"time_needed":"2-3 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Plan the visit around the dolphin show time","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Yanagawa River Punting (Kotatsu Boat)","name_ja":"柳川川下り こたつ舟","city":"fukuoka","area":"Around Fukuoka","category":"experience","lat":33.166,"lng":130.403,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שייט של שעה בסירת עץ שטוחה בתעלות של יאנאגאווה, ובחורף עם שולחן קוטאטסו מחומם בתוך הסירה.","reality":"שקט ונעים מאוד, השייט מנווט ביד בתעלות בין עצים ובתים ישנים. מתחת לגשרים הנמוכים צריך להתכופף כמעט לשכיבה.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כ-¥2,000-2,200 למבוגר, חצי מחיר לילדים","tip":"סירות הקוטאטסו שטות מ-1 בדצמבר עד סוף פברואר, ובגשם עוברים לסירה רגילה.","sources":["https://www.crossroadfukuoka.jp/spot/12901","https://tabi-mag.jp/yanagawa-kotatsu/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יושבים על מושבים נמוכים בסירה פתוחה, עגלה לא עולה. עם תינוק במנשא זה אפשרי ושקט.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Yanagawa%20River%20Punting%20(Kotatsu%20Boat)%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים לסירה באחת התחנות ליד תחנת נישיטטסו יאנאגאווה, יושבים מתחת לשמיכת הקוטאטסו ושטים כשעה בתעלות עד אזור אוהאנה.","special":"מערכת תעלות של 930 ק״מ בעיר אחת, ובחורף השייט עם קוטאטסו מחומם בתוך הסירה.","highlights":["קוטאטסו מחומם בסירה","התכופפות מתחת לגשרים","בתים ישנים לאורך התעלה"],"time_needed":"60-70 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Yanagawa, Fukuoka","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":70,"booking":"no","plan_line":"45 דקות ברכבת נישיטטסו מטנג׳ין, לא צריך להזמין מראש","baby_block":null,"tags":["boat","boat ride","river cruise","canal","punting","kotatsu","winter","yanagawa","day trip","סירה","שייט","שייט בתעלות","תעלות","קוטאטסו","חורף","יאנאגאווה","טיול יום"],"en":{"hype":"An hour-long ride in a flat wooden boat through Yanagawa's canals, and in winter with a heated kotatsu table in the boat.","reality":"Very calm and pleasant, the boatman poles by hand between trees and old houses. Under the low bridges you nearly lie down.","tip":"Kotatsu boats run Dec 1 to end of February, in rain it's a regular boat.","baby_notes":"Low seats in an open boat, no stroller on board. With the baby in a carrier it works and it's quiet.","price":"About ¥2,000-2,200 adults, half for kids","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Board at one of the stops near Nishitetsu Yanagawa station, sit under the kotatsu blanket and glide about an hour to the Ohana area.","special":"930 km of canals in one town, and in winter a heated kotatsu inside the boat.","highlights":["Heated kotatsu on board","Ducking under bridges","Old houses along the canal"],"time_needed":"60-70 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"45 min by Nishitetsu train from Tenjin, no booking needed","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Fukuoka Open Top Bus","name_ja":"福岡オープントップバス","city":"fukuoka","area":"Tenjin & Daimyo","category":"experience","lat":33.5915,"lng":130.3985,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אוטובוס קומתיים בלי גג שנוסע בסיבוב של שעה בעיר, לאורך החוף של מומוצ׳י או בנוף הלילה.","reality":"דרך נחמדה לראות הרבה מהעיר בשעה, אבל אין ירידות בדרך. בדצמבר קר מאוד למעלה, צריך להתלבש חם.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥2,000 למבוגר, ¥1,000 לילד","tip":"מסלול הערב עם האורות הכי שווה בדצמבר, להביא כפפות.","sources":["https://www.crossroadfukuoka.jp/spot/11107"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"אוטובוס פתוח וקר, ואת העגלה צריך לקפל.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fukuoka%20Open%20Top%20Bus%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים בטרמינל של טנג׳ין, מתיישבים בקומה העליונה הפתוחה ונוסעים כשעה בלי לרדת.","special":"שלושה מסלולים: מומוצ׳י והחוף, סיבוב אורות בערב, ומסוף מרץ 2026 גם מסלול לדזאיפו.","highlights":["מסלול האורות בערב","החוף של מומוצ׳י","מסלול לדזאיפו"],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Tenjin Expressway Bus Terminal 3F, 2-1-1 Tenjin, Chuo-ku, Fukuoka","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":70,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"להזמין באתר מראש, יוצא מטרמינל האוטובוסים של טנג׳ין קומה 3","baby_block":"אוטובוס פתוח וקר בחורף, לא מתאים לתינוק","tags":["bus tour","open top bus","double decker","sightseeing","night view","city tour","סיור באוטובוס","אוטובוס פתוח","אוטובוס קומתיים","סיור","נוף לילה","סיור בעיר"],"en":{"hype":"A roofless double-decker that loops the city for an hour, along the Momochi coast or through the night lights.","reality":"A nice way to see a lot of the city in an hour, but no stops on the way. In December it's very cold up top, dress warm.","tip":"The evening lights route is the best one in December, bring gloves.","baby_notes":"Open and cold bus, and the stroller has to be folded.","price":"¥2,000 adults, ¥1,000 kids","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Board at the Tenjin terminal, sit on the open top deck and ride about an hour without getting off.","special":"Three routes: Momochi and the coast, an evening lights loop, and since late March 2026 a route to Dazaifu.","highlights":["Evening lights route","Momochi coast","Dazaifu route"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Book online ahead, leaves from Tenjin Bus Terminal 3F","baby_block":"Open and cold in winter, not for a baby"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hakataza Theater","name_ja":"博多座","city":"fukuoka","area":"Nakasu & Canal City","category":"experience","lat":33.596,"lng":130.4065,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"התיאטרון הגדול של פוקואוקה, 1,500 מושבים עם במת קאבוקי מלאה, שמעלה קאבוקי, מחזות זמר וטאקאראזוקה.","reality":"הפקות ברמה גבוהה, אבל הכל ביפנית. בדצמבר התיאטרון מושכר בעיקר לקבוצות מקומיות, אז כדאי לבדוק את הלוח.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"הקאבוקי הגדול עולה בדרך כלל ביוני, זה הזמן לבוא בשביל קאבוקי.","sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/博多座","https://www.city.fukuoka.lg.jp/keizai/b_sisetu/life/00001_02.html","https://www.city.fukuoka.lg.jp/shisei/kouhou-hodo/hodo-happyo/2026/documents/260522Junehakatazaookabukihunanorikomi.pdf"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"הצגות של שעות באולם חשוך ושקט, לא מתאים לתינוק.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hakataza%20Theater%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מזמינים כרטיס להצגה, מגיעים ישר מתחנת נאקאסו-קוואבאטה ואוכלים בנטו בהפסקה כמו המקומיים.","special":"תיאטרון שנבנה במיוחד להצגות, עם מסלול קאבוקי (האנאמיצ׳י) שעובר בין הקהל.","highlights":["קאבוקי עם האנאמיצ׳י","מחזות זמר","בנטו בהפסקה"],"time_needed":"3-4 שעות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-1 Shimokawabatamachi, Hakata-ku, Fukuoka","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":210,"booking":"required","plan_line":"לבדוק את לוח ההצגות לפני, בדצמבר בעיקר הופעות של קבוצות מקומיות","baby_block":"הצגות ארוכות באולם חשוך, לא לתינוק","tags":["theater","theatre","kabuki","musical","takarazuka","show","performance","תיאטרון","קאבוקי","מחזמר","מחזות זמר","טאקאראזוקה","הופעה","הצגה"],"en":{"hype":"Fukuoka's big theatre, 1,500 seats with a full kabuki stage, staging kabuki, musicals and Takarazuka.","reality":"High-level productions, but everything is in Japanese. In December it's mostly rented to local groups, so check the schedule.","tip":"The big kabuki run is usually in June, that's the time to come for kabuki.","baby_notes":"Hours-long shows in a dark quiet hall, not for a baby.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Book a show, walk in straight from Nakasu-Kawabata station and eat a bento in the interval like the locals.","special":"A purpose-built drama theatre with a hanamichi kabuki runway through the audience.","highlights":["Kabuki with hanamichi","Musicals","Interval bento"],"time_needed":"3-4 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Check the show schedule first, December is mostly local groups","baby_block":"Long shows in a dark hall, not for a baby"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Christmas Market in Hikari no Machi Hakata","name_ja":"クリスマスマーケット in 光の街・博多","city":"fukuoka","area":"Hakata","category":"experience","lat":33.5895,"lng":130.42,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שוק חג המולד בכיכר שמול תחנת האקאטה, עם דוכני אוכל ויין חם ותאורה על כל חזית התחנה.","reality":"אווירה חגיגית ונעימה, בחינם, ממש ביציאה מהתחנה. בסופי שבוע ובערבים צפוף מאוד.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כניסה חינם","tip":"המשקאות החמים מוגשים בכוס של האירוע שלוקחים הביתה.","sources":["https://tetsudo-ch.com/13042139.html","https://www.trvlogue.com/ja/fukuoka-christmas-market-2026"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"כיכר פתוחה ושטוחה, אבל צפופה בערב. עם עגלה עדיף בשעות המוקדמות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Christmas%20Market%20in%20Hikari%20no%20Machi%20Hakata%20Fukuoka","website_u