JIN CHRISTMAS ADVENT","city":"fukuoka","area":"Tenjin & Daimyo","category":"experience","lat":33.5899,"lng":130.4017,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שוק חג המולד ברחבה שליד בניין העירייה בטנג׳ין, עם דוכני אוכל, יין חם ועץ מואר.","reality":"קטן מהשוק של האקאטה ופחות צפוף, ונוח לשלב עם ערב בטנג׳ין ובפארק המואר שליד.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כניסה חינם","tip":"חמש דקות הליכה ממנו לפארק טנג׳ין צ׳ואו המואר, לעשות את שניהם באותו ערב.","sources":["https://tetsudo-ch.com/13042139.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"רחבה פתוחה ושטוחה, נוח עם עגלה בשעות המוקדמות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tenjin%20Christmas%20Advent%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מסתובבים בין הדוכנים ברחבה, אוכלים ושותים משהו חם וממשיכים ברגל לפארק המואר.","special":"השוק נשאר פתוח עד 26 בדצמבר, יום אחרי שאר השווקים בעיר.","highlights":["דוכני אוכל","יין חם","עץ חג המולד המואר"],"time_needed":"45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Fukuoka City Hall Fureai Hiroba, 1-8-1 Tenjin, Chuo-ku, Fukuoka","opens":"17:00","closes":"23:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":["2026-12-12","2026-12-13","2026-12-14","2026-12-15","2026-12-16","2026-12-17","2026-12-18","2026-12-19","2026-12-20","2026-12-21","2026-12-22","2026-12-23","2026-12-24","2026-12-25","2026-12-26"],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בימי חול נפתח ב-17:00, בסופ״ש ובחגים ב-12:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["christmas market","christmas","illumination","lights","mulled wine","festival","winter","שוק חג המולד","כריסמס","חג המולד","תאורה","אורות","יין חם","פסטיבל","חורף"],"en":{"hype":"A Christmas market on the plaza by Tenjin's City Hall, with food stalls, mulled wine and a lit tree.","reality":"Smaller and calmer than the Hakata one, and easy to combine with an evening in Tenjin and the lit park next door.","tip":"The lit Tenjin Central Park is five minutes away on foot, do both the same evening.","baby_notes":"Open flat plaza, easy with a stroller early on.","price":"Free entry","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the stalls on the plaza, grab something hot to eat and drink, then walk over to the lit park.","special":"It stays open until December 26, a day after the other markets in the city.","highlights":["Food stalls","Mulled wine","Lit Christmas tree"],"time_needed":"45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Weekdays from 17:00, weekends and holidays from 12:00","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hikari no Forest Tenjin Central Park","name_ja":"光のフォレスト 天神中央公園","city":"fukuoka","area":"Tenjin & Daimyo","category":"experience","lat":33.5925,"lng":130.4035,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פארק טנג׳ין צ׳ואו מואר באלפי אורות לחג המולד, עם דוכנים ומופע קרקס חינמי בחוץ.","reality":"יפה במיוחד ליד הנהר והבניין הלבן ההיסטורי. מופע הקרקס בחינם הוא בונוס, אבל בגשם מבוטל.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"מופע הקרקס REVERIE עד 19 בדצמבר, ב-18:15 וב-20:25, לא בשישי ושבת.","sources":["https://tetsudo-ch.com/13042139.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים סלולים בפארק, נוח עם עגלה. בערב קר ליד הנהר.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hikari%20no%20Forest%20Tenjin%20Central%20Park%20Fukuoka","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מטיילים בשבילים המוארים בין העצים, עוצרים לאכול בדוכנים ונשארים למופע הקרקס אם הוא באותו ערב.","special":"קרקס חוצות חינמי באמצע העיר, בנוסף לתאורה סביב הבניין ההיסטורי מ-1910.","highlights":["שבילים מוארים","מופע הקרקס REVERIE","הבניין הלבן המואר"],"time_needed":"45 דקות-שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Tenjin Chuo Park, 1 Nishinakasu, Chuo-ku, Fukuoka","opens":"17:00","closes":"22:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":["2026-12-12","2026-12-13","2026-12-14","2026-12-15","2026-12-16","2026-12-17","2026-12-18","2026-12-19","2026-12-20","2026-12-21","2026-12-22","2026-12-23","2026-12-24","2026-12-25"],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":50,"booking":"no","plan_line":"התאורה דולקת עד חצות, הדוכנים עד 22:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["illumination","christmas lights","lights","park","circus","free show","christmas","winter","תאורה","אורות","אורות חג המולד","פארק","קרקס","מופע חינם","כריסמס","חורף"],"en":{"hype":"Tenjin Central Park lit with thousands of Christmas lights, with stalls and a free outdoor circus show.","reality":"Especially pretty by the river and the white historic building. The free circus is a bonus, but it's cancelled in rain.","tip":"The REVERIE circus runs until December 19, at 18:15 and 20:25, not on Fridays or Saturdays.","baby_notes":"Paved park paths, easy with a stroller. Cold by the river at night.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the lit paths between the trees, eat at the stalls and stay for the circus if it's on that night.","special":"A free outdoor circus in the middle of the city, plus lights around the 1910 historic building.","highlights":["Lit paths","REVERIE circus","Lit white building"],"time_needed":"45 minutes-1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Lights stay on until midnight, stalls until 22:00","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
