:30, תור קצר בסופ״ש","baby_block":null,"tags":["apple pie","afternoon tea","tea","coffee","cake","historic hotel","lounge","פאי תפוחים","אפטרנון טי","תה","קפה","עוגה","מלון היסטורי"],"en":{"hype":"Fujiya Hotel's lounge with a garden window, known for its old-recipe apple pie and afternoon tea.","reality":"Apple pie and coffee here is the cheap way to soak up the historic hotel. Afternoon tea is very pricey.","tip":"Walk the hotel halls and garden afterwards.","baby_notes":"Babies and strollers welcome, no smoking.","price":"¥2,000-4,000 per person, afternoon tea ¥8,500","serves":"Apple pie, royal milk tea, house coffee and afternoon tea.","dishes":["Apple pie","Apple pie a la mode","Royal milk tea","Afternoon tea"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"About 1 hour","kosher_note":"Desserts and drinks. Ask about ham in the afternoon tea sandwiches.","plan_line":"Open daily until 17:30, short wait at weekends","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Bakery & Sweets Picot","name_ja":"ベーカリー&スイーツ ピコット","city":"hakone","area":"Miyanoshita & Gora","category":"cafe","lat":35.2423,"lng":139.0565,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המאפייה של מלון פוג׳יה, מפורסמת בלחמניית קארי ובפאי התפוחים של המלון.","reality":"מאפים טובים במחיר סביר, טוב לקנות לדרך. רק 8 מקומות ישיבה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":3.68,"google_score":null,"price":"¥500-1,500","tip":"לחמניית הקארי הקלאסית יוצאת חמה בבוקר.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/kanagawa/A1410/A141001/14007490/","https://www.fujiyahotel.jp/meal/picot/index.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מקבלים ילדים. כמעט אין ישיבה, עדיף לקחת.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Picot%20Fujiya%20Hotel%20Miyanoshita%20Hakone","website_url":"https://www.fujiyahotel.jp/meal/picot/index.html","serves":"לחמים ומאפים של המלון, פאי תפוחים וקארי בשקית למזכרת.","dishes":["לחמניית קארי","לחם צימוקים","פאי תפוחים"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highli