ה ותה.","address":"395-1 Futagoyama, Hatajuku, Hakone, Ashigarashimo District, Kanagawa","opens":"07:00","closes":"17:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"מזומן בלבד. פתוח מ-7:00 כל יום","baby_block":null,"tags":["amazake","mochi","teahouse","tokaido","old road","rice drink","thatched roof","אמזאקה","מוצ׳י","בית תה","טוקאידו","דרך עתיקה","משקה אורז","גג קש"],"en":{"hype":"Thatched-roof teahouse on the old Tokaido road, serving amazake and mochi for centuries.","reality":"One of the most genuine stops in Hakone, best after walking the stone path. Amazake is a sweet, alcohol-free rice drink.","tip":"Cash only. Reach it by bus from Yumoto or Moto-Hakone.","baby_notes":"Tatami room. The old stone path is not for strollers, come by bus.","price":"¥500-1,500","serves":"Amazake (sweet fermented rice drink, no alcohol) and rice mochi with coatings.","dishes":["Amazake","Chikara mochi"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"30 min","kosher_note":"Rice, sweet beans and tea.","plan_line":"Cash only. Opens 7:00 daily","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Bakery & Table Hakone","name_ja":"ベーカリー&テーブル 箱根","city":"hakone","area":"Lake Ashi","category":"cafe","lat":35.2043,"lng":139.0247,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מאפייה בשלוש קומות מול נמל מוטו־הקונה, עם אמבט רגליים על המרפסת מול אגם אשי.","reality":"המקום הכי מצולם על האגם והלחם טוב באמת. בסופ״ש תור לקופה ולמקום באמבט הרגליים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":3.59,"google_score":null,"price":"¥800-2,500","tip":"לחמניית הקארי והלחם בצורת הר פוג׳י הם הנמכרים.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/kanagawa/A1410/A141001/14051671/","http://www.bthjapan.com/hakone.php"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מקבלים ילדים ועגלות. ללא עישון גם בחוץ.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bakery%20%26%20Table%20Hakone%20Hakone","website_url":"http://www.bthjapan.com/hakone.php","serves":"לחמים ומאפים, מרקים וקפה, ובית קפה עם נוף לאגם.","dishes":["לחמניית קארי","לחם הר פוג׳י","פוקאצ׳ת עגבניות"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"45 דקות","kosher":"options","kosher_note":"רוב הלחמים בסדר. לבדוק נקניקיות וקארי.","address":"9-1 Motohakone, Hakone, Ashigarashimo District, Kanagawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"פתוח מ-9:00. להגיע מוקדם לאמבט הרגליים","baby_block":null,"tags":["bakery","bread","curry bread","foot bath","lake view","cafe","coffee","breakfast","מאפייה","לחם","לחמניית קארי","אמבט רגליים","נוף לאגם","בית קפה","קפה","ארוחת בוקר"],"en":{"hype":"Three-floor bakery facing Moto-Hakone port, with a foot bath on the deck looking over Lake Ashi.","reality":"The most photographed spot on the lake, and the bread really is good. Weekend lines for the till and the foot bath.","tip":"The curry bread and Mt Fuji bread are the top sellers.","baby_notes":"Kids and strollers welcome. No smoking outdoors either.","price":"¥800-2,500","serves":"Breads and pastries, soups and coffee, and a cafe with lake views.","dishes":["Curry bread","Mt Fuji bread","Tomato focaccia"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"45 min","kosher_note":"Most breads are fine. Check the sausage and curry ones.","plan_line":"Opens 9:00. Come early for the foot bath","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Cafe Komon","name_ja":"cafe KOMON 湖紋","city":"hakone","area":"Lake Ashi","category":"cafe","lat":35.1935,"lng":139.027,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בית קפה גדול ליד מחסום הקונה סקישו, עם חלונות לאגם, דנגו, מתוקי מאצ׳ה וארוחות.","reality":"מקום מרווח ונוח עם נוף, טוב לעצירה ארוכה עם תינוק בצד הדרומי של האגם.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":3.47,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,200-3,000 לסועד","tip":"הפנקייק מאצ׳ה עם אזוקי הוא המנה המתוקה הבולטת.","s