 nouveau","perfume bottles","מוזיאון","מוזיאון אמנות","לליק","זכוכית","תכשיטים","ארט נובו","בקבוקי בושם"],"en":{"hype":"A museum of jewelry and glass by Rene Lalique, the French Art Nouveau master.","reality":"Pretty and well kept, but niche. Mainly for people into design and glass.","tip":"An Orient Express carriage stands by the entrance; it takes a separate ticket.","baby_notes":"A quiet museum, a crying baby will stand out.","price":"¥1,500","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Look through Lalique's jewelry, perfume bottles and glass, and there is a small garden outside.","special":"A big collection of Lalique, from jewelry to glass car mascots.","highlights":["Art Nouveau jewelry","Perfume bottles","The garden"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed the third Thursday of the month; last entry 15:30","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hakone Venetian Glass Museum","name_ja":"箱根ガラスの森美術館","city":"hakone","area":"Sengokuhara","category":"sight","lat":35.2648,"lng":139.0293,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון זכוכית ונציאנית בסגנון איטלקי, עם גן, בריכה ופסלי זכוכית ענקיים שנוצצים בשמש.","reality":"קצת קיטשי אבל צילומי ונעים, והגן יפה במיוחד בשמש. האוסף עצמו פחות מרשים מהתפאורה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,800, ¥1,700 עם הפרי פס","tip":"ביום שמש הקשתות מקריסטל בגן נוצצות, שווה לתזמן לצהריים.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5215.html","https://www.hakonenavi.jp/international/en/spot/604"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים סלולים בגן, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hakone%20Venetian%20Glass%20Museum%20Hakone","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מסתובבים בגן בין הקשתות והעצים מזכוכית, נכנסים למוזיאון של יותר מ-100 יצירות ונחים בקפה עם הופעה איטלקית.","special":"קשתות ועצים מכוסים בקריסטלים שמנצנצים באור, ובקפה שרים בלדות איטלקיות.","highlights":["קשת הקריסטלים בגן","זכוכית ונציאנית עתיקה","הקפה עם המוזיקה החיה"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"940-48 Sengokuhara, Hakone, Ashigarashimo District, Kanagawa","opens":"10:00","closes":"17:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"הכי יפה ביום שמש; כניסה אחרונה 17:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["museum","glass museum","venetian glass","crystal","garden","italian","photo spot","מוזיאון","מוזיאון זכוכית","זכוכית ונציאנית","קריסטל","גן","איטלקי","נקודת צילום"],"en":{"hype":"An Italian-style Venetian glass museum with a garden, a pond and huge glass sculptures that sparkle in the sun.","reality":"A bit kitschy but photogenic and pleasant, and the garden is best in sunshine. The collection matters less than the setting.","tip":"On a sunny day the crystal arches sparkle, so aim for midday.","baby_notes":"Paved garden paths, easy with a stroller.","price":"¥1,800, ¥1,700 with the Free Pass","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the garden among the glass arches and trees, see 100+ pieces in the museum and rest at the cafe with live Italian music.","special":"Arches and trees covered in crystals that catch the light, and Italian ballads sung in the cafe.","highlights":["The crystal arch in the garden","Antique Venetian glass","Cafe with live music"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Best on a sunny day; last entry 17:00","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Choanji Temple","name_ja":"長安寺","city":"hakone","area":"Sengokuhara","category":"sight","lat":35.271,"lng":139.033,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש זן מ-1356 בסנגוקוהרה, עם מאות פסלי ראקאן (תלמידי הבודהה) פזורים ביער.","reality":"שקט, חינם וכמעט בלי תיירים. כל פסל עם פרצוף והבעה משלו, וזה מצחיק ומרגש.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"לחפש את הפסלים עם ההבעות המשונות, כל אחד שונה.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5219.html","https://www.hakonenavi.jp/international/en/spot/353"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילי עפר ומדרגות ביער, עדיף מנשא.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Choanji%20Temple%20Hakone","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים בשער, מטיילים בשבילים בין הפסלים, ונכנסים לאולם המקדש.","special":"יותר מ-200 פסלי ראקאן מודרניים ביער, כל אחד בפוזה אחרת.","highlights":["פסלי הראקאן","שבילי היער","שלכת בנובמבר"],"time_needed":"20-40 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Sengokuhara, Hakone, Ashigarashimo District, Kanagawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"חינם ופתוח תמיד; 2 דקות מתחנת האוטובוס סנגוקו","baby_block":null,"tags":["temple","zen temple","rakan","statues","buddhist statues","forest","free","quiet","מקדש","מקדש זן","ראקאן","פסלים","פסלי בודהה","יער","חינם","שקט"],"en":{"hype":"A Zen temple from 1356 in Sengokuhara, with hundreds of rakan statues (Buddha's disciples) scattered through the woods.","reality":"Quiet, free and almost tourist-free. Every statue has its own face and expression; funny and touching.","tip":"Look for the odd expressions, each one is different.","baby_notes":"Dirt paths and steps in the woods; a carrier is easier.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go in through the gate, walk the paths among the statues and step into the main hall.","special":"Over 200 modern rakan statues in the forest, each in a different pose.","highlights":["The rakan statues","Forest paths","Fall colors in November"],"time_needed":"20-40 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Free, always open; 2 min from the Sengoku bus stop","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Sengokuhara Pampas Grass Field","name_ja":"仙石原すすき草原","city":"hakone","area":"Sengokuhara","category":"sight","lat":35.246,"lng":139.008,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שדה עשב סוסוקי ענק על מדרון ההר, שהופך לזהב כסוף בסתיו.","reality":"בסתיו זה יפהפה, אבל בדצמבר העשב חום ונבול ושווה הרבה פחות. ביקור רק אם עוברים בדרך.","verdict":"overhyped","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"בדצמבר לא לעשות מזה יעד, רק עצירה קצרה מהאוטובוס.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5218.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sengokuhara%20Pampas%20Grass%20Field%20Hakone","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יורדים בתחנת סנגוקו קוגן, הולכים בשביל שחוצה את השדה במעלה ההר ומצלמים.","special":"מדרון שלם מכוסה עשב גבוה שזז ברוח, בלי בניין אחד באופק.","highlights":["השביל באמצע השדה","תצפית על העמק"],"time_needed":"20-30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Sengokuhara, Hakone, Ashigarashimo District, Kanagawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בדצמבר העשב חום, שווה רק כעצירה קצרה","baby_block":null,"tags":["pampas grass","susuki","grassland","field","nature","autumn","walk","photo spot","עשב סוסוקי","סוסוקי","שדה","אחו","טבע","סתיו","הליכה","נקודת צילום"],"en":{"hype":"A huge field of susuki grass on the mountainside that turns silvery gold in fall.","reality":"Gorgeous in autumn, but in December the grass is brown and dying and worth much less. Only if you are passing anyway.","tip":"In December don't make it a destination, just a quick bus stop.","baby_notes":null,"price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Get off at Sengoku Kogen bus stop, walk the path up through the field and take photos.","special":"A whole slope of tall grass moving in the wind, not a building in sight.","highlights":["The path through the field","View over the valley"],"time_needed":"20-30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Brown in December, only worth a short stop","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Mount Kintoki","name_ja":"金時山","city":"hakone","area":"Sengokuhara","category":"experience","lat":35.277,"lng":139.034,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"טיול הר קצר למתחילים בצפון סנגוקוהרה, עם נוף ישיר לפוג׳י מהפסגה.","reality":"הנוף לפוג׳י מהפסגה מהטובים באזור, והשביל תלול וסלעי בסוף. בדצמבר קר מאוד למעלה.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"לצאת בבוקר, אז פוג׳י הכי ברור.","sources":["https://www.hakonenavi.jp/international/en/spot/581"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Mount%20Kintoki%20Hakone","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מתחילים בשביל מקינטוקי טוזנגוצ׳י, כשעתיים עלייה לפסגה, אוכלים סובה או אודון באחד משני בתי התה למעלה ויורדים.","special":"פוג׳י ממלא את כל האופק מהפסגה, בלי שום דבר באמצע.","highlights":["הנוף לפוג׳י","בתי התה בפסגה","נוף לאגם אשי"],"time_needed":"3-4 שעות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Kintoki Tozanguchi, Sengokuhara, Hakone, Ashigarashimo District, Kanagawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":210,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לצאת מוקדם ולהביא שכבות חמות, בפסגה קר","baby_block":"שביל הר תלול וסלעי, לא לעגלה","tags":["hike","hiking","mountain","mount fuji","fuji view","summit","trail","nature","טיול","טיול רגלי","הר","הר פוג׳י","נוף לפוג׳י","פסגה","שביל","טבע"],"en":{"hype":"A short beginner hike in north Sengokuhara with a straight-on view of Fuji from the top.","reality":"One of the best Fuji views around, and the trail gets steep and rocky near the end. Very cold up top in December.","tip":"Start in the morning, when Fuji is clearest.","baby_notes":null,"price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Start from the Kintoki Tozanguchi trailhead, climb about two hours to the summit, have soba or udon at one of the two teahouses and head down.","special":"Fuji fills the whole horizon from the top with nothing in between.","highlights":["Fuji view","Summit teahouses","View of Lake Ashi"],"time_needed":"3-4 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Start early and bring warm layers, it is cold on top","baby_block":"Steep, rocky mountain trail, no stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hakone Green Plaza Hotel Onsen","name_ja":"箱根グリーンプラザ","city":"hakone","area":"Sengokuhara","category":"experience","lat":35.24,"lng":139.006,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מלון ליד תחנת אובאקו של הרכבל, שהאמבטיות החיצוניות שלו פתוחות ביום ומשקיפות לפוג׳י.","reality":"נוף לפוג׳י מהאמבט, בזול יחסית ובלי המון אנשים. רק אחר הצהריים, וביום מעונן אין נוף.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,600","tip":"ברביעי וחמישי נפתח רק ב-15:00.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5209.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hakone%20Green%20Plaza%20Hotel%20Onsen%20Hakone","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יורדים מהרכבל באובאקו, הולכים כמה דקות למלון וטובלים באמבט החיצוני מול פוג׳י.","special":"אחד המקומות הבודדים בהקונה שרואים בהם את פוג׳י מתוך המים.","highlights":["אמבט חיצוני מול פוג׳י","קרוב לתחנת אובאקו"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Sengokuhara, Hakone, Ashigarashimo District, Kanagawa","opens":"13:00","closes":"18:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"רחצת יום 13:00-18:00, ברביעי-חמישי רק מ-15:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["onsen","hot spring","day onsen","rotenburo","mount fuji","fuji view","outdoor bath","אונסן","מעיין חם","אונסן יום","רוטנבורו","הר פוג׳י","נוף לפוג׳י","אמבט חיצוני"],"en":{"hype":"A hotel near Ubako ropeway station whose outdoor baths open to day visitors and face Mt Fuji.","reality":"Fuji from the tub, fairly cheap and not crowded. Afternoons only, and no view on cloudy days.","tip":"On Wednesdays and Thursdays it opens only at 15:00.","baby_notes":null,"price":"¥1,600","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Get off the ropeway at Ubako, walk a few minutes to the hotel and soak in the outdoor bath facing Fuji.","special":"One of the few spots in Hakone where you see Fuji from the water.","highlights":["Outdoor bath facing Fuji","Close to Ubako station"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Day bathing 13:00-18:00, from 15:00 Wed-Thu","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hakone Shrine","name_ja":"箱根神社","city":"hakone","area":"Lake Ashi","category":"sight","lat":35.2048,"lng":139.0251,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש שינטו ביער ארזים על חוף אגם אשי, עם שער טורי אדום שעומד בתוך המים.","reality":"היער והמדרגות יפים מאוד. לתמונה בשער שבמים יש תור ארוך, לרוב חצי שעה ומעלה, ואפשר לצלם אותו מהצד בלי לחכות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"להגיע לפני 9:00, אז התור לשער שבמים קצר.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5204.html","https://hakonejinja.or.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"הרבה מדרגות אבן בין השער למקדש הראשי, עגלה קשה. עדיף מנשא.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hakone%20Shrine%20Hakone","website_url":"https://hakonejinja.or.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במדרגות האבן בין הארזים לאולם הראשי, יורדים לשער הטורי שבמים, ומבקרים במקדש הקטן של קוזוריו (הדרקון) בשטח.","special":"שער השלום (הייווה נו טוריי) עומד בתוך האגם, ובימים בהירים פוג׳י ברקע.","highlights":["שער השלום במים","מדרגות ביער הארזים","מקדש קוזוריו"],"time_needed":"כשעה כולל תור","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"80-1 Motohakone, Hakone, Ashigarashimo District, Kanagawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"להגיע לפני 9:00 לתמונה בשער שבמים בלי תור ארוך","baby_block":null,"tags":["shrine","shinto shrine","torii","floating torii","peace torii","lake","cedar forest","photo spot","מקדש","מקדש שינטו","טוריי","שער","שער צף","אגם","יער ארזים","נקודת צילום"],"en":{"hype":"A Shinto shrine in a cedar forest on Lake Ashi, with a red torii gate standing in the water.","reality":"The forest and stairs are beautiful. The photo at the lake torii usually means a line of 30 minutes or more, but you can shoot it from the side without waiting.","tip":"Arrive before 9:00, when the torii line is short.","baby_notes":"Lots of stone steps between the gate and the main hall, hard with a stroller. A carrier is easier.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Climb the stone steps through the cedars to the main hall, go down to the torii in the water and visit the small Kuzuryu (dragon) shrine on the grounds.","special":"The Peace Torii stands in the lake, with Fuji behind it on clear days.","highlights":["Peace Torii in the water","Steps through the cedar forest","Kuzuryu shrine"],"time_needed":"About an hour with the line","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Arrive before 9:00 for the lake torii photo without a long line","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hakone Sightseeing Cruise","name_ja":"箱根海賊船","city":"hakone","area":"Lake Ashi","category":"experience","lat":35.2023,"lng":139.0258,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"ספינות בצורת ספינות פיראטים ששטות על אגם אשי בין טוגנדאי למוטו-הקונה, עם פוג׳י ביום בהיר.","reality":"הספינות עצמן קיטש מוחלט, אבל השיט נעים והנוף לאגם ולפוג׳י מהסיפון יפה. 25-40 דקות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,700 כיוון אחד, כלול בהקונה פרי פס","tip":"לעלות לסיפון העליון בחרטום, משם הנוף לפוג׳י הכי טוב.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5201.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש מקום לעגלה בסיפון הסגור. על הסיפון הפתוח קר ורוח בחורף.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hakone%20Sightseeing%20Cruise%20Hakone","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים בטוגנדאי אחרי הרכבל, שטים לאורך האגם ויורדים במוטו-הקונה, ליד מקדש הקונה.","special":"הדרך הכי טובה לראות את פוג׳י מעל אגם אשי, והוא חלק טבעי מהמעגל של הפרי פס.","highlights":["פוג׳י מהסיפון","השער האדום מהמים","שיט טוגנדאי-מוטו-הקונה"],"time_needed":"30-40 דקות שיט","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Motohakone Port, Motohakone, Hakone, Ashigarashimo District, Kanagawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"פוג׳י נראה הכי טוב בבוקר מוקדם או לפני השקיעה","baby_block":null,"tags":["boat","cruise","pirate ship","lake ashi","lake cruise","mount fuji","free pass","ferry","סירה","שיט","ספינת פיראטים","אגם אשי","שיט באגם","הר פוג׳י","פרי פס","מעבורת"],"en":{"hype":"Pirate-ship-shaped boats crossing Lake Ashi between Togendai and Moto-Hakone, with Fuji on clear days.","reality":"The boats are pure kitsch, but the ride is pleasant and the lake and Fuji views from deck are lovely. 25-40 minutes.","tip":"Head to the top deck at the bow for the best Fuji view.","baby_notes":"Room for a stroller on the enclosed deck. The open deck is cold and windy in winter.","price":"¥1,700 one way, covered by the Hakone Free Pass","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Board at Togendai after the ropeway, cruise the length of the lake and get off at Moto-Hakone near Hakone Shrine.","special":"The best way to see Fuji over Lake Ashi, and a natural part of the Free Pass loop.","highlights":["Fuji from the deck","The red torii from the water","Togendai to Moto-Hakone"],"time_needed":"30-40 minute cruise","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Fuji shows best early morning or before sunset","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hakone Checkpoint","name_ja":"箱根関所","city":"hakone","area":"Lake Ashi","category":"sight","lat":35.1906,"lng":139.0263,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שחזור של מחסום הבידוק של תקופת אדו על דרך הטוקאידו, ליד אגם אשי.","reality":"שחזור מדויק ומעניין לחובבי היסטוריה, אבל מהיר. חצי שעה מספיקה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥500, ¥400 עם הפרי פס","tip":"לעלות למגדל התצפית בשביל הנוף על האגם.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5205.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חצר עם חצץ, ובמגדל מדרגות תלולות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hakone%20Checkpoint%20Hakone","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בשערים, נכנסים לבתי השומרים ולתא המעצר, עולים למגדל ומסיימים במוזיאון הקטן ליד.","special":"נבנה מחדש ב-2007 בשיטות של פעם, על בסיס התוכניות המקוריות.","highlights":["מגדל התצפית","בתי השומרים","מוזיאון המחסום"],"time_needed":"30-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1 Hakone, Hakone, Ashigarashimo District, Kanagawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בדצמבר נסגר ב-16:30; כמה דקות מנמל הקונה-מאצ׳י","baby_block":null,"tags":["history","checkpoint","sekisho","edo period","tokaido","samurai","museum","היסטוריה","מחסום","סקישו","תקופת אדו","טוקאידו","סמוראים","מוזיאון"],"en":{"hype":"A rebuilt Edo-period inspection checkpoint on the old Tokaido road by Lake Ashi.","reality":"Accurate and interesting for history fans, but quick. Half an hour is enough.","tip":"Climb the lookout tower for the lake view.","baby_notes":"Gravel yard, and steep stairs in the tower.","price":"¥500, ¥400 with the Free Pass","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk through the gates, look into the guards' quarters and the cell, climb the tower and finish in the small museum next door.","special":"Rebuilt in 2007 with traditional methods from the original plans.","highlights":["Lookout tower","Guards' quarters","Checkpoint museum"],"time_needed":"30-45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closes 16:30 in December; minutes from Hakone-machi pier","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Old Tokaido Cedar Avenue","name_ja":"旧街道杉並木","city":"hakone","area":"Lake Ashi","category":"sight","lat":35.1966,"lng":139.0275,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"קטע של דרך הטוקאידו העתיקה, בצל ארזים ענקיים מתקופת אדו, בין מוטו-הקונה להקונה-מאצ׳י.","reality":"הליכה קצרה, שקטה ויפה בין המקדש למחסום. חינם, ולא צריך לתכנן אותה בנפרד.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"ללכת בה ברגל מהמקדש למחסום במקום לנסוע.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5205.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שביל עפר שטוח, עגלה עוברת.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Old%20Tokaido%20Cedar%20Avenue%20Hakone","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים כ-15 דקות בשביל לאורך האגם, בין גזעי ארזים ענקיים.","special":"הארזים ניטעו בתקופת אדו כדי לתת צל לנוסעים בטוקאידו.","highlights":["ארזים ענקיים","שקט ליד האגם"],"time_needed":"15-20 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Motohakone, Hakone, Ashigarashimo District, Kanagawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":20,"booking":"no","plan_line":"ללכת ברגל ממקדש הקונה למחסום, רבע שעה","baby_block":null,"tags":["cedar","cedar trees","old road","tokaido","walk","forest","free","edo period","ארזים","עצי ארז","דרך עתיקה","טוקאידו","הליכה","יער","חינם","תקופת אדו"],"en":{"hype":"A stretch of the old Tokaido road under huge Edo-era cedars, between Moto-Hakone and Hakone-machi.","reality":"A short, quiet, lovely walk between the shrine and the checkpoint. Free, no separate planning needed.","tip":"Walk it from the shrine to the checkpoint instead of taking the bus.","baby_notes":"Flat dirt path, a stroller gets through.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk about 15 minutes along the lake between huge cedar trunks.","special":"The cedars were planted in the Edo period to shade Tokaido travelers.","highlights":["Giant cedars","Quiet by the lake"],"time_needed":"15-20 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Walk from Hakone Shrine to the checkpoint, 15 min","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Onshi Hakone Park","name_ja":"恩賜箱根公園","city":"hakone","area":"Lake Ashi","category":"sight","lat":35.1958,"lng":139.0294,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פארק על חצי אי באגם אשי, באתר ארמון הקיץ לשעבר של משפחת הקיסר.","reality":"חינם, שקט, ומאחת התצפיות הכי טובות על אגם אשי ופוג׳י. רוב התיירים מפספסים אותו.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"לעלות לתצפית שבראש הגבעה, משם רואים את פוג׳י מעל האגם.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5207.html","https://www.hakonenavi.jp/international/en/spot/479"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש מדרגות לתצפית, אבל השבילים הראשיים מתאימים לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Onshi%20Hakone%20Park%20Hakone","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים מהצד של המחסום, עולים בשבילים לבניין התצפית ומסתכלים על האגם משלושה כיוונים.","special":"נקודת תצפית שפוג׳י והאגם נראים ממנה ביחד, בלי המון אנשים.","highlights":["תצפית על פוג׳י והאגם","בניין התצפית","שבילי הפארק"],"time_needed":"30-60 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"171 Motohakone, Hakone, Ashigarashimo District, Kanagawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"הכי טוב לפוג׳י בבוקר; 10 דקות מהמחסום","baby_block":null,"tags":["park","viewpoint","mount fuji","fuji view","lake ashi","imperial villa","free","walk","פארק","תצפית","הר פוג׳י","נוף לפוג׳י","אגם אשי","ארמון קיסרי","חינם","הליכה"],"en":{"hype":"A park on a peninsula in Lake Ashi, on the site of the former imperial summer palace.","reality":"Free, quiet and one of the best viewpoints over Lake Ashi and Fuji. Most tourists miss it.","tip":"Climb to the lookout at the top of the hill for Fuji over the lake.","baby_notes":"Stairs to the lookout, but the main paths are fine with a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Enter from the checkpoint side, follow the paths up to the lookout building and take in the lake on three sides.","special":"A viewpoint with Fuji and the lake together, without the crowds.","highlights":["Fuji and lake view","Lookout building","Park paths"],"time_needed":"30-60 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Best for Fuji in the morning; 10 min from the checkpoint","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Narukawa Art Museum","name_ja":"成川美術館","city":"hakone","area":"Lake Ashi","category":"sight","lat":35.2017,"lng":139.0273,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון לציור יפני מודרני (ניהונגה) מעל נמל מוטו-הקונה, עם טרקלין פנורמי מול האגם.","reality":"הציורים מיועדים לחובבים, אבל הטרקלין עם החלונות הענקיים לאגם, לשער ולפוג׳י שווה את הכניסה ביום בהיר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,500, ¥1,300 עם הפרי פס","tip":"לבוא רק ביום בהיר, כל הקסם הוא הנוף.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5221.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש מעלית מהכניסה, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Narukawa%20Art%20Museum%20Hakone","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים מהנמל, מסתובבים בגלריות, ומתיישבים לקפה בטרקלין מול האגם.","special":"מהטרקלין רואים ביחד את האגם, את שער מקדש הקונה ואת פוג׳י.","highlights":["הטרקלין הפנורמי","ציורי ניהונגה","נוף לשער שבמים"],"time_needed":"30-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"570 Motohakone, Hakone, Ashigarashimo District, Kanagawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"שווה רק ביום בהיר; מול נמל מוטו-הקונה","baby_block":null,"tags":["museum","art museum","nihonga","japanese painting","lake view","mount fuji","cafe","viewpoint","מוזיאון","מוזיאון אמנות","ניהונגה","ציור יפני","נוף לאגם","הר פוג׳י","קפה","תצפית"],"en":{"hype":"A museum of modern Japanese-style painting (nihonga) above Moto-Hakone pier, with a panorama lounge facing the lake.","reality":"The paintings are for fans, but the lounge with huge windows on the lake, the torii and Fuji is worth the ticket on a clear day.","tip":"Only come on a clear day; the view is the whole point.","baby_notes":"Elevator from the entrance, fine with a stroller.","price":"¥1,500, ¥1,300 with the Free Pass","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk up from the pier, look around the galleries and sit down for coffee in the lounge facing the lake.","special":"From the lounge you see the lake, Hakone Shrine's torii and Fuji together.","highlights":["Panorama lounge","Nihonga paintings","View of the lake torii"],"time_needed":"30-45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Only worth it on a clear day; opposite Moto-Hakone pier","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hakone Komagatake Ropeway","name_ja":"箱根駒ヶ岳ロープウェー","city":"hakone","area":"Lake Ashi","category":"experience","lat":35.2184,"lng":139.021,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רכבל מהקונה-אן לפסגת הר קומגטקה, עם נוף לאגם אשי ולפוג׳י ומקדש קטן למעלה.","reality":"ביום בהיר הנוף מהפסגה מהטובים בהקונה, ופחות עמוס מהרכבל הראשי. ביום מעונן לא רואים כלום.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥2,200 הלוך-חזור; 10% הנחה עם הפרי פס","tip":"לבדוק את מצלמות הפסגה או מזג האוויר לפני, אם אין ראות לא לעלות.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5224.html","https://www.princehotels.co.jp/hakone-area/komagatake_ropeway/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"בפסגה רוח חזקה וקור, להלביש את התינוק חם.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hakone%20Komagatake%20Ropeway%20Hakone","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים 7 דקות בקרון הגדול, הולכים בפסגה עד מקדש הקונה מוטוצומיה ומסתכלים על האגם ופוג׳י.","special":"פסגה פתוחה עם נוף של 360 מעלות, ומקדש קטן שמביט על פוג׳י.","highlights":["נוף לפוג׳י ולאגם","מקדש מוטוצומיה","פסגת קומגטקה"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"139 Motohakone, Hakone, Ashigarashimo District, Kanagawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:50","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עולים רק ביום בהיר; נעצר ברוח חזקה","baby_block":null,"tags":["ropeway","cable car","gondola","mountain","summit","mount fuji","fuji view","shrine","viewpoint","רכבל","גונדולה","הר","פסגה","הר פוג׳י","נוף לפוג׳י","מקדש","תצפית"],"en":{"hype":"A ropeway from Hakone-en to the top of Mt Komagatake, with Lake Ashi and Fuji views and a small shrine up top.","reality":"On a clear day the summit view is one of Hakone's best, and it is quieter than the main ropeway. On a cloudy day you see nothing.","tip":"Check the weather or summit camera first; if visibility is poor, skip it.","baby_notes":"Strong wind and cold at the summit; dress the baby warmly.","price":"¥2,200 return; 10% off with the Free Pass","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Ride the big cabin up in about 7 minutes, walk across the summit to Hakone Mototsumiya shrine and look out over the lake and Fuji.","special":"An open summit with a 360-degree view and a small shrine facing Fuji.","highlights":["Fuji and lake views","Mototsumiya shrine","Komagatake summit"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Only go on a clear day; stops in strong wind","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hakone-en Aquarium","name_ja":"箱根園水族館","city":"hakone","area":"Lake Ashi","category":"sight","lat":35.2187,"lng":139.0209,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אקווריום קטן בחוף אגם אשי, עם כלבי ים במים מתוקים ובריכת מי ים.","reality":"קטן ומיושן, לא אקווריום של עיר גדולה. טוב ליום גשום עם תינוק או ילדים, לא יותר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,600 למבוגר, ילדים ¥800","tip":"יש כרטיס משולב עם רכבל קומגטקה שחוסך כסף.","sources":["https://www.hakonenavi.jp/spot/1236","https://www.walkerplus.com/spot/ar0314s16360/price.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מקורה וחמים, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hakone-en%20Aquarium%20Hakone","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין המיכלים, צופים בהאכלת כלבי הים ובבריכת הדגים הגדולה.","special":"כלבי ים בייקל, מכלבי הים הבודדים שחיים במים מתוקים.","highlights":["כלבי ים בייקל","האכלה","בריכת מי ים"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"139 Motohakone, Hakone, Ashigarashimo District, Kanagawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"כרטיס משולב עם רכבל קומגטקה זול יותר","baby_block":null,"tags":["aquarium","seals","fish","family","rainy day","kids","indoor","אקווריום","כלבי ים","דגים","משפחות","יום גשום","ילדים","מקורה"],"en":{"hype":"A small aquarium on Lake Ashi with freshwater seals and a seawater tank.","reality":"Small and dated, not a big-city aquarium. Fine for a rainy day with a baby or kids, no more.","tip":"A combo ticket with the Komagatake Ropeway saves money.","baby_notes":"Indoors and warm, easy with a stroller.","price":"¥1,600 adults, ¥800 kids","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk past the tanks and watch the seal feeding and the big fish tank.","special":"Baikal seals, one of the few seals that live in fresh water.","highlights":["Baikal seals","Feeding time","Seawater tank"],"time_needed":"An hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Combo ticket with Komagatake Ropeway is cheaper","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kuzuryu Shrine Hongu","name_ja":"九頭龍神社 本宮","city":"hakone","area":"Lake Ashi","category":"sight","lat":35.229,"lng":139.017,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המקדש הראשי של הדרקון בעל תשעת הראשים, בתוך יער על חוף אגם אשי.","reality":"שקט ומיוחד, אבל רחוק: הליכה של חצי שעה מטוגנדאי או כניסה בתשלום ליער קוזוריו מצד הקונה-אן.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"ב-13 בכל חודש יש טקס חודשי והמקום עמוס.","sources":["https://www.hakonenavi.jp/international/en/spot/519","https://hakonejinja.or.jp/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kuzuryu%20Shrine%20Hongu%20Hakone","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים ביער לאורך החוף עד המקדש הקטן, שותים ממי המעיין ומסתכלים על האגם.","special":"מקדש ביער על המים, רחוק מההמונים של מקדש הקונה.","highlights":["המקדש על חוף האגם","יער קוזוריו","מי המעיין"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי כולל הליכה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Hakone Kuzuryu no Mori, Motohakone, Hakone, Ashigarashimo District, Kanagawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"חצי שעה הליכה מטוגנדאי; ב-13 בחודש עמוס","baby_block":"הליכה ארוכה ביער, לא לעגלה","tags":["shrine","shinto shrine","dragon","kuzuryu","forest","lake","quiet","walk","מקדש","מקדש שינטו","דרקון","קוזוריו","יער","אגם","שקט","הליכה"],"en":{"hype":"The main shrine of the nine-headed dragon, in a forest on the Lake Ashi shore.","reality":"Quiet and special, but far: a 30-minute walk from Togendai or a paid entry to Kuzuryu Forest from the Hakone-en side.","tip":"On the 13th of each month there is a monthly ceremony and it gets crowded.","baby_notes":null,"price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk through the forest along the shore to the little shrine, drink from the spring and take in the lake.","special":"A forest shrine on the water, far from the Hakone Shrine crowds.","highlights":["Shrine on the lakeshore","Kuzuryu Forest","Spring water"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours with the walk","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"30-min walk from Togendai; crowded on the 13th","baby_block":"Long forest walk, no stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hakone Ryuguden Honkan Day Onsen","name_ja":"龍宮殿本館 日帰り温泉","city":"hakone","area":"Lake Ashi","category":"experience","lat":35.22,"lng":139.02,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אונסן יום ליד הקונה-אן, היחיד בהקונה שרואים ממנו את אגם אשי ואת פוג׳י מאותה נקודה.","reality":"הנוף מהאמבט החיצוני מעולה ביום בהיר. רחוק מהתחנות, צריך אוטובוס מעגלי.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"לבדוק שעות באתר הרשמי לפני, הן משתנות.","sources":["https://www.hakonenavi.jp/international/en/spot/510"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hakone%20Ryuguden%20Honkan%20Day%20Onsen%20Hakone","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"אוטובוס מעגלי חינם ממוטו-הקונה, ואז טבילה באמבט החיצוני מול האגם ופוג׳י.","special":"אגם ופוג׳י ביחד מתוך המים, משהו שאין בשום אונסן אחר בהקונה.","highlights":["אמבט חיצוני מול האגם","נוף לפוג׳י"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"139 Motohakone, Hakone, Ashigarashimo District, Kanagawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"אוטובוס מעגלי חינם מליד הלוסון במוטו-הקונה","baby_block":null,"tags":["onsen","hot spring","day onsen","rotenburo","lake view","mount fuji","fuji view","outdoor bath","אונסן","מעיין חם","אונסן יום","רוטנבורו","נוף לאגם","הר פוג׳י","נוף לפוג׳י","אמבט חיצוני"],"en":{"hype":"A day onsen near Hakone-en, the only one in Hakone where you see Lake Ashi and Fuji from the same spot.","reality":"The outdoor bath view is superb on a clear day. Far from the stations; you need a loop bus.","tip":"Check hours on the official site first, they change.","baby_notes":null,"price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Free loop bus from Moto-Hakone, then soak in the outdoor bath facing the lake and Fuji.","special":"Lake and Fuji together from the water, something no other Hakone onsen has.","highlights":["Outdoor bath facing the lake","Fuji view"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Free loop bus from near the Lawson in Moto-Hakone","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Old Tokaido Road Hike (Moto-Hakone to Hatajuku)","name_ja":"箱根旧街道 石畳","city":"hakone","area":"Lake Ashi","category":"experience","lat":35.2008,"lng":139.03,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מסלול הליכה על אבני המרצפת המקוריות של דרך הטוקאידו, ממוטו-הקונה דרך בית התה אמאזקה צ׳איה עד הכפר האטאג׳וקו.","reality":"הקטע הכי יפה ושמור של הדרך העתיקה, ביער שקט. האבנים חלקלקות בגשם, ויורדים הרבה.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"ללכת בכיוון מטה, ממוטו-הקונה להאטאג׳וקו, ולחזור לאוטובוס K ליומוטו.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5205.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Old%20Tokaido%20Road%20Hike%20(Moto-Hakone%20to%20Hatajuku)%20Hakone","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יוצאים ממוטו-הקונה, עוצרים לאמאזקה (משקה אורז מתוק) בבית התה מתקופת אדו, וממשיכים בירידה ביער עד האטאג׳וקו.","special":"הולכים על אותן אבנים שהלכו עליהן נוסעים וסמוראים לפני 400 שנה.","highlights":["אבני המרצפת העתיקות","בית התה אמאזקה צ׳איה","הכפר האטאג׳וקו"],"time_needed":"שעה וחצי-שעה ושלושה רבעים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Motohakone, Hakone, Ashigarashimo District, Kanagawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":100,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לא ללכת אחרי גשם, האבנים חלקות מאוד","baby_block":"אבנים לא אחידות ומדרגות, לא לעגלה","tags":["hike","hiking","old road","tokaido","stone path","forest","edo period","tea house","walk","טיול","טיול רגלי","דרך עתיקה","טוקאידו","שביל אבן","יער","תקופת אדו","בית תה","הליכה"],"en":{"hype":"A walk on the original paving stones of the Tokaido road, from Moto-Hakone past Amazake-chaya teahouse to Hatajuku village.","reality":"The prettiest, best-kept stretch of the old road, through quiet forest. The stones get slippery in rain, and it is a lot of downhill.","tip":"Walk it downhill, Moto-Hakone to Hatajuku, then take bus K back to Yumoto.","baby_notes":null,"price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Set off from Moto-Hakone, stop for amazake (sweet rice drink) at the Edo-era teahouse and carry on downhill through the woods to Hatajuku.","special":"You walk the same stones travelers and samurai used 400 years ago.","highlights":["Ancient paving stones","Amazake-chaya teahouse","Hatajuku village"],"time_needed":"75-100 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Don't go after rain, the stones get very slippery","baby_block":"Uneven stones and steps, no stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Odawara Castle","name_ja":"小田原城","city":"hakone","area":"Odawara","category":"sight","lat":35.2508,"lng":139.1534,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"טירת הוג׳ו הלבנה, 10 דקות הליכה מתחנת אודווארה, בפארק עם חפיר וגשרים אדומים.","reality":"הטירה היא שחזור בטון מ-1960 והמוזיאון בפנים בינוני, אבל הפארק יפה והנוף מהקומה העליונה לים ולעיר שווה. עצירה טובה בדרך להקונה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"טירה ¥1,000 (כולל ביתן הסמוראים), ביתן הנינג׳ות ¥500","tip":"לשמור את הכרטיס, הוא כולל גם את ביתן הסמוראים בשער טוקיוואגי.","sources":["https://odawaracastle.com/info/","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5222.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"הפארק נוח לעגלה, אבל בתוך הטירה רק מדרגות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Odawara%20Castle%20Odawara","website_url":"https://odawaracastle.com/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בשערים ובגשרים, עולים בקומות הטירה עם שריון וחרבות עד התצפית, ומי שרוצה מנסה את מסלול הנינג׳ה בביתן הנינג׳ות.","special":"מבצר של שבט הוג׳ו שהחזיק מעמד מול הידיושי עד המצור הגדול של 1590.","highlights":["תצפית מהקומה העליונה","ביתן הנינג׳ות","שער טוקיוואגי"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"6-1 Jonai, Odawara, Kanagawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"10 דקות הליכה מתחנת אודווארה; טוב לפני העלייה להקונה","baby_block":"בתוך הטירה רק מדרגות, להשאיר עגלה בחוץ","tags":["castle","japanese castle","samurai","ninja","hojo clan","park","history","museum","טירה","טירה יפנית","סמוראים","נינג׳ה","הוג׳ו","פארק","היסטוריה","מוזיאון"],"en":{"hype":"The Hojo clan's white castle, a 10-minute walk from Odawara Station, in a park with a moat and red bridges.","reality":"The keep is a 1960 concrete rebuild and the museum inside is so-so, but the park is lovely and the top-floor view over the sea and city is worth it. A good stop on the way to Hakone.","tip":"Keep your ticket; it also covers the Samurai-kan in the Tokiwagi Gate.","baby_notes":"The park is stroller-friendly, but inside the keep it is stairs only.","price":"Keep ¥1,000 (incl. Samurai-kan), Ninja-kan ¥500","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Cross the gates and bridges, climb the floors of armor and swords to the lookout, and try the ninja course at the Ninja-kan if you like.","special":"The Hojo stronghold that held out against Hideyoshi until the great siege of 1590.","highlights":["Top-floor lookout","Ninja-kan","Tokiwagi Gate"],"time_needed":"An hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"10-min walk from Odawara Station; good before heading up to Hakone","baby_block":"Stairs only inside the keep, leave the stroller outside"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hotoku Ninomiya Shrine","name_ja":"報徳二宮神社","city":"hakone","area":"Odawara","category":"sight","lat":35.249,"lng":139.1545,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש שינטו בפארק טירת אודווארה, לכבוד ניומיה סונטוקו, הפילוסוף-חקלאי שכל ילד יפני מכיר.","reality":"שקט ונעים, עם הרבה פחות אנשים מהטירה שליד. עצירה של רבע שעה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"לחפש את פסל הילד שקורא ספר תוך כדי שהוא סוחב עצים, ניומיה בילדותו.","sources":["https://www.ninomiya.or.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חצר שטוחה, אפשר עם עגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hotoku%20Ninomiya%20Shrine%20Odawara","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים מהפארק של הטירה, עוברים בשער ובחצר, ומי שרוצה אוסף גושואין (חותמת מקדש).","special":"מקדש בן 130 שנה לאדם אחד, ניומיה סונטוקו, שנולד באזור.","highlights":["פסל ניומיה הילד","הגושואין","השער"],"time_needed":"15-20 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"8-10 Jonai, Odawara, Kanagawa","opens":"06:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":20,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לשלב עם טירת אודווארה, באותו פארק","baby_block":null,"tags":["shrine","shinto shrine","ninomiya sontoku","goshuin","castle park","quiet","history","מקדש","מקדש שינטו","ניומיה סונטוקו","גושואין","פארק הטירה","שקט","היסטוריה"],"en":{"hype":"A Shinto shrine in Odawara Castle park honoring Ninomiya Sontoku, the farmer-philosopher every Japanese child knows.","reality":"Quiet and pleasant, with far fewer people than the castle next door. A 15-minute stop.","tip":"Look for the statue of the boy reading while carrying firewood: young Ninomiya.","baby_notes":"Flat grounds, fine with a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk in from the castle park, through the gate and courtyard, and pick up a goshuin (shrine stamp) if you collect them.","special":"A 130-year-old shrine for one man, Ninomiya Sontoku, who was born in the area.","highlights":["Statue of young Ninomiya","Goshuin","The gate"],"time_needed":"15-20 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Pair it with Odawara Castle, same park","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Enoura Observatory","name_ja":"江之浦測候所","city":"hakone","area":"Odawara","category":"sight","lat":35.2085,"lng":139.1356,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מתחם אמנות ואדריכלות של הירושי סוגימוטו על צוק מעל מפרץ סגאמי, עם מנהרה שמכוונת לזריחה של היום הקצר בשנה.","reality":"מהמקומות הכי מרשימים באזור למי שאוהב אמנות ואדריכלות, ובדצמבר יש קסם מיוחד בגלל היום הקצר. רחוק, יקר ודורש תכנון.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥3,300 בהזמנה מראש, ¥3,850 בקופה","tip":"להזמין מראש משבצת 10:00 או 13:30, כרטיסים בקופה מוגבלים.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5225.html","https://www.odawara-af.com/en/enoura/","https://www.odawara-af.com/en/enoura/faq"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Enoura%20Observatory%20Odawara","website_url":"https://www.odawara-af.com/en/enoura/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"שאטל חינם מתחנת נבוקאווה, ואז שעה-שעתיים בין גלריה ארוכה מול הים, במה מזכוכית אופטית, גן אבנים וחורשת במבוק.","special":"כל המתחם מכוון לשמש: מנהרת הפלדה מאירה בזריחה של היום הקצר בשנה, באמצע דצמבר.","highlights":["גלריית הקיץ מול הים","מנהרת היום הקצר","במת הזכוכית האופטית","חורשת הבמבוק"],"time_needed":"שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"362-1 Enoura, Odawara, Kanagawa","opens":"10:00","closes":"16:30","closed_weekdays":[2,3],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":120,"booking":"required","plan_line":"להזמין משבצת מראש; סגור בשלישי ורביעי","baby_block":"שבילי עפר ומדרגות, לא מתאים לעגלה","tags":["art","architecture","hiroshi sugimoto","contemporary art","ocean view","garden","bamboo","stone","אמנות","אדריכלות","הירושי סוגימוטו","אמנות עכשווית","נוף לים","גן","במבוק","אבנים"],"en":{"hype":"Hiroshi Sugimoto's art and architecture site on a cliff over Sagami Bay, with a tunnel aligned to the winter solstice sunrise.","reality":"One of the most striking places around for art and architecture fans, and December adds something because of the solstice. Far, pricey and needs planning.","tip":"Book the 10:00 or 13:30 slot ahead; walk-up tickets are limited.","baby_notes":null,"price":"¥3,300 booked ahead, ¥3,850 at the door","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Free shuttle from Nebukawa Station, then 1-2 hours among a long gallery facing the sea, an optical-glass stage, a stone garden and a bamboo grove.","special":"The whole site is aligned to the sun: the steel tunnel lights up at the winter solstice sunrise in mid-December.","highlights":["Summer gallery facing the sea","Winter solstice tunnel","Optical glass stage","Bamboo grove"],"time_needed":"Two hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Book a slot ahead; closed Tuesdays and Wednesdays","baby_block":"Dirt paths and steps, not for a stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Suzuhiro Kamaboko Village","name_ja":"鈴廣かまぼこの里","city":"hakone","area":"Odawara","category":"experience","lat":35.2367,"lng":139.1448,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המתחם של יצרן הקמבוקו (עוגת דגים) הוותיק של אודווארה, עם מוזיאון, חנויות וסדנה להכנת קמבוקו וצ׳יקווה בידיים.","reality":"הסדנה כיפית ומצחיקה, ואוכלים את מה שמכינים. המוזיאון קטן. מתאים כחצי שעה-שעה בדרך מאודווארה להקונה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"להזמין את הסדנה באתר מראש. ביום רביעי יש רק סדנת צ׳יקווה.","sources":["https://www.kamaboko.com/museum/program/","https://www.kamaboko.com/sato/hours/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מתחם שטוח ומקורה ברובו, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Suzuhiro%20Kamaboko%20Village%20Odawara","website_url":"https://www.kamaboko.com/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מעצבים קמבוקו על קרש עץ וצולים צ׳יקווה בסדנה, צופים באומנים דרך החלון במוזיאון, וקונים בחנות הראשית.","special":"רואים איך עושים את מאכל הדגים הכי מזוהה עם אודווארה, ממש במפעל.","highlights":["סדנת קמבוקו וצ׳יקווה","האומנים במוזיאון","החנות הראשית"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"245 Kazamatsuri, Odawara, Kanagawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"18:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":75,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"צמוד לתחנת קזמצורי בקו הקונה טוזאן; להזמין סדנה","baby_block":null,"tags":["kamaboko","fish cake","chikuwa","workshop","cooking class","museum","souvenirs","family","קמבוקו","עוגת דגים","צ׳יקווה","סדנה","סדנת בישול","מוזיאון","מזכרות","משפחות"],"en":{"hype":"Odawara's long-running kamaboko (fish cake) maker's complex, with a museum, shops and a hands-on kamaboko and chikuwa class.","reality":"The class is fun and silly, and you eat what you make. The museum is small. Works as a 30-60 minute stop between Odawara and Hakone.","tip":"Book the class online ahead. On Wednesdays there is only the chikuwa class.","baby_notes":"Flat and mostly indoors, easy with a stroller.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Shape kamaboko on a wooden board and grill chikuwa in the class, watch the craftsmen through the museum window and shop at the main store.","special":"You see Odawara's signature fish food being made right in the factory.","highlights":["Kamaboko and chikuwa class","Craftsmen in the museum","Main shop"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Next to Kazamatsuri station on the Tozan line; book the class","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Uiro Odawara Main Store","name_ja":"ういろう 本店","city":"hakone","area":"Odawara","category":"shopping","lat":35.2459,"lng":139.1572,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"חנו