ing","Uiro sweets","Family museum"],"time_needed":"20-30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"15-min walk from the station, near the castle","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Minaka Odawara","name_ja":"ミナカ小田原","city":"hakone","area":"Odawara","category":"shopping","lat":35.2556,"lng":139.1545,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מתחם קניות ואוכל צמוד לתחנת אודווארה, עם רחוב בסגנון עיירת טירה מתקופת אדו.","reality":"נוח לקניות ואוכל בהמתנה לרכבת, אבל חדש ומסחרי. לא סיבה לבוא לאודווארה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כניסה חופשית","tip":"מגיעים בגשר המקורה מהתחנה, בלי לצאת לגשם.","sources":["https://minaka-odawara.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מתחם מודרני עם מעליות, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Minaka%20Odawara%20Odawara","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מסתובבים ברחוב בסגנון אדו, קונים קמבוקו ומזכרות מקומיות, ואוכלים באחת המסעדות במגדל.","special":"כל המזכרות של אודווארה במקום אחד, ממש ביציאה מהתחנה.","highlights":["רחוב בסגנון אדו","מזכרות מקומיות","מסעדות במגדל"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-1-15 Sakaecho, Odawara, Kanagawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"צמוד לתחנת אודווארה, טוב בהמתנה לרכבת","baby_block":null,"tags":["shopping mall","souvenirs","kamaboko","restaurants","station","edo style","shops","קניון","מזכרות","קמבוקו","מסעדות","תחנה","סגנון אדו","חנויות"],"en":{"hype":"A shopping and food complex next to Odawara Station, with an Edo-style castle-town street.","reality":"Handy for shopping and food while waiting for a train, but new and commercial. Not a reason to come to Odawara.","tip":"Reach it by the covered walkway from the station without going out in the rain.","baby_notes":"Modern complex with elevators, easy with a stroller.","price":"Free to enter","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the Edo-style street, pick up kamaboko and local souvenirs, and eat at one of the tower restaurants.","special":"All of Odawara's souvenirs in one place, right outside the station.","highlights":["Edo-style street","Local souvenirs","Tower restaurants"],"time_needed":"An hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Next to Odawara Station, good while waiting for a train","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Ishigakiyama Ichiya Castle Historical Park","name_ja":"石垣山一夜城歴史公園","city":"hakone","area":"Odawara","category":"sight","lat":35.237,"lng":139.14,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שרידי הטירה שהידיושי בנה ב-1590 על הגבעה מול טירת אודווארה, כדי לצור עליה.","reality":"רק חומות אבן ודשא, אבל הנוף לטירת אודווארה ולים יפה ואין כמעט אנשים. בלי רכב קשה להגיע.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"לקחת מונית מתחנת הייקאווה, כ-10 דקות.","sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9F%B3%E5%9E%A3%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%9C%E5%9F%8E"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ishigakiyama%20Ichiya%20Castle%20Historical%20Park%20Odawara","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מטיילים בין חומות האבן העתיקות ועולים לנקודה שמביטה על טירת אודווארה, בדיוק כמו הידיושי.","special":"האגדה מספרת שהטירה הופיעה כאילו בלילה אחד, כדי לשבור את רוח הנצורים.","highlights":["חומות האבן","המבט על טירת אודווארה","נוף למפרץ"],"time_needed":"30-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Hayakawa, Odawara, Kanagawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"הכי קל במונית, 10 דקות מתחנת הייקאווה","baby_block":null,"tags":["castle ruins","history","hideyoshi","stone walls","viewpoint","park","free","samurai","חורבות טירה","היסטוריה","הידיושי","חומות אבן","תצפית","פארק","חינם","סמוראים"],"en":{"hype":"The ruins of the castle Hideyoshi built in 1590 on the hill facing Odawara Castle, to besiege it.","reality":"Just stone walls and grass, but the view of Odawara Castle and the sea is lovely and almost no one is there. Hard to reach without a car.","tip":"Take a taxi from Hayakawa Station, about 10 minutes.","baby_notes":null,"price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Wander the old stone walls and climb to the spot that looks down on Odawara Castle, just as Hideyoshi did.","special":"Legend says the castle appeared as if overnight, to break the defenders' spirit.","highlights":["Stone walls","View of Odawara Castle","Bay view"],"time_needed":"30-45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Easiest by taxi, 10 min from Hayakawa Station","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kanagawa Prefectural Museum of Natural History","name_ja":"神奈川県立生命の星・地球博物館","city":"hakone","area":"Odawara","category":"sight","lat":35.2415,"lng":139.1325,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון טבע גדול באיריודה, עם שלדי דינוזאורים, מטאוריטים ואולם ענק של חרקים ובעלי חיים.","reality":"מפתיע בגודל ובאיכות, וזול מאוד. מקום מעולה ליום גשום עם תינוק, וכמעט אין בו תיירים זרים.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥520 למבוגר, ילדים עד חטיבת ביניים חינם","tip":"בסופ\"ש ובימי גשם עמוס, ביום חול שקט.","sources":["https://nh.kanagawa-museum.jp/visit/information.html","https://nh.kanagawa-museum.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"אולמות רחבים עם מעליות, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kanagawa%20Prefectural%20Museum%20of%20Natural%20History%20Odawara","website_url":"https://nh.kanagawa-museum.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מתחילים בשלדי הדינוזאורים בכניסה, עוברים באולם המטאוריטים ומסיימים בקיר הענק של בעלי החיים והחרקים.","special":"אוסף ענק של מאובנים ובעלי חיים, שלוש דקות הליכה מתחנה בקו של רכבת הקונה.","highlights":["שלדי דינוזאורים","מטאוריטים","אולם בעלי החיים"],"time_needed":"שעה וחצי-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"499 Iriuda, Odawara, Kanagawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:30","closed_weekdays":[1,2],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":100,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בדצמבר סגור בשני ושלישי; ליד תחנת איריודה","baby_block":null,"tags":["museum","natural history","dinosaurs","fossils","meteorites","animals","insects","rainy day","kids","מוזיאון","מוזיאון טבע","דינוזאורים","מאובנים","מטאוריטים","בעלי חיים","חרקים","יום גשום","ילדים"],"en":{"hype":"A big natural history museum in Iriuda with dinosaur skeletons, meteorites and a huge hall of animals and insects.","reality":"Surprisingly big and good, and very cheap. A great rainy-day pick with a baby, and almost no foreign tourists.","tip":"Busy on weekends and rainy days, quiet on weekdays.","baby_notes":"Wide halls with elevators, easy with a stroller.","price":"¥520 adults, free for junior high and younger","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Start with the dinosaur skeletons at the entrance, walk through the meteorite hall and finish at the giant wall of animals and insects.","special":"A huge collection of fossils and animals, 3 minutes' walk from a station on the Hakone Tozan line.","highlights":["Dinosaur skeletons","Meteorites","Animal hall"],"time_needed":"1.5-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mon and Tue in December; near Iriuda station","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
