,"baby_notes":"תור ארוך בחוץ ומקום צפוף ליד הפלנצ׳ה; קשה עם עגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Okonomiyaki%20Hassho%20Noboricho%20Hiroshima","website_url":null,"serves":"אוקונומיאקי בסגנון הירושימה עם אטריות סובה צהובות ושכבת ביצה, אפשר גם עם טמפורה של דיונון.","dishes":["סובה בשר וביצה","אוקונומיאקי עם ביצה כפולה"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים כולל תור","kosher":"options","kosher_note":"לבקש בלי חזיר (בוטה נאשי) או עם ביצה וירקות בלבד; המשטח משותף.","address":"14-17 Nobori-cho, Naka-ku, Hiroshima","opens":"10:00","closes":"15:00","closed_weekdays":[1,2],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":120,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור ב׳-ג׳; מזומן או PayPay, לבוא לפני 10:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["okonomiyaki","hiroshima style okonomiyaki","savory pancake","cabbage pancake","teppanyaki","griddle","noodles","yakisoba","אוקונומיאקי","פנקייק כרוב","טפניאקי","פלנצ׳ה","אטריות","יאקיסובה","local favorite","מקומי","queue","תור"],"en":{"hype":"The okonomiyaki locals treat as the benchmark, with one of the top Tabelog scores in town.","reality":"Worth it: sweet steamed cabbage, crispy noodles, big portions. The line can run 1-2 hours and it only opens until mid-afternoon.","tip":"Get there before the 10:00 opening, even earlier on weekends.","baby_notes":"Long line outside and a tight room by the griddle; hard with a stroller.","price":"¥1,000-2,000 per person","serves":"Hiroshima-style okonomiyaki with yellow soba noodles and an egg layer; squid tempura topping available.","dishes":["Soba with pork and egg","Double egg okonomiyaki"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"1-2 hours with the line","kosher_note":"Ask for it without pork (buta nashi), or egg and veg only; the griddle is shared.","plan_line":"Closed Mon-Tue; cash or PayPay, arrive before 10:00","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Okonomimura",