 Park & Castle","category":"food","lat":34.387,"lng":132.459,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"חנות טנטנמן מקומית שמגישה גם טנטנמן עם מרק וגם בלי, עם שלושה סוגי סאנשו על השולחן.","reality":"אלטרנטיבה טובה לקונימאטסו שפתוחה גם בסופ״ש ובערב. זול וממלא.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":3.56,"google_score":null,"price":"¥800-1,500 לסועד","tip":"יש חצי מנה למי שרוצה לטעום שני סוגים.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/hiroshima/A3401/A340117/34018187/","https://tablejourney.com/japan/hiroshima/budget-eating/musashibo/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"תינוקות וילדים רצויים, ללא עישון.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Musashibo%20tantanmen%20Hiroshima","website_url":null,"serves":"טנטנמן בלי מרק וטנטנמן עם מרק סויה או שומשום עשיר, וגם קארי.","dishes":["טנטנמן בלי מרק","טנטנמן סויה","סט מנפוקו"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"חצי שעה","kosher":"hard","kosher_note":"הבשר הטחון בטנטנמן הוא חזיר.","address":"5-12 Fujimi-cho, Naka-ku, Hiroshima","opens":"11:00","closes":"22:00","closed_weekdays":[2],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי ג׳; מזומן בלבד, הפסקה 15:00-18:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["tantanmen","soupless tantanmen","shirunashi tantanmen","spicy noodles","sansho","curry","ramen","טנטנמן","טנטנמן בלי מרק","אטריות חריפות","סאנשו","קארי","ראמן"],"en":{"hype":"A local tantanmen shop doing it with and without soup, three kinds of sansho on the table.","reality":"A good alternative to Kunimatsu that is open on weekends and evenings. Cheap and filling.","tip":"There is a half size if you want to try two kinds.","baby_notes":"Babies and kids welcome, non-smoking.","price":"¥800-1,500 per person","serves":"Soupless tantanmen and tantanmen in soy or rich sesame soup, plus curry.","dishes":["Soupless tantanmen","Soy tantanmen","Manpuku set"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"Half an hour","kosher_note":"The