eat counter. A bit out, about 2 km north of the castle, and weekday evenings only.","tip":"The green onion and jalapeno version (¥1,530) is why you come.","baby_notes":null,"price":"¥1,100-2,500 per person","serves":"Hiroshima-style okonomiyaki with green onion and jalapeno toppings, plus beef stew.","dishes":["Pork, egg and soba with green onion and jalapeno","Beef stew"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":"Ask for it without pork (buta nashi), or egg and veg only; the griddle is shared.","plan_line":"Weekdays only from 16:30; near Yokogawa Station","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Reichan","name_ja":"麗ちゃん","city":"hiroshima","area":"Hiroshima Station","category":"food","lat":34.397,"lng":132.4755,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אוקונומיאקי מ-1957 בתוך ekie בתחנת הירושימה, הארוחה הקלאסית לפני השינקנסן.","reality":"אוקונומיאקי טוב עם קרום פריך, נוח מאוד בתחנה ופתוח כל יום עד 22:00. יש תור בשעות הארוחה, הוא זז.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":3.49,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,000-2,000 לסועד","tip":"אפשר להזמין טייק אוויי בטלפון ולאכול ברכבת.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/hiroshima/A3401/A340121/34000061/","https://tabimaniajapan.com/japanese-food/the-ultimate-hiroshima-okonomiyaki-guide-top-5-local-picks"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"תינוקות וילדים רצויים, עגלות מותרות, נגיש לכיסא גלגלים וללא עישון.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Reichan%20ekie%20Hiroshima%20Station","website_url":"https://o-reichan.jp/","serves":"אוקונומיאקי בסגנון הירושימה, גם עם טמפורה של דיונון או צדפות בעונה.","dishes":["סובה בשר וביצה","אוקונומיאקי עם צדפות"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":"options","kosher_note":"לבקש בלי חזיר (בוטה נאשי) או עם ביצה וירקות בלבד; המשטח משותף.","address":"ekie 1F, 1-2 Matsubara-cho, Minami-ku, Hiroshima","opens":"11:00","closes":"22:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בצד השינקנסן (יציאה צפונית) של התחנה; אין הזמנות לישיבה","baby_block":null,"tags":["okonomiyaki","hiroshima style okonomiyaki","savory pancake","cabbage pancake","teppanyaki","griddle","noodles","yakisoba","אוקונומיאקי","פנקייק כרוב","טפניאקי","פלנצ׳ה","אטריות","יאקיסובה","station","תחנת רכבת","oyster","צדפות"],"en":{"hype":"Okonomiyaki since 1957 inside ekie at Hiroshima Station, the classic meal before the shinkansen.","reality":"Good okonomiyaki with a crispy crust, very handy and open daily to 22:00. Mealtime lines, but they move.","tip":"Order takeout by phone and eat it on the train.","baby_notes":"Babies and kids welcome, strollers OK, wheelchair accessible, non-smoking.","price":"¥1,000-2,000 per person","serves":"Hiroshima-style okonomiyaki, also with squid tempura or oysters in season.","dishes":["Soba with pork and egg","Oyster okonomiyaki"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":"Ask for it without pork (buta nashi), or egg and veg only; the griddle is shared.","plan_line":"Shinkansen (north) side of the station; no table bookings","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Denko Sekka ekie","name_ja":"電光石火 ekie広島店","city":"hiroshima","area":"Hiroshima Station","category":"food","lat":34.397,"lng":132.4755,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אוקונומיאקי בצורת כיפה עטופה בחביתה רכה, ברשימת 100 הטובות של טאבלוג.","reality":"גרסה מודרנית ושונה מהקלאסיקה, טעימה ומרשימה בצילום. התור בתחנה ארוך בשעות השיא, הסניף בכיכר שמול התחנה (Ekimae Hiroba) לפעמים פנוי יותר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":3.49,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,200-2,500 לסועד","tip":"המנה החתומה היא Denko Sekka עם הביצה הרכה מעל.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/hiroshima/A3401/A340121/34027532/","https://tabimaniajapan.com/japanese-food/the-ultimate-hiroshima-okonomiyaki-guide-top-5-local-picks"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"ישיבה רק על דלפק מול הפלנצ׳ה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Denko%20Sekka%20ekie%20Hiroshima","website_url":null,"serves":"אוקונומיאקי בסגנון הירושימה עטוף בחביתה רכה בצורת כיפה, וצדפות על הפלנצ׳ה.","dishes":["דנקו סקה (אוקונומיאקי כיפה)","צדפות על הפלנצ׳ה"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":"options","kosher_note":"לבקש בלי חזיר (בוטה נאשי) או עם ביצה וירקות בלבד; המשטח משותף.","address":"ekie 2F, 1-2 Matsubara-cho, Minami-ku, Hiroshima","opens":"11:00","closes":"23:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"אין הזמנות; פתוח כל יום עד 23:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["okonomiyaki","hiroshima style okonomiyaki","savory pancake","cabbage pancake","teppanyaki","griddle","noodles","yakisoba","אוקונומיאקי","פנקייק כרוב","טפניאקי","פלנצ׳ה","אטריות","יאקיסובה","omelette","egg","חביתה","ביצה","station","תחנת רכבת"],"en":{"hype":"Dome-shaped okonomiyaki wrapped in a soft omelette, on the Tabelog top 100.","reality":"A modern take that differs from the classic, tasty and photogenic. Long peak-hour lines in the station; the Ekimae Hiroba branch across the street is sometimes quieter.","tip":"The signature is the Denko Sekka with the soft egg on top.","baby_notes":"Counter seats only, facing the griddle.","price":"¥1,200-2,500 per person","serves":"Hiroshima-style okonomiyaki wrapped in a soft omelette dome, plus griddled oysters.","dishes":["Denko Sekka (dome okonomiyaki)","Griddled oysters"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":"Ask for it without pork (buta nashi), or egg and veg only; the griddle is shared.","plan_line":"No bookings; open daily to 23:00","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
