שי ותיק של יותר ממאה שנה בסמטה שקטה מאחורי המקדש.","reality":"אנאגו-משי עדין עם רוטב קליל, מנה אחת בלבד בכ-¥3,500. בצהריים מחכים, אבל זה האנאגו הכי טוב על האי.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":3.56,"google_score":null,"price":"כ-¥3,500 לסועד","tip":"להגיע ב-11:00 בפתיחה, אחר כך יש תור.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/hiroshima/A3402/A340202/34002045/","https://japanactivity.com/anago-meshi-miyajima-where-to-eat"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"ילדים רצויים, יש שולחנות טאטאמי. 16 מקומות בלבד, אין מקום לעגלה בפנים.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fujitaya%20anagomeshi%20Miyajima","website_url":null,"serves":"אנאגו-משי: צלופח ים צלוי על הגחלים מעל אורז שבושל בציר, עם מרק וחמוצים.","dishes":["אנאגו-משי"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"כשעה כולל המתנה","kosher":"hard","kosher_note":"יש רק מנה אחת, והיא צלופח.","address":"125-2 Miyajima-cho, Hatsukaichi, Hiroshima","opens":"11:00","closes":"16:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"אין הזמנות; פתוח 11:00-16:00, לבוא בפתיחה","baby_block":null,"tags":["anago","anago meshi","conger eel","eel rice","eel","אנאגו","אנאגו משי","צלופח","אורז עם צלופח","grilled eel","charcoal","צלופח צלוי","גחלים","miyajima","מיאג׳ימה"],"en":{"hype":"An anago meshi house over a century old in a quiet lane behind the shrine.","reality":"Delicate anago meshi with a light sauce, one dish only at about ¥3,500. There is a lunch wait, but it is the best anago on the island.","tip":"Arrive at the 11:00 opening; there is a line after.","baby_notes":"Kids welcome, tatami tables. Only 16 seats, no room for a stroller inside.","price":"About ¥3,500 per person","serves":"Anago meshi: charcoal-grilled conger eel over rice cooked in broth, with soup and pickles.","dishes":["Anago meshi"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"About an hour with the wait","kosher_note":"There is one