 egg","Seafood special"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":"Ask for it without pork (buta nashi), or egg and veg only; the griddle is shared.","plan_line":"Closed Wed; break 14:00-17:00, cash or PayPay","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hangetsuan","name_ja":"料亭・旅館 半月庵","city":"hiroshima","area":"Around Hiroshima","category":"food","lat":34.168,"lng":132.176,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בית אוכל ותיק ליד גשר קינטאי באיוואקוני, מגיש איוואקוני-זושי.","reality":"מקום לטעום את איוואקוני-זושי, סושי לחוץ בשכבות של אורז, דגים, ביצה ושורש לוטוס. ארוחה שקטה במחיר הוגן אחרי הגשר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":3.47,"google_score":null,"price":"¥2,000-3,000 לסועד","tip":"סט איוואקוני-זושי הוא המנה לבוא בשבילה.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/yamaguchi/A3506/A350601/35000801","http://hangetuan.com/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"ילדים רצויים, יש חדרי טאטאמי פרטיים.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hangetsuan%20Iwakuni","website_url":"http://hangetuan.com/","serves":"מטבח יפני ואיוואקוני-זושי (סושי לחוץ בשכבות עם דג, ביצה, שורש לוטוס ושיסו).","dishes":["סט איוואקוני-זושי"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":"options","kosher_note":"הסושי הלחוץ עם דג וביצה; לשאול אם יש שרימפס.","address":"1-17-27 Iwakuni, Iwakuni, Yamaguchi","opens":"11:00","closes":"22:00","closed_weekdays":[2],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":60,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"סגור בימי ג׳; הפסקה 14:00-17:30","baby_block":null,"tags":["iwakuni sushi","pressed sushi","sushi","lotus root","kaiseki","japanese","סושי","סושי לחוץ","איוואקוני זושי","שורש לוטוס","אוכל יפני","iwakuni","איוואקוני","kintaikyo","גשר קינטאי"],"en":{"hype":"An old restaurant-inn near Kintaikyo Bridge in Iwakuni, serving Iwakuni-zushi.","reality":"A place to try Iwakuni-zushi, layered pressed sushi of rice, fish, egg and lotus root. A quiet meal at a fair price after the bridge.","tip":"The Iwakuni-zushi set is the dish to come for.","baby_notes":"Kids welcome, private tatami rooms.","price":"¥2,000-3,000 per person","serves":"Japanese food and Iwakuni-zushi (layered pressed sushi with fish, egg, lotus root and shiso).","dishes":["Iwakuni-zushi set"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":"The pressed sushi is fish and egg; ask about shrimp.","plan_line":"Closed Tue; break 14:00-17:30","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hiroshima Andersen","name_ja":"広島アンデルセン","city":"hiroshima","area":"Downtown Hiroshima","category":"cafe","lat":34.3935,"lng":132.4585,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המאפייה הדנית הוותיקה של הירושימה ברחוב הונדורי, עם קפה, דוכן כריכים ובר יין.","reality":"מאפים טובים, הרבה מקום לשבת ונוח באמצע יום של סיבוב בעיר. גדול ושוקק, לא קפה אינטימי.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":3.53,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,000-2,000 לסועד","tip":"דוכן הכריכים פתוח מ-7:30, מתאים לארוחת בוקר.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/hiroshima/A3401/A340113/34000053/","https://tablejourney.com/japan/hiroshima/cafes/hiroshima-andersen/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"ידידותי למשפחות, ללא עישון, ספות ומקום מרווח.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hiroshima%20Andersen%20Hondori","website_url":"https://www.andersen.co.jp/hiroshima/","serves":"מאפייה ובית קפה בסגנון דני: מאפים, לחמים, כריכים, קפה ויין.","dishes":["מאפה דני","כריך","קפה"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":"options","kosher_note":"יש מאפים מתוקים וצמחוניים; חלק מהכריכים עם חזיר.","address":"7-1 Hondori, Naka-ku, Hiroshima","opens":"10:00","closes":"19:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"פתוח כל יום; דוכן הכריכים מ-7:30 עד 17:00","baby_block":null,"tags":[