inside the castle grounds, where local families come for baby blessings and New Year.","reality":"A fairly new concrete shrine, not much to look at. Fine as a short stop while at the castle.","tip":"On weekends you see families with babies in traditional dress for blessings.","baby_notes":"Flat and stroller friendly.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk under the torii, rinse your hands at the basin and watch the families coming for blessings.","special":"This is where locals bring babies and children for shrine rites.","highlights":["Torii gate","Baby blessings"],"time_needed":"15 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Combine with the castle, same grounds","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Shukkeien Garden","name_ja":"縮景園","city":"hiroshima","area":"Peace Park & Castle","category":"sight","lat":34.4005,"lng":132.4674,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גן יפני מהמאה ה־17 עם אגם, גשר מקושת ובתי תה, במרחק הליכה מהתחנה.","reality":"גן מטופח ושקט, אחד היפים באזור. בדצמבר פחות צבע, אבל בבוקר כמעט אין בו אף אחד.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥350","tip":"יש כרטיס משולב עם מוזיאון האמנות של המחוז שצמוד לגן.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3403.html","https://www.hpam.jp/museum/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"רוב השבילים שטוחים, אבל יש קטעי חצץ וגשר מקושת שצריך להרים בו עגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shukkeien%20Garden%20Hiroshima","website_url":"https://shukkeien.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים על השביל שמקיף את האגם, עוברים את הגשר המקושת ועוצרים בבתי התה לנוף על המים.","special":"הגן בנוי כנופים בזעיר אנפין: הרים, עמקים ויער סביב אגם אחד.","highlights":["גשר קוקוקיו","בתי התה","קרפיונים באגם"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-11 Kaminoboricho, Naka-ku, Hiroshima","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בחורף נסגר ב־17:00, כניסה אחרונה 16:30","baby_block":null,"tags":["garden","japanese garden","pond","tea house","bridge","koi","nature","גן","גן יפני","אגם","בית תה","גשר","קרפיונים","טבע"],"en":{"hype":"A 17th-century Japanese garden with a pond, an arched bridge and tea houses, walkable from the station.","reality":"Well kept and quiet, one of the nicest in the region. Less colour in December, but almost empty in the morning.","tip":"There's a combined ticket with the prefectural art museum next door.","baby_notes":"Mostly flat paths, but some gravel and an arched bridge where you'll carry the stroller.","price":"¥350","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the path around the pond, cross the arched bridge and stop at the tea houses for the view over the water.","special":"The garden is a miniature landscape: mountains, valleys and forest around one pond.","highlights":["Kokokyo Bridge","Tea houses","Koi in the pond"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closes 17:00 in winter, last entry 16:30","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hiroshima Museum of Art","name_ja":"ひろしま美術館","city":"hiroshima","area":"Peace Park & Castle","category":"sight","lat":34.3999,"lng":132.4567,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון קטן ליד הטירה עם אוסף אימפרסיוניסטים צרפתים: מונה, רנואר, ון גוך ופיקסו.","reality":"אוסף איכותי בבניין עגול ונעים, סיבוב של שעה. מתאים ליום גשום או כהפסקה מהנושא הכבד של פארק השלום.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"משתנה לפי התערוכה","tip":"עד 11 בינואר 2027 מוצגת תערוכה על אמנים בבתי קפה, עם ון גוך, טולוז־לוטרק ופיקסו.","sources":["https://www.hiroshima-museum.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"בניין בקומה אחת סביב חצר, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hiroshima%20Museum%20of%20Art%20Hiroshima","website_url":"https://www.hiroshima-museum.jp/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין האולמות שמקיפים את החצר הפנימית, מהאימפרסיוניסטים ועד פיקסו, ומסיימים בבית הקפה שבגן.","special":"אוסף צרפתי רציני בעיר שלא מצפים בה לזה.","highlights":["האולם הצרפתי","בית הקפה בגן"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-2 Motomachi, Naka-ku, Hiroshima","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני, כניסה אחרונה 16:30","baby_block":null,"tags":["art museum","museum","impressionism","monet","van gogh","picasso","painting","מוזיאון","מוזיאון אמנות","אימפרסיוניזם","ציורים","ון גוך","פיקסו","מונה"],"en":{"hype":"A small museum by the castle with French Impressionists: Monet, Renoir, Van Gogh and Picasso.","reality":"A good collection in a pleasant round building, an hour's visit. Good for a rainy day or a break from the heavy Peace Park.","tip":"Until 11 January 2027 there's a show on artists in cafes, with Van Gogh, Toulouse-Lautrec and Picasso.","baby_notes":"Single-floor building around a courtyard, easy with a stroller.","price":"Varies by exhibition","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the galleries around the inner courtyard, from the Impressionists to Picasso, and finish at the garden cafe.","special":"A serious French collection in a city you wouldn't expect it.","highlights":["French gallery","Garden cafe"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays, last entry 16:30","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hiroshima Prefectural Art Museum","name_ja":"広島県立美術館","city":"hiroshima","area":"Peace Park & Castle","category":"sight","lat":34.4,"lng":132.4682,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון האמנות של המחוז, צמוד לגן שוקיאן, עם ציור של דאלי ואמנות יפנית.","reality":"סביר, לא חובה. שווה בעיקר עם הכרטיס המשולב לגן או אם יש תערוכה מיוחדת שמעניינת.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"משתנה לפי התערוכה","tip":"בימי שישי פתוח עד 19:00 עד סוף מרץ 2027.","sources":["https://www.hpam.jp/museum/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"בניין מודרני עם מעליות, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hiroshima%20Prefectural%20Art%20Museum%20Hiroshima","website_url":"https://www.hpam.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מסתובבים באוסף הקבוע, ומחלונות הלובי מסתכלים על גן שוקיאן מלמעלה.","special":"בין היצירות יש את 'חלומה של ונוס' של דאלי.","highlights":["הציור של דאלי","הנוף לגן"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-22 Kaminoboricho, Naka-ku, Hiroshima","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-25","2026-12-26","2026-12-27","2026-12-28","2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני ומ־25 בדצמבר עד 1 בינואר","baby_block":null,"tags":["art museum","museum","dali","japanese art","exhibition","garden view","מוזיאון","מוזיאון אמנות","דאלי","אמנות יפנית","תערוכה"],"en":{"hype":"The prefecture's art museum, next to Shukkeien, with a Dali and Japanese art.","reality":"Fine, not essential. Worth it mostly with the garden combo ticket or for a special exhibition you care about.","tip":"Open until 19:00 on Fridays through March 2027.","baby_notes":"Modern building with lifts, easy with a stroller.","price":"Varies by exhibition","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the permanent collection, and look down on Shukkeien from the lobby windows.","special":"The collection includes Dali's 'Dream of Venus'.","highlights":["The Dali","Garden view"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays and 25 Dec to 1 Jan","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hiroshima Children's Museum","name_ja":"広島市こども文化科学館","city":"hiroshima","area":"Peace Park & Castle","category":"sight","lat":34.3985,"lng":132.4545,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון מדע לילדים מול הטירה, עם תצוגות לגעת בהן ופלנטריום.","reality":"מכוון לילדים בגיל בית ספר, אבל מקום מקורה, חינם ונקי לעצור בו עם תינוק כשקר או יורד גשם.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"תצוגות חינם, פלנטריום בתשלום","tip":"הפלנטריום בתשלום ובשפה היפנית בלבד.","sources":["https://www.pyonta.city.hiroshima.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעליות, שירותים עם החתלה ומקום לשבת, הרבה משפחות מקומיות.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hiroshima%20Children%27s%20Museum%20Hiroshima","website_url":"https://www.pyonta.city.hiroshima.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"משחקים בתצוגות המדע בקומות, ומי שרוצה נכנס להקרנה בפלנטריום.","special":"מקום משפחתי מקומי באמצע אזור התיירות.","highlights":["תצוגות מדע","פלנטריום"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"5-83 Motomachi, Naka-ku, Hiroshima","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני ובימי חול שאחרי חג","baby_block":null,"tags":["children's museum","science museum","kids","planetarium","family","rainy day","מוזיאון ילדים","מוזיאון מדע","ילדים","פלנטריום","משפחות","יום גשום"],"en":{"hype":"A kids' science museum opposite the castle, with hands-on exhibits and a planetarium.","reality":"Aimed at school-age kids, but an indoor, free, clean place to stop with a baby when it's cold or raining.","tip":"The planetarium costs extra and is in Japanese only.","baby_notes":"Lifts, toilets with changing tables and places to sit; lots of local families.","price":"Exhibits free, planetarium extra","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Play with the science exhibits on each floor, and catch a planetarium show if you like.","special":"A local family spot in the middle of the tourist area.","highlights":["Science exhibits","Planetarium"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays and the weekday after a holiday","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Atomic Bomb Hypocenter","name_ja":"原爆投下中心地","city":"hiroshima","area":"Downtown Hiroshima","category":"sight","lat":34.3947,"lng":132.4571,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"הנקודה שמעליה התפוצצה הפצצה, ליד בית החולים שימה, כמה דקות מהכיפה.","reality":"רק שלט ולוח זיכרון ברחוב צדדי, קל לפספס. שווה שתי דקות למי שרוצה לעמוד בנקודה עצמה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"הולכים מהכיפה מזרחה ברחוב הקטן, זה ממש קרוב.","sources":["https://www.city.hiroshima.lg.jp/english/peace/1029920/1009489.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מדרכה רגילה, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Atomic%20Bomb%20Hypocenter%20Hiroshima","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עומדים ליד הלוח מול בית החולים שימה וקוראים את ההסבר.","special":"הפצצה התפוצצה כ־600 מטר מעל המקום הזה.","highlights":[],"time_needed":"10 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-5-25 Otemachi, Naka-ku, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":10,"booking":"no","plan_line":"שתי דקות הליכה מהכיפה, לשלב באותו סיבוב","baby_block":null,"tags":["hypocenter","ground zero","atomic bomb","memorial","plaque","shima hospital","מרכז הפיצוץ","פצצת אטום","לוח זיכרון","היסטוריה"],"en":{"hype":"The spot the bomb exploded above, by Shima Hospital, a few minutes from the Dome.","reality":"Just a sign and plaque on a side street, easy to miss. Worth two minutes if you want to stand at the point itself.","tip":"Walk east from the Dome along the small street; it's very close.","baby_notes":"Normal pavement, fine with a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Stand by the plaque opposite Shima Hospital and read the sign.","special":"The bomb burst about 600 metres above this spot.","highlights":[],"time_needed":"10 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Two minutes' walk from the Dome, do both together","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Fukuromachi Elementary School Peace Museum","name_ja":"袋町小学校平和資料館","city":"hiroshima","area":"Downtown Hiroshima","category":"sight","lat":34.391,"lng":132.4588,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בית ספר שנשאר עומד אחרי הפצצה, עם קיר שעליו כתבו ניצולים הודעות בגיר כדי למצוא קרובים.","reality":"קטן, חינם וחזק מאוד. ההודעות בגיר שנשמרו על הקיר הן מהדברים הכי אישיים שרואים בהירושימה.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"המוזיאון בתוך בית ספר פעיל, נכנסים מהכניסה הצדדית של המבנה הישן.","sources":["https://www.city.hiroshima.lg.jp/english/peace/1029920/1009489.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חלל קטן בקומת קרקע ומרתף, צריך לבדוק מעלית במקום.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fukuromachi%20Elementary%20School%20Peace%20Museum%20Hiroshima","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יורדים לחדר עם הקיר המקורי, קוראים את התרגומים של ההודעות ורואים את הסרטון הקצר.","special":"ההודעות נכתבו בימים שאחרי הפצצה והתגלו מתחת לטיח רק ב־1999.","highlights":["קיר ההודעות בגיר"],"time_needed":"חצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"6-36 Fukuromachi, Naka-ku, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עשר דקות הליכה מהונדורי, לשלב בסיבוב במרכז","baby_block":null,"tags":["peace museum","school","atomic bomb","chalk messages","survivors","history","מוזיאון","בית ספר","פצצת אטום","הודעות","ניצולים","היסטוריה"],"en":{"hype":"A school that stayed standing after the bomb, with a wall where survivors chalked messages to find relatives.","reality":"Small, free and very powerful. The preserved chalk messages are among the most personal things in Hiroshima.","tip":"The museum is inside a working school; enter by the side door of the old building.","baby_notes":"Small space on ground floor and basement; check for a lift on site.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go down to the room with the original wall, read the translated messages and watch the short film.","special":"The messages were written in the days after the bomb and found under plaster only in 1999.","highlights":["The chalk message wall"],"time_needed":"Half an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Ten minutes' walk from Hondori, fit it into a downtown loop","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Former Bank of Japan Hiroshima Branch","name_ja":"旧日本銀行広島支店","city":"hiroshima","area":"Downtown Hiroshima","category":"sight","lat":34.3925,"lng":132.4598,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בניין בנק אבן שעמד 380 מטר מהפיצוץ, נפתח מחדש יומיים אחרי ומשמש היום חלל תצוגה.","reality":"בניין יפה מבפנים ומעט מבקרים. הכספות במרתף והסיפור על הבנק שחזר לעבוד מיד אחרי הפצצה שווים עצירה קצרה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"שווה לרדת למרתף לכספות, שם מוצג רוב ההסבר.","sources":["https://www.city.hiroshima.lg.jp/english/peace/1029920/1009489.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Former%20Bank%20of%20Japan%20Hiroshima%20Branch%20Hiroshima","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים לאולם הבנק הגבוה, רואים את התערוכה המתחלפת ויורדים למרתף לכספות.","special":"הבנק חזר לפעול יומיים אחרי הפצצה ונתן שירות לבנקים שנהרסו.","highlights":["אולם הבנק","הכספות במרתף"],"time_needed":"20 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"5-24 Fukuromachi, Naka-ku, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":20,"booking":"no","plan_line":"על הדרך בין הונדורי לפארק, כניסה חינם","baby_block":null,"tags":["bank","a-bombed building","architecture","history","vault","exhibition","בנק","בניין היסטורי","אדריכלות","היסטוריה","כספת","פצצת אטום"],"en":{"hype":"A stone bank building that stood 380 m from the blast, reopened two days later and now an exhibition space.","reality":"A handsome interior and few visitors. The basement vaults and the story of the bank working again right after the bomb are worth a short stop.","tip":"Go down to the basement vaults; most of the explanation is there.","baby_notes":null,"price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk into the tall banking hall, see the changing exhibit and go down to the vaults.","special":"The bank was working again two days after the bomb, serving banks that were destroyed.","highlights":["Banking hall","Basement vaults"],"time_needed":"20 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"On the way between Hondori and the park, free entry","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hiroshima Orizuru Tower","name_ja":"おりづるタワー","city":"hiroshima","area":"Peace Park & Castle","category":"experience","lat":34.396,"lng":132.4548,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מגדל ליד כיפת האטום עם גג תצפית מעץ, רמפה ספירלית למטה וקיר שזורקים אליו עגורי נייר.","reality":"הנוף על הכיפה והפארק מלמעלה מצוין, אבל ¥2,200 זה יקר לתצפית. שווה למי שרוצה להבין את המקום מלמעלה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥2,200 למבוגר, ¥100 לעגור לקיר","tip":"מקפלים עגור בקומה ה־12 וזורקים אותו לקיר הזכוכית, הוא נשאר שם עם אלפי אחרים.","sources":["https://www.orizurutower.jp/en/user-guide/ticket/","https://www.orizurutower.jp/en/opening-hours/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש מעלית לגג. הרמפה למטה ארוכה אבל אפשר לרדת בה עם עגלה או לחזור במעלית.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hiroshima%20Orizuru%20Tower%20Hiroshima","website_url":"https://www.orizurutower.jp/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במעלית לגג הפתוח, מסתכלים על הכיפה והפארק, מקפלים עגור וזורקים לקיר, ויורדים ברגל ברמפה הספירלית.","special":"הקיר מתמלא בעגורים שהמבקרים זורקים, ורואים אותו מהרחוב.","highlights":["הנוף על כיפת האטום","קיר העגורים","רמפת הספירלה"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-2-1 Otemachi, Naka-ku, Hiroshima","opens":"10:00","closes":"18:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"כניסה אחרונה 17:30, לבוא לקראת השקיעה","baby_block":null,"tags":["observation deck","tower","view","paper cranes","origami","rooftop","skyline","מגדל","תצפית","נוף","עגורי נייר","אוריגמי","גג"],"en":{"hype":"A tower by the A-Bomb Dome with a wooden rooftop deck, a spiral ramp down and a wall you drop paper cranes into.","reality":"The view over the Dome and park is great, but ¥2,200 is steep for a view. Worth it if you want to see the place from above.","tip":"Fold a crane on the 12th floor and drop it into the glass wall; it stays there with thousands of others.","baby_notes":"Lift to the roof. The ramp down is long but stroller friendly, or take the lift back.","price":"¥2,200 adults, ¥100 per crane","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Lift up to the open roof, look over the Dome and park, fold and drop a crane, then walk down the spiral ramp.","special":"The wall fills with visitors' cranes and you can see it from the street.","highlights":["View of the Dome","Crane wall","Spiral ramp"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Last entry 17:30, go towards sunset","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Peace Bell","name_ja":"平和の鐘","city":"hiroshima","area":"Peace Park & Castle","category":"experience","lat":34.3946,"lng":132.4518,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פעמון בפארק השלום שכל אחד יכול לצלצל בו, כקריאה לעולם בלי נשק גרעיני.","reality":"רגע קטן ופשוט, בלי תור ובלי כסף, ורוב המבקרים עוברים לידו. הצליל עמוק ונשמע בכל הפארק.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"מצלצלים פעם אחת בעדינות, יש אנשים שבאים לשם להתפלל.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3400.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"הצלצול חזק, כדאי להתרחק קצת עם התינוק.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Peace%20Bell%20Hiroshima","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מושכים בקורת העץ, מצלצלים פעם אחת ועומדים רגע בשקט.","special":"על הפעמון חרוטה מפת העולם בלי גבולות.","highlights":["מפת העולם על הפעמון"],"time_needed":"10 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-1 Nakajimacho, Naka-ku, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":10,"booking":"no","plan_line":"ליד אנדרטת הילדים, לעבור בו באותו סיבוב","baby_block":null,"tags":["peace bell","bell","ring the bell","memorial","peace park","nuclear","פעמון","פעמון השלום","לצלצל","אנדרטה","פארק השלום"],"en":{"hype":"A bell in Peace Park that anyone can ring, as a call for a world without nuclear weapons.","reality":"A small, simple moment, no queue and no cost, and most visitors walk past it. The deep sound carries across the park.","tip":"Ring it once, gently; some people come to pray there.","baby_notes":"It's loud, so step back a bit with the baby.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Pull the wooden beam, ring once and stand quietly for a moment.","special":"A world map without borders is cast into the bell.","highlights":["World map on the bell"],"time_needed":"10 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Next to the Children's Monument, do both together","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hiroshima World Heritage Sea Route","name_ja":"ひろしま世界遺産航路","city":"hiroshima","area":"Peace Park & Castle","category":"experience","lat":34.395,"lng":132.4527,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"סירה ישירה מפארק השלום למיאג'ימה, מאתר מורשת אחד לשני, במורד הנהר ודרך המפרץ.","reality":"יקר מהרכבת והמעבורת ולא נכלל ב־JR Pass, אבל חוסך החלפה ונותן נוף יפה על המפרץ. שווה בכיוון אחד.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥2,400 לכיוון, ¥4,400 הלוך חזור, בלי מס הכניסה לאי","tip":"לקחת סירה בכיוון אחד ולחזור ברכבת, ככה רואים את המפרץ בלי לשלם כפול.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3454.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"אפשר לעלות עם עגלה, ויש מושבים מקורים.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hiroshima%20World%20Heritage%20Sea%20Route%20Hiroshima","website_url":"https://www.aqua-net-h.co.jp/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במזח מוטויאסו ליד הכיפה, שטים 45 דקות לאורך הנהר ובמפרץ, ויורדים במזח של מיאג'ימה.","special":"מחבר את שני אתרי המורשת העולמית של העיר בלי לעבור בתחנה.","highlights":["היציאה ליד כיפת האטום","הנוף על המפרץ"],"time_needed":"45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Motoyasu Pier, 1-1 Otemachi, Naka-ku, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":45,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"סירה בכיוון אחד, חזרה ברכבת JR. הכרטיס לא כלול ב־JR Pass","baby_block":null,"tags":["boat","ferry","cruise","miyajima","sea route","river","bay","סירה","מעבורת","שייט","מיאג'ימה","נהר","מפרץ"],"en":{"hype":"A direct boat from Peace Park to Miyajima, World Heritage site to World Heritage site, down the river and across the bay.","reality":"Pricier than train plus ferry and not on the JR Pass, but no changes and a nice bay view. Worth it one way.","tip":"Take the boat one way and the train back; you get the bay without paying twice.","baby_notes":"You can board with a stroller and there's covered seating.","price":"¥2,400 one way, ¥4,400 return, plus island visitor tax","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Board at Motoyasu Pier by the Dome, ride 45 minutes down the river and across the bay, and land at Miyajima pier.","special":"Links the city's two World Heritage sites without going through the station.","highlights":["Departure by the Dome","Bay view"],"time_needed":"45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Boat one way, JR train back. Not covered by the JR Pass","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hiroshima Dreamination","name_ja":"ひろしまドリミネーション","city":"hiroshima","area":"Downtown Hiroshima","category":"experience","lat":34.3893,"lng":132.459,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"תאורת החורף של הירושימה: פסלי אור ענקיים לאורך שדרות השלום ורחובות המרכז.","reality":"חינם, יפה ונוח לטיול ערב עם עגלה. ב־2026 מתחילה רק ב־4 בדצמבר ונמשכת עד 24 בינואר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"הכי יפה בשדרות השלום בין גשר השלום לצומת טנאקה־מאצ'י, ומשם ממשיכים להונדורי.","sources":["https://www.city.hiroshima.lg.jp/tourism-culture/tourism/1021448/1053617.html","https://www.walkerplus.com/event/ar0834e17637/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מדרכות רחבות ושטוחות, נוח מאוד לעגלה. בסופי שבוע צפוף יותר.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hiroshima%20Dreamination%20Hiroshima","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים לאורך הרצועה הירוקה של שדרות השלום בין פסלי האור, וממשיכים לרחובות הקניות המוארים.","special":"השנה יש פסלים של חתולה קסומה חדשה בשם לומיה.","highlights":["שדרות השלום","רחובות הקניות המוארים"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Heiwa Odori, Naka-ku, Hiroshima","opens":"17:30","closes":"22:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":["2026-12-12","2026-12-13","2026-12-14","2026-12-15","2026-12-16","2026-12-17","2026-12-18","2026-12-19","2026-12-20","2026-12-21","2026-12-22","2026-12-23","2026-12-24","2026-12-25","2026-12-26","2026-12-27","2026-12-28","2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"דולק כל ערב 17:30-22:30, מ־4 בדצמבר עד 24 בינואר","baby_block":null,"tags":["illumination","lights","christmas lights","winter","night walk","festival","light show","תאורה","אורות","חורף","טיול לילי","פסטיבל","אורות חג המולד"],"en":{"hype":"Hiroshima's winter lights: giant light sculptures along Peace Boulevard and the downtown streets.","reality":"Free, pretty and a good stroller walk at night. In 2026 it starts only on 4 December and runs to 24 January.","tip":"Best on Peace Boulevard between Peace Bridge and Tanakamachi, then carry on to Hondori.","baby_notes":"Wide flat pavements, very stroller friendly. Busier on weekends.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the green strip of Peace Boulevard between the light sculptures, then on to the lit shopping streets.","special":"This year has sculptures of a new magic cat called Lumia.","highlights":["Peace Boulevard","Lit shopping streets"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Lit nightly 17:30-22:30, 4 December to 24 January","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hondori Shopping Street","name_ja":"本通商店街","city":"hiroshima","area":"Downtown Hiroshima","category":"shopping","lat":34.3933,"lng":132.4597,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רחוב הקניות המקורה הראשי של הירושימה, חצי קילומטר מפארק השלום מזרחה.","reality":"נוח ומקורה, עם חנויות רשת, ביגוד, בתי מרקחת ומזכרות. לא מיוחד, אבל טוב לשיטוט בגשם וקל לעגלה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"בקצה המזרחי יורדים דרומה לאוקונומימורה ולרחובות הצדדיים של אורה־בוקורו.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3406.html","https://www.hondori.or.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"רחוב הולכי רגל מקורה ושטוח, נוח מאוד לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hondori%20Shopping%20Street%20Hiroshima","website_url":"https://www.hondori.or.jp/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים מגשר מוטויאסו מזרחה עד האצ'וברי, נכנסים לבתי מרקחת, חנויות מזכרות וחנויות ביגוד.","special":"מחבר את פארק השלום למרכז הקניות בהליכה מקורה אחת.","highlights":["בתי מרקחת","חנויות מזכרות","ההמשך לאוקונומימורה"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Hondori, Naka-ku, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"מקורה, טוב ליום גשום ולטיול עם עגלה","baby_block":null,"tags":["shopping street","arcade","shopping","souvenirs","drugstore","fashion","covered street","רחוב קניות","קניות","מזכרות","בית מרקחת","אופנה","מקורה"],"en":{"hype":"Hiroshima's main covered shopping street, half a kilometre east from Peace Park.","reality":"Handy and covered, with chains, clothes, drugstores and souvenirs. Nothing special, but good for a rainy wander and easy with a stroller.","tip":"At the east end, head south to Okonomimura and the Urabukuro side streets.","baby_notes":"Covered, flat pedestrian street, very stroller friendly.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk east from Motoyasu Bridge to Hatchobori, stopping at drugstores, souvenir shops and clothes stores.","special":"Links Peace Park to the shopping centre in one covered walk.","highlights":["Drugstores","Souvenir shops","On to Okonomimura"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Covered, good for rain and for a stroller","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hiroshima Yumeplaza","name_ja":"ひろしま夢ぷらざ","city":"hiroshima","area":"Downtown Hiroshima","category":"shopping","lat":34.3938,"lng":132.4604,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"החנות של מחוז הירושימה בהונדורי, עם מוצרים מקומיים: ממתקים, רטבים, סאקה ותוצרת חקלאית.","reality":"המקום הכי טוב בעיר למזכרות אוכל מקומיות במחירים רגילים, בלי אריזות תיירותיות מנופחות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"שווה לחפש רוטב אוקונומיאקי מקומי