clothes and little boutiques.","reality":"Where Hiroshima's young crowd shops. No sights, just wandering between small, interesting stores.","tip":"Most shops only open around midday, so mornings are pointless.","baby_notes":"Narrow streets and small shops with steps, hard with a stroller.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Wander the lanes, browse vintage and clothes shops, and finish at a small cafe.","special":"Independent shops, not chains, which Hondori lacks.","highlights":["Vintage shops","Small boutiques"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Go after 12:00, shops open late","baby_block":"Small shops with steps, hard with a stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"ekie","name_ja":"エキエ","city":"hiroshima","area":"Hiroshima Station","category":"shopping","lat":34.3975,"lng":132.4752,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מתחם החנויות בתוך תחנת הירושימה, עם אזור מזכרות גדול ומסעדות.","reality":"המקום הכי נוח לקנות מזכרות לפני השינקנסן, עם כל המותגים המקומיים במקום אחד.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"אזור המזכרות ליד שערי השינקנסן נשאר פתוח עד מאוחר, טוב לקניות של הרגע האחרון.","sources":["https://www.otafuku.co.jp/visit/en/experience/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"בתוך התחנה, מעליות ושירותים עם החתלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=ekie%20Hiroshima","website_url":"https://www.ekie.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין דוכני המזכרות, קונים מומיג'י מנג'ו ורטבים, ואוכלים משהו לפני הרכבת.","special":"כל המותגים של הירושימה בכמה מטרים, צמוד לרציפים.","highlights":["מומיג'י מנג'ו","רוטב אוקונומיאקי","קופסאות אוכל לרכבת"],"time_needed":"חצי שעה-שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-2 Matsubaracho, Minami-ku, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לקנות מזכרות כאן ממש לפני השי