s":"Hiroshima Station, Matsubaracho, Minami-ku, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"החשמלית יוצאת מהקומה השנייה, בלי לצאת לרחוב","baby_block":null,"tags":["station building","shopping mall","shopping","restaurants","tram","new building","קניון","בניין התחנה","קניות","מסעדות","חשמלית"],"en":{"hype":"Hiroshima's new station building, opened in 2025, with shops, restaurants and the tram running inside.","reality":"New, clean and handy, and saves walking in the cold. The shops are mostly chains, so it's about location, not special shopping.","tip":"The tram to Peace Park leaves from the building's second floor, without going outside.","baby_notes":"New building with lifts and good toilets.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Browse the shop and restaurant floors, then go straight up to the tram on the second floor.","special":"The tram runs into the station building, rare in Japan.","highlights":["Tram stop on 2F","Restaurant floors"],"time_needed":"Half an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"The tram leaves from the 2nd floor, no need to go outside","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kumano Fude Select Shop Hiroshima","name_ja":"熊野筆セレクトショップ 広島店","city":"hiroshima","area":"Hiroshima Station","category":"shopping","lat":34.3978,"lng":132.4757,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"חנות של מכחולי קומאנו, המכחולים מהעיירה ליד הירושימה שמייצרת את רוב מכחולי האיפור והקליגרפיה ביפן.","reality":"מתנה מקומית אמיתית ולא עוד מזכרת. מכחולי האיפור רכים מאוד, והמחירים מתחילים נמוך ועולים מהר.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"אפשר לגעת ולנסות את המכחולים על היד לפני שבוחרים.","sources":["https://www.kumanofude.com/shop/hiroshima/","https://www.kumanofude.com/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חנות קטנה בקומת הכניסה של המלון, אפשר להיכנס עם עגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"