","reality":"המקום לקנות את ה'נאמה מומיג'י', גרסה לעיסה מקמח אורז, טרייה ובכל המילויים. 5-10 דקות הליכה מהתחנה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"הנאמה מומיג'י נטולת גלוטן ומחזיקה פחות זמן, לקנות בסוף הטיול.","sources":["https://www.city.hiroshima.lg.jp/english/hiroshima-brand-en/1032092/1032097/1014871.html","https://www.nisikido.co.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חנות ברחוב, כניסה שטוחה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nishikido%20Hikarimachi%20Main%20Store%20Hiroshima","website_url":"https://www.nisikido.co.jp/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"בוחרים מילויים, טועמים כשיש טעימות וקונים קופסאות מתנה.","special":"יש כאן את כל סוגי המילוי, גם כאלה שלא מגיעים לדוכנים בתחנה.","highlights":["נאמה מומיג'י","מומיג'י מנג'ו קלאסי"],"time_needed":"20 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-13-23 Hikarimachi, Higashi-ku, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":20,"booking":"no","plan_line":"הנאמה מומיג'י נטולת גלוטן, לקנות בימים האחרונים","baby_block":null,"tags":["momiji manju","sweets","wagashi","souvenirs","gluten free","maple cake","מומיג'י מנג'ו","ממתקים","מתוקים יפניים","מזכרות","ללא גלוטן"],"en":{"hype":"The main store of Nishikido, one of the big momiji manju makers (maple-leaf cakes).","reality":"The place for 'nama momiji', a chewy rice-flour version, fresh and in every filling. 5-10 minutes' walk from the station.","tip":"Nama momiji is gluten free and keeps less long; buy it at the end of the trip.","baby_notes":"Street-level shop, flat entrance.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Pick fillings, taste when samples are out and buy gift boxes.","special":"Every filling is here, including ones the station stalls don't carry.","highlights":["Nama momiji","Classic momiji manju"],"time_needed":"20 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Nama momiji is gluten free; buy it in the last days","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hiroshima Toshogu Shrine","name_ja":"広島東照宮","city":"hiroshima","area":"Hiroshima Station","category":"sight","lat":34.4045,"lng":132.4755,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש מ־1648 ממש מאחורי תחנת הירושימה, עם שער אדום ששרד את הפצצה ומנהרת שערי טורי במעלה ההר.","reality":"שקט, חינם ומעט תיירים, חמש דקות מהתחנה. מתאים לשעה פנויה לפני רכבת.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"מאחורי המקדש מתחילים כ־120 שערי טורי אדומים שעולים לשביל לפגודת השלום.","sources":["https://gethiroshima.com/features/peace-pagoda-hike/","https://www.jrpass.com/ja/blog/futabanosato-walking-trail"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש מדרגות עד המקדש, והשביל מאחוריו עם מדרגות רבות. עדיף מנשא.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hiroshima%20Toshogu%20Shrine%20Hiroshima","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במדרגות לאולם הראשי, עוברים בשער ששרד את הפצצה, ונכנסים למנהרת הטורי מאחור.","special":"השער שרד את הפצצה, והמקדש מוקדש לטוקוגאווה איאסו.","highlights":["השער האדום","מנהרת שערי הטורי"],"time_needed":"חצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-1-18 Futabanosato, Higashi-ku, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"חמש דקות מהיציאה הצפונית של התחנה","baby_block":"מדרגות, עדיף מנשא","tags":["shrine","shinto","torii","tokugawa","temple","hike","quiet","מקדש","שינטו","שערי טורי","טוקוגאווה","שקט","טיול"],"en":{"hype":"A shrine from 1648 right behind Hiroshima Station, with a red gate that survived the bomb and a torii tunnel up the hill.","reality":"Quiet, free and with few tourists, five minutes from the station. Good for a spare hour before a train.","tip":"Behind the shrine about 120 red torii gates climb to the path to the Peace Pagoda.","baby_notes":"Steps up to the shrine and many more on the path behind. A carrier is better.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Climb the steps to the main hall, pass the gate that survived the bomb and walk into the torii tunnel behind.","special":"The gate survived the bomb; the shrine honours Tokugawa Ieyasu.","highlights":["Red gate","Torii tunnel"],"time_needed":"Half an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Five minutes from the station's north exit","baby_block":"Steps, a baby carrier is better"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Futabayama Peace Pagoda","name_ja":"二葉山 仏舎利塔","city":"hiroshima","area":"Hiroshima Station","category":"experience","lat":34.408,"lng":132.477,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"טיול קצר ביער מאחורי התחנה עד פגודת כסף על הר פוטאבה, עם הנוף הכי טוב על העיר.","reality":"עלייה תלולה של כ־20 דקות בקטע האחרון, אבל קצרה. הנוף על העיר והמפרץ שווה את המאמץ.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"השבילים ביער חלקלקים אחרי גשם, נעליים טובות. אפשר גם לעלות בכביש הסלול.","sources":["https://gethiroshima.com/features/peace-pagoda-hike/","https://www.jrpass.com/ja/blog/futabanosato-walking-trail"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"שביל יער תלול עם מדרגות, לא לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Futabayama%20Peace%20Pagoda%20Hiroshima","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מתחילים במקדש טושוגו, עולים בין שערי הטורי, עוצרים במקדש אינארי הקטן, ומטפסים ביער עד הפגודה והנוף.","special":"הפגודה נבנתה ב־1966 כתפילה לשלום ולזכר הקורבנות.","highlights":["פגודת השלום","הנוף על העיר","מקדש קינקו אינארי"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Futabanosato, Higashi-ku, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"להתחיל מטושוגו, 40-60 דקות עד הפגודה","baby_block":"שביל יער תלול, לא לעגלה","tags":["hike","hiking","pagoda","view","viewpoint","forest","trail","sunset","טיול","הליכה","פגודה","נוף","תצפית","יער","שביל"],"en":{"hype":"A short forest hike behind the station to a silver pagoda on Mount Futaba, with the best view over the city.","reality":"A steep last stretch of about 20 minutes, but short. The view over the city and bay is worth it.","tip":"Forest paths are slippery after rain; wear good shoes, or take the paved road up.","baby_notes":"Steep forest path with steps, not for a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Start at Toshogu, climb through the torii, stop at the small Inari shrine, then up through the forest to the pagoda and view.","special":"The pagoda was built in 1966 as a prayer for peace and for the bomb's victims.","highlights":["Peace Pagoda","City view","Kinko Inari Shrine"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Start at Toshogu, 40-60 minutes up to the pagoda","baby_block":"Steep forest path, no stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hiroshima City Museum of Contemporary Art","name_ja":"広島市現代美術館","city":"hiroshima","area":"Hiroshima Station","category":"sight","lat":34.3858,"lng":132.4772,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המוזיאון הציבורי הראשון ביפן לאמנות עכשווית, בפארק היג'יאמה על גבעה דרומית לתחנה.","reality":"הבניין של קישו קורוקאווה מעניין בפני עצמו, והתערוכות משתנות, לפעמים מצוינות ולפעמים קשות להבנה. שווה למי שאוהב אמנות עכשווית.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"משתנה לפי התערוכה","tip":"משלבים עם טיול בפארק היג'יאמה, יש בו נוף על העיר.","sources":["https://gethiroshima.com/museums/hmoca","https://www.hiroshima-moca.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש מעלית בתוך המוזיאון. העלייה מהתחנה של החשמלית בגבעה, עדיף מונית עם עגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hiroshima%20City%20Museum%20of%20Contemporary%20Art%20Hiroshima","website_url":"https://www.hiroshima-moca.jp/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בתערוכה המתחלפת ובאוסף, ויוצאים לפארק לנוף על העיר.","special":"המוזיאון נפתח מחדש ב־2023 אחרי שיפוץ של יותר משנתיים.","highlights":["הבניין של קורוקאווה","הנוף מפארק היג'יאמה"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-1 Hijiyamakoen, Minami-ku, Hiroshima","opens":"10:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני. 500 מטר עלייה מתחנת היג'יאמה־שיטה","baby_block":null,"tags":["contemporary art","art museum","museum","modern art","architecture","park","view","אמנות עכשווית","מוזיאון","מוזיאון אמנות","אדריכלות","פארק","נוף"],"en":{"hype":"Japan's first public museum of contemporary art, in Hijiyama Park on a hill south of the station.","reality":"Kisho Kurokawa's building is interesting in itself, and the shows vary, sometimes great, sometimes hard to read. Worth it if you like contemporary art.","tip":"Pair it with a walk in Hijiyama Park, which has a city view.","baby_notes":"Lift inside. It's uphill from the tram stop; a taxi is easier with a stroller.","price":"Varies by exhibition","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk through the current show and the collection, then out into the park for the city view.","special":"Reopened in 2023 after more than two years of renovation.","highlights":["Kurokawa's building","Hijiyama Park view"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays. 500 m uphill from Hijiyama-shita stop","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
where not exists (select 1 from place_library p where p.city = x.city and lower(p.name) = lower(x.name));
insert into place_library (name, name_ja, city, area, category, lat, lng, coord_precision, hype, reality, verdict, tabelog_score, google_score, price, tip, sources, audience, baby_notes, local_pick, maps_url, website_url, serves, dishes, todo, special, highlights, time_needed, kosher, kosher_note, address, opens, closes, closed_weekdays, closed_dates, open_dates, best_time, visit_mins, booking, plan_line, baby_block, tags, en, facts_at, facts_sure, active)
select x.name, x.name_ja, x.city, x.area, x.category, x.lat, x.lng, x.coord_precision, x.hype, x.reality, x.verdict, x.tabelog_score, x.google_score, x.price, x.tip, x.sources, x.audience, x.baby_notes, x.local_pick, x.maps_url, x.website_url, x.serves, x.dishes, x.todo, x.special, x.highlights, x.time_needed, x.kosher, x.kosher_note, x.address, x.opens, x.closes, x.closed_weekdays, x.closed_dates, x.open_dates, x.best_time, x.visit_mins, x.booking, x.plan_line, x.baby_block, x.tags, x.en, x.facts_at, x.facts_sure, false from jsonb_populate_recordset(null::place_library, $cards$[{"name":"Mitaki-dera Temple","name_ja":"三瀧寺","city":"hiroshima","area":"Hiroshima Station","category":"sight","lat":34.418,"lng":132.433,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש בודהיסטי ביער בצפון העיר, עם שלושה מפלים, פגודה אדומה ומאות פסלי ג'יזו מכוסי טחב.","reality":"אחד המקומות הכי יפים והכי ריקים בהירושימה, עשר דקות ברכבת מהתחנה. העלייה מהתחנה ארוכה ותלולה.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"תרומה בקופה בכניסה, בערך ¥200","tip":"מתחנת מיטאקי יש 20 דקות הליכה בעלייה, מונית מיוקוגאווה חוסכת אותה.","sources":["https://gethiroshima.com/museums-attractions/mitaki-temple/","https://dive-hiroshima.com/en/explore/4884/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"מדרגות אבן רבות בתוך המתחם, לא לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Mitaki-dera%20Temple%20Hiroshima","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במדרגות בין פסלי הג'יזו, עוברים ליד המפלים, ומגיעים לפגודה האדומה ולאולמות שבראש המתחם.","special":"המים מהמפלים משמשים בטקס הזיכרון השנתי בפארק השלום.","highlights":["הפגודה האדומה","פסלי הג'יזו","המפלים"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"411 Mitakiyama, Nishi-ku, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"קו JR קאבה 8 דקות לתחנת מיטאקי, ואז עלייה","baby_block":"מדרגות אבן רבות, לא לעגלה","tags":["temple","buddhist temple","waterfall","pagoda","jizo","forest","moss","quiet","מקדש","מקדש בודהיסטי","מפל","פגודה","ג'יזו","יער","טחב","שקט"],"en":{"hype":"A Buddhist temple in the forest north of the city, with three waterfalls, a red pagoda and hundreds of mossy Jizo statues.","reality":"One of the prettiest and emptiest spots in Hiroshima, ten minutes by train from the station. The walk up from the station is long and steep.","tip":"It's a 20-minute uphill walk from Mitaki Station; a taxi from Yokogawa saves it.","baby_notes":"Lots of stone steps inside, not for a stroller.","price":"Donation box at the entrance, about ¥200","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Climb the steps past the Jizo statues and waterfalls up to the red pagoda and halls at the top.","special":"Water from the falls is used in the annual memorial ceremony in Peace Park.","highlights":["Red pagoda","Jizo statues","Waterfalls"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"JR Kabe line 8 min to Mitaki, then uphill","baby_block":"Many stone steps, no stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"OKOSTA","name_ja":"OKOSTA","city":"hiroshima","area":"Hiroshima Station","category":"experience","lat":34.3974,"lng":132.475,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שיעור אוקונומיאקי של אוטאפוקו, יצרנית הרוטב, שבו מכינים בעצמכם על הפלנצ'ה את הגרסה של הירושימה בשכבות.","reality":"כיף, מסודר ובאנגלית, ובסוף אוכלים את מה שהכנתם. יש גרסה צמחונית, אז אפשר לוותר על החזיר והשרימפס.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥2,500 לאדם","tip":"להזמין לפחות שלושה ימים מראש בטלפון או בטופס באתר.","sources":["https://www.otafuku.co.jp/visit/en/experience/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"שיעור של שעה וחצי ליד פלנצ'ה לוהטת, לא מתאים לתינוק בידיים.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=OKOSTA%20Hiroshima%20Station","website_url":"https://www.otafuku.co.jp/visit/en/experience/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מקבלים הדגמה, בונים את האוקונומיאקי שכבה אחרי שכבה על הפלנצ'ה, הופכים אותו ואוכלים.","special":"השיעור של יצרנית הרוטב עצמה, דקותיים מהתחנה.","highlights":["הכנה על הפלנצ'ה","גרסה צמחונית"],"time_needed":"שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"ekie, 1-2 Matsubaracho, Minami-ku, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":90,"booking":"required","plan_line":"שיעורים ב־10:30, 13:00 ו־18:30. להזמין 3 ימים מראש","baby_block":"פלנצ'ה לוהטת, לא עם תינוק בידיים","tags":["okonomiyaki","cooking class","workshop","hiroshima style","teppan","vegetarian","food experience","אוקונומיאקי","שיעור בישול","סדנה","פלנצ'ה","צמחוני","בישול"],"en":{"hype":"An okonomiyaki class by Otafuku, the sauce maker, where you cook the layered Hiroshima version on the griddle yourself.","reality":"Fun, well run and in English, and you eat what you make. There's a vegetarian version, so you can skip pork and shrimp.","tip":"Book at least three days ahead by phone or the online form.","baby_notes":"90 minutes at a hot griddle, not for holding a baby.","price":"¥2,500 per person","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Watch a demo, build the okonomiyaki layer by layer on the griddle, flip it and eat.","special":"Run by the sauce maker itself, two minutes from the station.","highlights":["Cooking on the griddle","Vegetarian version"],"time_needed":"1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Classes at 10:30, 13:00 and 18:30. Book 3 days ahead","baby_block":"Hot griddle, not with a baby in arms"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Mazda Museum","name_ja":"マツダミュージアム","city":"hiroshima","area":"Hiroshima Station","category":"experience","lat":34.374,"lng":132.505,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"סיור במפעל ובמוזיאון של מאזדה, כולל צפייה בפס הייצור מלמעלה, ליד תחנת מוקאינאדה.","reality":"סיור חינם ומרתק למי שאוהב מכוניות, אבל רק בהזמנה מראש ורק בימי חול. בלי הזמנה לא נכנסים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"מזמינים באתר עד שלושה חודשים מראש. יש סיור אחד ביום באנגלית.","sources":["https://www.mazda.com/en/about/museum/","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3405.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"סיור הליכה של שעה וחצי עד שעתיים בקבוצה, פחות מתאים לתינוק.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Mazda%20Museum%20Hiroshima","website_url":"https://www.mazda.com/en/about/museum/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נרשמים במשרד הראשי, עוברים בתערוכת הדגמים ההיסטוריים, ורואים את פס הייצור שבו מרכיבים מכוניות אמיתיות.","special":"רואים פס ייצור פעיל, לא רק מכוניות מוצגות.","highlights":["פס הייצור","דגמי מאזדה היסטוריים"],"time_needed":"שעה וחצי-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-1 Shinchi, Fuchu-cho, Aki-gun, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[0,6],"closed_dates":["2026-12-26","2026-12-27","2026-12-28","2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":120,"booking":"required","plan_line":"רק בהזמנה ורק בימי חול. סגור מ־26 בדצמבר עד 5 בינואר","baby_block":"סיור הליכה ארוך בקבוצה","tags":["mazda","car factory","factory tour","cars","museum","assembly line","automobile","מאזדה","מפעל","סיור במפעל","מכוניות","מוזיאון","פס ייצור","רכב"],"en":{"hype":"A tour of Mazda's factory and museum, including the assembly line seen from above, near Mukainada Station.","reality":"Free and fascinating if you like cars, but booking only and weekdays only. No booking, no entry.","tip":"Book online up to three months ahead. One tour a day is in English.","baby_notes":"A 90-120 minute walking tour in a group, not great with a baby.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Sign in at the head office, walk through the historic models and watch real cars being built on the line.","special":"You see a working assembly line, not just cars on display.","highlights":["Assembly line","Historic Mazdas"],"time_needed":"1.5-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Booking only, weekdays only. Closed 26 Dec to 5 Jan","baby_block":"Long group walking tour"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hiroden Streetcar","name_ja":"広島電鉄 路面電車","city":"hiroshima","area":"Hiroshima Station","category":"experience","lat":34.3972,"lng":132.4755,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"החשמליות של הירושימה, הרשת הגדולה ביפן, שנכנסות מאז 2025 לקומה השנייה של בניין התחנה.","reality":"הדרך הכי טובה לנוע בעיר, עם קרונות ישנים לצד חדשים. אחרי הצהריים צפוף מאוד.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כרטיס יומי ¥700 למבוגר","tip":"קו 2 ממשיך עד מיאג'ימגוצ'י, אבל הוא איטי, כשעה. לפארק השלום לוקחים קו 2 או 6 לתחנת הכיפה.","sources":["https://www.hiroden.co.jp/en/e-1day.html","https://www.japan-guide.com/blog/schauwecker/250803.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"בקרונות החדשים יש רצפה נמוכה ומקום לעגלה. בקרונות הישנים יש מדרגה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hiroden%20Streetcar%20Hiroshima","website_url":"https://www.hiroden.co.jp/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים בקומה השנייה של התחנה, נוסעים ברחובות עד הכיפה או האצ'וברי, ומשלמים ביציאה בכרטיס IC.","special":"חלק מהקרונות שרדו את הפצצה וחזרו לנסוע ימים ספורים אחריה.","highlights":["תחנת החשמלית בתוך התחנה","הקרונות הישנים"],"time_needed":null,"kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Hiroshima Station, Matsubaracho, Minami-ku, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":20,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לשלם בכרטיס IC ביציאה מהדלת הקדמית","baby_block":null,"tags":["tram","streetcar","public transport","hiroden","transport","day pass","retro tram","חשמלית","תחבורה ציבורית","כרטיס יומי","תחבורה","רכבת קלה"],"en":{"hype":"Hiroshima's trams, Japan's largest network, which since 2025 run into the second floor of the station building.","reality":"The best way around the city, with old cars next to new ones. Very crowded in the late afternoon.","tip":"Line 2 goes on to Miyajimaguchi but it's slow, about an hour. For Peace Park take line 2 or 6 to the Dome stop.","baby_notes":"New cars have low floors and room for a stroller. Old cars have a step.","price":"Day pass ¥700 adults","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Board on the station's second floor, ride through the streets to the Dome or Hatchobori, and pay with an IC card on the way out.","special":"Some cars survived the bomb and were running again days later.","highlights":["Tram stop inside the station","Old tram cars"],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Pay with an IC card when leaving by the front door","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hiroshima Kagura Wednesday Night","name_ja":"ひろしま神楽定期公演","city":"hiroshima","area":"Peace Park & Castle","category":"experience","lat":34.3962,"lng":132.4568,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מופע קאגורה, תיאטרון שינטו עם תלבושות זהב, מסכות ושדים, כל יום רביעי בערב ליד כיפת האטום.","reality":"45 דקות של מופע צבעוני ורועש עם כתוביות באנגלית ומנחה באנגלית. גם מי שלא אוהב תיאטרון נהנה.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,800","tip":"אחרי המופע אפשר להצטלם עם השחקנים בתלבושות.","sources":["https://gethiroshima.com/event/wednesday-night-kagura-2/2026-07-15/","https://www.japan.travel/en/ca/news/hiroshima-kagura-has-resumed-regular-performances-for-2025/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"תופים חזקים וזיקוקי תאורה על הבמה, רועש מאוד לתינוק.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hiroshima%20Prefectural%20Citizens%20Culture%20Center","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים מ־18:00, המופע מתחיל ב־19:00, וקוראים את הכתוביות מעל הבמה בזמן שהשדים נלחמים בגיבורים.","special":"להקות מהכפרים בצפון המחוז מופיעות בעיר, עם תלבושות כבדות מחוטי זהב.","highlights":["תלבושות הזהב","הנחש בעל שמונה הראשים","צילום עם השחקנים"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Hiroshima Prefectural Citizens Culture Center, 1-5-3 Otemachi, Naka-ku, Hiroshima","opens":"19:00","closes":"19:45","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":["2026-12-16","2026-12-23"],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":60,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"רק בימי רביעי עד חג המולד. להזמין דרך Klook או Viator","baby_block":"תופים חזקים, רועש לתינוק","tags":["kagura","theatre","theater","show","performance","dance","masks","shinto","traditional","קאגורה","תיאטרון","מופע","ריקוד","מסכות","שינטו","מסורתי"],"en":{"hype":"A kagura show, Shinto theatre with gold costumes, masks and demons, every Wednesday evening by the A-Bomb Dome.","reality":"45 minutes of colourful, loud theatre with English subtitles and an English MC. Fun even if you don't like theatre.","tip":"After the show you can take photos with the performers in costume.","baby_notes":"Loud drums and stage effects, very noisy for a baby.","price":"¥1,800","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Doors at 18:00, show at 19:00; follow the subtitles above the stage while demons fight heroes.","special":"Troupes from the villages of the north of the prefecture perform in town, in heavy gold-thread costumes.","highlights":["Gold costumes","Eight-headed serpent","Photos with performers"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Wednesdays only, until Christmas. Book via Klook or Viator","baby_block":"Loud drums, noisy for a baby"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Itsukushima Shrine","name_ja":"嚴島神社","city":"hiroshima","area":"Miyajima","category":"sight","lat":34.296,"lng":132.3198,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המקדש על המים והשער הצף של מיאג'ימה, אחד משלושת הנופים היפים של יפן.","reality":"באמת יפה כמו בתמונות, בעיקר בגאות. בצהריים צפוף מאוד במסדרונות, ובשפל השער כבר לא נראה צף.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥300, עם אולם האוצרות ¥500","tip":"לבדוק טבלת גאות ושפל לפני: מעל 250 ס\"מ השער נראה צף, מתחת ל־100 ס\"מ הולכים עד אליו.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3450.html","https://watabi.org/en/articles/itsukushima-shrine-guide"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"אין מדרגות במסדרונות המקדש, נכנסים עם עגלה. האיילים ברחובות מנסים לאכול מכל שקית.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Itsukushima%20Shrine","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים ממסדרון הכניסה, הולכים במסדרונות האדומים מעל המים, עוצרים מול השער הגדול ויוצאים בצד השני.","special":"המקדש בנוי על עמודים בתוך המפרץ, ובגאות הכל נראה צף.","highlights":["השער הגדול","המסדרונות האדומים","במת הנו"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-1 Miyajimacho, Hatsukaichi, Hiroshima","opens":"06:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בדצמבר פתוח 6:30-17:00. להגיע לפני 9:00 או בגאות","baby_block":null,"tags":["shrine","floating torii","torii","itsukushima","unesco","world heritage","shinto","tide","מקדש","שער צף","טורי","אתר מורשת","שינטו","גאות","מיאג'ימה"],"en":{"hype":"Miyajima's shrine on the water and its floating gate, one of Japan's three classic views.","reality":"As pretty as the photos, especially at high tide. Midday crowds pack the corridors, and at low tide the gate no longer looks like it floats.","tip":"Check the tide table first: above 250 cm the gate floats, below 100 cm you can walk out to it.","baby_notes":"No steps in the shrine corridors, so the stroller comes in. The deer in the streets go for any bag.","price":"¥300, ¥500 with the treasure hall","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Enter at the entrance corridor, walk the red corridors over the water, stop facing the great gate and exit on the far side.","special":"Built on posts in the bay, so at high tide it all seems to float.","highlights":["The great torii","Red corridors","Noh stage"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Open 6:30-17:00 in December. Go before 9:00 or at high tide","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Mount Misen","name_ja":"弥山","city":"hiroshima","area":"Miyajima","category":"sight","lat":34.2795,"lng":132.3195,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"ההר הגבוה של מיאג'ימה, עם נוף על האיים של ים סטו ומקדשים ליד הפסגה.","reality":"הנוף מהפסגה מהטובים באזור, גם בחורף. אולם הלהבה הנצחית נשרף במאי 2026, ומהרכבל עוד יש 30 דקות הליכה תלולה לפסגה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם ברגל, רכבל ¥2,000 הלוך חזור","tip":"בחורף מתחשך מוקדם, לרדת לפני 16:30 כשהרכבל האחרון יורד.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3451.html","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3453.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"שבילים תלולים עם מדרגות אבן, גם מהרכבל. רק עם מנשא.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Mount%20Misen%20Miyajima","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים ברכבל או ברגל בשביל דאישו־אין, ממשיכים לסלעים הענקיים ולפסגה, ונהנים מהנוף על הים.","special":"הסלעים הענקיים בפסגה והנוף על עשרות איים בים סטו.","highlights":["תצפית הפסגה","הסלעים הענקיים","שביל דאישו־אין"],"time_needed":"חצי יום","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Mount Misen, Miyajimacho, Hatsukaichi, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":180,"booking":"no","plan_line":"ברגל שעה וחצי-שעתיים לכיוון. לצאת מוקדם בחורף","baby_block":"שבילים תלולים ומדרגות, רק עם מנשא","tags":["mountain","hike","hiking","summit","view","viewpoint","nature","forest","הר","טיול","הליכה","פסגה","נוף","תצפית","טבע","יער"],"en":{"hype":"Miyajima's high mountain, with views over the Seto Inland Sea islands and temples near the top.","reality":"The summit view is one of the best around, even in winter. The eternal flame hall burned in May 2026, and from the ropeway it's still a steep 30-minute walk to the top.","tip":"It gets dark early in winter; be down before 16:30, when the last ropeway descends.","baby_notes":"Steep paths with stone steps, even from the ropeway. Carrier only.","price":"Free on foot, ropeway ¥2,000 return","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Ride the ropeway or hike the Daisho-in trail, continue past the giant boulders to the summit and take in the sea view.","special":"Giant boulders at the top and a view over dozens of Inland Sea islands.","highlights":["Summit lookout","Giant boulders","Daisho-in trail"],"time_needed":"Half a day","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"1.5-2 hours each way on foot. Start early in winter","baby_block":"Steep paths and steps, carrier only"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Daisho-in Temple","name_ja":"大聖院","city":"hiroshima","area":"Miyajima","category":"sight","lat":34.2925,"lng":132.3205,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המקדש הבודהיסטי הוותיק של האי, למרגלות הר מיסן, עם גלגלי תפילה ומאות פסלים קטנים.","reality":"יפה, חינם ושקט יותר מהמקדש על המים. רוב התיירים לא מגיעים עד לכאן, וחבל.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"מסובבים את גלגלי הסוטרות לאורך המדרגות בעלייה, זה נחשב כמו לקרוא אותן.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3453.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"הרבה מדרגות בין האולמות, קשה עם עגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Daisho-in%20Temple%20Miyajima","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במדרגות עם גלגלי התפילה, נכנסים למערה עם 88 הפסלים, ועוברים בין האולמות ופסלי הג'יזו עם הכובעים.","special":"מערה עם 88 פסלים שמייצגים את 88 המקדשים של מסלול העלייה לרגל בשיקוקו.","highlights":["גלגלי הסוטרות","מערת 88 הפסלים","מנדלת החול"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"210 Miyajimacho, Hatsukaichi, Hiroshima","opens":"08:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עשר דקות הליכה מהמקדש על המים, חינם","baby_block":"מדרגות רבות, קשה עם עגלה","tags":["temple","buddhist temple","prayer wheels","jizo","statues","cave","shingon","מקדש","מקדש בודהיסטי","גלגלי תפילה","ג'יזו","פסלים","מערה"],"en":{"hype":"The island's old Buddhist temple at the foot of Mount Misen, with prayer wheels and hundreds of small statues.","reality":"Pretty, free and quieter than the shrine on the water. Most tourists don't make it this far, which is a shame.","tip":"Spin the sutra wheels along the steps on the way up; it counts as reading them.","baby_notes":"Lots of steps between the halls, hard with a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Climb the steps with the prayer wheels, enter the cave with 88 icons and wander the halls and capped Jizo statues.","special":"A cave of 88 icons standing for the 88 temples of the Shikoku pilgrimage.","highlights":["Sutra wheels","Cave of 88 icons","Sand mandala"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Ten minutes' walk from the shrine, free","baby_block":"Many steps, hard with a stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Senjokaku (Toyokuni Shrine)","name_ja":"千畳閣（豊国神社）","city":"hiroshima","area":"Miyajima","category":"sight","lat":34.2973,"lng":132.3214,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אולם עץ ענק שהזמין הידיושי על גבעה מעל המקדש, ליד הפגודה בת חמש הקומות.","reality":"אולם ריק ופתוח עם רוח ונוף על המפרץ, נעים לשבת בו כמה דקות. הפגודה ליד מכוסה בפיגומים, ולפי התכנון הם יורדים בדצמבר 2026.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥100","tip":"יושבים על רצפת העץ ומסתכלים על התקרה המלאה בלוחות תפילה ישנים.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3452.html","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3450.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"עולים במדרגות לגבעה, ובאולם חולצים נעליים.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Senjokaku%20Miyajima","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים לגבעה, חולצים נעליים, יושבים באולם הגדול ומסתכלים על הנוף, ויוצאים לפגודה.","special":"האולם אף פעם לא הושלם, ולכן אין לו קירות קדמיים והוא פתוח לנוף.","highlights":["רצפת העץ הענקית","הפגודה בת חמש הקומות","הנוף על המפרץ"],"time_needed":"חצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-1 Miyajimacho, Hatsukaichi, Hiroshima","opens":"08:30","closes":"16:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"שתי דקות מהמקדש, לבדוק אם הפיגומים כבר ירדו מהפגודה","baby_block":"מדרגות לגבעה","tags":["hall","wooden hall","pagoda","five-story pagoda","hideyoshi","shrine","view","אולם עץ","פגודה","הידיושי","מקדש","נוף","היסטוריה"],"en":{"hype":"A huge wooden hall Hideyoshi ordered on a hill above the shrine, next to the five-storied pagoda.","reality":"An empty, breezy hall with a bay view, nice to sit in for a few minutes. The pagoda beside it is under scaffolding, due to come down in December 2026.","tip":"Sit on the wooden floor and look up at the ceiling covered in old prayer boards.","baby_notes":"Steps up the hill, and shoes off in the hall.","price":"¥100","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Climb the hill, take off your shoes, sit in the big hall for the view, then head out to the pagoda.","special":"The hall was never finished, so it has no front walls and stays open to the view.","highlights":["Huge wooden floor","Five-storied pagoda","Bay view"],"time_needed":"Half an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Two minutes from the shrine; check if the pagoda scaffolding is off","baby_block":"Steps up the hill"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Momijidani Park","name_ja":"紅葉谷公園","city":"hiroshima","area":"Miyajima","category":"sight","lat":34.2925,"lng":132.3245,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"עמק המייפלים של מיאג'ימה, בדרך לרכבל, עם נחל, גשרים אדומים ואיילים.","reality":"בסוף נובמבר הוא אדום ומלא אנשים. בדצמבר העלים כבר נשרו, אז זה פשוט טיול יער שקט ונחמד בדרך לרכבל.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"בדרך לרכבל עוברים בו בכל מקרה, אין צורך לתכנן לו זמן נפרד בדצמבר.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3456.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שביל סלול בעלייה מתונה, אפשר עם עגלה עד תחנת הרכבל.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Momijidani%20Park%20Miyajima","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים לאורך הנחל בין העצים, עוברים על הגשרים האדומים וממשיכים לתחנת הרכבל.","special":null,"highlights":["הגשרים האדומים","הנחל","האיילים"],"time_needed":"חצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Momijidani, Miyajimacho, Hatsukaichi, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בדצמבר העלים כבר נשרו, לעבור בדרך לרכבל","baby_block":null,"tags":["park","maple","autumn leaves","forest","stream","deer","nature walk","פארק","מייפל","שלכת","יער","נחל","איילים","טבע"],"en":{"hype":"Miyajima's maple valley on the way to the ropeway, with a stream, red bridges and deer.","reality":"In late November it's red and packed. By December the leaves are gone, so it's just a quiet, pleasant forest walk on the way to the ropeway.","tip":"You pass through it on the way to the ropeway anyway; no need to plan separate time in December.","baby_notes":"Paved path with a gentle climb, stroller fine up to the ropeway station.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk along the stream between the trees, cross the red bridges and carry on to the ropeway station.","special":null,"highlights":["Red bridges","The stream","Deer"],"time_needed":"Half an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Leaves are gone by December; walk it on the way to the ropeway","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Machiya-dori","name_ja":"町家通り","city":"hiroshima","area":"Miyajima","category":"sight","lat":34.2985,"lng":132.3225,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רחוב בתי העץ הישנים של מיאג'ימה, מקביל לרחוב הקניות, עם בתי קפה וחנויות קטנות.","reality":"שקט בהרבה מאומוטסנדו ונעים להליכה. בערב פנסי נייר דולקים מול הבתים והאי מתרוקן מתיירים.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"לחזור לכאן אחרי שהסירות של אחר הצהריים יוצאות, אז הרחוב כמעט ריק.","sources":["https://www.miyajima.or.jp/sightseeing/ss_street.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"רחוב צר ושטוח, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Machiya-dori%20Miyajima","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים מהמזח לכיוון המקדש ברחוב הזה במקום ברחוב הקניות, ונכנסים לחנויות ולבתי הקפה בבתים הישנים.","special":"בתי סוחרים מתקופת אדו שנשמרו, והפנסים שנדלקים בערב.","highlights":["בתי העץ הישנים","פנסי הנייר בערב"],"time_needed":"חצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Machiya-dori, Miyajimacho, Hatsukaichi, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"ללכת בו בערב, כשהפנסים דולקים והתיירים יצאו","baby_block":null,"tags":["old street","machiya","traditional houses","lanterns","cafes","walk","evening","רחוב ישן","בתים מסורתיים","פנסים","בתי קפה","הליכה","ערב"],"en":{"hype":"Miyajima's street of old wooden houses, parallel to the shopping street, with cafes and small shops.","reality":"Much quieter than Omotesando and nice to walk. In the evening paper lanterns glow in front of the houses and the island empties out.","tip":"Come back after the late-afternoon boats leave; the street is almost empty then.","baby_notes":"Narrow, flat street, easy with a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk from the pier to the shrine along this street instead of the shopping street, and drop into shops and cafes in the old houses.","special":"Preserved Edo-period merchant houses and the lanterns lit at night.","highlights":["Old wooden houses","Paper lanterns at night"],"time_needed":"Half an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Walk it in the evening, when lanterns are lit and tourists gone","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Miyajima History and Folklore Museum","name_ja":"宮島歴史民俗資料館","city":"hiroshima","area":"Miyajima","category":"sight","lat":34.295,"lng":132.318,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון קטן בבית של סוחר רוטב סויה בן 160 שנה, על חיי האי והטקסים של המקדש.","reality":"מוזיאון קטן ושקט בלי הרבה הסבר באנגלית, אבל הבית והגן היפני בתוכו שווים את ¥300.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥300 למבוגר, ילדים חינם","tip":"שווה בעיקר בשביל הבית הישן והגן, לא בשביל התצוגות.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3455.html","https://www.miyajima.or.jp/sightseeing/sightseeing02.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"בית ישן עם מדרגות וחליצת נעליים.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Miyajima%20History%20and%20Folklore%20Museum","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בחדרי הבית הישן, רואים את כלי העבודה ואת דגמי הסירות של הטקסים, ויושבים מול הגן.","special":"הבית והמחסן של משפחת סוחרים עשירה נשמרו כמו שהיו.","highlights":["הבית הישן","הגן היפני"],"time_needed":"חצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"57 Miyajimacho, Hatsukaichi, Hiroshima","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-26","2026-12-27","2026-12-28","2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני ומ־26 בדצמבר. כניסה אחרונה 16:30","baby_block":"מדרגות וחליצת נעליים","tags":["museum","history museum","folklore","traditional house","garden","merchant house","מוזיאון","היסטוריה","פולקלור","בית מסורתי","גן יפני"],"en":{"hype":"A small museum in a 160-year-old soy sauce merchant's house, about island life and the shrine's rites.","reality":"Small and quiet with little English, but the house and its Japanese garden are worth the ¥300.","tip":"Go for the old house and garden more than the displays.","baby_notes":"Old house with steps and shoes off.","price":"¥300 adults, children free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the old house's rooms, see the tools and ceremonial boat models, and sit facing the garden.","special":"A rich merchant family's home and storehouse, kept as they were.","highlights":["The old house","Japanese garden"],"time_needed":"Half an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays and from 26 December. Last entry 16:30","baby_block":"Steps and shoes off"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Miyajima Omotesando Shopping Street","name_ja":"宮島表参道商店街","city":"hiroshima","area":"Miyajima","category":"shopping","lat":34.2978,"lng":132.3215,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רחוב הקניות הראשי של מיאג'ימה, מהמזח עד המקדש, עם יותר מ־80 חנויות.","reality":"תיירותי וצפוף בצהריים, אבל זה המקום לכפות אורז מעץ, מומיג'י מנג'ו ומזכרות של האי. המחירים סבירים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"כפות האורז מעץ (שאקושי) הן המזכרת המקורית של האי, עדיף לקנות מעץ אמיתי ולא מפלסטיק.","sources":["https://www.miyajima.or.jp/sightseeing/ss_street.html","https://miyajima.or.jp/english/spot/spot_shamoji.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"רחוב שטוח ומקורה, אבל צפוף מאוד בצהריים עם עגלה. לשמור שקיות מהאיילים.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Miyajima%20Omotesando%20Shopping%20Street","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים מהמזח למקדש, נכנסים לחנויות כפות העץ והפסלים, ורואים דרך החלונות את המכונות שאופות מומיג'י מנג'ו.","special":"מכונות האפייה של המומיג'י מנג'ו עובדות בחלונות הראווה מול העוברים.","highlights":["כפות אורז מעץ","מומיג'י מנג'ו","גילופי עץ"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Omotesando, Miyajimacho, Hatsukaichi, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לעבור בבוקר לפני 11:00 או אחרי 16:00, בצהריים צפוף מאוד","baby_block":null,"tags":["shopping street","souvenirs","rice scoop","shamoji","momiji manju","woodcraft","crafts","רחוב קניות","מזכרות","כף אורז","מומיג'י מנג'ו","גילוף עץ","אומנות"],"en":{"hype":"Miyajima's main shopping street, from the pier to the shrine, with over 80 shops.","reality":"Touristy and packed at midday, but this is where to buy wooden rice scoops, momiji manju and island souvenirs. Prices are fair.","tip":"Wooden rice scoops (shakushi) are the island's original souvenir; get real wood, not plastic.","baby_notes":"Flat and covered, but very crowded at midday with a stroller. Keep bags away from the deer.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk from the pier to the shrine, browse the woodcraft shops and watch momiji manju being baked through the shop windows.","special":"Momiji manju machines bake away in the shop windows.","highlights":["Wooden rice scoops","Momiji manju","Wood carvings"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Go before 11:00 or after 16:00, packed at midday","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Miyajima Ropeway","name_ja":"宮島ロープウエー","city":"hiroshima","area":"Miyajima","category":"experience","lat":34.29,"lng":132.3265,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רכבל בשני חלקים מעמק המייפלים כמעט עד פסגת מיסן, עם נוף על המפרץ מהקרון.","reality":"חוסך שעה וחצי של טיפוס, אבל מהתחנה העליונה עוד 30 דקות הליכה תלולה לפסגה. ברוח חזקה הוא נעצר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,100 לכיוון, ¥2,000 הלוך חזור","tip":"הרבה עולים ברכבל ויורדים ברגל בשביל דאישו־אין, כך רואים את שניהם.","sources":["https://miyajima-ropeway.info/english/","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3451.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"עגלות לא עולות לרכבל העגול, משאירים אותן במשרד בתחנה התחתונה. אין מעליות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Miyajima%20Ropeway%20Miyajima","website_url":"https://miyajima-ropeway.info/english/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים מתחנת מומיג'ידאני, מחליפים קרון באמצע, ויוצאים לתצפית שישי־איווה לפני ההליכה לפסגה.","special":"מהקרון רואים את האיים של ים סטו נפרשים מתחת.","highlights":["תצפית שישי־איווה","הנוף מהקרון"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Momijidani, Miyajimacho, Hatsukaichi, Hiroshima","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עלייה אחרונה ב־16:00, ירידה אחרונה ב־16:30","baby_block":"בלי עגלה, משאירים למטה","tags":["ropeway","cable car","gondola","mountain","view","misen","רכבל","רכבל הרים","הר","נוף","מיסן","תצפית"],"en":{"hype":"A two-stage ropeway from the maple valley nearly to Misen's summit, with bay views from the cabin.","reality":"Saves a 90-minute climb, but from the top station it's still a steep 30-minute walk to the summit. It stops in strong wind.","tip":"Many ride up and hike down the Daisho-in trail, to get both.","baby_notes":"Strollers can't board the circular ropeway; leave them at the bottom station office. No lifts.","price":"¥1,100 one way, ¥2,000 return","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Board at Momijidani, change cabins halfway, and step out at Shishiiwa lookout before walking to the summit.","special":"From the cabin the Inland Sea islands spread out below.","highlights":["Shishiiwa lookout","Cabin views"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Last ride up 16:00, last ride down 16:30","baby_block":"No strollers, leave it at the bottom"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Walk to the Grand Torii at Low Tide","name_ja":"嚴島神社 大鳥居","city":"hiroshima","area":"Miyajima","category":"experience","lat":34.2958,"lng":132.3192,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בשפל המים נסוגים ואפשר ללכת על קרקעית המפרץ עד השער הגדול ולגעת בו.","reality":"רגע מיוחד ובחינם, אבל צריך לתזמן לפי השפל. הקרקעית בוצית וחלקה, ובגאות זה פשוט לא אפשרי.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"הולכים כשהמים מתחת ל־100 ס\"מ. טבלת השפל של השנה מופיעה באתר התיירות של מיאג'ימה ובמזח.","sources":["https://watabi.org/en/articles/itsukushima-shrine-guide","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3450.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"חול רטוב ובוץ, עגלה לא תעבור. רק עם מנשא.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Itsukushima%20Shrine%20Grand%20Torii","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יורדים מחוף מיקאסה לקרקעית, הולכים כ־200 מטר עד השער, ומסתכלים על העמודים הענקיים מקרוב.","special":"רואים מקרוב את השער שעומד על הקרקעית מכוח המשקל שלו, בלי יסודות.","highlights":["הליכה על קרקעית המפרץ","העמודים מקרוב"],"time_needed":"חצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Mikasahama, Miyajimacho, Hatsukaichi, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לבדוק טבלת שפל: מתחת ל־100 ס\"מ אפשר ללכת","baby_block":"חול ובוץ, רק עם מנשא","tags":["torii","grand torii","low tide","tide","walk","beach","floating gate","שער","טורי","שפל","גאות ושפל","הליכה","חוף","שער צף"],"en":{"hype":"At low tide the water pulls back and you can walk on the seabed to the great gate and touch it.","reality":"A special, free moment, but you have to time it with the tide. The seabed is muddy and slippery, and at high tide it can't be done.","tip":"Walk when the water is under 100 cm. The year's tide table is on the Miyajima tourism site and at the pier.","baby_notes":"Wet sand and mud, no stroller. Carrier only.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Step down from Mikasa beach onto the seabed, walk about 200 m to the gate and see the huge pillars up close.","special":"You see up close how the gate stands on the seabed by its own weight, without foundations.","highlights":["Walking the seabed","The pillars up close"],"time_needed":"Half an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Check the tide table: below 100 cm you can walk out","baby_block":"Sand and mud, carrier only"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Miyajima Traditional Industry Hall (Miyajiman Kobo)","name_ja":"宮島伝統産業会館（みやじまん工房）","city":"hiroshima","area":"Miyajima","category":"experience","lat":34.3005,"lng":132.323,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מרכז האומנות של האי ליד המזח, עם סדנאות אפיית מומיג'י מנג'ו ביד וגילוף כף אורז מעץ.","reality":"סדנה קצרה וזולה, מסודרת וכיפית, ויוצאים עם מזכרת שעשיתם בעצמכם. צריך להזמין מראש.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כניסה חינם, הסדנאות בתשלום","tip":"להזמין בטלפון 0829-44-1758 כמה ימים לפני, הסדנאות מתמלאות.","sources":["https://www.miyajima.or.jp/sightseeing/sightseeing02.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"בניין בקומת קרקע ליד המזח. בסדנת האפייה יש תבניות חמות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Miyajima%20Traditional%20Industry%20Hall","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"אופים מומיג'י מנג'ו בתבניות ברזל ביד, או משייפים ומעטרים כף אורז מעץ, ורואים בתצוגה את עבודות העץ של האי.","special":"אופים בעצמכם את העוגייה של האי בתבניות המקוריות.","highlights":["אפיית מומיג'י מנג'ו","גילוף כף אורז"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1165-9 Miyajimacho, Hatsukaichi, Hiroshima","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"required","plan_line":"סדנאות רק בהזמנה, 9:30-16:30. סגור בימי שני","baby_block":null,"tags":["workshop","momiji manju","baking","rice scoop","shamoji","craft","woodwork","סדנה","מומיג'י מנג'ו","אפייה","כף אורז","אומנות","עבודת עץ"],"en":{"hype":"The island's craft centre by the pier, with hand-baking momiji manju and wooden rice scoop workshops.","reality":"A short, cheap, well-run workshop, and you leave with a souvenir you made. Book ahead.","tip":"Book by phone on 0829-44-1758 a few days ahead; sessions fill up.","baby_notes":"Ground-floor building by the pier. The baking class uses hot moulds.","price":"Free entry, workshops paid","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Bake momiji manju by hand in iron moulds, or sand and decorate a wooden rice scoop, and see the island's woodwork on display.","special":"You bake the island's cake yourself in the original moulds.","highlights":["Baking momiji manju","Making a rice scoop"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Workshops by booking only, 9:30-16:30. Closed Mondays","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Chinkasai Fire Festival","name_ja":"鎮火祭","city":"hiroshima","area":"Miyajima","category":"experience","lat":34.2968,"lng":132.3205,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פסטיבל האש של 31 בדצמבר במיאג'ימה: כאלף לפידים בוערים נישאים בעיירה ונאספים בחוף מול המקדש.","reality":"קצר, רועש ומרשים מאוד, והמקומיים באמת חוגגים בו. החוף מתמלא מוקדם.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"לבדוק מראש את שעות המעבורות של ערב השנה החדשה, או לישון על האי.","sources":["https://www.miyajima.or.jp/event/calendar12.php"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"אש, עשן וצפיפות גדולה בחוף, לא מתאים לתינוק.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Itsukushima%20Shrine%20Mikasahama","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מחכים בחוף מיקאסה, רואים את הלפידים הענקיים נישאים בריצה מכל העיירה, ונשארים לטקס מול המקדש.","special":"טקס שינטו נגד שריפות שמסיים את השנה באי.","highlights":["הלפידים הענקיים","הטקס בחוף מול המקדש"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Mikasahama, Miyajimacho, Hatsukaichi, Hiroshima","opens":"18:00","closes":"18:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":["2026-12-31"],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"רק ב־31 בדצמבר מ־18:00, להגיע מוקדם לחוף","baby_block":"אש, עשן וצפיפות, לא עם תינוק","tags":["festival","fire festival","torches","new year's eve","shinto","ritual","event","פסטיבל","פסטיבל אש","לפידים","ערב השנה החדשה","שינטו","טקס","אירוע"],"en":{"hype":"Miyajima's 31 December fire festival: about a thousand burning torches carried through town and gathered on the beach by the shrine.","reality":"Short, loud and very impressive, and locals really celebrate it. The beach fills up early.","tip":"Check the New Year's Eve ferry times ahead, or sleep on the island.","baby_notes":"Fire, smoke and big crowds on the beach, not for a baby.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Wait on Mikasa beach, watch the giant torches rushed in from all over town, and stay for the rite by the shrine.","special":"A Shinto rite against fire that closes the year on the island.","highlights":["Giant torches","Beach rite by the shrine"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"31 December only, from 18:00; get to the beach early","baby_block":"Fire, smoke and crowds, not with a baby"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Senkoji Temple","name_ja":"千光寺","city":"hiroshima","area":"Around Hiroshima","category":"sight","lat":34.411,"lng":133.198,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המקדש על צלע ההר מעל אונומיצ'י, עם סלעים ענקיים ונוף על התעלה והאיים.","reality":"הנוף מהמקדש ומהתצפית בפארק מהיפים בים סטו. הרכבל קצר ונוח, ובירידה ברגל עוברים בסמטאות ובמקדשים הקטנים.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"מקדש חינם, רכבל ¥500 לכיוון, ¥700 הלוך חזור","tip":"עולים ברכבל ויורדים ברגל, הירידה היא החלק הכי יפה.","sources":["https://japanactivity.com/attractions/onomichi/senkoji-park-ropeway","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3477.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"הירידה ברגל כולה מדרגות וסמטאות תלולות, לא לעגלה. למעלה הרכבל מגיע לפארק.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Senkoji%20Temple%20Onomichi","website_url":"https://senkouji.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים ברכבל לפארק סנקוג'י, מסתכלים מהתצפית החינמית, יורדים למקדש האדום על הסלעים וממשיכים במדרגות לעיר.","special":"המקדש תלוי על סלעים מעל העיר, והנוף כולל את הגשרים של שימנאמי.","highlights":["התצפית בפארק","המקדש על הסלעים","רכבל סנקוג'י"],"time_needed":"שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"15-1 Higashitsuchidocho, Onomichi, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"רכבל 9:00-17:15. לעלות ברכבל ולרדת ברגל","baby_block":"הירידה במדרגות תלולות, לא לעגלה","tags":["temple","view","viewpoint","ropeway","onomichi","hillside","inland sea","מקדש","נוף","תצפית","רכבל","אונומיצ'י","ים סטו"],"en":{"hype":"The hillside temple above Onomichi, with giant boulders and a view over the channel and islands.","reality":"The view from the temple and park lookout is one of the best on the Inland Sea. The ropeway is short and easy, and walking down takes you through lanes and small temples.","tip":"Ride up and walk down; the walk down is the best part.","baby_notes":"The walk down is all steps and steep lanes, no stroller. The ropeway reaches the park at the top.","price":"Temple free, ropeway ¥500 one way, ¥700 return","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Ride up to Senkoji Park, take in the free lookout, go down to the red temple on the rocks and carry on down the steps into town.","special":"The temple hangs on boulders above the town, with the Shimanami bridges in view.","highlights":["Park lookout","Temple on the rocks","Senkoji Ropeway"],"time_needed":"1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Ropeway 9:00-17:15. Ride up, walk down","baby_block":"Steep steps on the way down, no stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Onomichi Temple Walk","name_ja":"尾道 古寺めぐり","city":"hiroshima","area":"Around Hiroshima","category":"experience","lat":34.41,"lng":133.2,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מסלול הליכה של 2.5 ק\"מ דרך 25 מקדשים על צלע ההר של אונומיצ'י, כולל סמטת החתולים.","reality":"הליכה יפה בסמטאות צרות עם נוף לים בכל פינה. סמטת החתולים מתוקה, אבל לא תמיד יש בה חתולים.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"לא צריך לעבור בכל 25 המקדשים, לבחור כמה ולשוטט בסמטאות ביניהם.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3477.html","https://www.trvlogue.com/en/senkoji-ropeway-onomichi-guide"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"מדרגות וסמטאות תלולות לכל אורך הדרך, לא לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Onomichi%20Temple%20Walk","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מתחילים ליד התחנה, הולכים מזרחה בין המקדשים, נכנסים לסמטת החתולים, ומשלבים עם הירידה מסנקוג'י.","special":"עשרים וחמישה מקדשים על קילומטרים ספורים, עם נוף לתעלה מכל מקום.","highlights":["סמטת החתולים","מקדשים על הצלע","נוף לתעלה"],"time_needed":"שעה-חצי יום","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Higashitsuchidocho, Onomichi, Hiroshima","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":150,"booking":"no","plan_line":"להתחיל מוקדם, ולשלב עם הירידה ברגל מסנקוג'י","baby_block":"מדרגות וסמטאות תלולות, לא לעגלה","tags":["walk","walking tour","temples","cat alley","cats","lanes","hillside","views","הליכה","מקדשים","סמטת החתולים","חתולים","סמטאות","נוף"],"en":{"hype":"A 2.5 km walk past 25 temples on Onomichi's hillside, including Cat Alley.","reality":"A pretty walk through narrow lanes with a sea view round every corner. Cat Alley is sweet, but there aren't always cats.","tip":"No need to see all 25 temples; pick a few and wander the lanes between them.","baby_notes":"Steps and steep lanes all the way, no stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Start near the station, head east between the temples, go through Cat Alley and tie it in with the walk down from Senkoji.","special":"Twenty-five temples in a few kilometres, with a channel view from everywhere.","highlights":["Cat Alley","Hillside temples","Channel view"],"time_needed":"1 hour to half a day","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Start early and combine with the walk down from Senkoji","baby_block":"Steps and steep lanes, no stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Onomichi City Museum of Art","name_ja":"尾道市立美術館","city":"hiroshima","area":"Around Hiroshima","category":"sight","lat":34.4115,"lng":133.199,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון בפארק סנקוג'י בבניין של טדאו אנדו, עם מרפסת ובית קפה מעל התעלה.","reality":"התערוכות משתנות ולא תמיד מעניינות, אבל הבניין והנוף מהמרפסת שווים עצירה כשכבר נמצאים למעלה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"משתנה לפי התערוכה","tip":"גם בלי כרטיס לתערוכה אפשר לשבת בבית הקפה מול הנוף.","sources":["https://gethiroshima.com/venue/onomichi-city-museum-of-art/","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3477.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"ליד התחנה העליונה של הרכבל, גישה שטוחה בפארק.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Onomichi%20City%20Museum%20of%20Art%20Hiroshima","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בתערוכה, עולים למרפסת בקומה השנייה ויושבים בבית הקפה מול התעלה.","special":"אנדו תכנן את הבניין כך שהנוף הוא חלק מהביקור.","highlights":["המרפסת מעל התעלה","בית הקפה"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"17-19 Nishitsuchidocho, Onomichi, Hiroshima","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני, ליד התחנה העליונה של רכבל סנקוג'י","baby_block":null,"tags":["art museum","museum","tadao ando","architecture","view","cafe","מוזיאון","מוזיאון אמנות","טדאו אנדו","אדריכלות","נוף","בית קפה"],"en":{"hype":"A museum in Senkoji Park in a Tadao Ando building, with a terrace and cafe above the channel.","reality":"Shows change and aren't always interesting, but the building and terrace view are worth a stop when you're up there anyway.","tip":"Even without an exhibition ticket you can sit in the cafe with the view.","baby_notes":"Next to the ropeway's top station, flat access in the park.","price":"Varies by exhibition","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"See the exhibition, go up to the second-floor terrace and sit in the cafe facing the channel.","special":"Ando designed it so the view is part of the visit.","highlights":["Terrace over the channel","Cafe"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays, by the top station of the Senkoji Ropeway","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Onomichi Hondori Shopping Street","name_ja":"尾道本通り商店街","city":"hiroshima","area":"Around Hiroshima","category":"shopping","lat":34.4085,"lng":133.201,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רחוב קניות מקורה של יותר מקילומטר לאורך הנמל של אונומיצ'י, עם חנויות ישנות ובתי קפה.","reality":"אווירה של יפן של פעם, קצת מוזנח ובחלקו סגור, וזה גם הקסם שלו. מתאים לשיטוט ולמזכרות מקומיות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"באזור הרחוב יש את אונומיצ'י אמונייה, חנות מזכרות מקומיות עם מאות סוגים בבית סוחרים ישן.","sources":["https://cdn.gltjp.com/en/directory/item/11374/","https://www.japan.travel/en/sg/jbyj-blog/retro-shopping-experience-onomichi-shotengai/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מקורה ושטוח, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Onomichi%20Hondori%20Shopping%20Street%20Hiroshima","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"