תי ולא עצירה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥510 למבוגר, ילדים עד חטיבת ביניים חינם","tip":"להגיע בבוקר, חלק מהחיות נכנסות פנימה מוקדם אחר הצהריים בחורף.","sources":["https://www.city.hiroshima.lg.jp/living/park-green/1005983/1026356/1018195.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"הרבה עליות ומורדות על הגבעה, עגלה עוברת אבל מתיש. יש שירותים עם החתלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Asa%20Zoological%20Park%20Hiroshima","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין המתחמים במעגל על הגבעה, עוצרים בג'ירפות ובפילים, ואוכלים בפינת המשפחות.","special":"אחד הגנים הראשונים ביפן שבנו מתחמים פתוחים בלי סורגים.","highlights":["ג'ירפות","פילים","קופים"],"time_needed":"חצי יום","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Asa-cho Dobutsuen, Asakita-ku, Hiroshima","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:30","closed_weekdays":[4],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":180,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי חמישי, כניסה אחרונה 16:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["zoo","animals","giraffe","elephant","family","kids","nature","גן חיות","חיות","ג'ירפה","פיל","משפחות","ילדים","טבע"],"en":{"hype":"Hiroshima's zoo on a hill in the north of the city, with giraffes, elephants and monkeys in big enclosures.","reality":"A good, cheap zoo with room for the animals. Far from the centre, about an hour by bus, so it's a family day, not a stop.","tip":"Go in the morning; some animals go indoors early in the afternoon in winter.","baby_notes":"Lots of ups and downs on the hill; a stroller manages but it's tiring. Toilets with changing tables.","price":"¥510 adults, free up to junior high","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Loop around the enclosures on the hill, stop at the giraffes and elephants, and eat in the family area.","special":"One of Japan's first zoos with open enclosures without bars.","highlights":["Giraffes","Elephants","Monkeys"],"time_needed":"Half a day","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Thursdays, last entry 16:00","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Fude no Sato Kobo","name_ja":"筆の里工房","city":"hiroshima","area":"Around Hiroshima","category":"sight","lat":34.363,"lng":132.588,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון המכחולים בקומאנו, העיירה שמייצרת את רוב מכחולי הקליגרפיה והאיפור ביפן.","reality":"מוזיאון קטן ומעניין למי שאוהב אומנות, עם הדגמות של אומנים וחנות גדולה. 45 דקות באוטובוס מהירושימה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כ־¥800 למבוגר, ההתנסות בתשלום נפרד","tip":"יש התנסות בגימור מכחול עם אומן ב־¥3,500, כדאי לברר מראש.","sources":["https://www.hiroshimacvb.jp/en/unique-experience/experience/846.html","https://dive-hiroshima.com/en/explore/162"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fude%20no%20Sato%20Kobo%20Kumano","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"רואים את התצוגות על ייצור מכחולים, צופים באומן עובד, וקונים בחנות מכחולי איפור וקליגרפיה.","special":"רואים אומנים עובדים ביד על מכחולים, ממש במקום שבו מייצרים אותם.","highlights":["הדגמת אומן","חנות המכחולים"],"time_needed":"שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"5-17-1 Nakamizo, Kumano-cho, Aki-gun, Hiroshima","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני. אוטובוס 45 דקות ממרכז האוטובוסים","baby_block":null,"tags":["brushes","makeup brushes","calligraphy","craft","museum","workshop","kumano fude","מכחולים","מכחולי איפור","קליגרפיה","אומנות","מוזיאון","סדנה"],"en":{"hype":"The brush museum in Kumano, the town that makes most of Japan's calligraphy and makeup brushes.","reality":"A small, interesting museum for craft lovers, with artisan demos and a big shop. 45 minutes by bus from Hiroshi