00-1,400 לסועד","tip":null,"sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/ishikawa/A1701/A170101/17013960/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"דלפק בלבד, בלי חדרים.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kanazawa%20Noukou%20Amaebi%20Ramen%20Benibotan%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":"ראמן בציר סמיך של שרימפס מתוק.","dishes":["ראמן אמאבי מיוחד"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher":"hard","kosher_note":"כל הציר עשוי משרימפס.","address":"14-11 Showamachi, Kanazawa","opens":"11:30","closes":"23:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"רק מזומן; טוב לערב אחרי הגעה ברכבת","baby_block":"דלפק בלבד","tags":["ramen","amaebi","sweet shrimp","shrimp ramen","seafood ramen","noodles","station","ראמן","אמאבי","שרימפס","ראמן שרימפס","אטריות","תחנה"],"en":{"hype":"Ramen in a thick broth of amaebi (local sweet shrimp), a few minutes' walk from the station.","reality":"A strong, unusual sea flavour you will not find in Tokyo. Not for anyone who dislikes deep shrimp taste.","tip":null,"baby_notes":"Counter only, no rooms.","price":"¥1,000-1,400 per person","serves":"Ramen in a thick sweet shrimp broth.","dishes":["Special amaebi ramen"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":"The whole broth is shrimp.","plan_line":"Cash only; good for an evening after arriving by train","baby_block":"Counter only"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hachiban Ramen Kanazawa Station","name_ja":"８番らーめん 金沢駅店","city":"kanazawa","area":"Station & Omicho","category":"food","lat":36.5781,"lng":136.648,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רשת הראמן של אישיקאווה, מפורסמת בראמן ירקות עם המון כרוב ונבטים.","reality":"זה צ'יין פשוט ולא גורמה, אבל זה הטעם שכל מקומי גדל עליו. ארוחה זולה ומהירה בתחנה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥800-1,200 לסועד","tip":"הסימן ״8״ על הקערה