ם אוסף תקליטים ומערכת שמע איכותית.","reality":"אווירה מיוחדת לערב שקט עם וויסקי ותקליטים, והקארי טוב. מותר לעשן ואין כניסה מתחת לגיל 20.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":3.43,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,000-5,000 לאדם","tip":"בסופ\"ש פתוח גם בצהריים עם קארי.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/ishikawa/A1701/A170101/17000206/","https://www.magical-trip.com/media/top-10-bars-in-kanazawa-for-2025-where-to-drink-like-a-local/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"מעשנים ואין כניסה מתחת לגיל 20.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jazz%20Spot%20Bokunen%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":"וויסקי, קוקטיילים ויין, עם קארי עוף ופסטה.","dishes":["קארי עוף","וויסקי"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher":"options","kosher_note":"יש קארי עוף; לשאול על השאר.","address":"6-22 Oyamamachi, Oyamacho Zig Bldg 1F, Kanazawa","opens":"17:30","closes":"00:00","closed_weekdays":[2],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"night","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בשלישי; דמי שולחן ¥600 מ-19:00","baby_block":"מגיל 20 בלבד, מעשנים","tags":["bar","drinks","nightlife","בר","משקאות","חיי לילה","jazz","jazz bar","vinyl","records","whisky","curry","oyama shrine","ג'אז","בר ג'אז","תקליטים","וויסקי","קארי"],"en":{"hype":"A jazz bar near Oyama Shrine, in a house behind a tiled gate, with a record collection and a high-end sound system.","reality":"A special feel for a quiet evening of whisky and vinyl, and the curry is good. Smoking allowed, no one under 20.","tip":"On weekends it also opens at lunch with curry.","baby_notes":"Smoking, no entry under 20.","price":"¥1,000-5,000 per person","serves":"Whisky, cocktails and wine, with chicken curry and pasta.","dishes":["Chicken curry","Whisky"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":"There is chicken curry; ask about the rest.","plan_line":"Closed Tuesdays; ¥600 cover from 19:00","baby_block":"Over 20 only, smoky"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Oriental Brewing Higashiyama","name_ja":"オリエンタル ブルーイング 東山店","city":"kanazawa","area":"Higashi Chaya & Kazuemachi","category":"nightlife","lat":36.5733,"lng":136.6655,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פאב הבירה של המבשלה המקומית אוריינטל ברוינג, ליד היגאשי צ'איה, עם 8 ברזים ופיצה נפוליטנית.","reality":"בירה מקומית טובה ומקום נינוח, ופתוח מ-11:00, מה שנדיר. מקבלים ילדים ועגלות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":3.44,"google_score":null,"price":"¥2,000-4,000 לאדם","tip":"יש פלייט טעימות של כמה בירות.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/ishikawa/A1701/A170101/17010381/","https://www.orientalbrewing.com/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מקבלים ילדים ועגלות, ללא עישון בפנים.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Oriental%20Brewing%20Higashiyama%20Kanazawa","website_url":"https://www.orientalbrewing.com/","serves":"בירת קראפט מקומית (8 ברזים) ופיצה נפוליטנית.","dishes":["פלייט טעימות","פיצה נפוליטנית"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher":"options","kosher_note":"יש פיצות צמחוניות; לוותר על אלה עם בשר מעובד.","address":"3-2-22 Higashiyama, Kanazawa","opens":"11:00","closes":"22:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"פתוח כל יום 11:00-22:00 חוץ מה-1 בינואר","baby_block":null,"tags":["bar","drinks","nightlife","בר","משקאות","חיי לילה","craft beer","beer","brewery","pizza","higashi chaya","beer flight","בירה","בירת קראפט","מבשלה","פיצה","היגאשי צ'איה"],"en":{"hype":"The taproom of local brewery Oriental Brewing near Higashi Chaya, with 8 taps and Neapolitan pizza.","reality":"Good local beer and a relaxed room, and it opens at 11:00, which is rare. Kids and strollers welcome.","tip":"There is a tasting flight of several beers.","baby_notes":"Kids and strollers welcome, no smoking inside.","price":"¥2,000-4,000 per person","serves":"Local craft beer (8 taps) and Neapolitan pizza.","dishes":["Tasting flight","Neapolitan pizza"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":"There are vegetarian pizzas; skip the ones with cured meat.","plan_line":"Open daily 11:00-22:00 except 1 January","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Nihonshu Makoto","name_ja":"日本酒真琴","city":"kanazawa","area":"Higashi Chaya & Kazuemachi","category":"nightlife","lat":36.5722,"lng":136.666,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בר סאקה קטן בהיגאשי צ'איה עם אודן ומנות קטנות, שממליץ על סאקה לפי הטעם.","reality":"דרך טובה לטעום סאקה של אישיקאווה בלי ללכת לקטמאצ'י, עם תפריט באנגלית. נסגר מוקדם, ב-19:00.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":3.45,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,000-2,000 לאדם","tip":"לומר לצוות איזה טעם אוהבים, והם בוחרים.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/ishikawa/A1701/A170101/17010802/","https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/feature/detail_490.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מקבלים תינוקות ועגלות, ללא עישון.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nihonshu%20Makoto%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":"סאקה מקומי, אודן ואובנזאי (מנות ביתיות קטנות), וגם צהריים.","dishes":["טעימות סאקה","אודן","אובנזאי"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher":"options","kosher_note":"האודן בציר דגים; לבחור ירקות וביצה.","address":"1-5-3 Higashiyama, Kanazawa","opens":"11:30","closes":"19:00","closed_weekdays":[2],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בשלישי; נסגר ב-19:00 (בשני ב-16:00)","baby_block":null,"tags":["bar","drinks","nightlife","בר","משקאות","חיי לילה","sake","sake bar","sake tasting","oden","higashi chaya","nihonshu","סאקה","בר סאקה","טעימות סאקה","אודן","היגאשי צ'איה"],"en":{"hype":"A small sake bar in Higashi Chaya with oden and small plates, where staff pick sake to your taste.","reality":"A good way to taste Ishikawa sake without going to Katamachi, with an English menu. It closes early, at 19:00.","tip":"Tell the staff what flavours you like and they choose.","baby_notes":"Babies and strollers welcome, non-smoking.","price":"¥1,000-2,000 per person","serves":"Local sake, oden and obanzai (small home-style dishes), and lunch.","dishes":["Sake tasting","Oden","Obanzai"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":"Oden is in fish broth; pick vegetables and egg.","plan_line":"Closed Tuesdays; closes 19:00 (Mondays 16:00)","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kanazawa Jizake Gura","name_ja":"金沢地酒蔵","city":"kanazawa","area":"Station & Omicho","category":"nightlife","lat":36.5781,"lng":136.648,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"דלפק סאקה של שישה מקומות בתוך תחנת קנאזאווה, עם סטים של טעימות סאקה מקומי.","reality":"הדרך הכי מהירה לטעום שלושה סאקה של אישיקאווה לפני רכבת. קטן מאוד וקצר, לא ערב שלם.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":3.48,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,000-2,000 לאדם","tip":"סט האנה של שלושה ג'ונמאי עולה ¥1,000.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/ishikawa/A1701/A170101/17000641/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"דלפק של 6 בלבד.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kanazawa%20Jizake%20Gura%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":"טעימות סאקה מקומי עם נשנושים כמו סבה נו השיקו (מקרל כבוש) וקמאבוקו.","dishes":["סט האנה (3 סאקה)","סבה נו השיקו"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher":"friendly","kosher_note":"בעיקר סאקה; הנשנושים מדגים.","address":"1-1 Kinoshinbomachi, Kanazawa Hyakubangai Anto, Kanazawa","opens":"08:30","closes":"20:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"פתוח 08:30-20:00 בתחנה; 6 מקומות בלבד","baby_block":"דלפק של 6 בלבד","tags":["bar","drinks","nightlife","בר","משקאות","חיי לילה","sake","sake tasting","sake bar","station","nihonshu","local sake","סאקה","טעימות סאקה","בר סאקה","תחנה"],"en":{"hype":"A six-seat sake counter inside Kanazawa Station, with tasting sets of local sake.","reality":"The quickest way to taste three Ishikawa sakes before a train. Very small and short, not a whole evening.","tip":"The Hana set of three junmai is ¥1,000.","baby_notes":"6-seat counter only.","price":"¥1,000-2,000 per person","serves":"Local sake tastings with snacks like saba no heshiko (cured mackerel) and kamaboko.","dishes":["Hana set (3 sakes)","Saba no heshiko"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":"Mostly sake; snacks are fish.","plan_line":"Open 8:30-20:00 in the station; only 6 seats","baby_block":"6-seat counter only"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Higashi Chaya District","name_ja":"ひがし茶屋街","city":"kanazawa","area":"Higashi Chaya & Kazuemachi","category":"sight","lat":36.5726,"lng":136.6663,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רובע הגיישות הישן של קנאזאווה, רחוב של בתי תה מעץ עם סורגים עדינים, והתמונה הכי מזוהה עם העיר.","reality":"יפה באמת, אבל ב-10:00-16:00 הרחוב הראשי מלא קבוצות וחנויות מזכרות. בבוקר מוקדם או אחרי 17:00 הוא שקט ושונה לגמרי.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כניסה חופשית לרחוב","tip":"הסמטאות מצפון לרחוב הראשי שקטות ויפות לא פחות.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4206.html","https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_10212.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"הרחוב שטוח ומרוצף, נוח לעגלה. בתוך בתי התה יש מדרגות תלולות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Higashi%20Chaya%20District%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מטיילים לאורך הרחוב הראשי והסמטאות, נכנסים לבית תה אחד שפתוח לקהל, ועוצרים בחנויות עלי הזהב. אפשר לחצות משם את גשר אסנוגאווה לקאזואמאצ'י.","special":"אחד משלושת רובעי הצ'איה בעיר, והגדול שבהם, עם בתי תה מתחילת המאה ה-19 שחלקם עדיין פעילים בערב.","highlights":["בית התה שימה","קאיקארו","חנויות עלי זהב","הסמטאות הצדדיות"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1 Higashiyama, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"להגיע לפני 9:30 או אחרי 17:00, אז אין המונים","baby_block":null,"tags":["geisha district","teahouse","teahouses","chaya","old town","wooden houses","street","גיישות","גיישה","בית תה","בתי תה","רובע היסטורי","בתי עץ","רחוב עתיק","צ'איה"],"en":{"hype":"Kanazawa's old geisha quarter: a street of wooden teahouses with fine lattices, the city's best-known picture.","reality":"Really pretty, but from 10:00 to 16:00 the main street is packed with groups and souvenir shops. Early morning or after 17:00 it is quiet and feels different.","tip":"The lanes north of the main street are just as pretty and much quieter.","baby_notes":"Flat paved street, easy with a stroller. The teahouses inside have steep stairs.","price":"Free to walk","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the main street and side lanes, go into one teahouse that is open to visitors, and stop at the gold leaf shops. From there you can cross the Asanogawa bridge to Kazuemachi.","special":"The largest of the city's three chaya districts, with early-1800s teahouses, some still working at night.","highlights":["Shima teahouse","Kaikaro","Gold leaf shops","The back lanes"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Go before 9:30 or after 17:00 to miss the crowds","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Shima Teahouse","name_ja":"志摩","city":"kanazawa","area":"Higashi Chaya & Kazuemachi","category":"sight","lat":36.5727,"lng":136.666,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בית תה של גיישות מ-1820 שהפך למוזיאון, נכס תרבות לאומי, שבו רואים איך נראה ערב בצ'איה.","reality":"הבית הכי מקורי שאפשר להיכנס אליו ברובע, קטן ונראה תוך חצי שעה. בצהריים צפוף בחדרים הצרים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥500 למבוגר","tip":"בסוף יש חדר תה עם נוף לגינה, אפשר להזמין מאצ'ה וממתק בתוספת תשלום.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4206.html","https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_10094.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"אין מקום לעגלה, מורידים נעליים ועולים במדרגות תלולות לקומה השנייה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shima%20Teahouse%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מורידים נעליים ועוברים בחדרי האירוח בקומה השנייה, שם הגיישות הופיעו מול האורחים. בקומה הראשונה רואים את המטבח ואת כלי הנגינה והמסרקים של הגיישות.","special":"הבית נשאר כמעט כמו שנבנה ב-1820 ולא שופץ לחנות, כך שרואים את המבנה המקורי של בית תה.","highlights":["חדר האירוח בקומה השנייה","אוסף המסרקים","חדר התה עם הגינה"],"time_needed":"30-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-13-21 Higashiyama, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בדצמבר-פברואר נסגר ב-17:00, כדאי לבוא בבוקר","baby_block":"מדרגות תלולות, בלי עגלה","tags":["teahouse","geisha house","museum","edo","tatami","matcha","בית תה","בית גיישות","מוזיאון","גיישה","טטאמי","מאצ'ה","היסטוריה"],"en":{"hype":"An 1820 geisha teahouse turned museum, a national cultural property, showing what an evening in the chaya looked like.","reality":"The most original house you can enter in the district. It is small and done in half an hour; the narrow rooms get crowded at midday.","tip":"At the end there is a tea room facing the garden where you can order matcha and a sweet for extra.","baby_notes":"No room for a stroller; shoes off and steep stairs to the second floor.","price":"¥500 per adult","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Take your shoes off and walk through the guest rooms upstairs, where geisha performed for guests. Downstairs you see the kitchen and the geisha's instruments and combs.","special":"The house is almost as built in 1820 and was never turned into a shop, so you see a real teahouse layout.","highlights":["Upstairs guest room","Comb collection","Garden tea room"],"time_needed":"30-45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closes at 17:00 from December to February, go in the morning","baby_block":"Steep stairs, no stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kaikaro","name_ja":"懐華樓","city":"kanazawa","area":"Higashi Chaya & Kazuemachi","category":"sight","lat":36.5722,"lng":136.6666,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בית התה הגדול ברובע, שעדיין מארח בערבים, עם מדרגות בלכה אדומה וחדר טטאמי ארוג בזהב.","reality":"מפואר יותר משימה אבל משופץ ומרגיש פחות אותנטי. כדאי לבחור אחד מהשניים, לא שניהם.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥750 למבוגר, תה בתוספת","tip":"סגור בימים לא קבועים, כדאי לבדוק באתר לפני.","sources":["https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_10039.html","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4206.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"מורידים נעליים ויש מדרגות, עגלה נשארת בחוץ.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kaikaro%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בחדרים המשופצים, רואים את גרם המדרגות האדום ואת חדר התה עם הטטאמי המוזהב, ויושבים לתה וממתק ליד האח השקוע.","special":"בית תה שפועל עד היום בערבים, ובשעות היום נפתח לקהל.","highlights":["המדרגות האדומות","טטאמי עם חוטי זהב","תה ליד האח"],"time_needed":"כ-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-14-8 Higashiyama, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":"10:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"ימי סגירה לא קבועים, לבדוק באתר לפני שמגיעים","baby_block":"מדרגות, בלי עגלה","tags":["teahouse","geisha","gold leaf tatami","tea","sweets","lacquer","בית תה","גיישה","טטאמי מוזהב","תה","ממתקים","לכה","זהב"],"en":{"hype":"The district's largest teahouse, still hosting guests at night, with red lacquer stairs and a tatami room woven with gold.","reality":"Grander than Shima but renovated and less authentic. Pick one of the two, not both.","tip":"It closes on irregular days, check the site first.","baby_notes":"Shoes off and stairs; the stroller stays outside.","price":"¥750 per adult, tea extra","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the renovated rooms, see the red staircase and the tea room with gold tatami, and sit for tea and a sweet by the sunken hearth.","special":"A teahouse that still works in the evenings and opens to the public by day.","highlights":["Red staircase","Gold-thread tatami","Tea by the hearth"],"time_needed":"About 45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closes on irregular days, check the site before going","baby_block":"Stairs, no stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kazuemachi Chaya District","name_ja":"主計町茶屋街","city":"kanazawa","area":"Higashi Chaya & Kazuemachi","category":"sight","lat":36.5703,"lng":136.6635,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רובע הצ'איה הקטן והשקט, שורה של בתי תה לאורך נהר אסנוגאווה וסמטאות צרות עם מדרגות.","reality":"אין בו אטרקציות או מוזיאונים, רק הליכה יפה של 20-30 דקות. עיקר הקסם בשעת דמדומים כשנדלקים הפנסים.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"סמטת קוראגארי-זאקה עם המדרגות מחברת לרחוב התחתון.","sources":["https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_52358.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"הטיילת לאורך הנהר שטוחה. בסמטאות אקארי-זאקה וקוראגארי-זאקה יש מדרגות, שם עדיף מנשא.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kazuemachi%20Chaya%20District%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים לאורך הנהר מול בתי התה, עולים בסמטאות הצרות, וחוצים את הגשר לרובע היגאשי צ'איה שבצד השני.","special":"שקט בהרבה מהיגאשי צ'איה, ולפעמים שומעים בערב שמיסן מתוך הבתים.","highlights":["הטיילת לאורך אסנוגאווה","אקארי-זאקה","קוראגארי-זאקה","הפנסים בערב"],"time_needed":"20-40 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Kazuemachi, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לבוא בשקיעה ולחבר להליכה להיגאשי צ'איה","baby_block":null,"tags":["chaya","teahouse","river","riverside","lanterns","alley","geisha","evening walk","צ'איה","בית תה","נהר","טיילת","פנסים","סמטה","גיישות","הליכת ערב"],"en":{"hype":"The small, quiet chaya district: a row of teahouses along the Asanogawa river and narrow stepped lanes.","reality":"No sights or museums, just a lovely 20-30 minute walk. It is at its best at dusk when the lanterns come on.","tip":"The stepped Kuragari-zaka lane links to the lower street.","baby_notes":"The riverside walk is flat. Akari-zaka and Kuragari-zaka have steps, better with a carrier.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk along the river past the teahouses, climb the narrow lanes, and cross the bridge to Higashi Chaya on the other side.","special":"Much quieter than Higashi Chaya; in the evening you sometimes hear shamisen from the houses.","highlights":["Asanogawa riverside","Akari-zaka","Kuragari-zaka","Lanterns at night"],"time_needed":"20-40 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Come at sunset and walk on to Higashi Chaya","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kanazawa Yasue Gold-Leaf Museum","name_ja":"金沢市立安江金箔工芸館","city":"kanazawa","area":"Higashi Chaya & Kazuemachi","category":"sight","lat":36.5716,"lng":136.6639,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון עירוני קטן על עלי הזהב, שבעיר מייצרים כמעט את כל מה שיש ביפן.","reality":"מסביר טוב איך מרקעים זהב לעובי של אלפית מילימטר, ונגמר בשעה. מתאים למי שרוצה להבין לפני הסדנה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥310 למבוגר, עד גיל 18 חינם","tip":"כדאי לבקר לפני סדנת זהב, ככה מבינים מה עושים.","sources":["https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_10062.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"בניין מודרני עם מעלית, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kanazawa%20Yasue%20Gold-Leaf%20Museum%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"רואים את כלי הריקוע ואת שלבי הייצור של עלה הזהב, ואחר כך פריטים מעוטרים בזהב: פרגודים, חרסינת קוטאני, לכה ומזבח בודהיסטי.","special":"מבוסס על האוסף של אומן הזהב קומיי יאסואה, עם הכלים המקוריים שלו.","highlights":["שלבי ריקוע הזהב","פרגודים מוזהבים","מזבח קנאזאווה"],"time_needed":"45 דקות-שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-3-10 Higashiyama, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[2],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":50,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שלישי, כניסה אחרונה 16:30","baby_block":null,"tags":["gold leaf","kinpaku","museum","craft","crafts","gold","artisan","עלי זהב","זהב","מוזיאון","מלאכת יד","אומנות","קינפאקו","ריקוע"],"en":{"hype":"A small city museum on gold leaf; Kanazawa makes almost all of Japan's.","reality":"Explains well how gold is beaten to a ten-thousandth of a millimetre, done in an hour. Good if you want to understand it before a workshop.","tip":"Visit before a gold leaf workshop so you know what you are doing.","baby_notes":"Modern building with a lift, easy with a stroller.","price":"¥310 adult, free under 18","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"See the beating tools and the stages of making gold leaf, then gold-decorated pieces: screens, Kutani porcelain, lacquer and a Buddhist altar.","special":"Built on the collection of gold leaf artisan Komei Yasue, with his own tools.","highlights":["Gold beating stages","Gilded screens","Kanazawa altar"],"time_needed":"45 minutes-1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Tuesdays, last entry 16:30","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Ohi Ware Museum","name_ja":"大樋美術館","city":"kanazawa","area":"Higashi Chaya & Kazuemachi","category":"sight","lat":36.5703,"lng":136.6618,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון של משפחת הקדרים אוהי, שמייצרת כבר 350 שנה קערות תה ביד בלי אובניים.","reality":"קטן ושקט, לחובבי קרמיקה וטקס תה. מי שלא מתחבר לקערות תה ייצא אחרי 20 דקות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥700, או ¥1,500 כולל מאצ'ה בקערת אוהי וממתק","tip":"הכרטיס עם התה שווה, שותים מתוך קערה אמיתית של המשפחה.","sources":["https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_10134.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"חדרים קטנים עם חפצים שבירים, עדיף בלי עגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ohi%20Ware%20Museum%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בשלושה אולמות על ההיסטוריה של כלי אוהי, ואז יושבים בחדר התה לשתות מאצ'ה מקערה של המשפחה. בגלריה הצמודה אפשר לקנות.","special":"הקערות נבנות ביד בלבד, וזיגוג הענבר החום שלהן מזוהה רק עם המשפחה הזאת.","highlights":["מאצ'ה בקערת אוהי","הזיגוג הענברי","הגלריה"],"time_needed":"45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-17 Hashiba-cho, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לקחת את הכרטיס עם התה, ¥1,500","baby_block":null,"tags":["pottery","ceramics","tea bowl","tea ceremony","matcha","museum","ohi","קרמיקה","כלי חרס","קערת תה","טקס תה","מאצ'ה","מוזיאון","קדרות"],"en":{"hype":"Museum of the Ohi potter family, making tea bowls by hand without a wheel for 350 years.","reality":"Small and quiet, for people into ceramics or tea. If tea bowls don't speak to you, you are out in 20 minutes.","tip":"The ticket with tea is worth it: you drink from a real family bowl.","baby_notes":"Small rooms full of breakables, better without a stroller.","price":"¥700, or ¥1,500 with matcha in an Ohi bowl and a sweet","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk three halls on the history of Ohi ware, then sit in the tea room for matcha from a family bowl. The gallery next door sells pieces.","special":"The bowls are shaped by hand only, and the brown amber glaze belongs to this one family.","highlights":["Matcha in an Ohi bowl","Amber glaze","The gallery"],"time_needed":"45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Take the ticket with tea, ¥1,500","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Utatsuyama Park","name_ja":"卯辰山公園","city":"kanazawa","area":"Higashi Chaya & Kazuemachi","category":"sight","lat":36.577,"lng":136.676,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"הגבעה מעל היגאשי צ'איה, עם תצפית על כל העיר ועד ים יפן.","reality":"נוף יפה, אבל צריך רכב או מונית כדי להגיע למעלה. ההליכה מהרובע תלולה וארוכה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"יפה במיוחד בערב, כשהעיר מוארת.","sources":["https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_50020.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Utatsuyama%20Park%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במונית לתצפית בפסגה (141 מטר) ומסתכלים על העיר, לגונת קהוקו והים. אפשר לרדת ברגל דרך רובע המקדשים לכיוון היגאשי צ'איה.","special":"המקום היחיד במרכז העיר שרואים ממנו את קנאזאווה כולה מלמעלה.","highlights":["תצפית בוקודאי","נוף לילה","הירידה ברגל"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Utatsuyama, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לעלות במונית ולרדת ברגל להיגאשי צ'איה","baby_block":"עלייה תלולה, בלי עגלה ברגל","tags":["viewpoint","observation deck","night view","park","hill","sunset","תצפית","נקודת תצפית","נוף לילה","פארק","גבעה","שקיעה","נוף"],"en":{"hype":"The hill above Higashi Chaya, with a view over the whole city to the Sea of Japan.","reality":"Nice view, but you need a car or taxi to the top. Walking up from the district is long and steep.","tip":"Best in the evening with the city lit up.","baby_notes":null,"price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Take a taxi to the summit lookout (141 m) and look over the city, Kahoku lagoon and the sea. You can walk down through the temple area toward Higashi Chaya.","special":"The one place near the centre where you see all of Kanazawa from above.","highlights":["Bokodai lookout","Night view","Walk down"],"time_needed":"1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Taxi up, walk down to Higashi Chaya","baby_block":"Steep climb, no stroller on foot"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Utatsuyama Temple District","name_ja":"卯辰山麓寺院群","city":"kanazawa","area":"Higashi Chaya & Kazuemachi","category":"sight","lat":36.5745,"lng":136.67,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"עשרות מקדשים קטנים על מדרון הגבעה מאחורי היגאשי צ'איה, אזור מוגן של סמטאות ושערי מקדשים.","reality":"רוב המקדשים סגורים מבפנים, וההנאה היא בהליכה השקטה. כמעט אין שם תיירים, דקות מהרחוב הכי צפוף בעיר.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"מתחילים מהקצה הצפוני של היגאשי צ'איה ועולים.","sources":["https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_50020.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Utatsuyama%20Temple%20District%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מטיילים בסמטאות בין שערי המקדשים ובתי הקברות הקטנים, ועולים בהדרגה במעלה הגבעה. אפשר להמשיך לתצפית של אוטאצויאמה.","special":"אזור שימור לאומי של רחובות מקדשים, שקט לגמרי ליד המוקד התיירותי.","highlights":["שערי מקדשים","סמטאות במדרון","השקט"],"time_needed":"30-60 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Higashiyama 1-chome, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לחבר להיגאשי צ'איה, זה ממש מאחוריו","baby_block":"מדרגות ושיפועים, עדיף מנשא","tags":["temples","temple","shrine","quiet walk","hillside","preservation district","מקדשים","מקדש","הליכה שקטה","מדרון","בתי קברות","סמטאות","שימור"],"en":{"hype":"Dozens of small temples on the hillside behind Higashi Chaya, a protected area of lanes and temple gates.","reality":"Most temples are closed inside; the point is the quiet walk. Almost no tourists, minutes from the busiest street in town.","tip":"Start from the north end of Higashi Chaya and walk uphill.","baby_notes":null,"price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Wander the lanes between temple gates and small graveyards, climbing slowly up the hill. You can carry on to the Utatsuyama lookout.","special":"A national preservation area of temple streets, totally quiet next to the tourist core.","highlights":["Temple gates","Hillside lanes","The quiet"],"time_needed":"30-60 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Pair it with Higashi Chaya, it is right behind it","baby_block":"Steps and slopes, carrier is better"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kenrokuen","name_ja":"兼六園","city":"kanazawa","area":"Kenrokuen & Korinbo","category":"sight","lat":36.5622,"lng":136.6626,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אחד משלושת הגנים היפים ביפן, עם בריכות, גשרים ופנס האבן קוטוג'י שמופיע בכל תמונה של העיר.","reality":"שווה את השם. בחורף העצים קשורים בחבלי יוקיצורי בצורת חרוט, וזה יפה במיוחד עם שלג. בצהריים מלא קבוצות.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥320 למבוגר, ¥100 לילדים 6-17","tip":"בנובמבר-פברואר נכנסים חינם מ-6:00 בבוקר, ויוצאים לפני 8:00.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4200.html","https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_10106.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילי חצץ רחבים, עגלה עוברת אבל קשה קצת. יש שירותים עם החתלה ליד הכניסות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kenrokuen%20Kanazawa","website_url":"https://www.pref.ishikawa.jp/siro-niwa/kenrokuen/e/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מסתובבים סביב בריכת קאסומיגאיקה, מצטלמים ליד פנס הקוטוג'י, ועולים לנקודה הגבוהה עם הנוף לעיר. אפשר לעצור לתה בבית התה שיגורה-טיי בתוך הגן.","special":"בחורף רואים את היוקיצורי, חבלים שמחזיקים את ענפי האורנים מפני משקל השלג, מסורת שמתחילה ב-1 בנובמבר.","highlights":["פנס קוטוג'י","בריכת קאסומיגאיקה","יוקיצורי על האורן קאראסאקי","בית התה שיגורה-טיי"],"time_needed":"שעה וחצי-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1 Kenroku-machi, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":"08:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"להגיע בבוקר מוקדם, הכניסה חינם עד 8:00 בחורף","baby_block":null,"tags":["garden","japanese garden","pond","lantern","yukitsuri","pine trees","snow","winter","גן","גן יפני","בריכה","פנס אבן","יוקיצורי","אורנים","שלג","חורף","גשר"],"en":{"hype":"One of Japan's three great gardens, with ponds, bridges and the Kotoji stone lantern in every photo of the city.","reality":"Lives up to the name. In winter the trees are tied with cone-shaped yukitsuri ropes, lovely with snow. Midday is full of groups.","tip":"From November to February entry is free from 6:00; leave before 8:00.","baby_notes":"Wide gravel paths: a stroller gets through but it is a bit hard. Toilets with changing tables near the gates.","price":"¥320 adult, ¥100 ages 6-17","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk around Kasumigaike pond, take the photo at the Kotoji lantern, and go up to the high point with the city view. You can stop for tea at Shigure-tei inside the garden.","special":"In winter you see yukitsuri, ropes holding pine branches against the snow, put up from 1 November.","highlights":["Kotoji lantern","Kasumigaike pond","Yukitsuri on Karasaki pine","Shigure-tei teahouse"],"time_needed":"1.5-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Go early: free entry before 8:00 in winter","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kanazawa Castle Park","name_ja":"金沢城公園","city":"kanazawa","area":"Kenrokuen & Korinbo","category":"sight","lat":36.5652,"lng":136.6592,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פארק הטירה של משפחת מאדה, עם שערים ומחסנים לבנים ששוחזרו בשיטות עץ מסורתיות.","reality":"אין מגדל טירה, וחלק מהאנשים מתאכזבים. מה שיש: חומות אבן ענקיות, מחסן גוג'יקן נאגאיה מבפנים ופארק נעים לטייל בו בחינם.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם, ¥320 לכניסה למגדלי הצפייה","tip":"מחסן גוג'יקן נאגאיה שווה את ¥320, רואים מבפנים את קורות העץ בלי מסמר אחד.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4202.html","https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_10060.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים רחבים ודשאים, נוח לעגלה. בתוך המגדלים יש מדרגות עץ תלולות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kanazawa%20Castle%20Park%20Kanazawa","website_url":"https://www.pref.ishikawa.jp/siro-niwa/kanazawajou/e/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים דרך שער אישיקאווה-מון מכיוון קנרוקואן, חוצים את הדשא הגדול ונכנסים למגדל הישי יאגורה ולמחסן הארוך. משם יורדים לגן גיוקוסנאינמארו.","special":"המבנים ששוחזרו נבנו בשיטות עץ של תקופת אדו, והחומות מראות סגנונות שונים של בניית אבן.","highlights":["שער אישיקאווה-מון","מחסן גוג'יקן נאגאיה","חומות האבן"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-1 Marunouchi, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":"08:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לחבר לקנרוקואן, הם צמודים דרך שער אישיקאווה","baby_block":null,"tags":["castle","samurai","stone walls","gate","park","maeda","turret","טירה","סמוראים","חומות אבן","שער","פארק","מגדל","היסטוריה"],"en":{"hype":"The Maeda clan's castle park, with gates and white storehouses rebuilt using traditional wood joinery.","reality":"There is no keep, and some people are let down. What you get: huge stone walls, the Gojikken Nagaya storehouse inside, and a pleasant free park.","tip":"The Gojikken Nagaya storehouse is worth the ¥320: you see the timber frame inside, no nails.","baby_notes":"Wide paths and lawns, easy with a stroller. Steep wooden stairs inside the turrets.","price":"Free, ¥320 to enter the turrets","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Enter through Ishikawa-mon gate from Kenrokuen, cross the big lawn and go into Hishi Yagura turret and the long storehouse. Then walk down to Gyokusen'inmaru garden.","special":"The rebuilt structures use Edo-period wood techniques, and the walls show different styles of stonework.","highlights":["Ishikawa-mon gate","Gojikken Nagaya storehouse","Stone walls"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Pair with Kenrokuen, joined through Ishikawa gate","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Gyokusen'inmaru Garden","name_ja":"玉泉院丸庭園","city":"kanazawa","area":"Kenrokuen & Korinbo","category":"sight","lat":36.5638,"lng":136.6573,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גן של הטירה מ-1634 ששוחזר ב-2015, עם בריכה מתחת לקירות אבן מדורגים.","reality":"קטן אבל יפה, וחינם. בערבי סוף שבוע יש תאורה, ואז הוא הכי שווה.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"בית התה גיוקוסן-אן מגיש מאצ'ה וממתק עם נוף לבריכה.","sources":["https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_52485.html","https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_10060.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים שטוחים סביב הבריכה, אפשר עם עגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gyokusen%27inmaru%20Garden%20Kanazawa","website_url":"https://www.pref.ishikawa.jp/siro-niwa/kanazawajou/e/gyokusen-in/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מטיילים סביב הבריכה ומסתכלים על קירות האבן המדורגים שמשמשים כמפלים. אפשר לשבת בבית התה גיוקוסן-אן לתה מול הנוף.","special":"קירות האבן בגן בנויים כמו קיר מעוצב ולא כביצור, דבר נדיר ביפן.","highlights":["קירות האבן המדורגים","בית התה גיוקוסן-אן","התאורה בערב"],"time_needed":"30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3 Marunouchi, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":"08:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לבדוק באתר את ערבי התאורה, בדרך כלל בסופי שבוע","baby_block":null,"tags":["garden","japanese garden","pond","light up","illumination","stone walls","tea house","matcha","גן","גן יפני","בריכה","תאורה","הארה","חומות אבן","בית תה","מאצ'ה"],"en":{"hype":"A 1634 castle garden rebuilt in 2015, with a pond under terraced stone walls.","reality":"Small but beautiful, and free. On weekend evenings it is lit up, and that is when it is best.","tip":"Gyokusen-an teahouse serves matcha and a sweet facing the pond.","baby_notes":"Flat paths around the pond, fine with a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk around the pond and look at the terraced stone walls that work as waterfalls. Sit in Gyokusen-an for tea with the view.","special":"The stone walls here are built as a designed backdrop, not as defence, which is rare in Japan.","highlights":["Terraced stone walls","Gyokusen-an teahouse","Evening light-up"],"time_needed":"30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Check the site for light-up nights, usually weekends","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"21st Century Museum of Contemporary Art, Kanazawa","name_ja":"金沢21世紀美術館","city":"kanazawa","area":"Kenrokuen & Korinbo","category":"sight","lat":36.5609,"lng":136.6582,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון עגול מזכוכית, המפורסם בזכות 'הבריכה' של לאנדרו ארליך, שנראים בה אנשים עומדים מתחת למים.","reality":"הבניין והאזור החינמי כיפיים ומתאימים לכולם. התור ל'בריכה' ארוך, ומי שרוצה לרדת אליה צריך כרטיס תערוכה ותור לפי שעה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כניסה חופשית לאזור הציבורי, כרטיס תערוכה משתנה","tip":"מלמעלה, מהאזור החינמי, רואים את הבריכה בלי כרטיס.","sources":["https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_10066.html","https://kanazawa21.jp/data_list.php?d=5&g=7"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שטוח, מעליות, מקום לעגלה ושירותים עם החתלה. מתאים מאוד עם תינוק.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=21st%20Century%20Museum%20of%20Contemporary%20Art%2C%20Kanazawa%20Kanazawa","website_url":"https://www.kanazawa21.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מסתובבים בבניין העגול ובמיצבים החיצוניים בדשא, מסתכלים על הבריכה מלמעלה, ואם יש כרטיס יורדים למטה. בשישי ושבת פתוח עד 20:00.","special":"המבנה של SANAA בלי חזית ראשית, עם כניסות מכל הכיוונים, והרבה מיצבים שאפשר לגעת בהם.","highlights":["הבריכה של ארליך","הבניין העגול","המיצבים בדשא"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-2-1 Hirosaka, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":"10:00","closes":"18:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני, לקנות כרטיס לבריכה בבוקר","baby_block":null,"tags":["museum","contemporary art","modern art","art","swimming pool","installation","architecture","מוזיאון","אמנות","אמנות עכשווית","אמנות מודרנית","בריכה","מיצב","אדריכלות"],"en":{"hype":"A round glass museum, famous for Leandro Erlich's Swimming Pool, where people seem to stand under water.","reality":"The building and the free zone are fun for everyone. The Pool queue is long, and going down into it needs an exhibition ticket and a timed slot.","tip":"From the free zone above you can see the Pool without a ticket.","baby_notes":"Flat, lifts, room for a stroller and toilets with changing tables. Very good with a baby.","price":"Free public zone, exhibition tickets vary","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk around the round building and the outdoor works on the lawn, look at the Pool from above, and go below if you have a ticket. Open until 20:00 on Friday and Saturday.","special":"SANAA's building has no front, with entrances on every side, and many works you can touch.","highlights":["Erlich's Swimming Pool","Round building","Lawn installations"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays; get Pool tickets in the morning","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"D.T. Suzuki Museum","name_ja":"鈴木大拙館","city":"kanazawa","area":"Kenrokuen & Korinbo","category":"sight","lat":36.5579,"lng":136.6618,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון קטן של האדריכל יושיו טניגוצ'י לזכר דייסטסו סוזוקי, שהביא את הזן למערב, עם בריכת מים שקטה.","reality":"אין כמעט מה 'לראות', המקום נועד לשבת מול הבריכה ולהירגע. מי שמחפש תערוכה יתאכזב, מי שצריך שקט יאהב.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥310, עד גיל 18 חינם","tip":"כדאי לחכות כמה דקות, כל כמה זמן נוצרות אדוות בבריכה.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4211.html","https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/spot/detail_10156.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שטוח ואפשר עם עגלה, אבל המקום שקט מאוד ותינוק בוכה יבלוט.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=D.T.%20Suzuki%20Museum%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים במסדרון קצר עם מידע על סוזוקי, ויוצאים לחצר בריכת המים. שם יושבים על הספסל מול המים והקירות ופשוט מסתכלים.","special":"אדריכלות מינימליסטית שכל התוכן שלה הוא השקט, מים, אבן ושמיים.","highlights":["חצר בריכת המים","חדר המחשבה","האדוות"],"time_needed":"30-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-4-20 Honda-machi, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני, 10 דקות הליכה מקנרוקואן","baby_block":null,"tags":["zen","museum","architecture","minimalist","water garden","meditation","quiet","זן","מוזיאון","אדריכלות","מינימליזם","בריכת מים","מדיטציה","שקט"],"en":{"hype":"A small museum by architect Yoshio Taniguchi for D.T. Suzuki, who brought Zen to the West, with a still water pool.","reality":"There is hardly anything to see; it is a place to sit by the water and calm down. If you want an exhibition you will be let down, if you want quiet you will love it.","tip":"Wait a few minutes: every so often ripples spread across the pool.","baby_notes":"Flat and fine with a stroller, but very quiet, so a crying baby stands out.","price":"¥310, free under 18","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk a short corridor about Suzuki and come out to the water courtyard. Sit on the bench facing the water and walls and just look.","special":"Minimal architecture whose whole content is the quiet: water, stone and sky.","highlights":["Water courtyard","Contemplative space","The ripples"],"time_needed":"30-45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays; 10 minutes on foot from Kenrokuen","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Oyama Shrine","name_ja":"尾山神社","city":"kanazawa","area":"Kenrokuen & Korinbo","category":"sight","lat":36.5653,"lng":136.6553,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המקדש של מאדה טושיאיה, מייסד השושלת, עם שער בסגנון מערבי וחלון ויטראז' צבעוני בראשו.","reality":"השער מיוחד באמת והגן מאחור נחמד, אבל מספיקות 20 דקות. פתוח תמיד, וטוב לעצירה בערב כשהשער מואר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"מאחורי המקדש יש גן קטן עם בריכה וגשרים שרוב האנשים מפספסים.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4203.html","https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_50021.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש מדרגות בכניסה הראשית, ומהצד יש כניסה שטוחה מכיוון הטירה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Oyama%20Shrine%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במדרגות לשער ההולנדי, נכנסים לחצר המקדש, ויוצאים לגן מאחור. משם יש מעבר ישיר לפארק הטירה.","special":"השער נבנה ב-1875 בעיצוב של אדריכל הולנדי ושימש פעם כמגדלור, והוא מערבב סגנון יפני, סיני ואירופי.","highlights":["שער ג'ינמון עם הוויטראז'","הגן מאחור","פסל מאדה טושיאיה"],"time_needed":"20-30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"11-1 Oyama-machi, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":25,"booking":"no","plan_line":"פתוח תמיד, יפה בערב כשהשער מואר","baby_block":null,"tags":["shrine","shinto","stained glass","gate","garden","maeda","מקדש","מקדש שינטו","ויטראז'","שער","גן","מאדה","היסטוריה"],"en":{"hype":"The shrine of Maeda Toshiie, founder of the clan, with a Western-style gate topped by a stained glass window.","reality":"The gate really is unusual and the garden behind is nice, but 20 minutes is enough. Always open; a good stop in the evening when the gate is lit.","tip":"Behind the shrine is a small garden with a pond and bridges most people miss.","baby_notes":"Stairs at the main entrance; a flat side entrance from the castle side.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Climb the steps to the Dutch-designed gate, go into the shrine yard, and out to the garden behind. From there you walk straight into the castle park.","special":"The 1875 gate, designed by a Dutch architect, was once a lighthouse and mixes Japanese, Chinese and European styles.","highlights":["Shinmon gate with stained glass","Garden behind","Maeda Toshiie statue"],"time_needed":"20-30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Always open; nice in the evening with the gate lit","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Seisonkaku Villa","name_ja":"成巽閣","city":"kanazawa","area":"Kenrokuen & Korinbo","category":"sight","lat":36.5602,"lng":136.6645,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"וילה שבנה אחד מאדוני מאדה לאמו ב-1863, צמודה לקנרוקואן, עם חדרים בצבעים עזים ותקרות מצוירות.","reality":"פחות מוכר ופחות צפוף מהגן. החדרים בקומה השנייה, בכחול אולטרמרין וסגול, מפתיעים. אסור לצלם בפנים.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥700 למבוגר","tip":"אסור לצלם בפנים, כדאי לדעת מראש.","sources":["https://www.seisonkaku.com/en","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4201.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"מורידים נעליים ויש מדרגות לקומה השנייה, עגלה לא נכנסת.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Seisonkaku%20Villa%20Kanazawa","website_url":"https://www.seisonkaku.com/en","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בחדרי הקומה הראשונה ובמסדרון שפונה לגן, ועולים לחדרים הצבעוניים בקומה השנייה. מסיימים בתערוכה של חפצי משפחת מאדה.","special":"הצבעים בקומה השנייה, כולל אולטרמרין מיובא, נדירים מאוד בבתים יפניים מהתקופה.","highlights":["החדרים הכחולים בקומה השנייה","התקרות המצוירות","המסדרון מול הגן"],"time_needed":"45 דקות-שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-2 Kenroku-machi, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[3],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":50,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי רביעי, כניסה אחרונה 16:30","baby_block":"נעליים בחוץ ומדרגות, בלי עגלה","tags":["villa","samurai house","maeda","palace","painted ceiling","museum","tatami","וילה","ארמון","בית סמוראים","מאדה","תקרה מצוירת","מוזיאון","טטאמי"],"en":{"hype":"A villa a Maeda lord built for his mother in 1863, next to Kenrokuen, with bold coloured rooms and painted ceilings.","reality":"Less known and less crowded than the garden. The upstairs rooms in ultramarine and purple are a surprise. No photos inside.","tip":"No photos inside, good to know before you go.","baby_notes":"Shoes off and stairs to the upper floor; no stroller inside.","price":"¥700 adult","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the ground floor rooms and the corridor facing the garden, then go up to the coloured rooms. End at the display of Maeda family objects.","special":"The upstairs colours, including imported ultramarine, are very rare in Japanese houses of the time.","highlights":["Blue rooms upstairs","Painted ceilings","Garden corridor"],"time_needed":"45 minutes-1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Wednesdays, last entry 16:30","baby_block":"Shoes off and stairs, no stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"National Crafts Museum","name_ja":"国立工芸館","city":"kanazawa","area":"Kenrokuen & Korinbo","category":"sight","lat":36.5588,"lng":136.661,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון המלאכות הלאומי של יפן, שעבר מטוקיו לקנאזאווה, בשני מבני צבא מעץ מתקופת מייג'י.","reality":"אוסף ברמה גבוהה של קרמיקה, לכה, טקסטיל ומתכת. התערוכות מתחלפות, וכדאי לבדוק מה מוצג.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"משתנה לפי תערוכה, בערך ¥1,000","tip":"בין תערוכות המוזיאון סגור לגמרי, לבדוק באתר.","sources":["https://www.momat.go.jp/craft-museum/en/access","https://www.gltjp.com/en/directory/item/12711/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש מעלית ומקום לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=National%20Crafts%20Museum%20Kanazawa","website_url":"https://www.momat.go.jp/craft-museum/en","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בשתי קומות התערוכה, ובחלל הצמוד רואים שחזור של סטודיו של אומן לכה. הבניין עצמו, בצבעי שמנת וירוק, יפה לצילום מבחוץ.","special":"אחד המוזיאונים הלאומיים היחידים ביפן מחוץ לערים הגדולות, בעיר שמזוהה עם מלאכות יד.","highlights":["הבניינים ההיסטוריים","אוסף הלכה והקרמיקה","הסטודיו המשוחזר"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-2 Dewa-machi, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:30","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני ובין תערוכות, לבדוק לפני","baby_block":null,"tags":["museum","crafts","ceramics","lacquer","textiles","art","meiji building","מוזיאון","מלאכות יד","קרמיקה","לכה","טקסטיל","אמנות","מבנה היסטורי"],"en":{"hype":"Japan's national crafts museum, moved from Tokyo to Kanazawa, in two Meiji-era wooden army buildings.","reality":"A top collection of ceramics, lacquer, textiles and metal. Shows rotate, so check what is on.","tip":"It shuts completely between exhibitions, check the site.","baby_notes":"Lift and room for a stroller.","price":"Varies by show, about ¥1,000","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go through the two exhibition floors, and next door see a rebuilt lacquer artist's studio. The cream and green building is nice to photograph from outside.","special":"One of the few national museums in Japan outside the big cities, in a city known for crafts.","highlights":["Historic buildings","Lacquer and ceramics","Rebuilt studio"],"time_needed":"1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays and between shows, check first","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
where not exists (select 1 from place_library p where p.city = x.city and lower(p.name) = lower(x.name));
insert into place_library (name, name_ja, city, area, category, lat, lng, coord_precision, hype, reality, verdict, tabelog_score, google_score, price, tip, sources, audience, baby_notes, local_pick, maps_url, website_url, serves, dishes, todo, special, highlights, time_needed, kosher, kosher_note, address, opens, closes, closed_weekdays, closed_dates, open_dates, best_time, visit_mins, booking, plan_line, baby_block, tags, en, facts_at, facts_sure, active)
select x.name, x.name_ja, x.city, x.area, x.category, x.lat, x.lng, x.coord_precision, x.hype, x.reality, x.verdict, x.tabelog_score, x.google_score, x.price, x.tip, x.sources, x.audience, x.baby_notes, x.local_pick, x.maps_url, x.website_url, x.serves, x.dishes, x.todo, x.special, x.highlights, x.time_needed, x.kosher, x.kosher_note, x.address, x.opens, x.closes, x.closed_weekdays, x.closed_dates, x.open_dates, x.best_time, x.visit_mins, x.booking, x.plan_line, x.baby_block, x.tags, x.en, x.facts_at, x.facts_sure, false from jsonb_populate_recordset(null::place_library, $cards$[{"name":"Ishikawa Prefectural Museum of Traditional Arts and Crafts","name_ja":"石川県立伝統産業工芸館","city":"kanazawa","area":"Kenrokuen & Korinbo","category":"sight","lat":36.5595,"lng":136.665,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון קטן ליד קנרוקואן שמציג את 36 המלאכות המסורתיות של אישיקאווה, מלכת ואג'ימה ועד קאגה יוזן.","reality":"סקירה טובה ומהירה של כל המלאכות במקום אחד, והקומה הראשונה חינם. החנות שלו טובה למזכרות אמיתיות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"קומה ראשונה חינם, קומה שנייה ¥260","tip":"בחורף סגור בכל יום חמישי.","sources":["https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_10009.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מבנה מודרני ונוח לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ishikawa%20Prefectural%20Museum%20of%20Traditional%20Arts%20and%20Crafts%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בתצוגה של המלאכות לפי סוגים: לכה, חרסינה, טקסטיל ועלי זהב, וקונים בחנות כלים שמיוצרים בידי אומנים מקומיים.","special":"המקום היחיד שרואים בו את כל 36 המלאכות של המחוז יחד.","highlights":["לכה ואג'ימה","חרסינת קוטאני","החנות"],"time_needed":"45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-1 Kenroku-machi, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[4],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בדצמבר-מרץ סגור בכל יום חמישי","baby_block":null,"tags":["crafts","museum","lacquer","kutani","yuzen","souvenirs","artisan","מלאכות יד","מוזיאון","לכה","קוטאני","יוזן","מזכרות","אומנים"],"en":{"hype":"A small museum by Kenrokuen showing Ishikawa's 36 traditional crafts, from Wajima lacquer to Kaga Yuzen.","reality":"A good quick overview of all the crafts in one place, and the ground floor is free. Its shop is good for real souvenirs.","tip":"In winter it closes every Thursday.","baby_notes":"Modern building, easy with a stroller.","price":"Ground floor free, upper floor ¥260","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the displays by craft type, lacquer, porcelain, textiles and gold leaf, and shop for pieces made by local artisans.","special":"The one place to see all 36 of the prefecture's crafts together.","highlights":["Wajima lacquer","Kutani porcelain","The shop"],"time_needed":"45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed every Thursday from December to March","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Shiinoki Cultural Complex","name_ja":"しいのき迎賓館","city":"kanazawa","area":"Kenrokuen & Korinbo","category":"sight","lat":36.5628,"lng":136.6559,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בניין המחוז הישן מ-1924 עם חזית אבן וזוג עצי שי ענקיים בני 300 שנה, בין הטירה למוזיאון ה-21.","reality":"אין בו הרבה בפנים, אבל העצים, הדשא מאחור והמעבר בחינם בין האטרקציות שווים עצירה קצרה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"מהדשא שמאחור עולים ישר לגן גיוקוסנאינמארו.","sources":["https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_51999.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"דשא גדול מאחור, טוב להפסקה עם התינוק.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shiinoki%20Cultural%20Complex%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מצטלמים מול עצי השי בחזית, נכנסים לבניין לראות את קירות האבן המקוריים, ויוצאים לדשא הגדול מאחור.","special":"שני העצים, בני 300 שנה, הם אוצר טבע לאומי.","highlights":["עצי השי בחזית","הדשא מאחור","הבניין מ-1924"],"time_needed":"15-30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-1-1 Hirosaka, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":20,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עצירה קצרה בדרך בין הטירה למוזיאון ה-21","baby_block":null,"tags":["historic building","old prefectural office","trees","lawn","park","architecture","מבנה היסטורי","עצים","דשא","פארק","אדריכלות","הפסקה"],"en":{"hype":"The 1924 old prefectural office with a stone front and two 300-year-old chinquapin trees, between the castle and the 21st Century Museum.","reality":"Not much inside, but the trees, the lawn behind and the free shortcut between sights are worth a short stop.","tip":"From the back lawn you walk straight up to Gyokusen'inmaru garden.","baby_notes":"Big lawn out back, good for a break with the baby.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Take a photo of the trees in front, go inside to see the original stone walls, and out to the big lawn behind.","special":"The two 300-year-old trees are a national natural monument.","highlights":["Trees out front","Back lawn","1924 building"],"time_needed":"15-30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Quick stop between the castle and the 21st Century Museum","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Ishiura Shrine","name_ja":"石浦神社","city":"kanazawa","area":"Kenrokuen & Korinbo","category":"sight","lat":36.5612,"lng":136.6598,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המקדש הוותיק בעיר, מול המוזיאון ה-21, עם מנהרה של עשרות שערי טורי אדומים.","reality":"קטן ונראה תוך עשר דקות, אבל מנהרת השערים מצטלמת יפה ופתוחה כל הזמן. טוב לחבר למוזיאון.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"קמע הכלב 'קיבי' של המקדש פופולרי כמזכרת.","sources":["https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_51999.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שטוח ואפשר עם עגלה לאורך מנהרת השערים.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ishiura%20Shrine%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים במנהרת השערים האדומים, מגיעים לאולם המקדש הקטן ומצטלמים. אפשר לקנות קמע.","special":"מקדש שמיוחס לו עבר של מעל 1,500 שנה, באמצע אזור המוזיאונים.","highlights":["מנהרת שערי הטורי","הקמעות"],"time_needed":"10-15 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-1-1 Honda-machi, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":15,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עצירה של עשר דקות ממול למוזיאון ה-21","baby_block":null,"tags":["shrine","torii","torii gates","red gates","shinto","amulet","מקדש","טורי","שערי טורי","שערים אדומים","שינטו","קמע"],"en":{"hype":"The city's oldest shrine, across from the 21st Century Museum, with a tunnel of red torii gates.","reality":"Small and done in ten minutes, but the gate tunnel photographs well and is always open. Pair it with the museum.","tip":"The shrine's dog mascot charm 'Kibi' is a popular souvenir.","baby_notes":"Flat, fine with a stroller through the gate tunnel.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the tunnel of red gates to the small hall, take photos and maybe buy a charm.","special":"A shrine said to go back over 1,500 years, in the middle of the museum area.","highlights":["Torii gate tunnel","Charms"],"time_needed":"10-15 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Ten-minute stop across from the 21st Century Museum","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Gyokusen-en Garden","name_ja":"玉泉園","city":"kanazawa","area":"Kenrokuen & Korinbo","category":"sight","lat":36.5636,"lng":136.6648,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גן פרטי קטן מאמצע המאה ה-17 על מדרון, ליד קנרוקואן, עם בית תה ואורן קוריאני גדול.","reality":"שקט לגמרי לעומת קנרוקואן שליד. אבל בחורף הוא נסגר מ-25 בדצמבר עד סוף פברואר, ובדצמבר הוא פתוח בשעות קצרות.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥700, או ¥1,700 עם מאצ'ה","tip":"טקס תה מלא ב-¥5,000 בהזמנה עד 3 ימים מראש.","sources":["https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_50111.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"שבילים צרים ומדרגות אבן במדרון.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gyokusen-en%20Garden%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים בשבילים הצרים של הגן במדרון, ויושבים לכוס מאצ'ה מול הגן.","special":"גן משפחתי פרטי שנבנה על פני כמה דורות, בלי קבוצות ובלי רעש.","highlights":["אורן קוריאני","בית התה","השקט"],"time_needed":"30-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"8-3 Kosho-machi, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":"10:00","closes":"16:00","closed_weekdays":[3],"closed_dates":["2026-12-25","2026-12-26","2026-12-27","2026-12-28","2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור מ-25 בדצמבר ובימי רביעי, בדצמבר 10:00-16:00","baby_block":"מדרגות אבן במדרון, בלי עגלה","tags":["garden","japanese garden","tea house","matcha","tea ceremony","quiet","pine","גן","גן יפני","בית תה","מאצ'ה","טקס תה","שקט","אורן"],"en":{"hype":"A small private garden from the mid-1600s on a slope by Kenrokuen, with a tea house and a large Korean pine.","reality":"Totally quiet compared with Kenrokuen next door. But it closes from 25 December to the end of February, and in December has short hours.","tip":"A full tea ceremony is ¥5,000, book up to 3 days ahead.","baby_notes":"Narrow paths and stone steps on a slope.","price":"¥700, or ¥1,700 with matcha","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Climb the garden's narrow paths up the slope and sit down for matcha facing the garden.","special":"A private family garden built over several generations, no groups, no noise.","highlights":["Korean pine","Tea house","The quiet"],"time_needed":"30-45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed from 25 Dec and Wednesdays; 10:00-16:00 in December","baby_block":"Stone steps on a slope, no stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Ishikawa Prefectural Library","name_ja":"石川県立図書館","city":"kanazawa","area":"Kenrokuen & Korinbo","category":"sight","lat":36.5525,"lng":136.67,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"הספרייה החדשה של המחוז, בניין עגול שבתוכו אולם קריאה בצורת אמפיתיאטרון שהפך ללהיט ברשתות.","reality":"מרשים באמת וחינם, ויש בו אזור ילדים. רחוק מעט מהמרכז, וסגור מ-21 בדצמבר 2026 ל-25 בינואר לעדכון מערכות.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"לא להגיע אחרי 21 בדצמבר, הספרייה סגורה עד סוף ינואר.","sources":["https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_52183.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מודרני, מעליות ומקום לעגלה, ויש אזור ילדים ייעודי.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ishikawa%20Prefectural%20Library%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים לאולם הקריאה העגול ועולים בקומות כדי לראות אותו מלמעלה, ועוברים בין 500 המקומות לשבת, עם יותר מ-100 סוגי כיסאות.","special":"אולם הקריאה בנוי בטבעות כמו אמפיתיאטרון, והספרים מסודרים ב-12 נושאים במעגל.","highlights":["אולם הקריאה העגול","אזור הילדים","מאה סוגי כיסאות"],"time_needed":"45 דקות-שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-43-1 Kodatsuno, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"18:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-21","2026-12-22","2026-12-23","2026-12-24","2026-12-25","2026-12-26","2026-12-27","2026-12-28","2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":50,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור מ-21 בדצמבר עד 25 בינואר, ובימי שני","baby_block":null,"tags":["library","architecture","modern architecture","reading room","books","kids area","rainy day","ספרייה","אדריכלות","אדריכלות מודרנית","אולם קריאה","ספרים","אזור ילדים","יום גשום"],"en":{"hype":"The prefecture's new library, a round building with an amphitheatre-like reading hall that went viral.","reality":"Truly impressive and free, with a kids' area. A bit out of the centre, and closed from 21 December 2026 to 25 January for a system update.","tip":"Don't go after 21 December: closed until late January.","baby_notes":"Modern, lifts and room for a stroller, plus a children's area.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go into the round reading hall and up the floors to see it from above, and wander among 500 seats in over 100 chair designs.","special":"The reading hall rises in rings like an amphitheatre, with books in 12 themes around the circle.","highlights":["Round reading hall","Kids' area","100 kinds of chairs"],"time_needed":"45 minutes-1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed 21 Dec to 25 Jan, and on Mondays","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Nagamachi Samurai District","name_ja":"長町武家屋敷跡","city":"kanazawa","area":"Nagamachi & Katamachi","category":"sight","lat":36.563,"lng":136.6497,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רובע הסמוראים הישן, סמטאות עם חומות בוץ צהבהבות ותעלות מים, חמש דקות מקורינבו.","reality":"קטן ונעים, נגמר בחצי שעה של הליכה. בחורף החומות מכוסות במחצלות קש נגד שלג, וזה הכי יפה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם לרחובות","tip":"מחצלות הקש (קומוקאקה) על החומות נתלות בתחילת דצמבר.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4204.html","https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_10195.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"סמטאות שטוחות ומרוצפות, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nagamachi%20Samurai%20District%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מטיילים לאורך תעלת אונושו והסמטאות, נכנסים לבית נומורה, ועוצרים בבתי האשיגארו בחינם.","special":"אחד המקומות הבודדים ביפן שבהם רחובות הסמוראים נשארו בתוך מרכז עיר.","highlights":["תעלת אונושו","חומות הבוץ","בית נומורה","מחצלות הקש בחורף"],"time_needed":"45 דקות-שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1 Nagamachi, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לבוא בבוקר, לפני שהקבוצות מגיעות מקורינבו","baby_block":null,"tags":["samurai","samurai district","old town","canal","earthen walls","straw mats","walk","סמוראים","רובע סמוראים","עיר עתיקה","תעלה","חומות","מחצלות קש","הליכה"],"en":{"hype":"The old samurai quarter: lanes of ochre mud walls and water channels, five minutes from Korinbo.","reality":"Small and pleasant, done in a half-hour walk. In winter the walls are covered in straw mats against snow, and that is when it looks best.","tip":"The straw mats (komokake) go up on the walls in early December.","baby_notes":"Flat paved lanes, easy with a stroller.","price":"Free streets","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk along the Onosho canal and the lanes, go into the Nomura house, and stop at the free Ashigaru houses.","special":"One of the few places in Japan where samurai streets survive inside a city centre.","highlights":["Onosho canal","Mud walls","Nomura house","Winter straw mats"],"time_needed":"45 minutes-1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Come in the morning, before the groups from Korinbo","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Nomura Samurai Family Residence","name_ja":"武家屋敷跡 野村家","city":"kanazawa","area":"Nagamachi & Katamachi","category":"sight","lat":36.5627,"lng":136.6489,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בית סמוראים משוחזר עם גן קטן ומפורסם, מפל, בריכת קוי ומרפסת שמשקיפה עליו.","reality":"הגן יפהפה אבל קטן מאוד, ובצהריים המרפסת עמוסה. בקומה העליונה יש חדר תה עם מאצ'ה בתוספת.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥550 למבוגר","tip":"מאצ'ה בחדר התה למעלה, עם נוף לגן מגבוה.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4204.html","https://www.ishikawatravel.jp/spots/nomura-residence/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"מורידים נעליים, אין מקום לעגלה, ויש מדרגות תלולות לחדר התה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nomura%20Samurai%20Family%20Residence%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בחדרי הבית עם הציורים על דלתות ההזזה, יושבים על המרפסת מול הגן עם בריכת הקוי, ועולים לחדר התה.","special":"הגן הקטן הזה נכלל בדירוגים של הגנים היפים ביפן, ונבנה בשטח של חצר עירונית.","highlights":["הגן עם בריכת הקוי","דלתות ההזזה המצוירות","חדר התה למעלה"],"time_needed":"45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-3-32 Nagamachi, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":"08:30","closes":"16:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-26","2026-12-27"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"להגיע בפתיחה ב-8:30, לפני שהמרפסת מתמלאת","baby_block":"נעליים בחוץ, בלי עגלה","tags":["samurai house","samurai","garden","koi","pond","tea room","matcha","בית סמוראים","סמוראים","גן","קוי","בריכה","חדר תה","מאצ'ה"],"en":{"hype":"A restored samurai house with a small famous garden: waterfall, koi pond and a veranda facing it.","reality":"The garden is beautiful but very small, and the veranda is packed at midday. Upstairs there is a tea room with matcha for extra.","tip":"Matcha in the upstairs tea room, with a view down on the garden.","baby_notes":"Shoes off, no room for a stroller, steep stairs to the tea room.","price":"¥550 adult","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the rooms with painted sliding doors, sit on the veranda facing the koi pond garden, and climb to the tea room.","special":"This tiny garden makes lists of Japan's best gardens, built in the space of a town courtyard.","highlights":["Koi pond garden","Painted sliding doors","Tea room upstairs"],"time_needed":"45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Arrive at 8:30 opening, before the veranda fills","baby_block":"Shoes off, no stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Ashigaru Museum","name_ja":"金沢市足軽資料館","city":"kanazawa","area":"Nagamachi & Katamachi","category":"sight","lat":36.5636,"lng":136.6487,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שני בתים משוחזרים של אשיגארו, חיילי רגל בדרג הנמוך של הסמוראים, בחינם.","reality":"פשוט וקטן, והניגוד לבית נומורה העשיר מעניין. עשר דקות מספיקות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"לבקר אחרי נומורה כדי לראות את ההבדל בין עשיר לעני.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4204.html","https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_10056.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מורידים נעליים בכניסה לבתים.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ashigaru%20Museum%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים לשני הבתים, רואים את החדרים הצנועים, המטבח והגינה הקטנה, ומשווים לבתי הסמוראים הגבוהים ברובע.","special":"מראה איך חיו הסמוראים הפשוטים, דבר שכמעט לא נשמר ביפן.","highlights":["שני הבתים","המטבח","הגינות הקטנות"],"time_needed":"15 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-9-3 Nagamachi, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":15,"booking":"no","plan_line":"חינם וקצר, לחבר לבית נומורה","baby_block":null,"tags":["samurai","foot soldier","ashigaru","museum","free","old house","סמוראים","חיילי רגל","אשיגארו","מוזיאון","חינם","בית ישן"],"en":{"hype":"Two restored houses of ashigaru, the lowest-rank foot soldiers, free.","reality":"Simple and small, and the contrast with the rich Nomura house is interesting. Ten minutes is enough.","tip":"Visit after Nomura to see rich next to poor.","baby_notes":"Shoes off at the door of each house.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go into both houses, see the modest rooms, the kitchen and the little garden, and compare with the grander samurai homes.","special":"Shows how ordinary samurai lived, something rarely kept in Japan.","highlights":["The two houses","The kitchen","Small gardens"],"time_needed":"15 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Free and quick, pair with the Nomura house","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kanazawa Shinise Memorial Hall","name_ja":"金沢市老舗記念館","city":"kanazawa","area":"Nagamachi & Katamachi","category":"sight","lat":36.5612,"lng":136.6511,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בית מרקחת מסורתי מתקופת אדו ששוחזר כמוזיאון, של משפחת נאקאיה הוותיקה.","reality":"קטן ונחמד, רק ¥100. החנות הישנה בקומה הראשונה היא העיקר, והשאר תצוגות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥100","tip":"החנות של נאקאיה שעדיין פעילה נמצאת בקאטאמאצ'י, לא רחוק.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4204.html","https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/shops/detail_20035.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"מורידים נעליים ויש מדרגות.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kanazawa%20Shinise%20Memorial%20Hall%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים לחנות התרופות המקורית עם המגירות והמשקלות, ועולים לתצוגה על החנויות הוותיקות של העיר וקישוטי החתונה של קנאזאווה.","special":"הבניין היה החנות של משפחת נאקאיה, שמוכרת תרופות בעיר מאז 1579.","highlights":["חנות התרופות","קישוטי הנישואין","הגינה הקטנה"],"time_needed":"20-30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-2-45 Nagamachi, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":25,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני, רק ¥100","baby_block":null,"tags":["pharmacy","apothecary","museum","edo","old shop","merchant house","בית מרקחת","תרופות","מוזיאון","אדו","חנות ישנה","בית סוחרים"],"en":{"hype":"An Edo-period traditional pharmacy restored as a museum, from the old Nakaya family.","reality":"Small and nice, only ¥100. The old shop on the ground floor is the main thing; the rest is displays.","tip":"Nakaya's still-working shop is in Katamachi, not far away.","baby_notes":"Shoes off and stairs.","price":"¥100","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Step into the original medicine shop with its drawers and scales, then go up to displays on the city's old shops and Kanazawa wedding decorations.","special":"The building was the Nakaya family shop; they have sold medicine in the city since 1579.","highlights":["The medicine shop","Wedding decorations","Small garden"],"time_needed":"20-30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays, only ¥100","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Myoryuji (Ninja Temple)","name_ja":"妙立寺","city":"kanazawa","area":"Nagamachi & Katamachi","category":"sight","lat":36.5539,"lng":136.6524,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"'מקדש הנינג'ה', מקדש של משפחת מאדה עם דלתות סתר, מדרגות נסתרות ומלכודות, בסיור מודרך.","reality":"אין קשר לנינג'ות, אבל המבנה מלא תחבולות הגנה באמת. הסיור ביפנית עם דף באנגלית, וחייבים להזמין בטלפון.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"בערך ¥1,000-1,200 למבוגר","tip":"מזמינים בטלפון 076-241-0888, אפשר עד חודש מראש.","sources":["https://japan-guide.com/e/e4205.html","https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/spot/detail_50022.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"מדרגות תלולות וצרות לאורך כל הסיור.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Myoryuji%20%28Ninja%20Temple%29%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מצטרפים לסיור של 40 דקות, עולים ויורדים במדרגות נסתרות, רואים פתחי מלכודת ומעברים סודיים ב-23 חדרים בכמה קומות.","special":"המקדש נבנה כמבצר נסתר, כי חוקי השוגון הגבילו את גובה הבניינים, ולכן הקומות מוסתרות.","highlights":["המדרגות הנסתרות","פתחי המלכודת","בור המים"],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-2-12 Nomachi, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"required","plan_line":"חובה להזמין בטלפון, הסיורים מתמלאים","baby_block":"מדרגות תלולות וצרות, לא מתאים","tags":["ninja","temple","trap doors","hidden stairs","secret passages","guided tour","נינג'ה","נינג'ות","מקדש","דלתות סתר","מדרגות נסתרות","מעברים סודיים","סיור מודרך"],"en":{"hype":"The 'Ninja Temple', a Maeda family temple with hidden doors, secret stairs and traps, on a guided tour.","reality":"Nothing to do with ninjas, but the building really is full of defensive tricks. The tour is in Japanese with an English sheet, and you must book by phone.","tip":"Book by phone on 076-241-0888, up to a month ahead.","baby_notes":"Steep, narrow stairs through the whole tour.","price":"About ¥1,000-1,200 adult","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Join the 40-minute tour, going up and down hidden stairs, seeing trap doors and secret passages across 23 rooms on several levels.","special":"Built as a hidden fortress because shogunate rules capped building heights, so the floors are concealed.","highlights":["Hidden stairs","Trap doors","The well"],"time_needed":"About 1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Phone booking required, tours fill up","baby_block":"Steep narrow stairs, not suitable"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Nishi Chaya District","name_ja":"にし茶屋街","city":"kanazawa","area":"Nagamachi & Katamachi","category":"sight","lat":36.5548,"lng":136.6502,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רובע הגיישות השלישי של העיר, רחוב קצר של בתי תה ליד מקדש הנינג'ה.","reality":"קצר מאוד, מאה מטר, אבל שקט ובלי ההמונים של היגאשי. כדאי לחבר לביקור במקדש הנינג'ה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"המוזיאון הקטן בקצה הדרומי חינם ומראה חדר תה לדוגמה.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4212.html","https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/attractions/detail_10199.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"רחוב שטוח, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nishi%20Chaya%20District%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים לאורך הרחוב, נכנסים למוזיאון נישי צ'איה בחינם, ועוצרים בחנות ממתקים מסורתית.","special":"עדיין גרות ועובדות בו גיישות, ובערב שומעים לפעמים נגינה.","highlights":["מוזיאון נישי צ'איה","בתי התה","השקט"],"time_needed":"20-30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2 Nomachi, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":25,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לחבר למקדש הנינג'ה, חמש דקות הליכה","baby_block":null,"tags":["geisha district","chaya","teahouse","old street","quiet","free museum","רובע גיישות","צ'איה","בית תה","רחוב עתיק","שקט","מוזיאון חינם","גיישות"],"en":{"hype":"The city's third geisha quarter, a short street of teahouses near the Ninja Temple.","reality":"Very short, about 100 m, but quiet and free of the Higashi crowds. Combine with the Ninja Temple.","tip":"The small museum at the south end is free and shows a model tea room.","baby_notes":"Flat street, easy with a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the street, go into the free Nishi Chaya museum, and stop at a traditional sweets shop.","special":"Geisha still live and work here, and in the evening you sometimes hear music.","highlights":["Nishi Chaya museum","Teahouses","The quiet"],"time_needed":"20-30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Pair with the Ninja Temple, five minutes away","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kanazawa Museum of Architecture (Taniguchi)","name_ja":"谷口吉郎・吉生記念 金沢建築館","city":"kanazawa","area":"Nagamachi & Katamachi","category":"sight","lat":36.556,"lng":136.6492,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון אדריכלות של האב והבן טניגוצ'י (הבן תכנן את MoMA החדש), עם שחזור של חדר האירוח מארמון סנטו.","reality":"לחובבי אדריכלות זה מקום מיוחד, השחזור של יושינטיי יפהפה. לאחרים זה מוזיאון קטן ושקט שאפשר לדלג.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_s