alk under the glass dome and take a photo in front of the wooden gate.","special":"The pillars take the shape of Noh theatre drums, an art tied to the city.","highlights":["Tsuzumi gate","Motenashi dome","Evening lights"],"time_needed":"10 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"On your way from the station, East Exit","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Natadera Temple","name_ja":"那谷寺","city":"kanazawa","area":"Around Kanazawa","category":"sight","lat":36.334,"lng":136.444,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש בן 1,300 שנה בין צוקי אבן, עם אולם על צלע הצוק, פגודה ושבילים ביער, ליד קאגה אונסן.","reality":"אחד המקדשים היפים באזור, ובסתיו מדהים. בחורף שקט מאוד. בלי רכב צריך לתכנן את אוטובוס CAN BUS.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"בערך ¥600-1,000 למבוגר","tip":"כרטיס CAN BUS יומי ב-¥1,000 בתחנת קאגה אונסן.","sources":["https://japan-guide.com/e/e4281.html","https://www.westjr.co.jp/global/en/ticket/hokuriku-arch-pass/Explore_Japan/spot/ishikawa/natadera-temple/index.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"הרבה מדרגות אבן, עדיף מנשא.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Natadera%20Temple","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במדרגות לאולם הבנוי על הצוק, עוברים במערה הקטנה, ומטיילים בשבילים בין הסלעים, הפגודה ובריכת הלוטוס.","special":"צוקי האבן הלבנים עם המקדש עליהם נראים כמו ציור סיני.","highlights":["צוק קיסקיזאן","האולם על הצוק","הפגודה בת שלוש הקומות"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Yu-122 Nata-machi, Komatsu, Ishikawa","opens":"08:45","closes":"16:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לבדוק שעות CAN BUS, הוא יוצא רק פעם בשעתיים","baby_block":"הרבה מדרגות אבן, עדיף מנשא","tags":["temple","buddhist temple","rocks","cliff","pagoda","autumn leaves","day trip","kaga onsen","מקדש","מקדש בודהיסטי","סלעים","צוק","פגודה","שלכת","טיול יום","קאגה אונסן"],"en":{"hype":"A 1,300-year-old temple among rock cliffs, with a hall on the cliff face, a pagoda and forest paths near Kaga Onsen.","reality":"One of the area's prettiest temples, stunning in autumn and very quiet in winter. Without a car you have to plan around the CAN BUS.","tip":"CAN BUS day pass is ¥1,000 at Kaga Onsen station.","baby_notes":"Lots of stone steps, a carrier is better.","price":"About ¥600-1,000 adult","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Climb to the hall built into the cliff, pass through the small cave, and walk the paths between rocks, the pagoda and the lotus pond.","special":"The white rock cliffs with the temple on them look like a Chinese painting.","highlights":["Kiseki-zan rock","Cliff hall","Three-storey pagoda"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Check CAN BUS times, it runs only every two hours","baby_block":"Lots of stone steps, carrier is better"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kakusenkei Gorge","name_ja":"鶴仙渓","city":"kanazawa","area":"Around Kanazawa","category":"sight","lat":36.2475,"lng":136.3755,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שביל לאורך נהר בתוך עיירת המעיינות יאמאנאקה אונסן, בין גשר העץ קורוגי לגשר אָיָאטוֹרי המתפתל.","reality":"הליכה נעימה של רבע שעה עד חצי שעה, בעיקר בסתיו. בחורף חלק מהשביל בוצי או סגור, ובשנת 2026 יש אזהרות דובים באזור.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"לבדוק אזהרות דובים מקומיות לפני ההליכה.","sources":["https://www.ishikawatravel.jp/en/spots/kakusenkei-gorge/","https://visitkaga.jp/attractions/kakusenkei-gorge?num=1"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"שביל צר עם מדרגות, לא לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kakusenkei%20Gorge","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מתחילים בגשר העץ קורוגי-באשי, הולכים 1.3 ק\"מ לאורך הנהר דרך גשר איאטורי עד גשר קורוטאני, וחוזרים דרך העיירה.","special":"גשר איאטורי-האשי