n or brass accessory.","baby_notes":null,"price":"Tin bowls from a few thousand yen","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Try bending the tin bowls, buy tableware or brass wind chimes, and sit for a sweet in the tea room served on tinware.","special":"100% tin that bends by hand, so one bowl becomes a plate or a basket.","highlights":["Bendable tin bowls","Brass wind chimes","Tea room"],"time_needed":"20-40 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed on the 1st and 3rd Tuesday of the month","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kanazawa Hyakubangai","name_ja":"金沢百番街","city":"kanazawa","area":"Station & Omicho","category":"shopping","lat":36.5779,"lng":136.6478,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מתחם החנויות בתוך תחנת קנאזאווה, עם אגף אנטו שמרכז את כל המזכרות המקומיות במקום אחד.","reality":"הכי נוח לקנות מזכרות ברגע האחרון לפני הרכבת: ממתקים, סאקה ומלאכות. המחירים כמו בחנויות בעיר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"משתנה","tip":"אנטו למזכרות ואוכל, רינטו לאופנה, אנטו נישי לסופרמרקט.","sources":["https://visitkanazawa.jp/en/shops/detail_50066.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מקורה ושטוח, מעליות ושירותים עם החתלה בתחנה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kanazawa%20Hyakubangai%20Kanazawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים באנטו בין דוכני הממתקים הוותיקים, הסאקה המקומי ומוצרי עלי הזהב, וקונים בדרך לרכבת.","special":null,"highlights":["אגף אנטו","ממתקים מקומיים","סאקה של אישיקאווה"],"time_needed":"30-60 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-1 Kinoshinbo-machi, Kanazawa, Ishikawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"להשאיר את המזכרות לסוף, כאן קונים לפני הרכבת","baby_block":null,"tags":["souvenirs","station shopping","sweets","sake","gifts","mall","last minute","מזכרות","קניות בתחנה","ממתקים","סאקה","מתנות