riendly","kosher_note":"הסטים מבוססים על בקר; יש גם סטים עם פירות ים, אז בוחרים את הבקר.","address":"1-8-2 Kitanagasadori, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":"11:00","closes":"21:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":70,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"סט הצהריים הכי משתלם, כדאי להגיע לפני 11:30","baby_block":null,"tags":["kobe beef","steak","teppanyaki","wagyu","beef","budget steak","lunch set","קובה ביף","סטייק","טפניאקי","וואגיו","בקר","סטייק זול","סט צהריים"],"en":{"hype":"The cheapest way to eat Kobe beef in town: teppanyaki on the grill right by Sannomiya Station.","reality":"Not the finest cut and it runs like a conveyor belt, but for tasting Kobe beef without breaking the bank it does the job.","tip":"The Kobe beef lunch set is the best deal; dinner prices jump.","baby_notes":"Kids are welcome and it is non-smoking.","price":"¥2,000-8,000 per person, cheapest at lunch","serves":"Kobe beef and wagyu steak sets on the teppan grill, with salad, grilled vegetables, rice and soup.","dishes":["Kobe beef lunch set","Sirloin steak","Grilled vegetables"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"About 1 hour","kosher_note":"Sets are beef-based; some include seafood, so pick the beef ones.","plan_line":"Lunch set is the best value, come before 11:30","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kobe Beef Steak Ishida Honten","name_ja":"神戸牛ステーキ Ishida. 本店","city":"kobe","area":"Sannomiya & Motomachi","category":"food","lat":34.695,"lng":135.193,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"טפניאקי קובה ביף מוכר מאוד ליד סנומיה, השף צולה מולכם על הדלפק.","reality":"מקצועי ומדויק, אבל יקר והמקומות להזמנה אונליין מוגבלים, אז בלי הזמנה מראש כנראה לא ייכנסו.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":3.6,"google_score":null,"price":"צהריים ¥6,000-8,000, ערב ¥10,000-15,000 לסועד","tip":"מאחרים יותר מעשר דקות? ההזמנה עלולה להתבטל. יש סניף אחות שלוש דקות הליכה (Ikuta Shindo).","sources":["https://tabelog.