מה סניפים בסנומיה.","reality":"קלאסי ואמין, אבל יקר ותיירותי למדי; משלמים גם על השם.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":3.55,"google_score":null,"price":"¥10,000-20,000 לסועד","tip":"34 מקומות, כולם בדלפק מול הפלנצ'ה; בצהריים (עד 15:00) המחיר נמוך יותר.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/hyogo/A2801/A280101/28002262/","https://savorjapan.com/contents/discover-oishii-japan/5-recommended-kobe-steak-restaurants-in-sannomiya-with-counter-seating"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מקבלים ילדים, אבל כל המקומות בדלפק גבוה ליד פלנצ'ה חמה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kobe%20Steak%20Restaurant%20Mouriya%20Sannomiya%20Kobe","website_url":"https://www.mouriya.co.jp/sannomiya","serves":"טפניאקי של קובה ביף, פילה וסינטה, בסטים עם ירקות ואורז.","dishes":["פילה קובה ביף","סט טפניאקי","סינטה קובה ביף"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"שעה וחצי","kosher":"friendly","kosher_note":"הסטים בנויים על בקר.","address":"1-9-9 Kitanagasadori, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":"11:00","closes":"22:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":90,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"להזמין אונליין, הטלפון לא עונה; בצהריים זול יותר","baby_block":null,"tags":["kobe beef","steak","teppanyaki","fillet","sirloin","counter","historic","קובה ביף","סטייק","טפניאקי","פילה","סינטה","דלפק","ותיק"],"en":{"hype":"A very old Kobe beef name with roots in the 1800s and several branches around Sannomiya.","reality":"Classic and reliable, but pricey and fairly touristy; part of the bill is the name.","tip":"34 seats, all at the teppan counter; lunch (until 15:00) costs less.","baby_notes":"Kids welcome, but every seat is at a high counter by a hot grill.","price":"¥10,000-20,000 per person","serves":"Kobe beef teppanyaki, fillet and sirloin, in sets with vegetables and rice.","dishes":["Kobe beef fillet","Teppanyaki set","Kobe beef sirloin"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":