%20Kobe","website_url":null,"serves":"נגיאקי, פנקייק דק עם הרבה בצל ירוק, ואוקונומיאקי על הפלנצ'ה.","dishes":["נגיאקי","אוקונומיאקי"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":"options","kosher_note":"לבקש נגיאקי עם בקר; הגרסאות הרגילות לפעמים עם חזיר או דיונון.","address":"1-5-5 Kitanagasadori, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":"17:00","closes":"24:00","closed_weekdays":[0],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":60,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"רק בערב, מזומן בלבד; להזמין אונליין","baby_block":"מותר לעשן בפנים","tags":["negiyaki","okonomiyaki","green onion","teppan","izakaya","late night","נגיאקי","אוקונומיאקי","בצל ירוק","פלנצ'ה","איזקאיה","ערב"],"en":{"hype":"Evening negiyaki and okonomiyaki, a minute from Hankyu Sannomiya.","reality":"A small local place open until midnight; smoking and no cards.","tip":"Negiyaki (green onion pancake), about ¥880, is the thing to order.","baby_notes":null,"price":"¥3,000-4,000 per person","serves":"Negiyaki, a thin pancake loaded with green onion, and okonomiyaki on the griddle.","dishes":["Negiyaki","Okonomiyaki"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"1 hour","kosher_note":"Ask for negiyaki with beef; standard versions sometimes have pork or squid.","plan_line":"Evenings only, cash only; book online","baby_block":"Smoking allowed inside"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Bokkake no Taku","name_ja":"ぼっかけの拓","city":"kobe","area":"Sannomiya & Motomachi","category":"food","lat":34.6922,"lng":135.1924,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בוקאקה, גיד בקר מבושל של קובה, על אוקונומיאקי, יאקיסובה וביצת עין.","reality":"דרך טובה לטעום את המנה הכי מקומית של קובה, במרתף סנטר פלאזה, בלי עישון.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":3.49,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,000-3,000 לסועד","tip":"מנת גיד הבקר עם ביצת עין היא המנה של הבית.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/hyogo/A2801/A280101/28050210/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick"