0 per adult, drinks extra","serves":"House drinks, sweets and light snacks.","dishes":[],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"About 1 hour","kosher_note":"Drinks and desserts.","plan_line":"Book a timed ticket and come after sunset","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Ikuta Shrine","name_ja":"生田神社","city":"kobe","area":"Sannomiya & Motomachi","category":"sight","lat":34.6951,"lng":135.1906,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אחד המקדשים השינטו העתיקים ביפן, ממש באמצע סנומיה, ושם קובה בא ממנו.","reality":"מקדש יפה ומטופח אבל לא ענק, עוברים אותו ברבע שעה. שווה כי הוא בדרך בין התחנה לקיטאנו.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כניסה חינם","tip":"מאחורי המבנה הראשי יש חורשת עצים קטנה ושקטה (איקוטה נו מורי) שרוב התיירים מפספסים.","sources":["https://www.ikutajinja.or.jp/","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3550.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילי חצץ בחצר, עגלה עוברת אבל בקושי.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ikuta%20Shrine%20Kobe","website_url":"https://www.ikutajinja.or.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים דרך שער הטוריאי האדום, עוברים לבניין הראשי ומשם ממשיכים לחורשה שמאחור. אפשר לקנות קמיע או פתק מזל.","special":"המקדש עומד באותו מקום כבר יותר מ-1,800 שנה ונבנה מחדש אחרי מלחמה, שריפות ורעידת האדמה של 1995.","highlights":["שער הטוריאי האדום","חורשת איקוטה נו מורי","פתקי מזל"],"time_needed":"20-30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-2-1 Shimoyamatedori, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":25,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לשלב בהליכה מסנומיה לקיטאנו, 5 דקות מהתחנה","baby_block":null,"tags":["shrine","shinto","torii","temple","forest","מקדש","שינטו","טוריאי","מקדשים","חורשה","sannomiya","omikuji","פתקי מזל","history","היסטוריה"],"en":{"hype":"One of Japan's oldest Shinto shrines, right in the middle of Sannomiya; Kobe takes its name from it.","reality":"Pretty and well kept but not huge, you're done in 15 minutes. Worth it because it sits on the way from the station to Kitano.","tip":"Behind the main hall there's a small quiet grove (Ikuta no Mori) most tourists miss.","baby_notes":"Gravel paths in the courtyard; a stroller gets through, barely.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk in through the red torii, visit the main hall, then the grove behind it. You can buy a charm or a fortune slip.","special":"It has stood here for over 1,800 years and was rebuilt after war, fires and the 1995 earthquake.","highlights":["Red torii gate","Ikuta no Mori grove","Fortune slips"],"time_needed":"20-30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Combine with the walk from Sannomiya up to Kitano, 5 min from station","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Nankinmachi","name_ja":"南京町","city":"kobe","area":"Sannomiya & Motomachi","category":"sight","lat":34.688,"lng":135.1878,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"צ׳יינה טאון של קובה, שני רחובות של דוכני אוכל רחוב, באוזי ומקדש סיני קטן.","reality":"קטן וצפוף, עוברים אותו ב-20 דקות. האוכל ברובו מותאם לטעם יפני ותיירותי, אבל זה כיף לנשנש תוך כדי הליכה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כניסה חינם, נשנושים ¥300-800","tip":"בסופ״ש אחר הצהריים יש תורות ארוכים בדוכנים וקשה לזוז. בבוקר בימי חול הרבה יותר רגוע.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3551.html","https://www.nankinmachi.or.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"עגלה עוברת אבל בסופ״ש העומס מעייף. אין איפה לשבת בשקט.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nankinmachi%20Kobe","website_url":"https://www.nankinmachi.or.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים דרך אחד השערים הסיניים, הולכים לאורך הרחוב הראשי עד הכיכר עם הביתן במרכז ועוצרים בדוכנים לבאוזי.","special":"נוסד על ידי סוחרים סינים שהגיעו אחרי פתיחת הנמל ב-1868, והיום זה מרכז הקהילה הסינית של קנסאי.","highlights":["שער צ׳ואן-מון","הביתן בכיכר המרכזית","דוכני באוזי"],"time_needed":"30-60 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-3-18 Sakaemachidori, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":"10:30","closes":"19:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"להגיע בצהריים ביום חול, בסופ״ש התורות בדוכנים ארוכים","baby_block":null,"tags":["chinatown","chinese","street food","buns","baozi","צ׳יינה טאון","סיני","אוכל רחוב","באוזי","לחמניות אדים","gate","שער","motomachi","dim sum","דים סאם"],"en":{"hype":"Kobe's Chinatown: two streets of food stalls, steamed buns and a small Chinese pavilion.","reality":"Small and crowded, you can walk it in 20 minutes. The food is mostly tuned to Japanese tourist tastes, but snacking while walking is fun.","tip":"Weekend afternoons mean long stall queues and slow walking. Weekday mornings are much calmer.","baby_notes":"Stroller works, but weekend crowds are tiring and there's nowhere quiet to sit.","price":"Free; snacks ¥300-800","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Enter through one of the Chinese gates, walk the main street to the central plaza pavilion and stop at the stalls for buns.","special":"Started by Chinese merchants after the port opened in 1868; today it's the centre of Kansai's Chinese community.","highlights":["Chōan-mon gate","Central plaza pavilion","Bun stalls"],"time_needed":"30-60 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Go at midday on a weekday; weekend stall queues are long","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Former Foreign Settlement","name_ja":"旧居留地","city":"kobe","area":"Sannomiya & Motomachi","category":"sight","lat":34.689,"lng":135.1925,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"הרובע שבו גרו וסחרו הזרים אחרי פתיחת הנמל, עם בנייני אבן מערביים מתחילת המאה ה-20.","reality":"זה בעיקר רחובות רחבים ונקיים עם בניינים ישנים שהפכו לחנויות יוקרה. נחמד לטיול רגלי של חצי שעה בין צ׳יינה טאון לנמל, לא יעד בפני עצמו.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"הבניין הכי יפה הוא בניין מס׳ 15 (Kyukyoryuchi Jugobankan), היחיד שנשאר מהתקופה המקורית.","sources":["https://www.feel-kobe.jp/en/","https://www.kobe-kyoryuchi.com/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מדרכות רחבות ושטוחות, נוח מאוד לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Former%20Foreign%20Settlement%20Kobe","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מסתובבים ברגל בין הבניינים ההיסטוריים, עוברים ליד בניין מס׳ 15 ומשם ממשיכים דרומה לפארק מריקן.","special":"שכונה מערבית מתוכננת מ-1868 עם רשת רחובות ישרה, נדיר ביפן.","highlights":["בניין מס׳ 15","בניין דאימארו הישן","רחובות עם תאורה בערב"],"time_needed":"30-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Kyomachi, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לעבור בדרך מצ׳יינה טאון לפארק מריקן, 10 דקות הליכה","baby_block":null,"tags":["architecture","western buildings","historic district","stone buildings","ארכיטקטורה","בניינים מערביים","רובע היסטורי","היסטוריה","history","walk","טיול רגלי","luxury shops","חנויות יוקרה","port history"],"en":{"hype":"The district where foreigners lived and traded after the port opened, with early 1900s Western stone buildings.","reality":"Mostly wide clean streets with old buildings turned into luxury shops. Nice for a 30-minute walk between Chinatown and the port, not a goal on its own.","tip":"The best building is No. 15 (Kyukyoryuchi Jugobankan), the only one left from the original period.","baby_notes":"Wide flat sidewalks, very easy with a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk between the old buildings, pass No. 15, then carry on south to Meriken Park.","special":"A planned Western quarter from 1868 with a straight street grid, rare in Japan.","highlights":["Building No. 15","Old Daimaru building","Lit streets in the evening"],"time_needed":"30-45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Walk through on the way from Chinatown to Meriken Park, 10 min","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kobe City Hall Observation Lobby","name_ja":"神戸市役所1号館24階展望ロビー","city":"kobe","area":"Sannomiya & Motomachi","category":"sight","lat":34.69,"lng":135.1956,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מרפסת תצפית חינמית בקומה 24 של העירייה, עם נוף על הנמל, ההרים והעיר.","reality":"תצפית טובה בלי לשלם כלום, בעיקר בשקיעה ובחושך. החלונות משקפים קצת בלילה, אבל בשביל חינם זה מעולה.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"עולים במעלית מהלובי של בניין 1. יש בית קפה קטן למעלה.","sources":["https://feel-kobe.jp/kobe-yakei/en/kobe-city-hall","https://www.trvlogue.com/en/kobe-city-hall-observatory"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעלית עד למעלה וחלל ממוזג ושקט, טוב לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kobe%20City%20Hall%20Observation%20Lobby%20Kobe","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים לקומה 24, עוברים בין החלונות לצד הנמל ולצד ההרים, ואפשר לשבת לשתות משהו מול הנוף.","special":"אחת התצפיות הבודדות ביפן שהן גם חינם וגם בגובה רציני מעל מרכז העיר.","highlights":["נוף על מגדל הנמל","תצפית לילה","קפה בקומה 24"],"time_needed":"20-30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"6-5-1 Kanocho, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":"10:00","closes":"22:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לעלות בשקיעה, חינם ופתוח עד 22:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["observation deck","view","night view","free","skyline","תצפית","נוף","נוף לילה","חינם","קו רקיע","city hall","עירייה","sunset","שקיעה","harbor view","נוף לנמל"],"en":{"hype":"A free observation deck on the 24th floor of City Hall, looking over the port, the mountains and the city.","reality":"A good view for nothing, best at sunset and after dark. Windows reflect a bit at night, but for free it's great.","tip":"Take the lift from the lobby of Building 1. There's a small cafe up top.","baby_notes":"Lift all the way up, quiet air-conditioned space, fine with a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go up to the 24th floor, move between the port-side and mountain-side windows, and sit with a drink facing the view.","special":"One of the few free observation decks in Japan that is actually high above the city centre.","highlights":["View of Port Tower","Night view","Cafe on the 24th floor"],"time_needed":"20-30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Go up at sunset; free and open until 22:00","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
where not exists (select 1 from place_library p where p.city = x.city and lower(p.name) = lower(x.name));
insert into place_library (name, name_ja, city, area, category, lat, lng, coord_precision, hype, reality, verdict, tabelog_score, google_score, price, tip, sources, audience, baby_notes, local_pick, maps_url, website_url, serves, dishes, todo, special, highlights, time_needed, kosher, kosher_note, address, opens, closes, closed_weekdays, closed_dates, open_dates, best_time, visit_mins, booking, plan_line, baby_block, tags, en, facts_at, facts_sure, active)
select x.name, x.name_ja, x.city, x.area, x.category, x.lat, x.lng, x.coord_precision, x.hype, x.reality, x.verdict, x.tabelog_score, x.google_score, x.price, x.tip, x.sources, x.audience, x.baby_notes, x.local_pick, x.maps_url, x.website_url, x.serves, x.dishes, x.todo, x.special, x.highlights, x.time_needed, x.kosher, x.kosher_note, x.address, x.opens, x.closes, x.closed_weekdays, x.closed_dates, x.open_dates, x.best_time, x.visit_mins, x.booking, x.plan_line, x.baby_block, x.tags, x.en, x.facts_at, x.facts_sure, false from jsonb_populate_recordset(null::place_library, $cards$[{"name":"Kobe City Museum","name_ja":"神戸市立博物館","city":"kobe","area":"Sannomiya & Motomachi","category":"sight","lat":34.688,"lng":135.192,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון העיר בבניין בנק ישן ומרשים, עם אחד האוספים הגדולים בעולם של אמנות ״נאמבאן״ ממפגשי יפן עם האירופאים.","reality":"מעניין למי שאוהב היסטוריה ומפות ישנות. בלי תערוכה מיוחדת התצוגה הקבועה קטנה, שעה מספיקה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥300 בלי תערוכה מיוחדת, יותר כשיש","tip":"בשישי ושבת פתוח עד 20:00, טוב לשלב עם ערב ברובע הזרים הישן.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3561.html","https://www.kobecitymuseum.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעליות ושקט, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kobe%20City%20Museum%20Kobe","website_url":"https://www.kobecitymuseum.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מתחילים בתצוגת המפות של יפן לאורך הדורות, ממשיכים לאוסף הנאמבאן עם הפרגודים המצוירים, ומסיימים בתערוכה המתחלפת.","special":"אוסף ציורי נאמבאן מהמאה ה-16, שמראים איך היפנים ראו את הסוחרים והמיסיונרים הפורטוגזים.","highlights":["אמנות נאמבאן","אוסף מפות עתיקות","הבניין הניאו-קלאסי"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"24 Kyomachi, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:30","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני. בשישי-שבת פתוח עד 20:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["museum","history","namban art","maps","מוזיאון","היסטוריה","אמנות","מפות","folding screens","פרגודים","art","rainy day","יום גשום","port history","היסטוריה של הנמל"],"en":{"hype":"The city museum in a grand old bank building, with one of the world's largest collections of Namban art from Japan's first contact with Europeans.","reality":"Interesting if you like history and old maps. Without a special exhibition the permanent display is small; an hour is enough.","tip":"Open until 20:00 on Fridays and Saturdays, good before an evening in the old settlement.","baby_notes":"Lifts and quiet, easy with a stroller.","price":"¥300 without a special exhibition, more with one","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Start with the maps of Japan through the ages, then the Namban collection with its painted screens, then the rotating exhibition.","special":"16th-century Namban paintings showing how Japanese artists saw Portuguese traders and missionaries.","highlights":["Namban art","Old map collection","The neoclassical building"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays. Open to 20:00 on Fri-Sat","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Sorakuen Garden","name_ja":"相楽園","city":"kobe","area":"Sannomiya & Motomachi","category":"sight","lat":34.693,"lng":135.185,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גן יפני מסורתי עם בריכה, ולצדו אורווה מערבית מעוטרת ובית סוחר זר משנת 1902.","reality":"גן קטן ושקט ממש ליד העירייה של המחוז, כמעט בלי תיירים. לא בליגה של קיוטו, אבל הפסקה נעימה מהעיר ב-¥300.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥300","tip":"בתחילת דצמבר עוד יש עלים אדומים בגן.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3560.html","https://www.feel-kobe.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים עם מדרגות אבן בחלקים, אפשר לעשות סיבוב חלקי עם עגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sorakuen%20Garden%20Kobe","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מקיפים את הבריכה בשביל, חוצים את הגשרונים ועוצרים ליד האורווה המעוטרת ובית האסאם.","special":"שילוב נדיר של גן יפני קלאסי עם שני מבנים מערביים מתקופת מייג׳י באותו מתחם.","highlights":["הבריכה והגשרים","האורווה המערבית","בית האסאם"],"time_needed":"40 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"5-3-1 Nakayamatedori, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[4],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי חמישי ומ-29 בדצמבר","baby_block":null,"tags":["japanese garden","garden","pond","autumn leaves","גן יפני","גן","בריכה","שלכת","עלים אדומים","koi","דגי קוי","quiet","שקט","meiji","western house"],"en":{"hype":"A traditional Japanese pond garden with an ornate Western stable and a 1902 foreign trader's house in the grounds.","reality":"A small quiet garden next to the prefectural offices, almost no tourists. Not Kyoto level, but a nice break from the city for ¥300.","tip":"In early December the garden can still have red leaves.","baby_notes":"Some stone steps on the paths; a partial loop works with a stroller.","price":"¥300","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the path around the pond, cross the little bridges and stop at the ornate stable and the Hassam House.","special":"A classic Japanese garden and two Meiji-era Western buildings in the same grounds, which is rare.","highlights":["Pond and bridges","The Western stable","Hassam House"],"time_needed":"40 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Thursdays and from 29 December","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kobe Motomachi Shopping Street","name_ja":"元町商店街","city":"kobe","area":"Sannomiya & Motomachi","category":"shopping","lat":34.6895,"lng":135.186,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מדרחוב מקורה ותיק של יותר מקילומטר, עם חנויות משפחתיות, ממתקים מקומיים ובתי קפה ישנים.","reality":"פחות נוצץ מסנומיה ויותר מקומי. כיף לשוטט בו כשיורד גשם, אבל אין פה משהו שאי אפשר בלעדיו.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם להסתובב","tip":"החלק המזרחי, קרוב לתחנת מוטומאצ׳י, הכי חי. מערבה החנויות נעשות ישנות ושקטות יותר.","sources":["https://www.kobe-motomachi.or.jp/","https://www.feel-kobe.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מקורה ושטוח לכל האורך, נוח לעגלה גם בגשם.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Motomachi%20Shopping%20Street%20Kobe","website_url":"https://www.kobe-motomachi.or.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים מערבה מתחנת מוטומאצ׳י, נכנסים לחנויות הממתקים והכלים, ויוצאים דרומה לצ׳יינה טאון שצמוד למדרחוב.","special":"אחד המדרחובים הוותיקים ביפן, פעיל מאז פתיחת הנמל.","highlights":["חנויות ממתקים ותיקות","חנויות כלי בית","מעבר ישיר לנאנקינמאצ׳י"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Motomachidori, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":"10:00","closes":"19:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"מקורה לכל האורך, תוכנית טובה ליום גשום","baby_block":null,"tags":["shopping street","arcade","covered","souvenirs","sweets","מדרחוב","קניות","מקורה","מזכרות","ממתקים","shotengai","שוק","rainy day","יום גשום","local shops","חנויות מקומיות"],"en":{"hype":"An old covered shopping street over a kilometre long, with family shops, local sweets and old cafes.","reality":"Less glossy than Sannomiya and more local. Fun to wander when it rains, but nothing here you can't live without.","tip":"The east end near Motomachi Station is liveliest. Heading west the shops get older and quieter.","baby_notes":"Covered and flat the whole way, easy with a stroller even in rain.","price":"Free to browse","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk west from Motomachi Station, pop into the sweet and homeware shops, then step south into Chinatown right next to it.","special":"One of Japan's oldest shopping streets, running since the port opened.","highlights":["Old sweet shops","Homeware shops","Direct link to Nankinmachi"],"time_needed":"1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Covered the whole way, a good rainy-day plan","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Sannomiya Center Gai","name_ja":"三宮センター街","city":"kobe","area":"Sannomiya & Motomachi","category":"shopping","lat":34.6915,"lng":135.1925,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המדרחוב המקורה הראשי של סנומיה, עם אופנה, חנויות אנימה, ספרים ומשחקים.","reality":"מדרחוב קניות רגיל של עיר יפנית גדולה, הרבה רשתות. שימושי לקניות, לא אטרקציה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם להסתובב","tip":"יש בו כמה חנויות מנגה ואנימה טובות, ובקצה המערבי הוא ממשיך ישר למוטומאצ׳י.","sources":["https://www.kobe-sannomiya.or.jp/","https://www.feel-kobe.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מקורה ושטוח, אבל צפוף בערב ובסופ״ש.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sannomiya%20Center%20Gai%20Kobe","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים מערבה מתחנת סנומיה לכל אורך המדרחוב, נכנסים לחנויות שמעניינות, וממשיכים למוטומאצ׳י.","special":null,"highlights":["חנויות מנגה ואנימה","אופנה יפנית","חיבור ישיר למוטומאצ׳י"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Sannomiyacho, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":"11:00","closes":"20:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"מתחיל ממש ליד תחנת סנומיה וממשיך עד מוטומאצ׳י","baby_block":null,"tags":["shopping street","arcade","fashion","anime","manga","מדרחוב","קניות","אופנה","אנימה","מנגה","books","ספרים","covered","מקורה","clothes","בגדים"],"en":{"hype":"Sannomiya's main covered shopping street, with fashion, anime shops, books and games.","reality":"A normal big-city Japanese shopping arcade with lots of chains. Handy for shopping, not a sight.","tip":"A few good manga and anime shops here, and at the west end it runs straight into Motomachi.","baby_notes":"Covered and flat, but crowded in the evening and on weekends.","price":"Free to browse","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk west from Sannomiya Station along the whole arcade, duck into what interests you, and carry on to Motomachi.","special":null,"highlights":["Manga and anime shops","Japanese fashion","Links straight to Motomachi"],"time_needed":"1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Starts right by Sannomiya Station and runs to Motomachi","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Daimaru Kobe","name_ja":"大丸神戸店","city":"kobe","area":"Sannomiya & Motomachi","category":"shopping","lat":34.6895,"lng":135.1905,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"חנות הכלבו הכי מרשימה בקובה, בבניין אבן ברובע הזרים הישן, עם קומת אוכל גדולה במרתף.","reality":"כלבו יפני איכותי ויקר. המרתף עם המאפים, הממתקים והקופסאות למתנה הוא הסיבה העיקרית להיכנס.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"מחירי כלבו, מתנות ממתקים מ-¥1,000","tip":"תיירים מקבלים פטור ממס בהצגת דרכון, בדלפק בקומה הייעודית.","sources":["https://www.daimaru.co.jp/kobe/","https://www.feel-kobe.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חדר הנקה והחתלה וגם מעליות, כמו ברוב חנויות הכלבו ביפן.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Daimaru%20Kobe%20Kobe","website_url":"https://www.daimaru.co.jp/kobe/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מתחילים בקומת האוכל במרתף, עוברים לקומות האופנה והכלים, ויוצאים לרחובות של רובע הזרים מסביב.","special":"הבניין משתלב ברובע ההיסטורי, ובחזית שלו יש קולונדה עם בתי קפה.","highlights":["קומת האוכל במרתף","מתנות ממתקים של קובה","הקולונדה בחזית"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"40 Akashimachi, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":"10:00","closes":"20:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לקנות מתנות ממתקים במרתף, יש פטור ממס עם דרכון","baby_block":null,"tags":["department store","depachika","food hall","sweets","gifts","כלבו","חנות כלבו","מרתף אוכל","ממתקים","מתנות","tax free","פטור ממס","fashion","אופנה","souvenirs","מזכרות"],"en":{"hype":"Kobe's most handsome department store, in a stone building in the old settlement, with a big food hall in the basement.","reality":"A quality, pricey Japanese department store. The basement with pastries, sweets and gift boxes is the main reason to go in.","tip":"Tourists get tax-free shopping with a passport at the dedicated counter.","baby_notes":"Nursing and changing room plus lifts, like most Japanese department stores.","price":"Department store prices; sweet gift boxes from ¥1,000","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Start at the basement food floor, move up to fashion and homeware, then walk out into the settlement streets around it.","special":"The building blends into the historic district, with a colonnade of cafes along the front.","highlights":["Basement food floor","Kobe sweet gifts","The front colonnade"],"time_needed":"1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Buy sweet gift boxes in the basement; tax-free with a passport","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kobe Fugetsudo Motomachi Main Store","name_ja":"神戸風月堂 元町本店","city":"kobe","area":"Sannomiya & Motomachi","category":"shopping","lat":34.6897,"lng":135.1877,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"החנות הראשית של יצרן הגופרט הכי מפורסם בקובה, עוגיות ופל דקות עם קרם, המזכרת הקלאסית מהעיר.","reality":"חנות ממתקים ותיקה ויפה. הגופרט טעים וארוז יפה למתנה, ולא צריך יותר מעשר דקות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"קופסאות גופרט מ-¥1,000 בערך","tip":"הקופסאות מחזיקות טוב בטיסה, מתנה נוחה להביא הביתה.","sources":["https://www.kobe-fugetsudo.co.jp/","https://www.feel-kobe.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kobe%20Fugetsudo%20Motomachi%20Main%20Store%20Kobe","website_url":"https://www.kobe-fugetsudo.co.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים, בוחרים קופסת גופרט בטעם וניל, תות או שוקולד, ואפשר לשבת בקפה של החנות.","special":"מייצרים גופרט בקובה מאז 1927.","highlights":["גופרט קלאסי","מארזי מתנה","הקפה בחנות"],"time_needed":"15 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-3-10 Motomachidori, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":15,"booking":"no","plan_line":"מתנה קלה לטיסה, ממש על מדרחוב מוטומאצ׳י","baby_block":null,"tags":["sweets","souvenir","gaufre","wafer","cookies","ממתקים","מזכרת","עוגיות","ופלים","גופרט","gift","מתנה","bakery","קונדיטוריה","omiyage"],"en":{"hype":"The main shop of Kobe's best-known gaufre maker: thin cream-filled wafers, the classic Kobe souvenir.","reality":"A pretty old sweet shop. The gaufres are tasty and nicely boxed for gifts, ten minutes is all it takes.","tip":"The boxes travel well, an easy gift to fly home with.","baby_notes":null,"price":"Gaufre boxes from about ¥1,000","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Pick a box of gaufres in vanilla, strawberry or chocolate; there's a cafe in the shop too.","special":"Making gaufres in Kobe since 1927.","highlights":["Classic gaufres","Gift boxes","The in-store cafe"],"time_needed":"15 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"An easy gift to fly with, right on Motomachi street","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"familiar Kobe Main Store","name_ja":"ファミリア 神戸本店","city":"kobe","area":"Sannomiya & Motomachi","category":"shopping","lat":34.6899,"lng":135.1897,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מותג בגדי התינוקות והילדים האהוב ביפן נולד בקובה, וזו חנות הדגל שלו.","reality":"בגדים ומתנות לתינוקות באיכות גבוהה ובמחיר גבוה. מי שמטיילים עם תינוק ימצאו פה מתנה שאין בבית.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"בגדי תינוק מ-¥3,000 בערך","tip":"הדובי והדפס המשבצות של familiar הם הקלאסיקה, טוב למתנת לידה.","sources":["https://www.familiar.co.jp/","https://www.feel-kobe.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חנות שבנויה להורים: מקום לעגלות ופינה לתינוקות.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=familiar%20Kobe%20Main%20Store%20Kobe","website_url":"https://www.familiar.co.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין מחלקות התינוקות והילדים, מסתכלים על מארזי המתנה, ובוחרים משהו עם הדובי המוכר.","special":"מותג מקובה מ-1950 שמשפחות יפניות קונות בו מתנות לידה.","highlights":["בגדי תינוקות","מארזי מתנת לידה","הדובי של familiar"],"time_needed":"30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Motomachidori, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"מתנת לידה יפנית קלאסית, ליד מוטומאצ׳י","baby_block":null,"tags":["baby clothes","kids clothes","baby gifts","children","בגדי תינוקות","בגדי ילדים","מתנת לידה","תינוקות","ילדים","toys","צעצועים","teddy bear","דובי","clothing","ביגוד"],"en":{"hype":"Japan's favourite baby and kids' clothing brand was born in Kobe, and this is its flagship.","reality":"High-quality, high-priced baby clothes and gifts. Anyone travelling with a baby will find a gift here you won't find at home.","tip":"The familiar bear and the check print are the classics, good for a new-baby gift.","baby_notes":"A shop built for parents: room for strollers and a baby corner.","price":"Baby clothes from about ¥3,000","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Browse the baby and kids' floors, look at the gift sets, pick something with the familiar bear.","special":"A Kobe brand since 1950 that Japanese families buy new-baby gifts from.","highlights":["Baby clothes","New-baby gift sets","The familiar bear"],"time_needed":"30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"A classic Japanese new-baby gift, near Motomachi","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Tor Road","name_ja":"トアロード","city":"kobe","area":"Sannomiya & Motomachi","category":"shopping","lat":34.6925,"lng":135.19,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רחוב משופע שעולה מרובע הזרים לכיוון קיטאנו, עם בוטיקים, חנויות עיצוב ובתי קפה.","reality":"רחוב נעים עם חנויות קטנות ושקטות. טוב כדרך יפה לעלות לקיטאנו, לא מקום לבלות בו חצי יום.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם להסתובב","tip":"הסמטאות הצדדיות סביב טור רואד ומזרחה לה מלאות חנויות בגדים יד שנייה ובוטיקים קטנים.","sources":["https://www.feel-kobe.jp/en/","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3550.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"עלייה מתונה אבל ארוכה עם עגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tor%20Road%20Kobe","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים לאט מכיוון מוטומאצ׳י לכיוון קיטאנו, נכנסים לבוטיקים ולחנויות העיצוב, ועוצרים לקפה בדרך.","special":null,"highlights":["בוטיקים קטנים","חנויות עיצוב","דרך יפה לקיטאנו"],"time_needed":"45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Tor Road, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לעלות בו ברגל לקיטאנו במקום ברחוב הראשי","baby_block":null,"tags":["boutiques","fashion","design shops","vintage","בוטיקים","אופנה","חנויות עיצוב","וינטג׳","יד שנייה","street","רחוב","clothes","בגדים","second hand","walk"],"en":{"hype":"A sloping street running from the old settlement up toward Kitano, lined with boutiques, design shops and cafes.","reality":"A pleasant street of small quiet shops. Good as a nice way up to Kitano, not a place for half a day.","tip":"The side lanes around Tor Road and east of it are full of second-hand clothes shops and small boutiques.","baby_notes":"A gentle but long climb with a stroller.","price":"Free to browse","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk slowly up from Motomachi toward Kitano, step into the boutiques and design shops, stop for coffee on the way.","special":null,"highlights":["Small boutiques","Design shops","A nice route to Kitano"],"time_needed":"45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Walk up this way to Kitano instead of the main road","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kobe Hankyu","name_ja":"神戸阪急","city":"kobe","area":"Sannomiya & Motomachi","category":"shopping","lat":34.6935,"lng":135.196,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"חנות הכלבו הגדולה שצמודה לתחנת סנומיה, עם מרתף אוכל ענק.","reality":"כלבו גדול ונוח ממש על התחנה. שימושי כשצריך הכל במקום אחד או מתנות של הרגע האחרון, לא יעד.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"מחירי כלבו","tip":"פטור ממס לתיירים עם דרכון. המרתף טוב לקופסאות ממתקים לפני הרכבת.","sources":["https://www.hankyu-dept.co.jp/kobe/","https://www.feel-kobe.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעליות, חדר הנקה והחתלה ושירותים נוחים.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kobe%20Hankyu%20Kobe","website_url":"https://www.hankyu-dept.co.jp/kobe/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יורדים למרתף האוכל לממתקים ולארוחה מהירה, ועולים לקומות האופנה אם צריך.","special":null,"highlights":["מרתף האוכל","מתנות של הרגע האחרון","יציאה ישירה לתחנה"],"time_needed":"45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"8-1-1 Onoedori, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":"10:00","closes":"20:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"נוח לקנות מתנות רגע לפני הרכבת בסנומיה","baby_block":null,"tags":["department store","depachika","food hall","gifts","כלבו","חנות כלבו","מרתף אוכל","מתנות","tax free","פטור ממס","sannomiya station","תחנת סנומיה","fashion","אופנה","sweets","ממתקים"],"en":{"hype":"The big department store attached to Sannomiya Station, with a huge basement food hall.","reality":"A big convenient store right on the station. Useful when you need everything in one place or last-minute gifts, not a destination.","tip":"Tax-free for tourists with a passport. The basement is good for sweet boxes before your train.","baby_notes":"Lifts, nursing and changing room, good toilets.","price":"Department store prices","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Head down to the basement for sweets and a quick meal, go up to fashion if you need it.","special":null,"highlights":["Basement food hall","Last-minute gifts","Direct station exit"],"time_needed":"45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Handy for gifts just before the train at Sannomiya","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Sakaemachi","name_ja":"栄町通","city":"kobe","area":"Sannomiya & Motomachi","category":"shopping","lat":34.6878,"lng":135.189,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רחוב ישן ליד צ׳יינה טאון שבבנייני המשרדים הישנים שלו נפתחו חנויות קטנות של מעצבים, וינטג׳ וכלים.","reality":"צריך לחפש: החנויות בקומות עליונות של בניינים ישנים ולא רואים אותן מהרחוב. למי שאוהבים חנויות עצמאיות זה שווה שעה.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם להסתובב","tip":"הרבה חנויות פותחות רק בצהריים ונסגרות מוקדם, וחלקן סגורות באמצע השבוע. כדאי להגיע אחרי 12:00.","sources":["https://www.feel-kobe.jp/en/","https://www.kobe-sannomiya.or.jp/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"הרבה חנויות בקומה שנייה בלי מעלית.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sakaemachi%20Kobe","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מסתובבים ברחוב סאקאה-מאצ׳י ובסמטאות מצפון לו, עולים במדרגות לחנויות בבניינים הישנים, ומסיימים בצ׳יינה טאון הצמוד.","special":"בניינים מתקופת הסחר של הנמל שהפכו לקיני חנויות עצמאיות.","highlights":["חנויות וינטג׳","חנויות כלים ועיצוב","בניינים ישנים"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Sakaemachidori, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"להגיע אחרי 12:00, הרבה חנויות פותחות מאוחר","baby_block":"הרבה חנויות בקומה שנייה בלי מעלית","tags":["vintage","independent shops","design","ceramics","zakka","וינטג׳","חנויות עצמאיות","עיצוב","כלים","קרמיקה","second hand","יד שנייה","old buildings","בניינים ישנים","boutiques","בוטיקים"],"en":{"hype":"An old street by Chinatown where former office buildings now hold small designer, vintage and homeware shops.","reality":"You have to look: the shops are on upper floors of old buildings and invisible from the street. Worth an hour if you like independent shops.","tip":"Many shops open only around noon and close early, some shut midweek. Come after 12:00.","baby_notes":"Many shops are up a flight of stairs with no lift.","price":"Free to browse","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Wander Sakaemachi-dori and the lanes north of it, climb into the shops in the old buildings, finish in Chinatown next door.","special":"Buildings from the port's trading days turned into nests of independent shops.","highlights":["Vintage shops","Homeware and design","Old buildings"],"time_needed":"1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Come after 12:00, many shops open late","baby_block":"Many shops up stairs, no lift"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kitano Ijinkan-gai","name_ja":"北野異人館街","city":"kobe","area":"Kitano","category":"sight","lat":34.7015,"lng":135.191,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שכונה על המדרון מעל סנומיה, עם בתים מערביים שבנו סוחרים זרים לפני יותר ממאה שנה.","reality":"השכונה עצמה יפה לשיטוט וחינם. הבתים בפנים נעשו מסחריים ויקרים, ושניים-שלושה מספיקים, לא צריך את כרטיס השבעה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"רחובות חינם, כל בית ¥350-1,050","tip":"הרחוב הראשי עם הבתים עולה בתלילות. עולים במונית למעלה ויורדים ברגל.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3550.html","https://www.ijinkan.net/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"עליות תלולות ומדרגות בחלק מהסמטאות. עגלה קלה עוברת ברחובות הראשיים, לא בתוך הבתים.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kitano%20Ijinkan-gai%20Kobe","website_url":"https://www.ijinkan.net/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מתחילים בכיכר שליד בית שבשבת התרנגול, נכנסים לבית אחד או שניים, ומשוטטים בסמטאות עם הבתים הישנים ובתי הקפה.","special":"כ-30 בתי מגורים מערביים מתקופת מייג׳י וטאישו שנשארו במקום, נדיר ביפן.","highlights":["בית שבשבת התרנגול","בית מואגי","סמטאות המדרון"],"time_needed":"שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Kitanocho, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":120,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לבחור 2-3 בתים, כרטיס של 7 בתים לא שווה את הכסף","baby_block":null,"tags":["western houses","historic houses","old houses","architecture","meiji","בתים מערביים","בתים היסטוריים","ארכיטקטורה","היסטוריה","שכונה","neighborhood","hillside","מדרון","walk","טיול רגלי","ijinkan"],"en":{"hype":"A hillside neighbourhood above Sannomiya with Western houses foreign merchants built over a century ago.","reality":"The streets are pretty to wander and free. The houses inside are commercial and pricey; two or three are enough, skip the seven-house ticket.","tip":"The main street of houses climbs steeply. Take a taxi up and walk down.","baby_notes":"Steep slopes and stairs in some lanes. A light stroller handles the main streets, not inside the houses.","price":"Streets free; each house ¥350-1,050","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Start at the square by the Weathercock House, go into one or two houses, then wander the lanes of old houses and cafes.","special":"Around 30 Meiji and Taisho era Western homes still in place, rare in Japan.","highlights":["Weathercock House","Moegi House","The hillside lanes"],"time_needed":"2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Pick 2-3 houses; the 7-house ticket isn't worth it","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Weathercock House","name_ja":"風見鶏の館","city":"kobe","area":"Kitano","category":"sight","lat":34.7019,"lng":135.1906,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"הבית הכי מפורסם בקיטאנו, בית לבנים אדום של סוחר גרמני משנת 1909 עם שבשבת תרנגול על הגג.","reality":"נפתח מחדש ב-2025 אחרי שיפוץ, והפנים שמור ויפה. אם נכנסים רק לבית אחד בקיטאנו, זה הבית.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥500, או ¥650 משולב עם בית מואגי","tip":"הכרטיס המשולב עם בית מואגי הירוק שליד הוא העסקה הכי טובה בשכונה.","sources":["https://www.ijinkan.net/","https://www.city.kobe.lg.jp/a10019/810320483784.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"מדרגות פנימיות לקומה השנייה, משאירים את העגלה בחוץ.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Weathercock%20House%20Kobe","website_url":"https://www.ijinkan.net/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים לחדרי המגורים, לחדר האוכל ולחדר העבודה המקוריים, ועולים לקומה השנייה לחדר הילדים. בחוץ מצלמים את החזית מהכיכר.","special":"בית הלבנים היחיד בין בתי קיטאנו, ונכס תרבות חשוב של יפן.","highlights":["שבשבת התרנגול","הריהוט המקורי","הכיכר שמול הבית"],"time_needed":"30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-13-3 Kitanocho, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לקנות כרטיס משולב עם בית מואגי ב-¥650","baby_block":"מדרגות בפנים, העגלה נשארת בחוץ","tags":["western house","historic house","weathercock","brick","museum","בית מערבי","בית היסטורי","שבשבת","לבנים","מוזיאון","architecture","ארכיטקטורה","german","גרמני","ijinkan"],"en":{"hype":"Kitano's most famous house: a 1909 red-brick home of a German merchant with a rooster weathervane on the roof.","reality":"Reopened in 2025 after restoration, and the interior is well kept. If you go into only one house in Kitano, make it this one.","tip":"The combined ticket with the green Moegi House next door is the best deal in the area.","baby_notes":"Inside stairs to the upper floor; leave the stroller outside.","price":"¥500, or ¥650 with Moegi House","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk through the original living rooms, dining room and study, then upstairs to the children's room. Photograph the front from the square outside.","special":"The only brick house among Kitano's homes, and an Important Cultural Property.","highlights":["The weathercock","Original furniture","The square out front"],"time_needed":"30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Buy the ¥650 combo ticket with Moegi House","baby_block":"Stairs inside; stroller stays outside"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Moegi House","name_ja":"萌黄の館","city":"kobe","area":"Kitano","category":"sight","lat":34.7017,"lng":135.1903,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בית עץ ירוק בהיר משנת 1903 של קונסול אמריקאי, עם מרפסות פתוחות ונוף לעיר.","reality":"קטן וזול, ונעים יותר מבתים יקרים ממנו. מהמרפסת בקומה השנייה רואים את הים מעל הגגות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥350","tip":"שווה בעיקר במשולב עם בית שבשבת התרנגול שממול.","sources":["https://www.ijinkan.net/","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3550.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"מדרגות פנימיות, משאירים את העגלה בכניסה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Moegi%20House%20Kobe","website_url":"https://www.ijinkan.net/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בחדרים עם האחים והטפטים המקוריים, ועולים למרפסת בקומה השנייה לנוף.","special":"המרפסות הסגורות בזכוכית בקומה השנייה מסגרות את הנוף לנמל.","highlights":["המרפסת עם הנוף","הארובה שנפלה ברעידה ונשארה בגינה","החזית הירוקה"],"time_needed":"20 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-10-11 Kitanocho, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":"09:00","closes":"18:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":20,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לשלב עם בית שבשבת התרנגול בכרטיס משולב","baby_block":"מדרגות בפנים, העגלה נשארת בכניסה","tags":["western house","historic house","consul","wooden house","view","בית מערבי","בית היסטורי","קונסול","בית עץ","נוף","architecture","ארכיטקטורה","american","אמריקאי","ijinkan"],"en":{"hype":"A pale green 1903 wooden house built for an American consul, with open verandas and a city view.","reality":"Small and cheap, and nicer than some pricier houses. From the upstairs veranda you see the sea over the rooftops.","tip":"Best as a combo with the Weathercock House across the way.","baby_notes":"Inside stairs; leave the stroller at the entrance.","price":"¥350","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the rooms with their original fireplaces and wallpaper, then go up to the veranda for the view.","special":"The glassed-in upstairs verandas frame the view down to the port.","highlights":["The veranda view","The chimney that fell in the 1995 quake, kept in the garden","Green facade"],"time_needed":"20 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Pair with the Weathercock House on a combo ticket","baby_block":"Stairs inside; stroller stays at the door"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Uroko House","name_ja":"うろこの家","city":"kobe","area":"Kitano","category":"sight","lat":34.7032,"lng":135.189,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"הבית עם קירות ״קשקשי הדג״ מצפחה בראש המדרון, ולידו גלריה קטנה עם תצפית.","reality":"החזית יפה לתמונה, אבל ב-¥1,050 זה הבית הכי יקר בשכונה ובפנים אין הרבה. מצלמים מבחוץ וממשיכים.","verdict":"overhyped","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,050","tip":"את החזית ואת פסל החזיר הבר בכניסה רואים גם בלי להיכנס.","sources":["https://kobe-ijinkan.net/en","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3550.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"עלייה תלולה ומדרגות עד הבית.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Uroko%20House%20Kobe","website_url":"https://kobe-ijinkan.net/en","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במדרגות לראש הגבעה, מצלמים את החזית, ואם נכנסים עולים לגלריה שליד בשביל התצפית.","special":"קירות מכוסים באלפי לוחות צפחה עגולים שנראים כמו קשקשים.","highlights":["חזית הקשקשים","תצפית מהגלריה","פסל החזיר הבר"],"time_needed":"20-30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-20-4 Kitanocho, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":25,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לצלם מבחוץ, הכניסה יקרה ביחס למה שיש בפנים","baby_block":"עלייה תלולה ומדרגות עד הבית","tags":["western house","historic house","slate","scales","view","בית מערבי","בית היסטורי","צפחה","קשקשים","נוף","gallery","גלריה","photo spot","תמונה","ijinkan"],"en":{"hype":"The house with slate 'fish scale' walls at the top of the slope, with a small gallery and lookout next door.","reality":"The front is pretty for a photo, but at ¥1,050 it's the priciest house in the area and there's not much inside. Photograph it and move on.","tip":"You can see the front and the wild boar statue at the gate without going in.","baby_notes":"Steep climb and stairs to the house.","price":"¥1,050","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Climb to the top of the hill, photograph the facade, and if you go in, head up the gallery next door for the view.","special":"Walls covered in thousands of round slate tiles that look like scales.","highlights":["The scale facade","Gallery lookout","Wild boar statue"],"time_needed":"20-30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Photo from outside; entry is pricey for what's inside","baby_block":"Steep climb and stairs to the house"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kitano Tenmangu Shrine","name_ja":"北野天満神社","city":"kobe","area":"Kitano","category":"sight","lat":34.7024,"lng":135.1904,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש קטן בראש מדרגות מעל בית שבשבת התרנגול, עם נוף על הגגות של קיטאנו עד הים.","reality":"מקדש פשוט אבל הנוף מהמדרגות שלו הוא מהטובים בשכונה, וזה חינם. חמש דקות שוות.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"מכאן יוצאת התמונה הכי יפה של בית שבשבת התרנגול מלמעלה.","sources":["https://www.feel-kobe.jp/en/","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3550.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"מדרגות אבן תלולות, אין גישה לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kitano%20Tenmangu%20Shrine%20Kobe","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במדרגות לצד בית שבשבת התרנגול, מתפללים או סתם מסתכלים, ומצלמים את הנוף לגגות ולנמל.","special":"המקדש מוקדש לאל הלימוד, וסטודנטים מגיעים לבקש הצלחה בבחינות.","highlights":["נוף לגג בית שבשבת התרנגול","פסל הפרה לקבלת מזל","נוף לנמל"],"time_needed":"15 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-12-1 Kitanocho, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":15,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לעלות במדרגות לנוף החינמי הכי טוב בקיטאנו","baby_block":"מדרגות אבן תלולות, אין גישה לעגלה","tags":["shrine","shinto","view","stairs","free","מקדש","שינטו","נוף","מדרגות","חינם","photo spot","תמונה","tenjin","learning","לימודים"],"en":{"hype":"A small shrine up a flight of stairs above the Weathercock House, looking over Kitano's rooftops to the sea.","reality":"A simple shrine, but the view from its steps is one of the best in the area and it's free. Five minutes well spent.","tip":"This is where the best shot of the Weathercock House from above comes from.","baby_notes":"Steep stone stairs, no stroller access.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Climb the stairs beside the Weathercock House, pay a visit or just look, and photograph the rooftops and port.","special":"Dedicated to the god of learning; students come to ask for exam luck.","highlights":["View over the Weathercock roof","The lucky ox statue","Port view"],"time_needed":"15 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Climb the steps for the best free view in Kitano","baby_block":"Steep stone stairs, no stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kobe Muslim Mosque","name_ja":"神戸ムスリムモスク","city":"kobe","area":"Kitano","category":"sight","lat":34.6975,"lng":135.1885,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המסגד הראשון שנבנה ביפן, מ-1935, בסגנון טורקי עם צריחים, בתחתית שכונת קיטאנו.","reality":"מבחוץ מבנה מיוחד ושונה מכל מה שמסביב. בפנים זה מקום תפילה פעיל ולא אתר תיירות, אז רובם מסתפקים בהצצה מבחוץ.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"מבקרים נכנסים רק מחוץ לזמני התפילה, בלבוש צנוע, ונשים עם כיסוי ראש.","sources":["https://www.feel-kobe.jp/en/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kobe%20Muslim%20Mosque%20Kobe","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מסתכלים על החזית והצריחים מהרחוב. מי שנכנסים חולצים נעליים ונכנסים בשקט לאולם התפילה.","special":"שרד גם את הפצצות מלחמת העולם השנייה וגם את רעידת האדמה של 1995.","highlights":["הצריחים","חזית בסגנון טורקי","אולם התפילה"],"time_needed":"15 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-25-14 Nakayamatedori, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":15,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לבוא בלבוש צנוע, ולא בזמן תפילת יום שישי","baby_block":null,"tags":["mosque","islam","minaret","religion","architecture","מסגד","אסלאם","צריח","דת","ארכיטקטורה","history","היסטוריה","turkish","טורקי","1935"],"en":{"hype":"The first mosque built in Japan, from 1935, in a Turkish style with minarets, at the foot of Kitano.","reality":"From outside it's unlike anything around it. Inside it's an active place of prayer, not a tourist site, so most people just look from the street.","tip":"Visitors go in only outside prayer times, dressed modestly; women cover their hair.","baby_notes":null,"price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Look at the facade and minarets from the street. If you go in, shoes off and quiet in the prayer hall.","special":"It survived both the WWII bombings and the 1995 earthquake.","highlights":["The minarets","Turkish-style facade","The prayer hall"],"time_needed":"15 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Dress modestly, and avoid Friday midday prayers","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Rhine House","name_ja":"ラインの館","city":"kobe","area":"Kitano","category":"sight","lat":34.7011,"lng":135.1915,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בית עץ מערבי משנת 1915 שאפשר להיכנס אליו בחינם, עם חנות מזכרות ותערוכה קטנה על השכונה.","reality":"לא מרשים כמו בית שבשבת התרנגול, אבל הכניסה חינם ויש בו שירותים נקיים וספסלים. עצירה נוחה באמצע הסיבוב.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"בקומה השנייה יש פינה עם מידע על רעידת האדמה ועל שיקום הבתים.","sources":["https://www.ijinkan.net/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"הקומה הראשונה נגישה, שירותים במקום.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Rhine%20House%20Kobe","website_url":"https://www.ijinkan.net/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים לחדרים, עולים לתצוגה בקומה השנייה ומשתמשים בשירותים לפני שממשיכים לעלות בגבעה.","special":"אחד הבתים הבודדים בשכונה שהעירייה פותחת בחינם.","highlights":["כניסה חינם","תצוגה על השכונה","שירותים ומנוחה"],"time_needed":"15 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-10-24 Kitanocho, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":15,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עצירה חינמית עם שירותים באמצע סיבוב קיטאנו","baby_block":null,"tags":["western house","historic house","free","museum","souvenirs","בית מערבי","בית היסטורי","חינם","מוזיאון","מזכרות","toilets","שירותים","rest stop","מנוחה","ijinkan"],"en":{"hype":"A 1915 Western wooden house you can enter for free, with a souvenir shop and a small exhibit on the area.","reality":"Not as striking as the Weathercock House, but it's free and has clean toilets and benches. A handy stop mid-walk.","tip":"Upstairs there's a corner on the earthquake and how the houses were restored.","baby_notes":"Ground floor accessible; toilets on site.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the rooms, see the upstairs display, use the toilets before climbing on up the hill.","special":"One of the few houses in the area the city opens for free.","highlights":["Free entry","Neighbourhood exhibit","Toilets and a rest"],"time_needed":"15 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Free stop with toilets in the middle of a Kitano walk","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Takenaka Carpentry Tools Museum","name_ja":"竹中大工道具館","city":"kobe","area":"Kitano","category":"sight","lat":34.7048,"lng":135.196,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון לכלי הנגרות היפנית המסורתית, עם דגם בגודל מלא של מבנה מקדש שמראה איך בונים בלי מסמרים.","reality":"מפתיע ומעולה גם למי שלא מתעניין בנגרות. שקט, מעוצב יפה, ומעט מאוד תיירים מגיעים.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כ-¥700","tip":"ממש ליד תחנת שין-קובה, אפשר לשלב לפני הרכבל לגן הצמחים או מפל נונוביקי.","sources":["https://www.dougukan.jp/","https://www.feel-kobe.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעלית בין הקומות ושקט, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Takenaka%20Carpentry%20Tools%20Museum%20Kobe","website_url":"https://www.dougukan.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יורדים לקומות התצוגה, רואים את המסורים והמקצועות הישנים, את מבנה המקדש החצוי ואת חיבורי העץ שאפשר לגעת בהם.","special":"אחד המוזיאונים היחידים בעולם שמוקדשים לכלי נגרות, בבניין של חברת הבנייה טקנאקה.","highlights":["שער מקדש בגודל מלא","חיבורי עץ בלי מסמרים","גן יפני קטן"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"7-5-1 Kumochicho, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":"09:30","closes":"16:30","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני, 3 דקות הליכה מתחנת שין-קובה","baby_block":null,"tags":["museum","carpentry","tools","woodwork","architecture","מוזיאון","נגרות","כלי עבודה","עץ","ארכיטקטורה","craft","אומנות","joinery","חיבורי עץ","rainy day","יום גשום"],"en":{"hype":"A museum of traditional Japanese carpentry tools, with a full-size temple structure showing how they build without nails.","reality":"Surprisingly good even if carpentry isn't your thing. Quiet, beautifully designed, and very few tourists.","tip":"Right by Shin-Kobe Station, easy to pair with the herb garden ropeway or Nunobiki Falls.","baby_notes":"Lift between floors and quiet, fine with a stroller.","price":"About ¥700","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Head down through the galleries: old saws and planes, the cut-away temple structure, and wood joints you can handle.","special":"One of the only museums in the world devoted to carpentry tools, run by the Takenaka construction company.","highlights":["Full-size temple gate","Nail-free wood joints","Small Japanese garden"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays; 3 min walk from Shin-Kobe Station","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Nunobiki Falls","name_ja":"布引の滝","city":"kobe","area":"Kitano","category":"sight","lat":34.7085,"lng":135.195,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מפל של 43 מטר ביער, רבע שעה הליכה מתחנת השינקנסן שין-קובה.","reality":"מפתיע כמה מהר יוצאים מהעיר. המפל נאה אבל לא ענק, והעלייה בשביל מדרגות מאתגרת. שווה בשילוב עם הרכבל.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"עולים למפל ברגל ומשם ממשיכים לתצפית מיהאראשי, או ממשיכים עד גן הצמחים ויורדים ברכבל.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3563.html","https://www.feel-kobe.jp/en/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"שביל עם מדרגות אבן, רק עם מנשא.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nunobiki%20Falls%20Kobe","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יוצאים מהיציאה הדרומית בקומה הראשונה של שין-קובה, עוברים במנהרה מתחת לתחנה, ועולים 15-20 דקות ביער עד המפל.","special":"ארבעה מפלים ברצף שמופיעים בשירה היפנית כבר אלף שנה.","highlights":["המפל הגדול אונדאקי","תצפית מיהאראשי","שביל היער"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Fukiaicho, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לצאת מהיציאה הדרומית בקומה 1 של שין-קובה ולעלות ברגל","baby_block":"מדרגות אבן, רק עם מנשא","tags":["waterfall","hike","forest","nature","trail","מפל","מסלול","טיול","יער","טבע","shin-kobe","viewpoint","תצפית","walk","הליכה"],"en":{"hype":"A 43 m waterfall in the forest, a 15-minute walk from Shin-Kobe bullet train station.","reality":"Surprising how fast you leave the city. The falls are nice but not huge, and the stepped path is a workout. Best combined with the ropeway.","tip":"Walk up to the falls, then on to Miharashi lookout, or keep going to the herb garden and ride the ropeway down.","baby_notes":"Stone stairs on the path, carrier only.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Leave Shin-Kobe by the ground-floor south exit, go through the tunnel under the station and climb 15-20 minutes through the woods.","special":"Four falls in a row that have appeared in Japanese poetry for a thousand years.","highlights":["Ondaki main fall","Miharashi lookout","Forest path"],"time_needed":"1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Use Shin-Kobe's ground-floor south exit and walk up","baby_block":"Stone steps, carrier only"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kitano Kobo no Machi","name_ja":"北野工房のまち","city":"kobe","area":"Kitano","category":"shopping","lat":34.699,"lng":135.1925,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בית ספר יסודי ישן משנות ה-30 שהפך לבית לחנויות ולסדנאות של אומנים ויצרנים מקובה.","reality":"מקום נחמד לחפש מזכרות מקומיות כמו נעליים, ממתקים וסבונים, והמבנה עצמו חמוד. לא כל הסדנאות פעילות בכל יום.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כניסה חינם","tip":"בחלק מהסדנאות אפשר להכין משהו בעצמם, אבל צריך לשאול בכל חנות על שעות.","sources":["https://kitanokoubou.jp/","https://www.feel-kobe.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מבנה עם מעלית ושירותים, נוח לעצור עם תינוק.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kitano%20Kobo%20no%20Machi%20Kobe","website_url":"https://kitanokoubou.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין הכיתות שהפכו לחנויות, קונים ממתקים ומוצרים של יצרני קובה, ומציצים לסדנאות.","special":"המסדרונות והכיתות של בית הספר נשארו כמו שהיו.","highlights":["כיתות שהפכו לחנויות","מוצרים של יצרני קובה","סדנאות קטנות"],"time_needed":"45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-17-1 Nakayamatedori, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":"10:00","closes":"18:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עצירה נוחה עם שירותים בדרך למטה מקיטאנו","baby_block":null,"tags":["crafts","workshop","souvenirs","local products","old school","אומנות","סדנה","מזכרות","מוצרים מקומיים","בית ספר ישן","handmade","עבודת יד","sweets","ממתקים","shoes"],"en":{"hype":"A 1930s elementary school turned into shops and workshops for Kobe makers and craftspeople.","reality":"A nice place for local souvenirs like shoes, sweets and soaps, and the building is cute. Not every workshop is running every day.","tip":"Some workshops let you make something yourself; ask at each shop about times.","baby_notes":"Lift and toilets in the building, an easy stop with a baby.","price":"Free entry","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Wander the classrooms turned shops, buy sweets and goods from Kobe makers, peek into the workshops.","special":"The school's corridors and classrooms are kept as they were.","highlights":["Classrooms turned shops","Kobe-made goods","Small workshops"],"time_needed":"45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Handy stop with toilets on the way down from Kitano","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Meriken Park","name_ja":"メリケンパーク","city":"kobe","area":"Harborland & Meriken","category":"sight","lat":34.6825,"lng":135.189,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פארק על המים של הנמל עם שלט BE KOBE, מגדל הנמל האדום ומוזיאון הים, הגלויה של קובה.","reality":"פארק פתוח ונעים לטיול, בעיקר בשקיעה כשהמגדל והמוזיאון נדלקים. התור לתמונה בשלט BE KOBE יכול להיות ארוך.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"את השלט BE KOBE מצלמים בבוקר מוקדם בלי תור, ואת קו הרקיע עם המגדל מהצד של הארבורלנד בערב.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3552.html","https://www.feel-kobe.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שטוח ורחב, נוח מאוד לעגלה. רוח חזקה מהים בחורף.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Meriken%20Park%20Kobe","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים לאורך המים, מצטלמים בשלט BE KOBE, עוברים ליד אנדרטת הרעידה ומסיימים בשקיעה מול המגדל.","special":"כל אייקוני הנמל של קובה במקום אחד, חמש דקות הליכה מצ׳יינה טאון.","highlights":["שלט BE KOBE","מגדל הנמל","תאורת ערב"],"time_needed":"45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2 Hatobacho, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"להגיע לשקיעה, ולצלם את BE KOBE בבוקר בלי תור","baby_block":null,"tags":["park","harbor","waterfront","photo spot","be kobe","פארק","נמל","טיילת","תמונה","שקיעה","sunset","night view","נוף לילה","port","sea","ים"],"en":{"hype":"A waterfront park with the BE KOBE sign, the red Port Tower and the Maritime Museum, Kobe's postcard.","reality":"An open, pleasant park to stroll, best at sunset when the tower and museum light up. The queue for a BE KOBE photo can be long.","tip":"Shoot the BE KOBE sign early morning with no queue, and the skyline with the tower from the Harborland side in the evening.","baby_notes":"Flat and wide, easy with a stroller. Strong sea wind in winter.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk along the water, take a photo at BE KOBE, pass the earthquake memorial and finish at sunset facing the tower.","special":"All of Kobe's port landmarks in one spot, five minutes' walk from Chinatown.","highlights":["BE KOBE sign","Port Tower","Evening lights"],"time_needed":"45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Come for sunset; shoot BE KOBE in the morning with no queue","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kobe Port Tower","name_ja":"神戸ポートタワー","city":"kobe","area":"Harborland & Meriken","category":"sight","lat":34.6826,"lng":135.1867,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המגדל האדום בצורת שעון חול, סמל העיר, שנפתח מחדש ב-2024 עם מרפסת גג פתוחה.","reality":"תצפית טובה על הנמל וההרים, ומרפסת הגג באוויר הפתוח שווה את התוספת. מתצפית העירייה רואים כמעט את אותו נוף בחינם, אבל בלי המגדל עצמו.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,000, עם מרפסת הגג ¥1,200","tip":"כרטיסים עם שעת כניסה, כדאי לקנות אונליין לפני השקיעה כשיש עומס.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3552.html","https://www.kobe-port-tower.com/en"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעלית עד קומת התצפית. למרפסת הגג עולים במדרגות, עגלה לא עולה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kobe%20Port%20Tower%20Kobe","website_url":"https://www.kobe-port-tower.com/en","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במעלית לקומת התצפית, עוברים בין הקומות עם הנוף, ועולים במדרגות למרפסת הגג הפתוחה.","special":"המגדל מ-1963 עשוי רשת צינורות אדומים, ובלילה הוא נדלק בתאורה מתחלפת.","highlights":["מרפסת הגג הפתוחה","נוף לנמל ולהרים","תאורת לילה"],"time_needed":"45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"5-5 Hatobacho, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":"09:00","closes":"23:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":45,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"לקנות אונליין כרטיס עם שעה לשקיעה, כולל מרפסת הגג","baby_block":null,"tags":["tower","observation deck","view","night view","landmark","מגדל","תצפית","נוף","נוף לילה","סמל העיר","rooftop","גג","port","נמל","sunset","שקיעה"],"en":{"hype":"The red hourglass-shaped tower, the city's symbol, reopened in 2024 with an open rooftop deck.","reality":"A good view of the port and mountains, and the open-air rooftop is worth the extra. City Hall's free deck shows nearly the same view, minus the tower itself.","tip":"Tickets have entry times; buy online before sunset on busy days.","baby_notes":"Lift to the observation floor. The rooftop is up stairs, no stroller.","price":"¥1,000; with rooftop ¥1,200","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Ride up to the observation floor, move between the viewing levels, then climb the stairs to the open rooftop.","special":"Built in 1963 from a lattice of red pipes; at night it glows with changing lights.","highlights":["Open rooftop deck","Port and mountain view","Night lights"],"time_needed":"45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Book a timed ticket online for sunset, rooftop included","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Port of Kobe Earthquake Memorial Park","name_ja":"神戸港震災メモリアルパーク","city":"kobe","area":"Harborland & Meriken","category":"sight","lat":34.6835,"lng":135.189,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"קטע של הרציף שנשאר בדיוק כמו אחרי רעידת האדמה של 1995, עמודי תאורה נוטים ובטון שבור.","reality":"קטן, חינם ומרגש. בכמה דקות מבינים כמה חזקה הייתה הרעידה. עוצרים כאן בדרך במריקן פארק.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"השלטים באנגלית ליד הרציף מסבירים מה קרה פה ב-17 בינואר 1995.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3552.html","https://www.feel-kobe.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שביל שטוח לאורך הרציף, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Port%20of%20Kobe%20Earthquake%20Memorial%20Park%20Kobe","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים לאורך הקטע השבור של הרציף, קוראים את השלטים ומסתכלים על התמונות מאותו יום.","special":"אחד המקומות היחידים שבהם נשאר נזק אמיתי מהרעידה כפי שהיה.","highlights":["הרציף השבור","עמודי התאורה הנוטים","שלטים באנגלית"],"time_needed":"15 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-2 Hatobacho, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":15,"booking":"no","plan_line":"10 דקות, לשלב בטיול במריקן פארק","baby_block":null,"tags":["memorial","earthquake","history","1995","port","אנדרטה","רעידת אדמה","היסטוריה","נמל","זיכרון","hanshin","free","חינם","outdoor","בחוץ"],"en":{"hype":"A stretch of quay left exactly as the 1995 earthquake left it, with tilted lamp posts and broken concrete.","reality":"Small, free and moving. In a few minutes you see how strong the quake was. Stop here on your way through Meriken Park.","tip":"The English signs by the quay explain what happened here on 17 January 1995.","baby_notes":"Flat path along the quay, fine with a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk along the broken section of quay, read the signs and look at the photos from that day.","special":"One of the only places where real quake damage is kept as it was.","highlights":["The broken quay","Tilted lamp posts","English signs"],"time_needed":"15 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"10 minutes; fold it into a Meriken Park walk","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kobe Maritime Museum & Kawasaki Good Times World","name_ja":"神戸海洋博物館・カワサキワールド","city":"kobe","area":"Harborland & Meriken","category":"sight","lat":34.6815,"lng":135.188,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון הנמל עם הגג הלבן בצורת מפרש, ובאותו כרטיס תצוגה של קוואסאקי עם אופנועים, רכבת שינקנסן ומסוק.","reality":"החלק של קוואסאקי הכי כיפי: יושבים על אופנועים ונכנסים לקרון שינקנסן מקורי. החלק הימי ישן יותר. טוב ליום גשום או עם ילדים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥900","tip":"יש כרטיס משולב עם מגדל הנמל, משתלם אם עושים את שניהם.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3552.html","https://kobe-maritime-museum.com/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מבנה נגיש עם מעליות ושירותים.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kobe%20Maritime%20Museum%20%26%20Kawasaki%20Good%20Times%20World%20Kobe","website_url":"https://kobe-maritime-museum.com/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מתחילים בדגמי האוניות וההיסטוריה של הנמל, ועוברים לקוואסאקי ורלד: אופנועים לשבת עליהם, ראש שינקנסן 0 וסימולטורים.","special":"הקרון של שינקנסן מסדרה 0, הראשונה מ-1964, שאפשר להיכנס אליו.","highlights":["קרון שינקנסן 0","אופנועי קוואסאקי","גג המפרש הלבן"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-2 Hatobacho, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":"10:00","closes":"18:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני ומ-29 בדצמבר. כרטיס משולב עם המגדל משתלם","baby_block":null,"tags":["museum","maritime","ships","motorcycles","shinkansen","מוזיאון","ימי","אוניות","אופנועים","שינקנסן","kawasaki","קוואסאקי","trains","רכבות","rainy day","יום גשום","kids","ילדים"],"en":{"hype":"The port museum under the white sail-shaped roof, and on the same ticket Kawasaki's showcase of motorbikes, a bullet train and a helicopter.","reality":"The Kawasaki part is the fun one: sit on the bikes and walk into a real bullet train car. The maritime part is more dated. Good on a rainy day or with kids.","tip":"There's a combo ticket with Port Tower, worth it if you do both.","baby_notes":"Accessible building with lifts and toilets.","price":"¥900","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Start with the ship models and port history, then Kawasaki Good Times World: bikes to sit on, a 0 Series bullet train nose and simulators.","special":"A car from the 0 Series, the very first 1964 bullet train, that you can step inside.","highlights":["0 Series bullet train car","Kawasaki motorbikes","White sail roof"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays and from 29 Dec. Tower combo ticket saves money","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Minatogawa Shrine","name_ja":"湊川神社","city":"kobe","area":"Harborland & Meriken","category":"sight","lat":34.6795,"lng":135.1735,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש גדול ליד תחנת קובה שהמקומיים קוראים לו ״נאנקו-סאן״, לזכר הסמוראי קוסונוקי מסאשיגה.","reality":"מקדש רחב ושקט עם מעט תיירים, ממש ליד הארבורלנד. לא חובה, אבל עצירה נעימה בדרך.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"על תקרת אולם התפילה יש ציורים גדולים של דרקון ופרחים, שווה להרים את הראש.","sources":["https://www.minatogawajinja.or.jp/","https://www.feel-kobe.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חצר רחבה, חלקה מרוצפת, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Minatogawa%20Shrine%20Kobe","website_url":"https://www.minatogawajinja.or.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים דרך השער הגדול, עוברים לאולם הראשי עם ציורי התקרה, ומבקרים בקבר של קוסונוקי בצד המזרחי.","special":"אחד המקדשים החשובים בקובה, ובראש השנה מגיעים אליו מאות אלפי מתפללים.","highlights":["ציורי התקרה","קבר קוסונוקי","השער הגדול"],"time_needed":"20-30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-1-1 Tamondori, Chuo-ku, Kobe","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":25,"booking":"no","plan_line":"5 דקות הליכה מתחנת JR קובה, טוב לשלב עם הארבורלנד","baby_block":null,"tags":["shrine","shinto","samurai","history","מקדש","שינטו","סמוראי","היסטוריה","kusunoki","nanko","temple","quiet","שקט","ceiling paintings","ציורים"],"en":{"hype":"A big shrine by Kobe Station that locals call 'Nanko-san', honouring the samurai Kusunoki Masashige.","reality":"A wide, quiet shrine with few tourists, right next to Harborland. Not essential, but a pleasant stop on the way.","tip":"The worship hall ceiling has large paintings of a dragon and flowers; look up.","baby_notes":"Wide courtyard, partly paved, fine with a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Enter through the big gate, visit the main hall with its ceiling paintings, then Kusunoki's grave on the east side.","special":"One of Kobe's most important shrines; hundreds of thousands come on New Year.","highlights":["Ceiling paintings","Kusunoki's grave","The great gate"],"time_needed":"20-30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"5 min walk from JR Kobe Station; pair with Harborland","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
