osher_note":"Minced pork and pork broth in most bowls.","plan_line":"Open daily until 5:00, good after the bars","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Torigin Honten Nishiki","name_ja":"名古屋コーチン料理 錦三丁目 鳥銀本店","city":"nagoya","area":"Sakae","category":"food","lat":35.170522,"lng":136.905816,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מסעדת קוצ׳ין ותיקה בנישיקי, עם עוף ששוחט בבוקר ומוגש גם כסשימי.","reality":"המקום לנסות סיר קוצ׳ין וסשימי עוף בחמישה סוגים, בחדר שמשקיף על גינה יפנית. יקר יותר ממסעדות יאקיטורי, ומתאים לארוחה רגועה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"להזמין סיר קוצ׳ין לשולחן, זו המנה של המקום. יש גם טבסאקי.","sources":["https://www.nagoya-info.jp/en/gourmet/detail/2/","https://gurunavi.com/en/n827700/rst"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Torigin%20Honten%20Nishiki%20Nagoya","website_url":"http://www.torigin.co.jp/","serves":"סיר קוצ׳ין, מגש של חמישה סוגי סשימי עוף, ומנות קוצ׳ין נוספות.","dishes":["סיר קוצ׳ין","סשימי קוצ׳ין","יאקיטורי"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher":"friendly","kosher_note":"כמעט הכל עוף. סשימי העוף נא, למי שלא אוכל עוף לא מבושל.","address":"Miyaki Bldg, 3-14-22 Nishiki, Naka-ku, Nagoya","opens":"17:00","closes":"22:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":120,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"פתוח כל ערב מ-17:00, בשישי-שבת עד 23:30; להזמין","baby_block":null,"tags":["nagoya cochin","chicken","hot pot","nabe","chicken sashimi","yakitori","japanese garden","dinner","קוצ׳ין","עוף","סיר","נאבה","סשימי עוף","יאקיטורי","ארוחת ערב"],"en":{"hype":"An old Cochin restaurant in Nishiki, with chicken butchered that morning and served even as sashimi.","reality":"The place for Cochin hot pot and a five-kind chicken sashimi platter, in rooms looking onto a Japanese garden. Pricier than yakitori bars, for a calm dinner.","tip":"Order the Cochin hot pot for the table, it's the house dish. They do tebasaki too.","baby_notes":null,"price":null,"serves":"Cochin hot pot, a five-kind chicken sashimi platter and other Cochin dishes.","dishes":["Cochin hot pot","Cochin sashimi","Yakitori"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":"Almost all chicken. The sashimi is raw chicken, if that's an issue.","plan_line":"Open nightly from 17:00, Fri-Sat till 23:30; book","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Maruha Shokudo LACHIC","name_ja":"まるは食堂 ラシック店","city":"nagoya","area":"Sakae","category":"food","lat":35.1675339,"lng":136.9077215,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שרימפס מטוגן ענק משוק טויוהאמה בחצי האי צ׳יטה, בקומה 8 של לאשיק.","reality":"השרימפס כאן אמיתי ועסיסי יותר מהמקומות של התחנה, ויש גם סשימי ודגים מבושלים. מסעדה בקניון, אז קל עם משפחה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"צהריים מ-¥1,000, ערב מ-¥3,000","tip":"בסופ״ש פתוח ברצף 11:00-22:00 בלי הפסקה.","sources":["https://www.gltjp.com/ja/directory/item/16538/","https://www.gltjp.com/en/article/item/20952/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"בתוך קניון לאשיק, יש מעליות. חדר עישון משותף מול הכניסה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Maruha%20Shokudo%20LACHIC%20Nagoya","website_url":"http://www.maruha-net.co.jp/shop/lachic","serves":"אבי פוראי ענק משרימפס של אייצ׳י, סט עם סשימי, ודגים מבושלים.","dishes":["אבי פוראי ענק","סט מארוהה","דג מבושל"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher":"options","kosher_note":"יש סשימי ודגים עם קשקשים. השרימפס והרכיכות בחוץ.","address":"LACHIC 8F, 3-6-1 Sakae, Naka-ku, Nagoya","opens":"11:00","closes":"22:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בימי חול הפסקה 15:00-17:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["ebi fry","fried shrimp","seafood","sashimi","fish","simmered fish","department store","שרימפס מטוגן","אבי פוראי","פירות ים","סשימי","דגים","דג מבושל","קניון"],"en":{"hype":"Giant fried shrimp from Toyohama market on the Chita peninsula, on the 8th floor of LACHIC.","reality":"The shrimp here is meatier than the station versions, and there's sashimi and simmered fish too. A mall restaurant, so easy with family.","tip":"Weekends it's open straight through 11:00-22:00.","baby_notes":"Inside LACHIC with lifts. Shared smoking room opposite the entrance.","price":"Lunch from ¥1,000, dinner from ¥3,000","serves":"Jumbo ebi fry from Aichi shrimp, a set with sashimi, and simmered fish.","dishes":["Jumbo ebi fry","Maruha set","Simmered fish"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":"There's sashimi and scaled fish. Shrimp and shellfish are out.","plan_line":"Weekdays break 15:00-17:00","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Ibasho","name_ja":"いば昇","city":"nagoya","area":"Sakae","category":"food","lat":35.171103,"lng":136.905868,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בית היטסומבושי ותיק בנישיקי, מקום מקומי בלי ההייפ של המקומות הגדולים.","reality":"צלופח טוב בבניין ישן, ותור קצר יותר מבמקומות המפורסמים. סגור בראשון ובשני השני והשלישי של החודש.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"בערב ההזמנה האחרונה ב-20:00, לא להגיע מאוחר.","sources":["https://www.nagoya-info.jp/en/gourmet/detail/88/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ibasho%20Nagoya","website_url":"http://www.ibashou.jp/","serves":"היטסומבושי, צלופח על אורז שאוכלים בשלבים.","dishes":["היטסומבושי"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher":"hard","kosher_note":"המנה העיקרית צלופח.","address":"3-13-22 Nishiki, Naka-ku, Nagoya","opens":"11:00","closes":"20:00","closed_weekdays":[0],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":6