u & Kamimaezu","category":"food","lat":35.160279,"lng":136.90356,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"טונקאטסו עם פירורי לחם ביתיים באוסו, ברשימת 100 הטונקאטסו.","reality":"טונקאטסו מצוין במחיר הוגן, וקרוקטים של סרטנים בשמנת שחוזרים בשבילם. בקומה השנייה חדרי טטאמי למשפחות.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":3.73,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,000-3,000","tip":"להזמין אונליין, בטלפון לא עונים.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/aichi/A2301/A230105/23000039/","https://www.nagoya-info.jp/en/gourmet/detail/100/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"בקומה 2 חדרי טטאמי שמתאימים לילדים קטנים, אסור לעשן.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Suzuya%20Akamon%20Nagoya","website_url":null,"serves":"טונקאטסו בציפוי פירורים ביתי, וקרוקטים של סרטנים בשמנת.","dishes":["טונקאטסו","קרוקט סרטנים"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher":"hard","kosher_note":"חזיר וסרטנים.","address":"3-11-17 Osu, Naka-ku, Nagoya","opens":"11:00","closes":"21:30","closed_weekdays":[4],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":60,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"סגור בחמישי; הפסקה 15:00-17:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["tonkatsu","pork cutlet","katsu","crab cream croquette","panko","osu","local","טונקאטסו","שניצל חזיר","קאטסו","קרוקט","אוסו","מקומי"],"en":{"hype":"Tonkatsu with house-made panko in Osu, on the top-100 tonkatsu list.","reality":"Excellent tonkatsu at a fair price, and crab cream croquettes regulars come back for. Tatami rooms upstairs for families.","tip":"Book online; they don't answer the phone.","baby_notes":"Tatami rooms on the 2nd floor work with small kids, no smoking.","price":"¥1,000-3,000","serves":"Tonkatsu in house panko, and crab cream croquettes.","dishes":["Tonkatsu","Crab cream croquette"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":"Pork and crab.","plan_line":"Closed Thursdays; break 15:00-17:00","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kiharutei Honten","name_ja":"気晴亭 本店","city":"nagoya","area":"Osu & Kamimaezu","category":"food","lat":35.157598,"lng":136.916871,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מיסו קאטסו מ-1945 ליד צורומאי, עם רוטב שמתבשל כבר יותר מ-77 שנה.","reality":"מקום מקומי ושקט יותר מיאבאטון, עם 'שאצ׳יהוקו-דון' ומנות שלא מוצאים בתחנה. רחוק קצת מאוסו, עשר דקות מצורומאי.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"מ-¥1,000","tip":"'טונטון מאבושי' מוגבל ל-15 מנות ביום.","sources":["https://www.gltjp.com/en/directory/item/13480/","https://www.gltjp.com/en/article/item/20952/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש תפריט עם תמונות.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kiharutei%20Honten%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://kiharutei.com/","serves":"מיסו קאטסו, שאצ׳יהוקו-דון וטונטון מאבושי.","dishes":["מיסו קאטסו","שאצ׳יהוקו-דון","טונטון מאבושי"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher":"hard","kosher_note":"הליבה חזיר.","address":"5-21-6 Chiyoda, Naka-ku, Nagoya","opens":"11:00","closes":"22:30","closed_weekdays":[2],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":50,"booking":"no","plan_line":"מזומן בלבד; סגור בשלישי","baby_block":null,"tags":["miso katsu","misokatsu","pork cutlet","tonkatsu","red miso","local","old shop","מיסו קאטסו","שניצל חזיר","טונקאטסו","מיסו אדום","מקומי","מקום ותיק"],"en":{"hype":"Miso katsu since 1945 near Tsurumai, with a sauce simmered for more than 77 years.","reality":"Quieter and more local than Yabaton, with a Shachihoko-don and dishes you won't find at the station. A bit out of Osu, ten minutes from Tsurumai.","tip":"Tonton mabushi is limited to 15 a day.","baby_notes":"Picture menu.","price":"From ¥1,000","serves":"Miso katsu, Shachihoko-don and tonton mabushi.","dishes":["Miso katsu","Shachihoko-don","Tonton mabushi"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":"Pork at the core.","plan_line":"Cash only; closed Tuesdays","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
