oya","area":"Atsuta & Port","category":"food","lat":35.1425,"lng":136.9015,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"קוצ׳ין טהור מאז 1953, שלוש דקות מתחנת קנאיאמה, עם סירי מיסו האצ׳ו וקאיסקי.","reality":"מקום לארוחת קוצ׳ין רצינית ושקטה עם חדרים פרטיים. בצהריים האויאקודון הפרימיום הוא הדרך הזולה לטעום.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"צהריים מ-¥2,000, ערב מ-¥6,000","tip":"להזמין שולחן, ובצהריים לבקש את האויאקודון.","sources":["https://www.gltjp.com/en/directory/item/16706/","https://www.gltjp.com/en/article/item/20952/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חדרים פרטיים, אסור לעשן.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nagoya%20Cochin%20Ichio%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://ichiou.com/","serves":"סירים במיסו האצ׳ו, מיזוטאקי, קאיסקי עונתי, נגימה וצוקונה על פחם, ואויאקודון פרימיום.","dishes":["אויאקודון פרימיום","סיר מיסו","צוקונה"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher":"friendly","kosher_note":"כמעט הכל עוף.","address":"2-2-1 Kanayamacho, Atsuta-ku, Nagoya","opens":"11:30","closes":"22:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":90,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"להזמין; 3 דקות מתחנת קנאיאמה","baby_block":null,"tags":["nagoya cochin","chicken","oyakodon","hot pot","mizutaki","kaiseki","private room","kanayama","קוצ׳ין","עוף","אויאקודון","סיר","מיזוטאקי","קאיסקי","חדר פרטי"],"en":{"hype":"Purebred Cochin since 1953, three minutes from Kanayama station, with Hatcho miso hot pots and kaiseki.","reality":"For a serious, quiet Cochin meal with private rooms. At lunch the premium oyakodon is the cheap way in.","tip":"Book a table, and order the oyakodon at lunch.","baby_notes":"Private rooms, no smoking.","price":"Lunch from ¥2,000, dinner from ¥6,000","serves":"Hatcho miso hot pots, mizutaki, seasonal kaiseki, charcoal negima and tsukune, and premium oyakodon.","dishes":["Premium oyakodon","Miso hot pot","Tsukune"],"t