a-ku, Nagoya","opens":"10:30","closes":"22:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לאכול לפני או אחרי הטירה, סגור 29.12-1.1","baby_block":null,"tags":["food street","nagoya meshi","miso katsu","miso nikomi","hitsumabushi","tebasaki","tofu ice cream","castle","רחוב אוכל","נגויה משי","מיסו קאטסו","מיסו ניקומי","היטסומבושי","טבסאקי","טירת נגויה"],"en":{"hype":"Two food streets by the Nagoya Castle gates, with branches of Yabaton, Yamamotoya, Bincho and more.","reality":"Very handy for Nagoya food right after the castle, but these are chain branches you can also find downtown, and mealtimes get lines.","tip":"The Yoshinao zone (by the main gate) is the old-style one; the Muneharu zone is modern and open till 22:00.","baby_notes":"Open street, easy with a stroller.","price":null,"serves":"Miso katsu, miso nikomi udon, hitsumabushi, tebasaki, ankake spaghetti and tofu soft serve.","dishes":["Miso nikomi","Hitsumabushi","Tofu soft serve"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":"Mixed. Tebasaki, udon and tofu work; miso katsu and eel don't.","plan_line":"Eat before or after the castle; closed Dec 29 to Jan 1","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Coffee House Kako Hanaguruma Honten","name_ja":"コーヒーハウス かこ 花車本店","city":"nagoya","area":"Nagoya Station","category":"cafe","lat":35.169099,"lng":136.890101,"coord_precision":"exact","hype":"הקיסה (בית קפה יפני ותיק) הכי מפורסם בנגויה לסט בוקר, ברשימת 100 בתי הקפה של Tabelog.","reality":"טוסט עבה עם ארבע ריבות ביתיות וקפה טוב, באווירה של שכונה. תור קטן בבוקר, אבל זז מהר.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":3.73,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,000-2,000","tip":"להזמין 'שנטיי רוז'. מזומן בלבד.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/aichi/A2301/A230101/23005509/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"ידידותי לילדים, אסור לעשן.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":