ood cheesecake and mille-feuille, and few seats so it fills fast.","tip":"Online booking works, but come at quiet times.","baby_notes":"Babies welcome, but it's small.","price":"Under ¥1,000","serves":"Coffee from select beans, New York cheesecake, mille-feuille, a sandwich and a morning set.","dishes":["Honduras coffee","New York cheesecake","Mille-feuille"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Wed and 4th Thu; only 14 seats","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Bonbon","name_ja":"洋菓子・喫茶ボンボン","city":"nagoya","area":"Castle & Higashi","category":"cafe","lat":35.177616,"lng":136.914439,"coord_precision":"exact","hype":"קונדיטוריה וקיסה רטרו מ-1949, עם כ-30 עוגות קטנות בוויטרינה וסט בוקר.","reality":"נוסטלגיה של שואה במחירים של פעם. עוגות קטנות וזולות וקפה חזק, ופתוח עד 21:00.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":3.63,"google_score":null,"price":"מ-¥500","tip":"בימי חול עד 10:00 מקבלים טוסט וביצה עם המשקה. 'מארון' היא העוגה הכי מבוקשת.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/aichi/A2301/A230104/23000428/","https://www.gltjp.com/ja/directory/item/13486/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מתאים לילדים, עגלות מתקבלות, אסור לעשן.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bonbon%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://cake-bonbon.com/","serves":"עוגות קטנות, פרפה ופודינג, קפה חזק וסט בוקר.","dishes":["מארון","פודינג","סט בוקר"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher":"friendly","kosher_note":null,"address":"2-1-22 Izumi, Higashi-ku, Nagoya","opens":"08:00","closes":"21:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"מזומן בלבד; בעומס ישיבה מוגבלת לשעה","baby_block":null,"tags":["coffee","kissa","cafe","morning set","breakfast","toast","קפה","בית קפה","קיסה","ארוחת בוקר","סט בוקר","טוסט","cake","pastry","pudding","retro","עוגה","עוגות","פודינג","רטרו"],"en":{"hype":"A retro patisserie and kissa from 1949, with about 30 small cakes in the case and a morning set.","reality":"Showa nostalgia at old-time prices. Small cheap cakes and strong coffee, open until 21:00.","tip":"Weekdays until 10:00 you get toast and egg with your drink. The Marron is the top cake.","baby_notes":"Kid friendly, strollers welcome, no smoking.","price":"From ¥500","serves":"Small cakes, parfaits and pudding, strong coffee and a morning set.","dishes":["Marron","Pudding","Morning set"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Cash only; 60-minute limit when busy","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
