":"מוזיאון בתוך מפעל הנול המקורי של טויוטה, מהמכונות של המשפחה לפני שהתחילו לייצר מכוניות ועד רובוטים של היום.","reality":"הרבה יותר טוב ממה שנשמע: מכונות ענק פועלות מול העיניים והדגמות חיות. גם מי שלא אוהב מכוניות יוצא מרוצה.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כ-¥1,000 למבוגר","tip":"כדאי לתפוס את ההדגמות של מכונות האריגה, הן רצות כמה פעמים ביום.","sources":["https://www.tcmit.org/english/","https://www.gltjp.com/en/directory/item/11763/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"אולמות ענקיים ושטוחים, מעליות ומקום רחב לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Toyota%20Commemorative%20Museum%20of%20Industry%20and%20Technology%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.tcmit.org/english/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מתחילים באולם הטקסטיל עם הנולים הפועלים, עוברים לאולם הרכב עם פס ייצור ורובוטים, ובסוף מרכז הניסויים לילדים.","special":"הכול בבניין הלבנים האדומות המקורי של 1911, והמכונות באמת מופעלות מולכם.","highlights":["נולים פועלים","פס ייצור רכב","רובוטים","בניין הלבנים"],"time_needed":"2-3 שעות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"4-1-35 Noritakeshinmachi, Nishi-ku, Nagoya","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":150,"booking":"no","plan_line":"שווה לפחות שעתיים, הכניסה האחרונה ב-16:30","baby_block":null,"tags":["museum","toyota","cars","automobile","looms","textile","robots","industry","engineering","מוזיאון","טויוטה","מכוניות","רכב","נולים","טקסטיל","רובוטים","תעשייה","הנדסה"],"en":{"hype":"A museum inside Toyota's original loom factory, from the family's weaving machines to today's car robots.","reality":"Far better than it sounds: huge machines running in front of you and live demos. Even people who don't care about cars love it.","tip":"Catch the loom demonstrations, they run several times a day.","baby_notes":"Huge flat halls, lifts and plenty of room for a stroller.","price":"About ¥1,000 per adult","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Start in the textile hall with working looms, move to the car hall with an assembly line and robots, and end at the hands-on science area.","special":"It is all in the original 1911 red-brick factory, and the machines really run.","highlights":["Working looms","Car assembly line","Robots","Red-brick hall"],"time_needed":"2-3 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Give it at least two hours; last entry 16:30","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Sky Promenade","name_ja":"スカイプロムナード","city":"nagoya","area":"Nagoya Station","category":"sight","lat":35.1705,"lng":136.8857,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"תצפית פתוחה לשמיים בקומות 44-46 של מידלנד סקוור, מול תחנת נגויה.","reality":"הנוף בלילה יפה ופתוח, ואין צורך להזמין. בעיר שטוחה כמו נגויה זו התצפית הכי גבוהה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כ-¥1,000 למבוגר","tip":"בשקיעה ובלילה זה הכי יפה; ביום עם רוח חזקה התצפית לפעמים נסגרת.","sources":["https://www.walkerplus.com/spot/ar0623s16078/price.html","https://japanactivity.com/attractions/nagoya/sky-promenade","https://www.midland-square.com/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעלית עד למעלה, מתאים לעגלה; בחוץ קר ויש רוח בדצמבר.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Midland%20Square%20Sky%20Promenade%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.midland-square.com/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במעלית לקומה 44, מטיילים במסלול הפתוח בין הקומות ומסתכלים על העיר ועל התחנה מלמעלה.","special":"תצפית חיצונית בלי זכוכית באמצע הדרך, בגובה של כ-220 מטר.","highlights":["נוף לילה","מסלול פתוח","נוף לתחנה"],"time_needed":"כ-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"4-7-1 Meieki, Nakamura-ku, Nagoya","opens":"11:00","closes":"22:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"night","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"הכי יפה אחרי השקיעה, להביא שכבה חמה כי זה בחוץ","baby_block":null,"tags":["observation deck","view","night view","skyscraper","sunset","city view","תצפית","נוף","נוף לילה","גורד שחקים","שקיעה","מגדל","midland square","מידלנד סקוור"],"en":{"hype":"An open-air observation deck on floors 44-46 of Midland Square, across from Nagoya Station.","reality":"The night view is wide and open and there is no need to book. In a flat city like Nagoya it is the highest lookout.","tip":"Best at sunset and after dark; it sometimes closes on very windy days.","baby_notes":"Lift all the way up, fine with a stroller; cold and windy outside in December.","price":"About ¥1,000 per adult","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Ride the lift to floor 44, walk the open-air path between floors and look down over the city and the station.","special":"Open-air viewing at about 220 m.","highlights":["Night view","Open-air walkway","Station view"],"time_needed":"About 45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Best after sunset; bring a warm layer, it is outdoors","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Shikemichi","name_ja":"四間道","city":"nagoya","area":"Nagoya Station","category":"sight","lat":35.1777,"lng":136.8935,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רחוב סוחרים מהמאה ה-18 עם מחסנים לבנים ובתי עץ, עשר דקות מהתחנה.","reality":"רחוב קצר ושקט, יותר נעים מאשר מרשים. היום יש בו בתי קפה ומסעדות קטנות בבתים הישנים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"משלבים עם רחוב אנדוג׳י הסמוך באותו טיול.","sources":["https://www.nagoya-info.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"רחוב שטוח, עגלה עוברת בקלות.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shikemichi%20Nagoya","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים לאורך המחסנים הלבנים, מציצים למקדשים הזעירים על הגגות ועוצרים לקפה באחד הבתים הישנים.","special":"המחסנים נבנו גבוה ומאבן אחרי שריפה גדולה ב-1700, ושרדו את המלחמה.","highlights":["מחסני קורה לבנים","מקדשי גג","בתי עץ ישנים"],"time_needed":"כחצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-chome Nagono, Nishi-ku, Nagoya","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עשר דקות הליכה מתחנת נגויה או מתחנת קוקוסאי סנטר","baby_block":null,"tags":["historic street","old town","merchant houses","storehouses","kura","walk","רחוב היסטורי","עיר עתיקה","בתי סוחרים","מחסנים","טיול רגלי","בתי עץ","old houses","בתים ישנים"],"en":{"hype":"An 18th-century merchant street of white storehouses and wooden houses, ten minutes from the station.","reality":"A short, quiet street, more pleasant than grand. The old houses now hold small cafes and restaurants.","tip":"Pair it with Endoji shopping street next door.","baby_notes":"Flat street, easy with a stroller.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk along the white storehouses, spot the tiny rooftop shrines and stop for coffee in one of the old houses.","special":"The stone-based storehouses were built after a big fire in 1700 and survived the war.","highlights":["White kura storehouses","Rooftop shrines","Old wooden houses"],"time_needed":"About 30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"10 minutes walk from Nagoya Station or Kokusai Center Station","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Toyokuni Shrine","name_ja":"豊国神社","city":"nagoya","area":"Nagoya Station","category":"sight","lat":35.1678,"lng":136.8634,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש בפארק נקאמורה, במקום שבו נולד טויוטומי הידיושי, אחד משלושת מאחדי יפן.","reality":"מקדש שכונתי פשוט בפארק נעים; שווה בעיקר למי שמתעניין בהיסטוריה של הסמוראים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"השער האדום הענק בדרך מתחנת נקאמורה קואן הוא אחד הגדולים ביפן.","sources":["https://www.nagoya-info.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"פארק שטוח עם שבילים, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Toyokuni%20Shrine%20Nakamura%20Park%20Nagoya","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים מתחת לשער האדום הענק, מטיילים בפארק נקאמורה ונכנסים למקדש ולאנדרטת מקום ההולדת של הידיושי.","special":"כאן נולד הידיושי, האיש שאיחד את יפן במאה ה-16.","highlights":["השער האדום הענק","מקום הולדת הידיושי","פארק נקאמורה"],"time_needed":"כחצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Nakamura Park, Nakamura-cho, Nakamura-ku, Nagoya","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"חמש דקות הליכה מתחנת נקאמורה קואן בקו היגאשיאמה","baby_block":null,"tags":["shrine","park","samurai","history","hideyoshi","torii","מקדש","פארק","סמוראים","היסטוריה","הידיושי","שער טורי","שינטו","shinto"],"en":{"hype":"A shrine in Nakamura Park on the spot where Toyotomi Hideyoshi, one of Japan's three unifiers, was born.","reality":"A simple neighbourhood shrine in a nice park; mostly for people into samurai history.","tip":"The giant red torii on the way from Nakamura Koen Station is one of the biggest in Japan.","baby_notes":"Flat park paths, easy with a stroller.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk under the huge red torii, stroll Nakamura Park and visit the shrine and Hideyoshi's birthplace marker.","special":"Hideyoshi, who unified Japan in the 16th century, was born here.","highlights":["Giant red torii","Hideyoshi's birthplace","Nakamura Park"],"time_needed":"About 30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"5 minutes walk from Nakamura Koen Station on the Higashiyama line","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Oasis 21","name_ja":"オアシス21","city":"nagoya","area":"Sakae","category":"sight","lat":35.1711,"lng":136.9105,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גג זכוכית בצורת חללית מעל כיכר בסאקאה, עם בריכת מים שעולים עליה ונוף למגדל מיראי.","reality":"ביום זו בעיקר תחנת אוטובוס עם חנויות; בערב, כשהגג מואר, זה יפה באמת וחינם.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"לבוא אחרי החשכה, כשהגג מואר ומגדל מיראי מאחוריו.","sources":["https://www.sakaepark.co.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעליות עד הגג, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Oasis%2021%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.sakaepark.co.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במעלית ל\"ספינת המים\" על הגג, מקיפים את הבריכה הרדודה ומצלמים את מגדל מיראי, ואז יורדים לחנויות של ג׳יבלי ופוקימון בכיכר שמתחת.","special":"מסלול הליכה סביב בריכה על גג זכוכית בגובה 14 מטר.","highlights":["ספינת המים","נוף למגדל מיראי","תאורת לילה"],"time_needed":"כחצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-11-1 Higashisakura, Higashi-ku, Nagoya","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"הכי יפה אחרי החשכה, משלבים עם מגדל מיראי ופארק היסאיה אודורי","baby_block":null,"tags":["architecture","rooftop","night view","plaza","illumination","free","photo spot","ארכיטקטורה","גג","נוף לילה","כיכר","תאורה","חינם","צילום","spaceship","חללית"],"en":{"hype":"A spaceship-shaped glass roof over a plaza in Sakae, with a water pool you walk around and a view of the Mirai Tower.","reality":"By day it is mostly a bus terminal with shops; in the evening, lit up, it is lovely and free.","tip":"Come after dark when the roof is lit with the tower behind it.","baby_notes":"Lifts up to the roof, easy with a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Take the lift to the \"Spaceship-Aqua\" roof, walk around the shallow pool, photograph the Mirai Tower, then go down to the shops in the plaza below.","special":"A walkway around a pool on a glass roof 14 m up.","highlights":["Spaceship-Aqua roof","Mirai Tower view","Night lights"],"time_needed":"About 30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Best after dark; pair with Mirai Tower and Hisaya-odori Park","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Chubu Electric Power MIRAI TOWER","name_ja":"中部電力 MIRAI TOWER","city":"nagoya","area":"Sakae","category":"sight","lat":35.1726,"lng":136.9085,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מגדל הטלוויזיה הוותיק של יפן מ-1954, היום אתר מורשת לאומי עם תצפית ומלון.","reality":"התצפית נמוכה יחסית, 90-100 מטר, אבל הנוף על השדרה הירוקה של סאקאה נחמד. המגדל יפה יותר מבחוץ מאשר הנוף מבפנים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,300 למבוגר","tip":"בקופה לא תמיד מקבלים כרטיס אשראי, כדאי להחזיק מזומן.","sources":["https://www.aichinow.pref.aichi.jp/spots/detail/97/","https://www.nagoya-info.jp/spot/detail/9/","https://www.nagoya-tv-tower.co.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעלית לתצפית, מתאים לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Chubu%20Electric%20Power%20MIRAI%20TOWER%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.nagoya-tv-tower.co.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים לתצפית הסגורה ולמרפסת הפתוחה מעליה, מסתכלים לאורך פארק היסאיה אודורי, ויורדים לבית הקפה והחנות בבסיס.","special":"מגדל השידור הראשון ביפן, והראשון שהוכרז כנכס תרבות לאומי.","highlights":["המרפסת הפתוחה","נוף לשדרה","תאורת לילה"],"time_needed":"כ-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-6-15 Nishiki, Naka-ku, Nagoya","opens":"10:00","closes":"21:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"להחזיק מזומן לכרטיס, ובשבת פתוח עד 21:40","baby_block":null,"tags":["tower","observation deck","tv tower","view","night view","landmark","מגדל","תצפית","מגדל טלוויזיה","נוף","נוף לילה","ציון דרך","nagoya tv tower","מגדל נגויה"],"en":{"hype":"Japan's oldest TV tower from 1954, now a national heritage site with a lookout and a hotel.","reality":"The deck is fairly low at 90-100 m, but the view down Sakae's green avenue is nice. The tower looks better from outside than the view from inside.","tip":"The ticket desk may not take cards, so carry cash.","baby_notes":"Lift to the deck, fine with a stroller.","price":"¥1,300 per adult","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go up to the indoor deck and the open-air balcony above it, look along Hisaya-odori Park, then visit the cafe and shop at the base.","special":"Japan's first broadcast tower and the first to be named a national cultural property.","highlights":["Open-air balcony","Avenue view","Night lights"],"time_needed":"About 45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Carry cash for the ticket; open until 21:40 on Saturdays","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hisaya-odori Park","name_ja":"久屋大通公園","city":"nagoya","area":"Sakae","category":"sight","lat":35.1735,"lng":136.9083,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שדרה ירוקה ארוכה במרכז סאקאה, עם דשא, חנויות ובתי קפה סביב מגדל מיראי.","reality":"מקום טוב לנשום בין קניות, לא יעד בפני עצמו. בדצמבר יש בו בדרך כלל תאורות חג.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"החלק הצפוני סביב המגדל (RAYARD) הוא הכי מטופח, עם שירותים ובתי קפה.","sources":["https://www.nagoya-info.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"דשא ושבילים רחבים, שירותים בחנויות לאורך הפארק.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hisaya-odori%20Park%20Nagoya","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מטיילים לאורך הדשא מהמגדל צפונה, עוצרים לקפה באחד הביתנים ומחכים לתאורת הערב.","special":"פארק צר וארוך באמצע הדאונטאון, עם נוף ישיר למגדל.","highlights":["נוף למגדל מיראי","מדשאות","חנויות RAYARD"],"time_needed":"כחצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-5 Nishiki, Naka-ku, Nagoya","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"מקום טוב להפסקה עם התינוק בין הקניות בסאקאה","baby_block":null,"tags":["park","lawn","green space","walk","shops","cafes","illumination","פארק","מדשאה","שדרה","טיול","חנויות","בתי קפה","תאורה","picnic","פיקניק"],"en":{"hype":"A long green strip in central Sakae with lawns, shops and cafes around the Mirai Tower.","reality":"A good breather between shopping, not a destination on its own. In December there are usually holiday lights.","tip":"The northern part around the tower (RAYARD) is the best kept, with toilets and cafes.","baby_notes":"Lawns and wide paths; toilets in the shops along the park.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the lawns north from the tower, stop for coffee at one of the pavilions and wait for the evening lights.","special":"A narrow park through the middle of downtown with a straight view of the tower.","highlights":["Mirai Tower view","Lawns","RAYARD shops"],"time_needed":"About 30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"A good stop with the baby between Sakae shopping","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Nagoya City Science Museum","name_ja":"名古屋市科学館","city":"nagoya","area":"Sakae","category":"experience","lat":35.1648,"lng":136.8994,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון מדע עם אחד הפלנטריומים הגדולים בעולם, בתוך כדור כסף ענק, וחדר סופת טורנדו.","reality":"הפלנטריום מרשים מאוד גם בלי להבין יפנית, אבל הכרטיסים נגמרים מוקדם. התערוכות עצמן מכוונות לילדים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,000 למבוגר כולל פלנטריום, ¥500 תערוכות בלבד","tip":"כרטיסי הפלנטריום נמכרים לפי שעות, ובימים עמוסים נגמרים עד הצהריים.","sources":["https://www.ncsm.city.nagoya.jp/","https://www.aichinow.pref.aichi.jp/spots/detail/16/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעליות וחדר הנקה, נוח לעגלה; בפלנטריום חושך מלא ושקט, תינוק שבוכה יכול להפריע.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nagoya%20City%20Science%20Museum%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.ncsm.city.nagoya.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"קונים כרטיס לפלנטריום בהגעה, ובזמן ההמתנה עוברים בין התערוכות: סופת הטורנדו, חדר הקור במינוס 30 וסליל הברק.","special":"כיפת פלנטריום בקוטר 35 מטר, מהגדולות בעולם.","highlights":["הפלנטריום","חדר הטורנדו","חדר הקור","הדגמת ברק"],"time_needed":"2-3 שעות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-17-1 Sakae, Naka-ku, Nagoya","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-18","2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":150,"booking":"no","plan_line":"להגיע בפתיחה כדי לקבל כרטיס לפלנטריום","baby_block":null,"tags":["science museum","planetarium","stars","space","tornado","kids","museum","מוזיאון מדע","פלנטריום","כוכבים","חלל","טורנדו","ילדים","מוזיאון","astronomy","אסטרונומיה"],"en":{"hype":"A science museum with one of the world's biggest planetariums inside a giant silver ball, plus an indoor tornado.","reality":"The planetarium is impressive even without Japanese, but tickets run out early. The exhibits are aimed at kids.","tip":"Planetarium tickets are sold by time slot and on busy days are gone by midday.","baby_notes":"Lifts and a nursing room, easy with a stroller; the planetarium is fully dark and quiet, a crying baby will be noticed.","price":"¥1,000 per adult with the planetarium, ¥500 exhibits only","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Buy a planetarium slot when you arrive, and while you wait see the tornado, the minus-30 cold room and the lightning coil.","special":"A 35 m planetarium dome, among the largest in the world.","highlights":["Planetarium","Tornado lab","Deep-freeze room","Lightning show"],"time_needed":"2-3 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Arrive at opening to get a planetarium ticket","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Osu Kannon","name_ja":"大須観音","city":"nagoya","area":"Osu & Kamimaezu","category":"sight","lat":35.1592,"lng":136.8995,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש בודהיסטי אדום ובולט בקצה אזור הקניות של אוסו, עם יונים, עשן קטורת ושוק עתיקות פעמיים בחודש.","reality":"המקדש עצמו נבנה מחדש אחרי המלחמה והביקור קצר; הוא שער טוב לרחובות אוסו, ושווה במיוחד ביום השוק.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"ב-18 וב-28 לכל חודש יש שוק עתיקות ופשפשים מול המקדש.","sources":["https://www.osu-kannon.jp/","https://nagoyabuzz.com/the-osu-antique-market"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מדרגות למבנה הראשי; החצר שטוחה ונוחה לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Osu%20Kannon%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.osu-kannon.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במדרגות לאולם האדום, מפזרים קטורת, ומשם נכנסים לרחובות המקורים של אוסו.","special":"בספרייה של המקדש שמור עותק קדום של ה\"קוג׳יקי\", ספר ההיסטוריה העתיק ביפן.","highlights":["האולם האדום","שוק העתיקות","כניסה לרחובות אוסו"],"time_needed":"כרבע שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-21-47 Osu, Naka-ku, Nagoya","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":20,"booking":"no","plan_line":"ב-18 וב-28 בחודש יש שוק עתיקות, להגיע בבוקר","baby_block":null,"tags":["temple","buddhist","kannon","pigeons","incense","antique market","osu","מקדש","בודהיסטי","קאנון","יונים","קטורת","שוק עתיקות","אוסו","red temple","מקדש אדום"],"en":{"hype":"A bright red Buddhist temple at the edge of the Osu shopping area, with pigeons, incense smoke and an antique market twice a month.","reality":"The temple was rebuilt after the war and a visit is short; it is a good gateway to Osu, best on market days.","tip":"On the 18th and 28th of each month an antique and flea market fills the grounds.","baby_notes":"Stairs up to the main hall; the courtyard is flat and fine for a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Climb the steps to the red hall, waft some incense, then head into Osu's covered streets.","special":"The temple library holds an early copy of the Kojiki, Japan's oldest history book.","highlights":["Red main hall","Antique market","Gateway to Osu"],"time_needed":"About 15 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Antique market on the 18th and 28th; come in the morning","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Banshoji Temple","name_ja":"万松寺","city":"nagoya","area":"Osu & Kamimaezu","category":"sight","lat":35.1606,"lng":136.903,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש בלב רחובות אוסו, שבו מתקיים מופע בובה מכנית של אודה נובונאגה, וגם מופע מים ואור של דרקון לבן.","reality":"המקדש מודרני ונראה כמו בניין, אבל מופע הבובה הקצר משעשע וחינם. שווה לתזמן אם כבר באוסו.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"בובת נובונאגה פועלת ב-10:00, 12:00, 14:00, 16:00 ו-18:00, ומופע הדרקון בשעות האי-זוגיות.","sources":["https://www.nagoya-info.jp/spot/detail/71/","https://aichinow.pref.aichi.jp/en/spots/detail/3621/","https://www.banshoji.or.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"הבובה בחזית הרחוב, נגיש עם עגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Banshoji%20Temple%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.banshoji.or.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מגיעים כמה דקות לפני השעה העגולה ועומדים מול הבובה המכנית של נובונאגה, ואחר כך מציצים למופע הדרקון הלבן.","special":"בובת קאראקורי שמשחזרת את נובונאגה זורק קטורת בהלוויה של אביו, סצנה מפורסמת מכאן בדיוק.","highlights":["בובת נובונאגה","מופע הדרקון הלבן"],"time_needed":"כרבע שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-29-12 Osu, Naka-ku, Nagoya","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":15,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בובת נובונאגה רק בשעות זוגיות: 10, 12, 14, 16, 18","baby_block":null,"tags":["temple","karakuri","mechanical doll","puppet","nobunaga","samurai","dragon","show","מקדש","קאראקורי","בובה מכנית","בובות","נובונאגה","סמוראים","דרקון","מופע","osu","אוסו"],"en":{"hype":"A temple in the middle of Osu with a mechanical Oda Nobunaga doll show and a white-dragon water and light show.","reality":"The temple is modern and looks like an office block, but the short doll show is fun and free. Worth timing if you are in Osu anyway.","tip":"The Nobunaga doll runs at 10:00, 12:00, 14:00, 16:00 and 18:00; the dragon show on the odd hours.","baby_notes":"The doll faces the street, easy with a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Arrive a few minutes before the hour and stand in front of the Nobunaga doll, then catch the white-dragon show.","special":"A karakuri doll replays Nobunaga throwing incense at his father's funeral, a famous scene that happened right here.","highlights":["Nobunaga doll","White-dragon show"],"time_needed":"About 15 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Nobunaga doll on even hours only: 10, 12, 14, 16, 18","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Nagoya Castle","name_ja":"名古屋城","city":"nagoya","area":"Castle & Higashi","category":"sight","lat":35.1856,"lng":136.8991,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"הטירה של שושלת טוקוגאווה עם דגי הזהב על הגג, וארמון הונמארו שנבנה מחדש בעץ ובציורי זהב.","reality":"המגדל הראשי סגור לפנים כבר שנים בגלל שיפוץ לעץ, ורואים אותו רק מבחוץ. הארמון המשוחזר הוא הסיבה האמיתית לבוא, והוא יפה מאוד.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥500 למבוגר","tip":"בכניסה לארמון חולצים נעליים ונותנים להם שקית; כדאי גרביים חמות בדצמבר.","sources":["https://www.nagoyajo.city.nagoya.jp/en","https://www.nagoyabuzz.com/nagoya-castle/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"השטח גדול עם חצץ ושבילים, עגלה עוברת; בתוך הארמון עגלות לא נכנסות, צריך מנשא.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nagoya%20Castle%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.nagoyajo.city.nagoya.jp/en","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים בשער המזרחי, עוברים בארמון הונמארו בגרביים בין חדרים מצוירים בזהב, מצלמים את המגדל עם דגי הזהב מהחומה, ומסיימים בקינשאצ׳י יוקוצ׳ו לאוכל.","special":"הארמון שוחזר אחד לאחד לפי תצלומים ושרטוטים מלפני המלחמה, כולל ציורי הקיר על רקע זהב.","highlights":["ארמון הונמארו","דגי הזהב על הגג","החומות והחפיר","קינשאצ׳י יוקוצ׳ו"],"time_needed":"שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-1 Honmaru, Naka-ku, Nagoya","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":120,"booking":"no","plan_line":"המגדל הראשי סגור לפנים; לבנות את הביקור סביב ארמון הונמארו","baby_block":"בארמון אין עגלות, רק מנשא","tags":["castle","palace","samurai","tokugawa","golden shachihoko","history","gardens","moat","טירה","ארמון","סמוראים","טוקוגאווה","דגי זהב","היסטוריה","חפיר","חומות","honmaru","הונמארו"],"en":{"hype":"The Tokugawa castle with golden fish on the roof and the Honmaru Palace rebuilt in wood and gold-leaf paintings.","reality":"The main keep has been closed inside for years for a wooden rebuild and you only see it from outside. The rebuilt palace is the real reason to come, and it is beautiful.","tip":"You take your shoes off for the palace and carry them in a bag; warm socks help in December.","baby_notes":"Big grounds with gravel and paths, a stroller copes; no strollers inside the palace, bring a carrier.","price":"¥500 per adult","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Enter by the East Gate, walk the Honmaru Palace in socks past gold-painted rooms, photograph the keep and its golden fish from the walls, and finish at Kinshachi Yokocho for food.","special":"The palace was rebuilt exactly from prewar photos and plans, gold-background wall paintings included.","highlights":["Honmaru Palace","Golden shachihoko","Walls and moat","Kinshachi Yokocho"],"time_needed":"2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"The main keep is closed inside; plan the visit around the palace","baby_block":"No strollers inside the palace, carrier only"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Nagoya City Hall","name_ja":"名古屋市役所","city":"nagoya","area":"Castle & Higashi","category":"sight","lat":35.1815,"lng":136.9064,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בניין העירייה מ-1933 עם מגדל בסגנון טירה, ולידו משרדי מחוז אייצ׳י בסגנון דומה.","reality":"מבנה יפה לצילום בדרך לטירה, לא יותר. בימי חול אפשר להציץ למבואה המפוארת.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"יוצאים בתחנת שיאקושו ועוברים ליד שני הבניינים בדרך לשער המזרחי של הטירה.","sources":["https://www.nagoya-info.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מדרכות רחבות, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nagoya%20City%20Hall%20Nagoya","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עומדים מול שני הבניינים לצילום, ובימי חול נכנסים לראות את המבואה והמדרגות משיש.","special":"ארכיטקטורה מערבית עם גג יפני, סגנון של שנות ה-30 שנשמר כנכס תרבות.","highlights":["מגדל השעון","משרדי מחוז אייצ׳י","המבואה"],"time_needed":"כרבע שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-1-1 Sannomaru, Naka-ku, Nagoya","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":15,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עצירה קצרה בדרך מתחנת שיאקושו לטירה","baby_block":null,"tags":["architecture","city hall","historic building","1930s","photo spot","ארכיטקטורה","עירייה","בניין היסטורי","שנות ה-30","צילום","בניין","clock tower","מגדל שעון"],"en":{"hype":"The 1933 city hall with a castle-style tower, next to the Aichi prefectural office in a similar style.","reality":"A nice photo on the way to the castle, nothing more. On weekdays you can peek into the grand lobby.","tip":"Exit at Shiyakusho Station and pass both buildings on the way to the castle's East Gate.","baby_notes":"Wide pavements, easy with a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Stand across from the two buildings for a photo and on weekdays step into the marble lobby.","special":"Western architecture with a Japanese roof, a 1930s style kept as a cultural property.","highlights":["Clock tower","Aichi prefectural office","The lobby"],"time_needed":"About 15 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"A short stop between Shiyakusho Station and the castle","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Tokugawa Art Museum","name_ja":"徳川美術館","city":"nagoya","area":"Castle & Higashi","category":"sight","lat":35.1846,"lng":136.934,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אוסף האוצרות של משפחת טוקוגאווה מאוֹוארי: חרבות, שריונות, כלי תה, ומגילת סיפור גנג׳י העתיקה.","reality":"אחד ממוזיאוני הסמוראים הטובים ביפן, עם הסברים באנגלית. מגילת גנג׳י המקורית מוצגת רק כמה שבועות בשנה, ושאר הזמן יש העתק.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"בסוף דצמבר ובתחילת ינואר המוזיאון סגור בדרך כלל, כדאי לבדוק את התאריכים באתר.","sources":["https://tokugawa-art-museum.jp/en/usage/getting-here","https://www.tokyoartbeat.com/en/venues/-/the-tokugawa-art-museum","https://tokugawa-art-museum.jp/en"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעליות ומעברים רחבים; שקט מאוד בפנים.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tokugawa%20Art%20Museum%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://tokugawa-art-museum.jp/en","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין חדרי החרבות והשריונות, חדר תה משוחזר ובמת נו, וממשיכים בשער המשותף לגן טוקוגאווה-אן.","special":"אוסף שהגיע ישר מבית הדאימיו, כולל חפצים שהיו של טוקוגאווה אייאסו עצמו.","highlights":["חרבות ושריונות","חדר התה","במת הנו","מגילת גנג׳י"],"time_needed":"שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1017 Tokugawa-cho, Higashi-ku, Nagoya","opens":"10:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בסוף דצמבר ותחילת ינואר, לבדוק תאריכים באתר לפני","baby_block":null,"tags":["museum","samurai","swords","armor","tokugawa","tea ceremony","genji","art","history","מוזיאון","סמוראים","חרבות","שריון","טוקוגאווה","טקס תה","גנג׳י","אמנות","היסטוריה","katana","קטאנה"],"en":{"hype":"The treasures of the Owari Tokugawa family: swords, armour, tea utensils and the ancient Tale of Genji scrolls.","reality":"One of the best samurai museums in Japan, with English labels. The original Genji scroll is shown only a few weeks a year; otherwise a replica.","tip":"It usually closes from late December to early January; check the dates on the website.","baby_notes":"Lifts and wide halls; very quiet inside.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk through the rooms of swords and armour, a rebuilt tea room and a Noh stage, then go through the shared gate into Tokugawa-en garden.","special":"The collection came straight from the daimyo household, including pieces that belonged to Tokugawa Ieyasu himself.","highlights":["Swords and armour","Tea room","Noh stage","Genji scrolls"],"time_needed":"1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed late Dec to early Jan; check the dates online first","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
where not exists (select 1 from place_library p where p.city = x.city and lower(p.name) = lower(x.name));
insert into place_library (name, name_ja, city, area, category, lat, lng, coord_precision, hype, reality, verdict, tabelog_score, google_score, price, tip, sources, audience, baby_notes, local_pick, maps_url, website_url, serves, dishes, todo, special, highlights, time_needed, kosher, kosher_note, address, opens, closes, closed_weekdays, closed_dates, open_dates, best_time, visit_mins, booking, plan_line, baby_block, tags, en, facts_at, facts_sure, active)
select x.name, x.name_ja, x.city, x.area, x.category, x.lat, x.lng, x.coord_precision, x.hype, x.reality, x.verdict, x.tabelog_score, x.google_score, x.price, x.tip, x.sources, x.audience, x.baby_notes, x.local_pick, x.maps_url, x.website_url, x.serves, x.dishes, x.todo, x.special, x.highlights, x.time_needed, x.kosher, x.kosher_note, x.address, x.opens, x.closes, x.closed_weekdays, x.closed_dates, x.open_dates, x.best_time, x.visit_mins, x.booking, x.plan_line, x.baby_block, x.tags, x.en, x.facts_at, x.facts_sure, false from jsonb_populate_recordset(null::place_library, $cards$[{"name":"Tokugawaen","name_ja":"徳川園","city":"nagoya","area":"Castle & Higashi","category":"sight","lat":35.1851,"lng":136.933,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גן יפני מסורתי עם אגם, מפל וגשרים, צמוד למוזיאון טוקוגאווה.","reality":"גן יפה ומטופח במחיר סמלי, פחות צפוף מגני קיוטו. בדצמבר עוד נשארים עלי סתיו אדומים בתחילת החודש.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כ-¥300 למבוגר","tip":"קונים כרטיס משולב עם מוזיאון טוקוגאווה וחוסכים.","sources":["https://www.tokugawaen.aichi.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חלק מהשבילים עם מדרגות ואבנים; העגלה עוברת בשביל הראשי סביב האגם.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tokugawaen%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.tokugawaen.aichi.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מקיפים את אגם ריוסן-קו, עוברים על הגשרים ליד המפל, ועוצרים בבית התה לתה ירוק.","special":"גן בסגנון של אחוזת דאימיו, עם מפל ועמק קטן באמצע העיר.","highlights":["האגם והקוי","המפל","גשר העץ","עלי הסתיו"],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1001 Tokugawa-cho, Higashi-ku, Nagoya","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:30","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"כרטיס משולב עם המוזיאון הסמוך זול יותר","baby_block":null,"tags":["japanese garden","garden","pond","koi","waterfall","autumn leaves","teahouse","גן יפני","גן","אגם","דגי קוי","מפל","עלי שלכת","בית תה","tokugawa","טוקוגאווה"],"en":{"hype":"A traditional Japanese garden with a pond, waterfall and bridges, next to the Tokugawa Art Museum.","reality":"A lovely, well-kept garden for little money and far less crowded than Kyoto. Early December still has some red autumn leaves.","tip":"Buy the combined ticket with the Tokugawa Art Museum to save.","baby_notes":"Some paths have steps and stones; the stroller manages the main loop around the pond.","price":"About ¥300 per adult","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk around Ryusen-ko pond, cross the bridges by the waterfall and stop at the teahouse for green tea.","special":"A daimyo-estate style garden with a waterfall and small valley in the middle of the city.","highlights":["Pond and koi","Waterfall","Wooden bridge","Autumn leaves"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"The combined ticket with the museum next door is cheaper","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Cultural Path Futaba Museum","name_ja":"文化のみち二葉館","city":"nagoya","area":"Castle & Higashi","category":"sight","lat":35.1851,"lng":136.9182,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בית בסגנון מערבי עם גג כתום ויטראז׳ים, שהיה ביתה של קאוואקאמי סאדאיאקו, השחקנית היפנית הראשונה.","reality":"בית קטן ויפה שמגלה את נגויה של תחילת המאה ה-20; מתאים למי שאוהב ארכיטקטורה ובתים ישנים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כ-¥200","tip":"הבית בשכונת שומוקו, ושווה להמשיך ברגל בין הבתים הישנים של \"דרך התרבות\" לכיוון הטירה.","sources":["https://www.nagoya-info.jp/en/spot/detail/32.html","https://barrierfree.city.nagoya.jp/en/facilities/detail/2b788f6c-0daf-4539-a18e-6d9b358f8885","https://www.futabakan.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש מעלית; בבית חולצים נעליים.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Cultural%20Path%20Futaba%20Museum%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.futabakan.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בחדרי הבית, באולם עם הוויטראז׳ והמדרגות המעוגלות, וממשיכים לטייל בשכונה.","special":"ויטראז׳ים מקוריים מתקופת טאישו ובית שמשלב מערב ויפן.","highlights":["הוויטראז׳ים","המדרגות המעוגלות","שכונת שומוקו"],"time_needed":"כ-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-23 Shumoku-cho, Higashi-ku, Nagoya","opens":"10:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"משלבים עם הליכה בשכונת שומוקו בדרך לטירה","baby_block":null,"tags":["historic house","architecture","stained glass","taisho","western style","museum","בית היסטורי","ארכיטקטורה","ויטראז׳","טאישו","סגנון מערבי","מוזיאון","actress","שחקנית"],"en":{"hype":"A Western-style house with an orange roof and stained glass, once home to Kawakami Sadayakko, Japan's first actress.","reality":"A small, pretty house that shows early 20th-century Nagoya; for people who like architecture and old houses.","tip":"It is in Shumoku, so keep walking past the old houses of the \"Cultural Path\" towards the castle.","baby_notes":"There is a lift; shoes off inside.","price":"About ¥200","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk through the rooms, the hall with the stained glass and curved stairs, then wander the neighbourhood.","special":"Original Taisho-era stained glass in a house mixing West and Japan.","highlights":["Stained glass","Curved staircase","Shumoku neighbourhood"],"time_needed":"About 45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Pair it with a walk through Shumoku on the way to the castle","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Higashiyama Zoo and Botanical Gardens","name_ja":"東山動植物園","city":"nagoya","area":"Castle & Higashi","category":"experience","lat":35.1567,"lng":136.9759,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גן חיות וגן בוטני ענק, עם הגורילה המפורסמת שבאני, קואלות וחממה עתיקה מזכוכית.","reality":"זול מאוד וגדול מאוד, טוב לחצי יום עם תינוק. חלק מהמתחמים ישנים, אבל הגורילות והקואלות שוות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥500 למבוגר","tip":"השטח הררי וגדול: נכנסים בשער הראשי ליד התחנה ויורדים בהדרגה לכיוון הגן הבוטני.","sources":["https://www.higashiyama.city.nagoya.jp/english","https://cdn.gltjp.com/en/directory/item/11779/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים סלולים עם עליות, יש חדרי הנקה ושירותים עם משטח החתלה; השכרת עגלות במקום.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Higashiyama%20Zoo%20and%20Botanical%20Gardens%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.higashiyama.city.nagoya.jp/english","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מתחילים בגורילות ובקואלות, ממשיכים לגן הבוטני עם החממה מ-1937, ומסיימים במגדל השמיים בקצה הפארק.","special":"כ-500 מינים של בעלי חיים ו-7,000 מיני צמחים באותו כרטיס, בפחות ממחיר של קפה.","highlights":["הגורילה שבאני","הקואלות","החממה מזכוכית","מגדל השמיים"],"time_needed":"חצי יום","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-70 Higashiyama Motomachi, Chikusa-ku, Nagoya","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:50","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":210,"booking":"no","plan_line":"יוצאים בתחנת היגאשיאמה קואן, השער הראשי שלוש דקות משם","baby_block":null,"tags":["zoo","botanical garden","animals","gorilla","koala","greenhouse","park","kids","גן חיות","גן בוטני","בעלי חיים","גורילה","קואלה","חממה","פארק","ילדים","family","משפחות"],"en":{"hype":"A huge zoo and botanical garden with the famous gorilla Shabani, koalas and an old glass greenhouse.","reality":"Very cheap and very big, a good half day with a baby. Some enclosures are dated, but the gorillas and koalas are worth it.","tip":"The grounds are hilly and large: enter at the main gate by the station and work your way down to the botanical garden.","baby_notes":"Paved paths with slopes, nursing rooms and changing tables; strollers for rent.","price":"¥500 per adult","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Start with the gorillas and koalas, continue to the botanical garden with its 1937 greenhouse, and end at the Sky Tower at the edge of the park.","special":"About 500 animal species and 7,000 plant species on one ticket that costs less than a coffee.","highlights":["Shabani the gorilla","Koalas","Glass greenhouse","Sky Tower"],"time_needed":"Half a day","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Get off at Higashiyama Koen Station; main gate 3 minutes away","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Higashiyama Sky Tower","name_ja":"東山スカイタワー","city":"nagoya","area":"Castle & Higashi","category":"sight","lat":35.1545,"lng":136.9789,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מגדל תצפית בקצה גן החיות היגאשיאמה, על גבעה, עם נוף לכל נגויה.","reality":"זול ושקט, ובלילה הנוף טוב. כדאי בעיקר כהמשך לגן החיות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥300, כרטיס משולב עם גן החיות ¥640","tip":"פתוח עד 21:30, אז אפשר לסיים את גן החיות ולחזור לנוף לילה.","sources":["https://www.nagoya-info.jp/en/spot/detail/132","https://www.japan365days.com/nagoya_higashiyama_sky_tower.php","https://www.higashiyama.city.nagoya.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעלית לתצפית, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Higashiyama%20Sky%20Tower%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.higashiyama.city.nagoya.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במעלית לקומת התצפית, מחפשים את הטירה ואת התחנה באופק, ואפשר לשבת במסעדה למעלה.","special":"עומד על גבעה, כך שהתצפית בגובה 180 מטר מעל פני הים.","highlights":["נוף לילה","נוף לכל העיר"],"time_needed":"כחצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Higashiyama Sky Tower, Tashiro-cho, Chikusa-ku, Nagoya","opens":"09:00","closes":"21:30","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"כרטיס משולב עם גן החיות זול יותר","baby_block":null,"tags":["observation deck","tower","view","night view","zoo","hill","תצפית","מגדל","נוף","נוף לילה","גן חיות","גבעה","cheap","זול"],"en":{"hype":"A lookout tower at the edge of Higashiyama Zoo, on a hill with a view over all of Nagoya.","reality":"Cheap and quiet with a good night view. Mostly worth it as a follow-on to the zoo.","tip":"Open until 21:30, so you can finish the zoo and come back for the night view.","baby_notes":"Lift to the deck, easy with a stroller.","price":"¥300, combined with the zoo ¥640","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Ride the lift to the deck, spot the castle and the station on the skyline, and there is a restaurant up top.","special":"It sits on a hill, so the deck is 180 m above sea level.","highlights":["Night view","Whole-city view"],"time_needed":"About 30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"The combined ticket with the zoo is cheaper","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kakuozan Nittaiji Temple","name_ja":"覚王山日泰寺","city":"nagoya","area":"Castle & Higashi","category":"sight","lat":35.1676,"lng":136.9536,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המקדש היחיד ביפן שלא שייך לשום זרם, נבנה לשמירת שרידים של הבודהה שהתקבלו מתאילנד.","reality":"מקדש רחב ושקט עם פגודה גבוהה, והדרך אליו ברחוב קקואוזן עם חנויות קטנות ובתי קפה היא חצי מהעניין.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"ב-21 בכל חודש יש יריד דוכנים לאורך הרחוב אל המקדש.","sources":["https://www.nittaiji.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"הרחוב בעלייה קלה; שטח המקדש רחב ונוח לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kakuozan%20Nittaiji%20Temple%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.nittaiji.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יוצאים בתחנת קקואוזן, עולים ברחוב עם החנויות ובתי הקפה, ומטיילים בין האולם הראשי לפגודה בת חמש הקומות.","special":"השרידים הם מתנה ממלך סיאם ב-1900, והמקדש מנוהל במשותף על ידי כל הזרמים הבודהיסטיים ביפן.","highlights":["הפגודה בת חמש הקומות","רחוב קקואוזן","יריד ה-21 בחודש"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-1 Hoo-cho, Chikusa-ku, Nagoya","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":["2026-12-21"],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"ב-21 בחודש יש יריד; משלבים עם ויוקיסו הסמוך","baby_block":null,"tags":["temple","buddhist","pagoda","buddha relics","thailand","kakuozan","market","cafes","מקדש","בודהיסטי","פגודה","שרידי הבודהה","תאילנד","קקואוזן","יריד","בתי קפה","neighbourhood","שכונה"],"en":{"hype":"The only temple in Japan that belongs to no sect, built to hold Buddha relics given by Thailand.","reality":"A wide, quiet temple with a tall pagoda; the walk up Kakuozan's street of small shops and cafes is half the fun.","tip":"On the 21st of each month a fair of stalls lines the street to the temple.","baby_notes":"The street climbs gently; the temple grounds are wide and fine for a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Get off at Kakuozan Station, walk up the street of shops and cafes, and wander between the main hall and the five-storey pagoda.","special":"The relics were a gift from the King of Siam in 1900, and all of Japan's Buddhist sects run the temple together.","highlights":["Five-storey pagoda","Kakuozan street","Fair on the 21st"],"time_needed":"An hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Fair on the 21st of each month; pair with Yokiso nearby","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Yokiso","name_ja":"揚輝荘","city":"nagoya","area":"Castle & Higashi","category":"sight","lat":35.17,"lng":136.9555,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אחוזת וילות מתחילת המאה ה-20 של מייסד מצוזאקאיה, עם בית אורחות מעוטר בסגנונות מכל העולם.","reality":"מעט מאוד תיירים מגיעים, וחבל: בית שוסאקוקו מלא פרטים מפתיעים, כולל חדר בסגנון הודי. מקום שקט לשעה.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"בית שוסאקוקו בתשלום קטן, הגן הצפוני חינם","tip":"הגן הדרומי פתוח רק בסיורים בימי רביעי ושבת.","sources":["https://www.nagoya-info.jp/spot/detail/62/","https://www.city.nagoya.jp/kankou/bunka/1034457/1016040/1016042/1017357/1017368.html","https://www.yokiso.jp/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"בבית שוסאקוקו מדרגות ואין מעלית; הגן הצפוני עם שבילי אבן.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Yokiso%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.yokiso.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים לבית שוסאקוקו ועוברים בין החדרים המעוטרים עד המרתף בסגנון הודי, ואז מטיילים בגן הצפוני עם הבית ההיסטורי והבריכה.","special":"בית שנבנה ב-1937 עם פרטים מהודו, סין ואירופה, כי הבעלים אירח כאן אורחים מכל אסיה.","highlights":["בית שוסאקוקו","החדר ההודי","הגן הצפוני"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-5-21 Hoo-cho, Chikusa-ku, Nagoya","opens":"09:30","closes":"16:30","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עשר דקות הליכה מתחנת קקואוזן, משלבים עם ניטאיג׳י","baby_block":"מדרגות בבית ואין מעלית","tags":["villa","historic house","garden","architecture","matsuzakaya","kakuozan","museum","וילה","בית היסטורי","גן","ארכיטקטורה","מצוזאקאיה","קקואוזן","מוזיאון","estate","אחוזה"],"en":{"hype":"An early 20th-century villa estate of the Matsuzakaya founder, with a guest house decorated in styles from around the world.","reality":"Very few tourists come, which is a shame: Shoshokaku is full of surprising details, including an Indian-style room. A quiet hour.","tip":"The south garden opens only on guided tours on Wednesdays and Saturdays.","baby_notes":"Shoshokaku has stairs and no lift; the north garden has stone paths.","price":"Small fee for Shoshokaku, north garden free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go through the decorated rooms of Shoshokaku down to the Indian-style basement, then stroll the north garden with its old house and pond.","special":"A 1937 house with touches from India, China and Europe, because the owner hosted guests from all over Asia.","highlights":["Shoshokaku house","Indian room","North garden"],"time_needed":"An hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"10 minutes walk from Kakuozan Station; pair with Nittaiji","baby_block":"Stairs inside and no lift"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Togan-ji Temple","name_ja":"桃巌寺","city":"nagoya","area":"Castle & Higashi","category":"sight","lat":35.1615,"lng":136.9665,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש קטן בשכונת מגורים עם פסל בודהה ירוק ענק, 10 מטר, בתוך חורשת במבוק.","reality":"מקום מוזר ומצחיק שכמעט אף תייר לא מכיר; הביקור קצר, ושווה רק למי שעובר באזור, למשל בדרך לפארק ג׳יבלי.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"חמש דקות הליכה מתחנת מוטויאמה; משם ממשיכים בקו היגאשיאמה לפוג׳יגאוקה ולג׳יבלי.","sources":["https://www.nagoya-info.jp/spot/detail/114/","https://aichinow.pref.aichi.jp/spots/detail/306/","https://www.nagoyabuzz.com/togan-jis-green-buddha/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים לא סלולים בחלקם, עגלה עוברת בזהירות.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Togan-ji%20Temple%20Nagoya","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים לחורשת הבמבוק ועומדים מול הבודהה הירוק, ואז מסתובבים בשטח המקדש הקטן.","special":"בודהה מברונזה צבוע ירוק, שעומד על עשרה פילים.","highlights":["הבודהה הירוק","חורשת הבמבוק"],"time_needed":"כחצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-16 Yotsuyadori, Chikusa-ku, Nagoya","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עצירה קצרה בדרך לג׳יבלי, חמש דקות מתחנת מוטויאמה","baby_block":null,"tags":["temple","big buddha","statue","bamboo","quirky","off the beaten path","מקדש","בודהה ענק","פסל","במבוק","מוזר","מחוץ למסלול","buddhist","בודהיסטי"],"en":{"hype":"A small temple in a residential area with a huge 10 m green Buddha in a bamboo grove.","reality":"A strange, fun spot almost no tourists know; the visit is short and only worth it if you are nearby, say on the way to Ghibli Park.","tip":"5 minutes walk from Motoyama Station; from there the Higashiyama line runs on to Fujigaoka for Ghibli.","baby_notes":"Some paths are unpaved; a stroller manages with care.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk into the bamboo grove, stand in front of the green Buddha, then look around the small temple grounds.","special":"A bronze Buddha painted green, standing on ten elephants.","highlights":["Green Buddha","Bamboo grove"],"time_needed":"About 30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"A short stop on the way to Ghibli; 5 min from Motoyama Station","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Koshoji Temple","name_ja":"八事山興正寺","city":"nagoya","area":"Castle & Higashi","category":"sight","lat":35.1424,"lng":136.958,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש גדול על גבעה ביאגוטו עם הפגודה העתיקה היחידה מעץ בנגויה, מ-1808.","reality":"שקט, ירוק ולא מתויר, ונותן תחושה של מקדש בקיוטו בלי ההמונים. מתאים לבוקר רגוע.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"יוצאים בתחנת יאגוטו בקו מייג׳ו או צורומאי, והמקדש דקות ספורות משם.","sources":["https://www.koshoji.or.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"החלק התחתון שטוח; לאזור העליון יש מדרגות ושבילי יער.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Koshoji%20Temple%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.koshoji.or.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים בשער הראשי לפגודה בת חמש הקומות, מטיילים בין האולמות ואפשר לעלות בשביל היער לחלק העליון.","special":"הפגודה העתיקה מעץ היחידה בנגויה, נכס תרבות חשוב.","highlights":["הפגודה מעץ","שבילי היער","אולם התפילה"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"78 Yagotohonmachi, Showa-ku, Nagoya","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"שלוש דקות הליכה מתחנת יאגוטו","baby_block":null,"tags":["temple","pagoda","wooden pagoda","buddhist","forest","quiet","history","מקדש","פגודה","פגודה מעץ","בודהיסטי","יער","שקט","היסטוריה","yagoto","יאגוטו"],"en":{"hype":"A big hillside temple in Yagoto with Nagoya's only old wooden pagoda, from 1808.","reality":"Quiet, green and untouristy, with a Kyoto-temple feel without the crowds. Good for a calm morning.","tip":"Get off at Yagoto Station on the Meijo or Tsurumai line; it is a few minutes away.","baby_notes":"The lower part is flat; the upper part has steps and forest paths.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Enter at the main gate to the five-storey pagoda, wander between the halls and take the forest path up to the upper grounds.","special":"Nagoya's only old wooden pagoda, an important cultural property.","highlights":["Wooden pagoda","Forest paths","Main hall"],"time_needed":"An hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"3 minutes walk from Yagoto Station","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Atsuta Jingu","name_ja":"熱田神宮","city":"nagoya","area":"Atsuta & Port","category":"sight","lat":35.1283,"lng":136.9087,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אחד המקדשים הקדושים ביפן, שבו שמורה לפי המסורת החרב הקיסרית קוסאנאגי, בתוך יער עצים עתיקים.","reality":"המבנים פשוטים, ואת החרב אף אחד לא רואה. מה שעובד זה היער השקט והאווירה, ולוקחים לזה פחות משעה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם, אולם האוצרות קוסאנאגי-קאן בתשלום","tip":"אחרי המקדש הולכים חמש דקות לגן שירוטורי, ובצהריים לארוחת היטסומאבושי (צלופח) בשכונה.","sources":["https://www.atsutajingu.or.jp/en/","https://www.nagoya-info.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילי חצץ רחבים, עגלה עוברת אבל לאט.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Atsuta%20Jingu%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.atsutajingu.or.jp/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים בשער הדרומי, הולכים בשביל היער אל האולם הראשי, עוברים ליד עץ הקמפור בן אלף השנים ואפשר לראות חרבות סמוראים בקוסאנאגי-קאן.","special":"מקדש שמחזיק אחד משלושת סמלי הקיסרות של יפן, ולכן מגיעים אליו כ-7 מיליון מתפללים בשנה.","highlights":["שביל היער","עץ הקמפור העתיק","אולם החרבות קוסאנאגי-קאן"],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-1-1 Jingu, Atsuta-ku, Nagoya","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בסוף דצמבר ובראש השנה עמוס מאוד, עדיף לבוא לפני ה-28","baby_block":null,"tags":["shrine","shinto","sacred sword","forest","camphor tree","history","imperial regalia","מקדש","שינטו","חרב קדושה","יער","עץ קמפור","היסטוריה","סמלי הקיסרות","swords","חרבות"],"en":{"hype":"One of Japan's holiest shrines, said to hold the imperial sword Kusanagi, set in a forest of old trees.","reality":"The buildings are plain and nobody sees the sword. The quiet forest and the mood are what work, and it takes under an hour.","tip":"After the shrine walk five minutes to Shirotori Garden, and have hitsumabushi (eel) for lunch nearby.","baby_notes":"Wide gravel paths; a stroller copes, slowly.","price":"Free; the Kusanagi-kan treasure hall charges","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Enter by the south gate, walk the forest path to the main hall, pass the thousand-year-old camphor tree and see samurai swords in Kusanagi-kan.","special":"It holds one of Japan's three imperial regalia, which draws about 7 million worshippers a year.","highlights":["Forest path","Old camphor tree","Kusanagi-kan sword hall"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Very crowded around New Year; better before the 28th","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Shirotori Garden","name_ja":"白鳥庭園","city":"nagoya","area":"Atsuta & Port","category":"sight","lat":35.1296,"lng":136.9022,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גן יפני גדול ליד אטסוטה, שבנוי כמו מפה של נהר קיסו מההרים לים.","reality":"רגוע ויפה, כמעט בלי תיירים, ובית התה בתוכו מגיש תה ירוק ומתוק במחיר קטן. משלים טוב לאטסוטה.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥300 למבוגר","tip":"בבית התה סייריו-טיי מגישים מאצ׳ה ועוגייה יפנית מול הגן.","sources":["https://www.nagoya-info.jp/en/spot/detail/33","https://aichi-now.jp/en/spots/detail/7"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"רוב השבילים שטוחים וסלולים, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shirotori%20Garden%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.shirotori-garden.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים לאורך \"הנהר\" מהגבעה עד האגם הגדול, חוצים את הגשרים, ועוצרים למאצ׳ה בבית התה.","special":"עיצוב הגן מספר את הדרך של המים מהר אונטאקה ועד מפרץ איסה.","highlights":["האגם הגדול","בית התה","גשרי העץ"],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-5 Atsuta Nishimachi, Atsuta-ku, Nagoya","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"חמש דקות הליכה מאטסוטה ג׳ינגו, משלבים באותו בוקר","baby_block":null,"tags":["japanese garden","garden","pond","teahouse","matcha","quiet","bridges","גן יפני","גן","אגם","בית תה","מאצ׳ה","שקט","גשרים","tea ceremony","טקס תה"],"en":{"hype":"A big Japanese garden near Atsuta, laid out like a map of the Kiso River from the mountains to the sea.","reality":"Calm and pretty with almost no tourists, and the teahouse serves matcha and a sweet for little money. A good match for Atsuta.","tip":"Seiu-tei teahouse serves matcha and a Japanese sweet facing the garden.","baby_notes":"Most paths are flat and paved, easy with a stroller.","price":"¥300 per adult","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Follow the \"river\" from the hill to the big pond, cross the bridges and stop for matcha at the teahouse.","special":"The layout tells the journey of water from Mt Ontake to Ise Bay.","highlights":["Big pond","Teahouse","Wooden bridges"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"5 minutes walk from Atsuta Jingu; pair them in one morning","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Port of Nagoya Public Aquarium","name_ja":"名古屋港水族館","city":"nagoya","area":"Atsuta & Port","category":"sight","lat":35.0906,"lng":136.8786,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אחד האקווריומים הגדולים ביפן, עם לווייתנים קטלניים, בלוגות ומופע דולפינים באמפיתיאטרון ענק.","reality":"גדול ומרשים, טוב במיוחד עם תינוק. מי שהיה בקאיוקאן באוסקה יראה דברים דומים, אבל מופע הדולפינים כאן גדול יותר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כ-¥2,000 למבוגר","tip":"בודקים את שעות מופע הדולפינים בכניסה ומתכננים סביבו; היציעים העליונים לא נרטבים.","sources":["https://www.nagoyaaqua.jp/","https://www.nagoya-info.jp/en/course/detail/35"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעליות, חדרי הנקה ושירותים עם משטח החתלה, מתאים מאוד לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Port%20of%20Nagoya%20Public%20Aquarium%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.nagoyaaqua.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מתחילים בבניין הצפוני עם הלווייתנים הקטלניים והבלוגות, תופסים את מופע הדולפינים, ועוברים לבניין הדרומי עם צבי הים והפינגווינים.","special":"אחד המקומות היחידים ביפן שמחזיקים לווייתנים קטלניים.","highlights":["מופע הדולפינים","הלווייתנים הקטלניים","הבלוגות","הפינגווינים"],"time_needed":"2-3 שעות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-3 Minatomachi, Minato-ku, Nagoya","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":180,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני מחוץ לחופשות; לתכנן סביב שעת מופע הדולפינים","baby_block":null,"tags":["aquarium","orca","killer whale","dolphin show","beluga","penguins","sea turtles","kids","אקווריום","לווייתן קטלני","מופע דולפינים","בלוגה","פינגווינים","צבי ים","ילדים","דגים","fish"],"en":{"hype":"One of Japan's biggest aquariums, with orcas, belugas and a dolphin show in a huge stadium.","reality":"Big and impressive, especially with a baby. If you have done Kaiyukan in Osaka it feels similar, but the dolphin show here is bigger.","tip":"Check the dolphin show times at the entrance and plan around them; the upper rows stay dry.","baby_notes":"Lifts, nursing rooms and changing tables, very stroller friendly.","price":"About ¥2,000 per adult","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Start in the North Building with the orcas and belugas, catch the dolphin show, then cross to the South Building for sea turtles and penguins.","special":"One of the few places in Japan that keeps orcas.","highlights":["Dolphin show","Orcas","Belugas","Penguins"],"time_needed":"2-3 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays outside school holidays; plan around the dolphin show","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Antarctic Research Ship Fuji","name_ja":"南極観測船ふじ","city":"nagoya","area":"Atsuta & Port","category":"sight","lat":35.092,"lng":136.8815,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"ספינת מחקר אמיתית שהפליגה לאנטארקטיקה, עגונה כמוזיאון ליד האקווריום.","reality":"ביקור קצר וזול, עם חדרי צוות שנשארו כמו שהיו. שווה כתוספת לאקווריום, לא כיעד בפני עצמו.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כ-¥300, יש כרטיס משולב עם האקווריום ובניין הנמל","tip":"הכרטיס המשולב של הנמל (אקווריום, ספינה ובניין הנמל) זול יותר.","sources":["https://www.nagoya-info.jp/en/course/detail/35"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"מדרגות תלולות וצרות בין הסיפונים.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Antarctic%20Research%20Ship%20Fuji%20Nagoya","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים לספינה ועוברים בחדר המכונות, המטבח, חדר הניתוח והגשר, ובמוזיאון האנטארקטיקה על הסיפון.","special":"הספינה הפליגה 18 פעמים לאנטארקטיקה, והכול נשמר כמו ביום האחרון.","highlights":["הגשר","חדרי הצוות","מוזיאון אנטארקטיקה"],"time_needed":"כ-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-9 Minatomachi, Minato-ku, Nagoya","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"כרטיס משולב עם האקווריום זול יותר","baby_block":"מדרגות תלולות, לא לעגלה","tags":["ship","museum","antarctica","icebreaker","port","history","ספינה","מוזיאון","אנטארקטיקה","שוברת קרח","נמל","היסטוריה","research","מחקר"],"en":{"hype":"A real research ship that sailed to Antarctica, moored as a museum next to the aquarium.","reality":"A short, cheap visit with crew rooms left as they were. Good as an add-on to the aquarium, not a trip on its own.","tip":"The port combo ticket (aquarium, ship and Port Building) is cheaper.","baby_notes":"Steep, narrow stairs between decks.","price":"About ¥300; combo ticket with the aquarium and Port Building","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Board and walk through the engine room, galley, sick bay and bridge, plus the Antarctic museum on deck.","special":"The ship made 18 trips to Antarctica and everything is kept as on its last day.","highlights":["Bridge","Crew quarters","Antarctic museum"],"time_needed":"About 45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"The combo ticket with the aquarium is cheaper","baby_block":"Steep stairs, no stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Nagoya Port Building","name_ja":"名古屋港ポートビル","city":"nagoya","area":"Atsuta & Port","category":"sight","lat":35.0912,"lng":136.88,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בניין בצורת מפרש בגארדן פיר, עם תצפית לנמל ומוזיאון ימי.","reality":"תצפית צנועה על נמל תעשייתי ומוזיאון קטן. רק למי שכבר באקווריום ויש לו כרטיס משולב.","verdict":"overhyped","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כ-¥300, כלול בכרטיס המשולב","tip":"אם עושים רק דבר אחד בנמל, עדיף האקווריום.","sources":["https://www.nagoya-info.jp/en/course/detail/35"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעלית לתצפית, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nagoya%20Port%20Building%20Nagoya","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים לתצפית בקומה השביעית לראות את הנמל ואת הגשרים, ויורדים למוזיאון הימי.","special":null,"highlights":["תצפית לנמל","המוזיאון הימי"],"time_needed":"כחצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-9 Minatomachi, Minato-ku, Nagoya","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"שווה רק עם הכרטיס המשולב של האקווריום","baby_block":null,"tags":["observation deck","port","harbor","maritime museum","view","ships","תצפית","נמל","מוזיאון ימי","נוף","אוניות","garden pier","גארדן פיר"],"en":{"hype":"A sail-shaped building on Garden Pier with a harbour lookout and a maritime museum.","reality":"A modest view over an industrial port and a small museum. Only if you are at the aquarium already with the combo ticket.","tip":"If you do just one thing at the port, make it the aquarium.","baby_notes":"Lift to the deck, fine with a stroller.","price":"About ¥300, included in the combo ticket","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go up to the 7th-floor deck to see the port and bridges, then down to the maritime museum.","special":null,"highlights":["Harbour view","Maritime museum"],"time_needed":"About 30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Only worth it with the aquarium combo ticket","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"SCMAGLEV and Railway Park","name_ja":"リニア・鉄道館","city":"nagoya","area":"Atsuta & Port","category":"experience","lat":35.0461,"lng":136.8507,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון הרכבות של JR סנטרל: שינקנסנים אמיתיים מכל הדורות, רכבת המגלב הניסיונית וסימולטורי נהיגה.","reality":"גם מי שלא חובב רכבות נהנה לעמוד ליד השינקנסן הראשון ולהיכנס לקרונות. הסימולטורים דורשים הגרלה או כרטיס נוסף.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,000 למבוגר","tip":"נרשמים להגרלת סימולטור השינקנסן מיד בכניסה, המקומות מוגבלים.","sources":["https://museum.jr-central.co.jp/en/facilities/","https://shoryudo.go-centraljapan.jp/en/?p=1804"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"אולם ענק ושטוח, חדר הנקה ומקום רב לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=SCMAGLEV%20and%20Railway%20Park%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://museum.jr-central.co.jp/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין 39 הקרונות המקוריים, נכנסים לשינקנסן הישן, רואים את המגלב שקבע שיא מהירות, ומסיימים בדגם הרכבות הענק.","special":"הרכבת המגנטית שהגיעה ל-581 קמ״ש עומדת כאן, לצד כל דורות השינקנסן.","highlights":["רכבת המגלב","השינקנסן מסדרה 0","סימולטור נהיגה","הדגם הענק"],"time_needed":"2-3 שעות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-2-2 Kinjofuto, Minato-ku, Nagoya","opens":"10:00","closes":"17:30","closed_weekdays":[2],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":150,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שלישי; משלבים עם לגולנד שליד באותו יום","baby_block":null,"tags":["train museum","railway","shinkansen","bullet train","maglev","simulator","trains","מוזיאון רכבות","רכבות","שינקנסן","רכבת קליע","מגלב","סימולטור","jr central","kids","ילדים"],"en":{"hype":"JR Central's railway museum: real shinkansen from every generation, the test maglev and driving simulators.","reality":"Even non-train people enjoy standing next to the first shinkansen and walking through the cars. The simulators need a lottery or extra ticket.","tip":"Enter the shinkansen simulator lottery as soon as you arrive; places are limited.","baby_notes":"One huge flat hall, a nursing room and plenty of stroller space.","price":"¥1,000 per adult","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk among 39 original cars, step inside the old shinkansen, see the record-setting maglev and end at the huge model railway.","special":"The maglev that reached 581 km/h stands here with every shinkansen generation.","highlights":["Maglev train","Series 0 shinkansen","Driving simulator","Giant diorama"],"time_needed":"2-3 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Tuesdays; pair with LEGOLAND next door","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"LEGOLAND Japan","name_ja":"レゴランド・ジャパン","city":"nagoya","area":"Atsuta & Port","category":"experience","lat":35.0503,"lng":136.8435,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פארק לגו עם מתקנים לילדים, מינילנד של ערים יפניות מלגו ובדצמבר אירוע חג מולד.","reality":"בנוי לילדים בגילי 2-12; למבוגרים בלי ילדים זה יקר ודל. עם תינוק יש פינות משחק, אבל רוב המתקנים לא בשבילו.","verdict":"overhyped","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"המיניטאון של טוקיו, קיוטו ואוסקה מלגו הוא החלק שמבוגרים הכי נהנים ממנו.","sources":["https://legoland.jp/en/operation/info/opening-hours/opening-hours-legoland-japan","https://www.haveagood-holiday.com/en/articles/legoland-japan-christmas-night-2026"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים שטוחים, חדרי הנקה ושירותים עם משטח החתלה; רוב המתקנים לא לתינוקות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=LEGOLAND%20Japan%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.legoland.jp/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מסתובבים במיניטאון עם ציוני הדרך של יפן מלגו, עולים על כמה מתקנים רגועים ונכנסים לחנות הלגו הגדולה.","special":"ב-18 וב-19 בדצמבר 2026 יש ערבי חג מולד עם תאורה בתשלום נפרד.","highlights":["מיניטאון","חנות הלגו","אירוע חג המולד"],"time_needed":"חצי יום","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-2-1 Kinjofuto, Minato-ku, Nagoya","opens":"10:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":240,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"בחורף יש ימים סגורים; לבדוק את לוח הפתיחה באתר לפני קניית כרטיס","baby_block":null,"tags":["theme park","lego","kids","rides","miniland","christmas","family","פארק שעשועים","לגו","ילדים","מתקנים","מיניטאון","חג מולד","משפחות","toys","צעצועים"],"en":{"hype":"A LEGO theme park with kids' rides, a Miniland of Japanese cities in LEGO and a Christmas event in December.","reality":"Built for kids aged 2-12; adults without kids find it pricey and thin. There are play corners for a baby, but most rides are not for them.","tip":"The LEGO Miniland of Tokyo, Kyoto and Osaka is the part adults enjoy most.","baby_notes":"Flat paths, nursing rooms and changing tables; most rides are not for babies.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Wander Miniland with Japan's landmarks in LEGO, ride a few gentle rides and visit the big LEGO store.","special":"On 18 and 19 December 2026 there are Christmas night events, ticketed separately.","highlights":["Miniland","LEGO store","Christmas event"],"time_needed":"Half a day","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Some winter days are closed; check the calendar before buying tickets","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"SEA LIFE Nagoya","name_ja":"シーライフ名古屋","city":"nagoya","area":"Atsuta & Port","category":"experience","lat":35.0496,"lng":136.843,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אקווריום קטן צמוד ללגולנד, עם מנהרת דגים ודגמי לגו בתוך המיכלים.","reality":"קטן מאוד ויקר ביחס לאקווריום של הנמל. שווה רק כחלק מכרטיס משולב עם לגולנד.","verdict":"overhyped","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"אם רוצים אקווריום, עדיף אקווריום נמל נגויה הגדול.","sources":["https://www.visitsealife.com/nagoya/en/","https://www.legoland.jp/en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מקורה, שטוח ונוח לעגלה; טוב לתינוק ביום גשום.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=SEA%20LIFE%20Nagoya%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.visitsealife.com/nagoya/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים במנהרה מתחת למים ובין המיכלים עם דגמי הלגו, ובפינת המגע.","special":null,"highlights":["מנהרת הדגים","דגמי לגו מתחת למים"],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Sea Life Nagoya, Kinjofuto, Minato-ku, Nagoya","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"רק בכרטיס משולב עם לגולנד; לבד לא שווה את המחיר","baby_block":null,"tags":["aquarium","fish","tunnel","lego","kids","rainy day","אקווריום","דגים","מנהרה","לגו","ילדים","יום גשום","sea life","סי לייף"],"en":{"hype":"A small aquarium next to LEGOLAND with a fish tunnel and LEGO models in the tanks.","reality":"Very small and pricey next to the Port Aquarium. Only worth it in a combo with LEGOLAND.","tip":"If you want an aquarium, the big Port of Nagoya Aquarium is the better pick.","baby_notes":"Indoors, flat and stroller friendly; good for a baby on a rainy day.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the underwater tunnel and the tanks with LEGO models, plus the touch pool.","special":null,"highlights":["Fish tunnel","LEGO models underwater"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Only in a combo with LEGOLAND; not worth the price alone","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Inuyama Castle","name_ja":"犬山城","city":"nagoya","area":"Around Nagoya","category":"sight","lat":35.3884,"lng":136.9393,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אחת מחמש הטירות ביפן שהמגדל שלהן מקורי, מ-1537, על צוק מעל נהר קיסו.","reality":"בניגוד לטירת נגויה, כאן נכנסים לעץ האמיתי. המדרגות בפנים תלולות כמו סולם, והמרפסת למעלה עם נוף לנהר היא השיא.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"בסופי שבוע יש תור לעלות למגדל, כדאי להגיע בפתיחה.","sources":["https://inuyama-castle.jp/","https://Japan-guide.com/e/e3351.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"בתוך המגדל מדרגות תלולות מאוד, רק עם מנשא; את העגלה משאירים בחוץ.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Inuyama%20Castle%20Inuyama%20Aichi","website_url":"https://inuyama-castle.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים בשביל מהעיר העתיקה, נכנסים למגדל ומטפסים במדרגות העץ התלולות עד המרפסת הפתוחה סביב הקומה העליונה.","special":"מגדל עץ מקורי מלפני 500 שנה, נכס לאומי, עם מרפסת שמקיפים ברגל מעל הנהר.","highlights":["המרפסת העליונה","מדרגות העץ","הנוף לנהר קיסו"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"65-2 Kitakoken, Inuyama, Aichi","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"30 דקות ברכבת מייטטסו מנגויה; להגיע בפתיחה לפני התור","baby_block":"מדרגות תלולות כמו סולם, רק מנשא","tags":["castle","original castle","national treasure","samurai","river view","history","טירה","טירה מקורית","נכס לאומי","סמוראים","נוף לנהר","היסטוריה","kiso river","נהר קיסו","inuyama","אינויאמה"],"en":{"hype":"One of only five castles in Japan with an original keep, from 1537, on a cliff above the Kiso River.","reality":"Unlike Nagoya Castle, here you walk inside the real wood. The stairs are ladder-steep, and the top balcony over the river is the highlight.","tip":"There is a queue to climb the keep on weekends; arrive at opening.","baby_notes":"Very steep stairs inside the keep, carrier only; leave the stroller outside.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk up from the old town, enter the keep and climb the steep wooden stairs to the open balcony around the top floor.","special":"An original 500-year-old wooden keep, a national treasure, with a balcony you walk around above the river.","highlights":["Top balcony","Wooden stairs","Kiso River view"],"time_needed":"An hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"30 min by Meitetsu from Nagoya; come at opening to beat the queue","baby_block":"Ladder-steep stairs, carrier only"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Inuyama Castle Town","name_ja":"犬山城下町","city":"nagoya","area":"Around Nagoya","category":"sight","lat":35.384,"lng":136.942,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רחובות עץ ישנים מתחת לטירה, עם דוכני אוכל רחוב, חנויות מתוקים ובתים מתקופת אדו.","reality":"נעים מאוד אבל בסופי שבוע צפוף כמו פסטיבל. הרחובות עצמם קצרים, ובשבילם ובשביל הטירה מספיק חצי יום.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"בימי חול הרחובות רגועים בהרבה, ורוב הדוכנים פתוחים מ-10:00 עד 17:00.","sources":["https://inuyama.gr.jp/","https://www.nagoya-info.jp/en/spot/detail/220"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"רחובות שטוחים, עגלה עוברת; בסופי שבוע צפוף.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Inuyama%20Castle%20Town%20Honmachi%20Inuyama","website_url":"https://inuyama.gr.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים ברחוב הונמאצ׳י מהתחנה לכיוון הטירה, טועמים מהדוכנים, ונכנסים לבית הקראקורי ולמוזיאון העיר בדרך.","special":"העיר שמרה את תוכנית הרחובות של המאה ה-17, והבתים הישנים פועלים כחנויות.","highlights":["רחוב הונמאצ׳י","אוכל רחוב","בתי עץ ישנים"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Honmachi, Inuyama, Aichi","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"מגיעים מתחנת אינויאמה, עשר דקות הליכה ברחובות עד הטירה","baby_block":null,"tags":["old town","castle town","historic street","street food","edo","sweets","walk","עיר עתיקה","עיר טירה","רחוב היסטורי","אוכל רחוב","אדו","מתוקים","טיול רגלי","inuyama","אינויאמה"],"en":{"hype":"Old wooden streets below the castle with street-food stalls, sweet shops and Edo-era houses.","reality":"Very pleasant but packed like a festival on weekends. The streets are short; with the castle, half a day is plenty.","tip":"Weekdays are much calmer; most stalls open about 10:00 to 17:00.","baby_notes":"Flat streets, a stroller copes; crowded on weekends.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk Honmachi street from the station towards the castle, snack at the stalls and stop at the karakuri house and city museum on the way.","special":"The town kept its 17th-century street plan and the old houses still trade as shops.","highlights":["Honmachi street","Street food","Old wooden houses"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"From Inuyama Station, a 10-minute walk through the old streets","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Sanko Inari Shrine","name_ja":"三光稲荷神社","city":"nagoya","area":"Around Nagoya","category":"sight","lat":35.3872,"lng":136.9405,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש קטן למרגלות טירת אינויאמה עם לוחות תפילה בצורת לב ושורת שערים אדומים.","reality":"קטן וחביב, מלא זוגות יפניים שמצלמים את הלבבות. חמש דקות בדרך לטירה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"יש כאן בריכה שבה שוטפים מטבעות למזל, תרבות יפנית ותיקה.","sources":["https://inuyama.gr.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"כמה מדרגות בכניסה; השטח קטן.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sanko%20Inari%20Shrine%20Inuyama","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים מתחת לשערים האדומים, רואים את לוחות הלב ושוטפים מטבע בבריכת הכסף.","special":null,"highlights":["לוחות הלב","השערים האדומים","בריכת הכסף"],"time_needed":"כרבע שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Sanko Inari Shrine, Kitakoken, Inuyama, Aichi","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":15,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בדרך לטירה, ממש לפני העלייה","baby_block":null,"tags":["shrine","inari","torii","heart","ema","love","photo spot","מקדש","אינארי","שערים אדומים","לב","לוחות תפילה","אהבה","צילום","inuyama","אינויאמה"],"en":{"hype":"A small shrine at the foot of Inuyama Castle with heart-shaped prayer plaques and a row of red torii.","reality":"Small and sweet, full of Japanese couples photographing the hearts. Five minutes on the way to the castle.","tip":"There is a pond where people wash coins for luck, an old Japanese custom.","baby_notes":"A few steps at the entrance; the grounds are small.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk under the red torii, see the heart plaques and wash a coin in the money pond.","special":null,"highlights":["Heart plaques","Red torii","Money-washing pond"],"time_needed":"About 15 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"On the way to the castle, right before the climb","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Urakuen","name_ja":"有楽苑","city":"nagoya","area":"Around Nagoya","category":"sight","lat":35.3864,"lng":136.9405,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גן תה שקט ליד טירת אינויאמה, עם בית התה ג׳ואן מ-1618, אחד משלושה בתי תה שהם נכס לאומי.","reality":"יפה ושקט אבל יקר ביחס לגודל, ואת ג׳ואן רואים רק מבחוץ. למי שאוהב גנים ותה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כ-¥1,000 כניסה, תה ומתוק בתוספת","tip":"אפשר לשתות מאצ׳ה בבית התה החדש שבגן.","sources":["https://aichinow.pref.aichi.jp/en/spots/detail/179/","https://www.jeepe.jp/en/articles/urakuen-tea-garden-inuyama-2317"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילי אבן וחצץ, עגלה עוברת בקושי.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Urakuen%20Joan%20Teahouse%20Inuyama","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מטיילים בשביל האבן בגן, עוצרים מול בית התה ג׳ואן, ויושבים למאצ׳ה בבית התה החדש.","special":"ג׳ואן נבנה על ידי אודה אוראקוסאי, אחיו של נובונאגה ומאסטר תה מפורסם.","highlights":["בית התה ג׳ואן","מאצ׳ה בגן","גן הטחב"],"time_needed":"כ-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1 Gomonsaki, Inuyama, Aichi","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[3],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי רביעי; חמש דקות מהטירה","baby_block":null,"tags":["tea garden","teahouse","tea ceremony","matcha","national treasure","garden","גן תה","בית תה","טקס תה","מאצ׳ה","נכס לאומי","גן","joan","ג׳ואן"],"en":{"hype":"A quiet tea garden by Inuyama Castle with the 1618 Joan teahouse, one of three teahouses that are national treasures.","reality":"Pretty and calm but pricey for its size, and Joan is only seen from outside. For people who love gardens and tea.","tip":"You can have matcha in the newer teahouse inside the garden.","baby_notes":"Stone and gravel paths; hard going with a stroller.","price":"About ¥1,000 entry; tea and sweet extra","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Follow the stone path through the garden, stop at Joan teahouse and sit for matcha in the newer teahouse.","special":"Joan was built by Oda Urakusai, Nobunaga's brother and a famous tea master.","highlights":["Joan teahouse","Matcha in the garden","Moss garden"],"time_needed":"About 45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Wednesdays; five minutes from the castle","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Tokoname Pottery Footpath","name_ja":"やきもの散歩道","city":"nagoya","area":"Around Nagoya","category":"sight","lat":34.8875,"lng":136.841,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"סמטאות בעיר החרסים טוקונאמה, עם קירות עשויים צנצנות ישנות, ארובות לבנים ותנור מדרגות היסטורי.","reality":"שקט ומקסים, ממש לא מתויר. יש עליות ומדרגות, והחנויות הקטנות של הקדרים פתוחות בעיקר בסופי שבוע.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"מקבלים מפה בתחנת המידע ליד תחנת טוקונאמה; מסלול A הקצר לוקח כשעה.","sources":["https://www.tokoname-kankou.net/en/spot/detail/13/","https://aichi-en.mytabi.net/yakimono-sanpomichi.php"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"עליות, מדרגות ושבילים צרים; קשה עם עגלה, עדיף מנשא.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tokoname%20Pottery%20Footpath%20Tokoname","website_url":"https://www.tokoname-kankou.net/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים במסלול A בין הארובות, עוברים בסמטת דוקאנזאקה עם הקירות מהצנצנות, ונכנסים לתנור המדרגות הישן ולגלריות.","special":"מקום שבו מייצרים קרמיקה כבר 900 שנה, עם הקירות מצנצנות שבורות.","highlights":["סמטת דוקאנזאקה","תנור המדרגות","רחוב חתולי המזל","גלריות הקדרים"],"time_needed":"שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-chome Sakaemachi, Tokoname, Aichi","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":120,"booking":"no","plan_line":"30 דקות ברכבת מייטטסו מנגויה; בימי רביעי חלק מהמקומות סגורים","baby_block":"עליות ומדרגות, קשה עם עגלה","tags":["pottery","ceramics","old town","walk","kilns","chimneys","maneki neko","craft","קרמיקה","קדרות","עיר עתיקה","טיול רגלי","תנורים","ארובות","חתול מזל","מלאכת יד","tokoname","טוקונאמה"],"en":{"hype":"Lanes in the pottery town of Tokoname, with walls made of old jars, brick chimneys and a historic climbing kiln.","reality":"Quiet and charming, not touristy at all. There are slopes and steps, and the small potters' shops open mostly on weekends.","tip":"Grab a map at the info desk by Tokoname Station; the short A course takes about an hour.","baby_notes":"Slopes, steps and narrow paths; hard with a stroller, use a carrier.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Follow course A among the chimneys, walk Dokanzaka lane with its jar walls, and step into the old climbing kiln and galleries.","special":"Pottery has been made here for 900 years; the lane walls are built from broken jars.","highlights":["Dokanzaka lane","Climbing kiln","Maneki-neko street","Potters' galleries"],"time_needed":"2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"30 min by Meitetsu from Nagoya; some places shut on Wednesdays","baby_block":"Slopes and steps, hard with a stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"INAX Museums","name_ja":"INAXライブミュージアム","city":"nagoya","area":"Around Nagoya","category":"sight","lat":34.8981,"lng":136.8433,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון אריחים וקרמיקה של חברת LIXIL בטוקונאמה, עם אוסף אסלות היסטוריות וסדנת קישוט אריחים.","reality":"מוזר ומעניין יותר ממה שנשמע, והסדנה כיפית. חלק מהמבנים עשויים להיות סגורים לשיפוץ, כדאי לבדוק לפני.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"סדנת אריחים כ-¥900","tip":"סדנת האריחים לא דורשת הזמנה, הקבלה האחרונה ב-16:00.","sources":["https://www.lixil.com/en/about/culture/inax_museums.html","https://www.tokoname-kankou.net/en/experience/detail/48/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מבנים שטוחים עם גישה לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=INAX%20Live%20Museum%20Tokoname","website_url":"https://livingculture.lixil.com/ilm/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין מוזיאון האריחים מכל העולם ואוסף האסלות הישנות, ויושבים לקשט אריח בסדנה.","special":"אוסף אריחים מצוירים מהמזרח התיכון, אירופה ויפן, ואסלות מעוטרות מתקופת מייג׳י.","highlights":["מוזיאון האריחים","האסלות ההיסטוריות","סדנת קישוט"],"time_needed":"שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-130 Okuei-cho, Tokoname, Aichi","opens":"10:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[3],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי רביעי; 15 דקות הליכה או אוטובוס ממרכז טוקונאמה","baby_block":null,"tags":["museum","tiles","ceramics","toilets","workshop","craft","pottery","מוזיאון","אריחים","קרמיקה","אסלות","סדנה","מלאכת יד","קדרות","lixil","tokoname","טוקונאמה"],"en":{"hype":"LIXIL's tile and ceramics museum in Tokoname, with a collection of historic toilets and a tile-decorating workshop.","reality":"Odder and more interesting than it sounds, and the workshop is fun. Some buildings may be closed for work, so check first.","tip":"The tile workshop needs no booking; last entry 16:00.","baby_notes":"Flat buildings with stroller access.","price":"Tile workshop about ¥900","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk through the world tile museum and the old toilet collection, then sit down to decorate a tile in the workshop.","special":"Painted tiles from the Middle East, Europe and Japan, and decorated Meiji-era toilets.","highlights":["Tile museum","Historic toilets","Decorating workshop"],"time_needed":"1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Wednesdays; 15 min walk or bus from central Tokoname","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Toyota Automobile Museum","name_ja":"トヨタ博物館","city":"nagoya","area":"Around Nagoya","category":"sight","lat":35.1765,"lng":137.0587,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון מכוניות עם כ-140 רכבים מכל העולם, מהמכונית הראשונה של בנץ ועד מכוניות יפניות מהשנים האחרונות.","reality":"אוסף מצוין שלא מוגבל לטויוטה; מתאים לחובבי רכב, ושאר האנשים יעדיפו את מוזיאון טויוטה ליד התחנה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,200 למבוגר","tip":"נמצא באותו קו לינימו של פארק ג׳יבלי, אפשר לשלב באותו יום.","sources":["https://toyota-automobile-museum.jp/en/visit/faq/","https://www.gltjp.com/en/directory/item/12103/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"אולמות שטוחים ומעליות, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Toyota%20Automobile%20Museum%20Nagakute","website_url":"https://toyota-automobile-museum.jp/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מתחילים בקומה השנייה עם המכוניות הראשונות של אירופה ואמריקה, יורדים לקומה של המכוניות היפניות, ועוברים לביתן תרבות הרכב.","special":"האוסף מספר את כל ההיסטוריה של הרכב, לא רק של טויוטה.","highlights":["המכוניות הראשונות","מכוניות יפניות קלאסיות","ביתן תרבות הרכב"],"time_needed":"שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"41-100 Yokomichi, Nagakute, Aichi","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":120,"booking":"no","plan_line":"משלבים עם פארק ג׳יבלי, שתי תחנות בקו לינימו","baby_block":null,"tags":["car museum","cars","automobile","classic cars","toyota","museum","vintage","מוזיאון רכב","מכוניות","רכב","מכוניות קלאסיות","טויוטה","מוזיאון","וינטג׳","nagakute","נגאקוטה"],"en":{"hype":"A car museum with about 140 vehicles from around the world, from the first Benz to recent Japanese cars.","reality":"An excellent collection, not just Toyota; for car lovers, while everyone else may prefer the Toyota museum by the station.","tip":"It is on the same Linimo line as Ghibli Park, so you can do both in a day.","baby_notes":"Flat halls and lifts, easy with a stroller.","price":"¥1,200 per adult","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Start on the 2nd floor with early European and American cars, go down to the Japanese cars, then cross to the car culture hall.","special":"It tells the whole history of the car, not just Toyota's.","highlights":["First cars","Classic Japanese cars","Car culture hall"],"time_needed":"2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Pair with Ghibli Park, two stops apart on the Linimo line","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Arimatsu","name_ja":"有松","city":"nagoya","area":"Around Nagoya","category":"sight","lat":35.0675,"lng":136.97,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רחוב עתיק מתקופת אדו בדרך הטוקאידו, עיר של צביעת שיבורי (קשירה וצביעה באינדיגו) כבר 400 שנה.","reality":"רחוב יפה ושקט בלי המון תיירים, 20 דקות מנגויה. הבתים הגדולים של סוחרי הבד שמורים היטב, אבל אין הרבה לעשות חוץ מללכת ולקנות.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"רוב החנויות סוגרות בסביבות 17:00; עדיף להגיע בבוקר או בצהריים.","sources":["https://linimo.pref.aichi.jp/en/spot/detail/18","https://triptojapan.com/places/arimatsu-town/VxHpXfi4QS-biK4Q7f1R3w"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"רחוב שטוח וצר, עגלה עוברת; זהירות ממכוניות.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Arimatsu%20Historic%20Townscape%20Midori-ku%20Nagoya","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים לאורך הרחוב הראשי בין בתי הסוחרים, נכנסים לחנויות השיבורי, ועוצרים במוזיאון השיבורי לראות אומניות עובדות.","special":"אחד הקטעים השמורים ביותר של דרך הטוקאידו ההיסטורית, עם בתים בני מאות שנים.","highlights":["בתי הסוחרים","חנויות שיבורי","מוזיאון השיבורי"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Arimatsu, Midori-ku, Nagoya","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"20 דקות ברכבת מייטטסו מתחנת מייטטסו נגויה לתחנת ארימאצו","baby_block":null,"tags":["old town","historic street","tokaido","shibori","tie dye","indigo","textiles","crafts","עיר עתיקה","רחוב היסטורי","טוקאידו","שיבורי","צביעת קשירה","אינדיגו","טקסטיל","מלאכת יד","edo","אדו"],"en":{"hype":"An Edo-period street on the old Tokaido road, a town of shibori tie-dye in indigo for 400 years.","reality":"A pretty, quiet street without crowds, 20 minutes from Nagoya. The big cloth merchants' houses are well kept, but there is little to do beyond walking and shopping.","tip":"Most shops close around 17:00; come in the morning or at midday.","baby_notes":"Flat, narrow street; a stroller copes, watch for cars.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the main street past the merchant houses, browse the shibori shops and stop at the shibori museum to watch craftswomen at work.","special":"One of the best-kept stretches of the historic Tokaido road, with centuries-old houses.","highlights":["Merchant houses","Shibori shops","Shibori museum"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"20 min by Meitetsu from Meitetsu Nagoya to Arimatsu Station","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Aichi Museum of Flight","name_ja":"あいち航空ミュージアム","city":"nagoya","area":"Around Nagoya","category":"sight","lat":35.2477,"lng":136.9225,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון תעופה בשדה התעופה הישן של נגויה, עם מטוס הנוסעים היפני הראשון YS-11 ודגם בגודל מלא של מטוס הזירו.","reality":"למי שאוהב מטוסים זה כיף, עם נוף למסלול ולמפעל של מיצובישי. לאחרים זה רחוק מדי.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"ליד המוזיאון יש מרפסת תצפית למסלול, חינם.","sources":["https://aichi-mof.com/625281e1e7d28e2a3f6952799cbfc38d5eb00438.pdf","https://life-designs.jp/en/webmagazine/aichi-museum-of-flight_en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"אולם אחד גדול ושטוח, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Aichi%20Museum%20of%20Flight%20Toyoyama","website_url":"https://aichi-mof.com/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין המטוסים באולם הגדול, נכנסים לתא הטייס של ה-YS-11, ויוצאים למרפסת לראות המראות.","special":"נמצא על שדה תעופה פעיל, ממש ליד מפעל המטוסים שבו נבנה הזירו המקורי.","highlights":["מטוס YS-11","דגם הזירו","מרפסת המסלול"],"time_needed":"שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Aichi Museum of Flight, Toyoyama, Nishikasugai, Aichi","opens":"10:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[2,3],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בשלישי וברביעי; אוטובוס משדה התעופה נגויה (קומאקי)","baby_block":null,"tags":["aviation museum","airplanes","aircraft","zero fighter","ys-11","airport","planes","מוזיאון תעופה","מטוסים","מטוס","זירו","שדה תעופה","תעופה","kids","ילדים"],"en":{"hype":"An aviation museum at Nagoya's old airport with Japan's first passenger plane, the YS-11, and a full-size Zero replica.","reality":"Fun for plane lovers, with views of the runway and the Mitsubishi plant. Too far for everyone else.","tip":"Next to the museum there is a free runway viewing deck.","baby_notes":"One big flat hall, easy with a stroller.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk among the planes in the main hall, sit in the YS-11 cockpit and go out to the deck to watch takeoffs.","special":"It sits on a working airfield next to the plant where the original Zero was built.","highlights":["YS-11","Zero replica","Runway deck"],"time_needed":"1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Tue and Wed; bus from Nagoya (Komaki) Airport","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
