,000 כולל שובר של ¥1,000 לאוכל או חנויות","tip":"ב-23-25 בדצמבר צריך כרטיס מתוארך מראש; מגיעים לפני השקיעה כדי לראות את ההדלקה.","sources":["https://www.kankomie.or.jp/topic/1353","https://vegcale.com/2026/10/17/nabananosato-winter-illumination/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים שטוחים, עגלה עוברת; בערב קר מאוד ובסופי שבוע צפוף.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nabana%20no%20Sato%20Kuwana%20Mie","website_url":"https://www.nagashima-onsen.co.jp/nabana/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים במנהרת האור הארוכה, עומדים מול מופע האורות הראשי על האגם, ומשתמשים בשובר לאוכל חם או לחנות.","special":"כ-8 מיליון נורות, ובעונת 2026-2027 אזור חדש בנושא \"גן עדן פראי\".","highlights":["מנהרת האור","מופע האגם","גן הבגוניות"],"time_needed":"2-3 שעות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"270 Nagashimacho Komae, Kuwana, Mie","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":["2026-12-12","2026-12-13","2026-12-14","2026-12-15","2026-12-16","2026-12-17","2026-12-18","2026-12-19","2026-12-20","2026-12-21","2026-12-22","2026-12-23","2026-12-24","2026-12-25","2026-12-26","2026-12-27","2026-12-28","2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":150,"booking":"no","plan_line":"להגיע לפני השקיעה; ב-23-25 בדצמבר רק עם כרטיס מתוארך","baby_block":null,"tags":["illumination","christmas lights","light tunnel","flower park","winter","night","lights","תאורה","אורות חג מולד","מנהרת אור","פארק פרחים","חורף","לילה","אורות","begonia","בגוניות","nagashima","נגאשימה"],"en":{"hype":"A flower park in Nagashima with one of Japan's biggest winter illuminations: a long light tunnel and a huge light show on a lake.","reality":"Really spectacular and much photographed, but weekends and Christmas week are badly crowded with queues to leave. Weekdays are much nicer.","tip":"For 23-25 December you need a dated ticket in advance; arrive before sunset to see the lights come on.","baby_notes":"Flat paths, a stroller copes; very cold in the evening and crowded on weekends.","price":"About ¥2,500-3,000 including a ¥1,000 voucher for food or shops","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk through the long light tunnel, stand in front of the main light show on the lake and use the voucher for hot food or a shop.","special":"About 8 million bulbs, and for 2026-2027 a new \"wild paradise\" area.","highlights":["Light tunnel","Lake show","Begonia garden"],"time_needed":"2-3 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Arrive before sunset; 23-25 Dec needs a dated ticket","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Arimatsu Narumi Shibori Kaikan","name_ja":"有松・鳴海絞会館","city":"nagoya","area":"Around Nagoya","category":"experience","lat":35.0679,"lng":136.9693,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון השיבורי של ארימאצו, עם הדגמות חיות של צביעת קשירה וסדנה שבה צובעים מטפחת בעצמכם.","reality":"הסדנה כיפית ויוצאים עם מזכרת אמיתית; המוזיאון קטן. צריך להזמין את הסדנה מראש.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"מזמינים את הסדנה בטלפון או במייל כמה ימים לפני.","sources":["https://en.go-centraljapan.jp/industry/detail_386.html","https://aichinow.pref.aichi.jp/en/spots/detail/1987/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש מדרגות לקומה השנייה; הסדנה בישיבה ליד שולחן.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Arimatsu%20Narumi%20Shibori%20Kaikan%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://shibori-kaikan.com/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"צופים באומניות שקושרות בד בחוטים קטנים, ואז יושבים לקשור ולצבוע מטפחת באינדיגו בעצמכם.","special":"מאות דוגמאות קשירה שונות, וחלק מהאומניות עובדות במלאכה עשרות שנים.","highlights":["הדגמת קשירה","סדנת צביעה","חנות השיבורי"],"time_needed":"שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3008 Arimatsu, Midori-ku, Nagoya","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-28","2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":90,"booking":"required","plan_line":"סדנת הצביעה רק בהזמנה מראש","baby_block":null,"tags":["tie dye","shibori","indigo","workshop","textiles","craft","museum","dyeing","צביעת קשירה","שיבורי","אינדיגו","סדנה","טקסטיל","מלאכת יד","מוזיאון","צביעה","handkerchief","מטפחת"],"en":{"hype":"Arimatsu's shibori museum, with live tie-dye demonstrations and a workshop where you dye your own handkerchief.","reality":"The workshop is fun and you leave with a real souvenir; the museum is small. Book the workshop ahead.","tip":"Book the workshop by phone or email a few days before.","baby_notes":"Stairs to the second floor; the workshop is seated at a table.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Watch craftswomen bind cloth with tiny threads, then sit down to bind and dye a handkerchief in indigo yourself.","special":"Hundreds of different binding patterns, and some of the craftswomen have done this for decades.","highlights":["Binding demo","Dyeing workshop","Shibori shop"],"time_needed":"1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"The dyeing workshop is by advance booking only","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Museum Meiji-mura","name_ja":"博物館明治村","city":"nagoya","area":"Around Nagoya","category":"experience","lat":35.3418,"lng":136.9895,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"כפר מוזיאון ענק עם יותר מ-60 בניינים מתקופת מייג׳י שהועברו לכאן, כולל חזית מלון אימפריאל של פרנק לויד רייט.","reality":"מקום מיוחד מאוד שאפשר לבלות בו יום שלם, עם רכבת קיטור וחשמלית ישנה. השטח הררי וגדול, ובחורף נסגר מוקדם.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"אפשר להשכיר תלבושות מתקופת מייג׳י ולהסתובב בהן בין הבניינים.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e2276.html","https://shoryudo.go-centraljapan.jp/en/aichi_3/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים סלולים עם עליות חדות; רוב הבניינים עם מדרגות בכניסה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Museum%20Meiji-mura%20Inuyama","website_url":"https://www.meijimura.com/english/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נוסעים ברכבת הקיטור ובחשמלית של קיוטו, נכנסים לבתים, לכנסייה ולבית הכלא הישן, ומסיימים בלובי של מלון אימפריאל.","special":"הלובי המקורי של מלון אימפריאל מטוקיו, שתכנן פרנק לויד רייט, נבנה כאן מחדש.","highlights":["מלון אימפריאל","רכבת הקיטור","החשמלית של קיוטו","תלבושות מייג׳י"],"time_needed":"חצי יום-יום","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1 Uchiyama, Inuyama, Aichi","opens":"10:00","closes":"16:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":300,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בחורף נסגר ב-16:00 ויש ימי סגירה; לבדוק את לוח הפתיחה באתר","baby_block":null,"tags":["open air museum","meiji","architecture","historic buildings","steam train","frank lloyd wright","tram","costume rental","מוזיאון פתוח","מייג׳י","ארכיטקטורה","בניינים היסטוריים","רכבת קיטור","חשמלית","השכרת תלבושות","imperial hotel","מלון אימפריאל"],"en":{"hype":"A huge open-air museum with over 60 Meiji-era buildings moved here, including Frank Lloyd Wright's Imperial Hotel facade.","reality":"A special place for a full day, with a steam train and an old tram. The grounds are big and hilly, and in winter it closes early.","tip":"You can rent Meiji-era outfits and walk around in them.","baby_notes":"Paved paths with steep slopes; most buildings have steps at the door.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Ride the steam train and the old Kyoto tram, go into houses, a church and the old prison, and end in the Imperial Hotel lobby.","special":"The original Tokyo Imperial Hotel lobby by Frank Lloyd Wright was rebuilt here.","highlights":["Imperial Hotel","Steam train","Kyoto tram","Meiji outfits"],"time_needed":"Half to full day","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closes at 16:00 in winter with some closed days; check the calendar","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"The Little World Museum of Man","n