ות בנות 6 טון עם האבנים, טועמים מיסו ומסיימים בחנות.","special":"המיסו מתיישן שנתיים בחביות עץ תחת אבנים, באותה שיטה כבר מאות שנים.","highlights":["חביות העץ","ערימות האבנים","טעימת מיסו","גלידת מיסו"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"69 Okan-dori, Hatcho-cho, Okazaki, Aichi","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"הסיורים יוצאים פעם בשעה; משלבים עם טירת אוקאזאקי","baby_block":null,"tags":["miso","factory tour","brewery","fermentation","tasting","food culture","hatcho miso","מיסו","סיור במפעל","מבשלה","תסיסה","טעימות","תרבות אוכל","okazaki","אוקאזאקי"],"en":{"hype":"A miso brewery over 350 years old in Okazaki, with a free tour among giant wooden barrels topped with piles of stones.","reality":"A short, interesting tour with tastings, and this dark miso is the base of Nagoya cooking. Worth the trip with Okazaki Castle.","tip":"You taste miso at the end, and the shop also sells miso ice cream.","baby_notes":"Flat storehouses, fine with a stroller; strong miso smell.","price":"Tour free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Join the tour of the storehouses, see the 6-tonne barrels under their stones, taste the miso and finish at the shop.","special":"The miso ages two years in wooden barrels under stones, the same way for centuries.","highlights":["Wooden barrels","Stone piles","Miso tasting","Miso ice cream"],"time_needed":"An hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Tours leave about hourly; pair with Okazaki Castle","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Tokoname Climbing Kiln Plaza","name_ja":"登窯広場","city":"nagoya","area":"Around Nagoya","category":"experience","lat":34.8858,"lng":136.842,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גלריה וסטודיו לצד תנור מדרגות ישן בטוקונאמה, שבהם מציירים על כלי קרמיקה.","reality":"פעילות נחמדה ושקטה באמצע מסלול הקדרות, בלי הזמנה מראש. הכלי נשלח או נאסף אחרי הצריבה.","verdict":