cond hand","anime","figures","electronics","street food","רחוב קניות","מדרחוב מקורה","וינטג׳","יד שנייה","אנימה","פיגורות","אלקטרוניקה","אוכל רחוב","osu","אוסו"],"en":{"hype":"A grid of covered streets with about 1,200 shops: second-hand, anime, electronics, vintage clothes and street food.","reality":"The liveliest, most fun area in Nagoya, messy and local, with much better prices than Tokyo. Very crowded on weekends.","tip":"The streets are covered, so it is a good rainy-day spot.","baby_notes":"Covered, flat streets, a stroller copes; crowded on weekends.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Enter from Osu Kannon and wander Banshoji-dori and Shintencho: vintage shops, anime and figures, and street food at every corner.","special":"Temples, second-hand shops and street food together, with no mall feel.","highlights":["Vintage shops","Anime and figures","Street food","Osu Kannon temple"],"time_needed":"2-3 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Most shops open 10:00-11:00; busy on weekends","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Osu Kannon Antique Market","name_ja":"大須観音骨董市","city":"nagoya","area":"Osu & Kamimaezu","category":"shopping","lat":35.1592,"lng":136.8995,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שוק עתיקות ופשפשים בחצר מקדש אוסו קאנון, פעמיים בחודש.","reality":"כמה עשרות דוכנים של קימונו ישנים, כלי חרסינה, צעצועים ופריטים מוזרים. מחירים סבירים ואפשר להתמקח קצת.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כניסה חינם","tip":"מגיעים בבוקר, הדוכנים מתחילים לארוז ב-15:30.","sources":["https://nagoyabuzz.com/the-osu-antique-market","https://en.japantravel.com/aichi/osu-kannon-antique-fair/1409"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חצר שטוחה, עגלה עוברת בין הדוכנים.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Osu%20Kannon%20Nagoya","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מסתובבים בין הדוכנים בחצר המקדש, מחפשים קימונו ישן, כלי תה או גלויות, ומשם ממשיכים לרחובות