s and pop-ups.","reality":"Good for young Japanese fashion and character shops; less interesting if that is not your thing.","tip":"The upper floors have character and game shops.","baby_notes":"Lifts, easy with a stroller.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the three buildings of Japanese brands and go up to the character and anime floors.","special":null,"highlights":["Japanese fashion","Character shops","Pop-ups"],"time_needed":"An hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Direct exit from Yaba-cho Station","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Loft Nagoya","name_ja":"ロフト名古屋","city":"nagoya","area":"Sakae","category":"shopping","lat":35.1641,"lng":136.9035,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"חנות לייף סטייל יפנית בכמה קומות בנאדיה פארק: כלי כתיבה, קוסמטיקה ומתנות.","reality":"דומה להנדס, עם יותר קוסמטיקה ומוצרי טיפוח יפניים. מקום טוב למתנות קטנות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"קומת הקוסמטיקה היפנית שווה לקניית מתנות.","sources":["https://www.loft.co.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעליות, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Loft%20Nagoya%20Nadya%20Park","website_url":"https://www.loft.co.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין קומות כלי הכתיבה, הקוסמטיקה ומוצרי הבית, וקונים מתנות קטנות.","special":null,"highlights":["כלי כתיבה","קוסמטיקה יפנית","מתנות"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Nadya Park, 3-18-1 Sakae, Naka-ku, Nagoya","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עשר דקות הליכה מתחנת יבאצ׳ו","baby_block":null,"tags":["lifestyle store","stationery","cosmetics","skincare","gifts","homeware","כלי כתיבה","קוסמטיקה","טיפוח","מתנות","כלי בית","loft","לופט"],"en":{"hype":"A Japanese lifestyle store over several floors in Nadya Park: stationery, cosmetics and gifts.","reality":"Like Hands but with more Japanese cosmetics and skincare. A good place for small gifts.","tip":"The Japanese cosmetics floor is worth it for gifts.","baby_notes":"Lifts, easy with a stroller.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go through the stationery, cosmetics and homeware floors and pick up small gifts.","special":null,"highlights":["Stationery","Japanese cosmetics","Gifts"],"time_needed":"An hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"10 min walk from Yaba-cho Station","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Sakae Chika","name_ja":"サカエチカ","city":"nagoya","area":"Sakae","category":"shopping","lat":35.17,"lng":136.9085,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"קניון תת-קרקעי מתחת לתחנת סאקאה, עם חנויות אופנה, מתוקים ובתי קפה.","reality":"שימושי בגשם או בקור, ועובר בדרך בין התחנה, אואזיס 21 והכלבו. לא יעד בפני עצמו.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"המעברים מחברים בין התחנה, מיצוקושי ואואזיס 21 בלי לצאת לקור.","sources":["https://www.sakaechika.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מקורה וממוזג, יש מעליות לרחוב.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sakae%20Chika%20underground%20mall%20Nagoya","website_url":"https://www.sakaechika.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים במעברים בין התחנה לאתרים של סאקאה ועוצרים בחנויות המתוקים.","special":null,"highlights":["מעברים מקורים","מתוקים","אופנה"],"time_needed":"כחצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Sakae Station underground, 3-5 Sakae, Naka-ku, Nagoya","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"מקום טוב לעבור בו בין אתרי סאקאה ביום גשום","baby_block":null,"tags":["underground mall","shopping","sweets","fashion","rainy day","station","קניון תת קרקעי","קניות","מתוקים","אופנה","יום גשום","תחנה","sakae","סאקאה"],"en":{"hype":"An underground mall below Sakae Station with fashion, sweets and cafes.","reality":"Handy in rain or cold, and on the way between the station, Oasis 21 and the department stores. Not a destination.","tip":"The passages link the station, Mitsukoshi and Oasis 21 without going out into the cold.","baby_notes":"Covered and air-conditioned, with lifts to the street.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the passages between the station and Sakae's sights and stop at the sweet shops.","special":null,"highlights":["Covered passages","Sweets","Fashion"],"time_needed":"About 30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Good for moving between Sakae sights on a rainy day","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Mitsui Outlet Park Jazz Dream Nagashima","name_ja":"三井アウトレットパーク ジャズドリーム長島","city":"nagoya","area":"Around Nagoya","category":"shopping","lat":35.0335,"lng":136.732,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אחד מקניוני האאוטלט הגדולים ביפן, עם כ-300 חנויות של מותגים יפניים ובינלאומיים, ליד ספא לנד.","reality":"הנחות אמיתיות על מותגי ספורט ואופנה, אבל ענק ומעייף. כדאי רק עם רשימה, ובסופי שבוע עמוס.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"מבקשים בדלפק המידע קופון תיירים להנחה נוספת, עם דרכון.","sources":["https://www.nagoya-info.jp/en/spot/detail/43","https://mitsui-shopping-park.com/en/mop/nagashima/english/special/sightseeing/index.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שטח פתוח ושטוח, נוח לעגלה; יש חדרי הנקה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Mitsui%20Outlet%20Park%20Jazz%20Dream%20Nagashima","website_url":"https://mitsui-shopping-park.com/mop/nagashima/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מתמקדים במותגים מהרשימה, עוצרים לאוכל באזור המסעדות, וממשיכים לתאורה בנבאנה נו סאטו בערב.","special":null,"highlights":["מותגי ספורט","מותגים יפניים","קופון תיירים"],"time_needed":"חצי יום","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"333 Nagashimacho Urayasu, Kuwana, Mie","opens":"10:00","closes":"20:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":240,"booking":"no","plan_line":"אוטובוס ישיר ממייטטסו באס סנטר; לבקש קופון תיירים בכניסה","baby_block":null,"tags":["outlet","outlet mall","shopping","brands","discounts","sportswear","fashion","אאוטלט","קניון","קניות","מותגים","הנחות","בגדי ספורט","אופנה","nagashima","נגאשימה"],"en":{"hype":"One of Japan's biggest outlet malls, with about 300 Japanese and international brands next to Spa Land.","reality":"Real discounts on sports and fashion brands, but huge and tiring. Go with a list; busy on weekends.","tip":"Ask the info desk for a tourist coupon for an extra discount, with your passport.","baby_notes":"Open, flat grounds, easy with a stroller; nursing rooms on site.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Stick to the brands on your list, stop at the food court, and head on to the Nabana no Sato lights in the evening.","special":null,"highlights":["Sports brands","Japanese brands","Tourist coupon"],"time_needed":"Half a day","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Direct bus from Meitetsu Bus Center; ask for the tourist coupon","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Takeda Kahei Shoten","name_ja":"竹田嘉兵衛商店","city":"nagoya","area":"Around Nagoya","category":"shopping","lat":35.0676,"lng":136.9697,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"חנות שיבורי משפחתית ותיקה בארימאצו, בבית סוחרים היסטורי, עם בדים, מטפחות וקימונו צבועים ביד.","reality":"הבית עצמו יפה כמו מוזיאון, והמוצרים איכותיים אבל יקרים. גם להציץ בלי לקנות שווה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"מטפחת או צעיף שיבורי הם מזכרת קטנה ונוחה למזוודה.","sources":["https://linimo.pref.aichi.jp/en/spot/detail/18"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מפתן גבוה בכניסה; החנות צרה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Takeda%20Kahei%20Shoten%20Arimatsu","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים לבית הסוחרים, מסתכלים על הבדים והקימונו, ובוחרים מטפחת או צעיף.","special":"המשפחה עוסקת בשיבורי בארימאצו כבר דורות, והבית הוא נכס תרבות.","highlights":["בית הסוחרים","צעיפי שיבורי","קימונו"],"time_needed":"כחצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Takeda Kahei Shoten, Arimatsu, Midori-ku, Nagoya","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"חלק מהביקור ברחוב ארימאצו, החנויות נסגרות בסביבות 17:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["shibori","tie dye","indigo","textiles","kimono","scarves","crafts","souvenirs","שיבורי","צביעת קשירה","אינדיגו","טקסטיל","קימונו","צעיפים","מלאכת יד","מזכרות","arimatsu","ארימאצו"],"en":{"hype":"An old family shibori shop in Arimatsu, in a historic merchant house, with hand-dyed cloth, handkerchiefs and kimono.","reality":"The house itself is as pretty as a museum, and the goods are high quality but pricey. Worth a look even without buying.","tip":"A shibori handkerchief or scarf is an easy small souvenir for the suitcase.","baby_notes":"High step at the entrance; the shop is narrow.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Step into the merchant house, look over the cloth and kimono, and pick a handkerchief or scarf.","special":"The family has worked in shibori in Arimatsu for generations, and the house is a cultural property.","highlights":["Merchant house","Shibori scarves","Kimono"],"time_needed":"About 30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Part of an Arimatsu visit; shops close around 17:00","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Toyota Kaikan Museum","name_ja":"トヨタ会館","city":"nagoya","area":"Around Nagoya","category":"sight","lat":35.0549,"lng":137.158,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אולם התצוגה במטה של טויוטה בעיר טויוטה, עם תערוכה חדשה על איך בונים מכונית, מהתכנון ועד רובוטי הריתוך.","reality":"חינם ומעניין לחובבי רכב, אבל רחוק מנגויה, והסיורים במפעל עצמו לא מתקיימים כרגע. למי שלא חובב מכוניות, מוזיאון טויוטה ליד תחנת נגויה מספיק.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"ההסברים בתערוכה גם באנגלית; במקום סיור במפעל יש תיאטרון שמראה את פס הייצור.","sources":["https://global.toyota/en/newsroom/corporate/44438543.html","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3308.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"אולם תצוגה שטוח ומרווח, נוח לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Toyota%20Kaikan%20Museum%20Toyota%20City","website_url":"https://www.toyota.co.jp/en/about_toyota/facility/toyota_kaikan/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בתערוכה \"TOYOTA's Creative Carmaking\": דגם של המכונית הראשונה, פירוק של פריוס, רובוטי ריתוך ותיאטרון על פס הייצור, ומסיימים בדגמים החדשים באולם.","special":"נמצא ממש במטה של טויוטה, ליד המפעלים שבהם המכוניות נבנות.","highlights":["רובוטי ריתוך","התיאטרון של פס הייצור","הדגמים החדשים"],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1 Toyota-cho, Toyota, Aichi","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[0],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי ראשון ובחופשת סוף השנה; כשעה ברכבת מנגויה","baby_block":null,"tags":["toyota","cars","car showroom","robots","factory","automobile","museum","free","טויוטה","מכוניות","אולם תצוגה","רובוטים","מפעל","רכב","מוזיאון","חינם","toyota city","עיר טויוטה"],"en":{"hype":"The showroom at Toyota's head office in Toyota City, with a new exhibit on how a car is made, from design to welding robots.","reality":"Free and interesting for car fans, but far from Nagoya, and plant tours are not running now. If cars are not your thing, the Toyota museum by Nagoya Station is enough.","tip":"Exhibit labels are also in English; instead of a plant tour there is a theatre showing the production line.","baby_notes":"Flat, roomy showroom, easy with a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk through \"TOYOTA's Creative Carmaking\": a model of the first car, a stripped-down Prius, welding robots and a production-line theatre, then the new models in the hall.","special":"It sits at Toyota's head office, next to the plants where the cars are built.","highlights":["Welding robots","Production-line theatre","New models"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Sundays and over New Year; about an hour by train from Nagoya","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Meiji no Yakata","name_ja":"明治の館","city":"nikko","area":"Shrines & Town","category":"food","lat":36.7563,"lng":139.6015,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בית אבן מערבי מתחילת המאה ה-20 ביער שליד טושוגו, מפורסם באומורייס, בסטייק וואגיו ובעוגת גבינה.","reality":"האוכל טוב ולא זול, והבית הישן בתוך עצי הארז הוא הסיבה האמיתית לבוא. בסופי שבוע יש תור ואין הזמנות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":3.67,"google_score":null,"price":"¥3,000-4,000 לסועד","tip":"לסיים בעוגת הגבינה של הבית, היא המנה שכולם לוקחים.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/tochigi/A0903/A090301/9000107/","https://www.meiji-yakata.com/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"ילדים רצויים, 100 מקומות ישיבה ואין עישון.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Meiji%20no%20Yakata%20Nikko","website_url":"https://www.meiji-yakata.com/","serves":"יושוקו, אוכל מערבי בסגנון יפני: אומורייס (חביתה על אורז מטוגן), סטייקים והמבורגר סטייק מבשר וואגיו מטוצ'יגי.","dishes":["אומורייס","סטייק וואגיו טוצ'יגי","עוגת גבינה"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher":"options","kosher_note":"סטייק והמבורגר בקר הם בחירה בטוחה, לשאול על הרכיבים באומורייס.","address":"2339-1 Sannai, Nikko, Tochigi","opens":"11:00","closes":"19:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בסופי שבוע ובצהריים אין הזמנות, להגיע ב-11:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["omurice","omelette rice","yoshoku","western food","steak","wagyu","cheesecake","cake","heritage house","אומורייס","יושוקו","אוכל מערבי","סטייק","וואגיו","עוגת גבינה","עוגה","בית היסטורי"],"en":{"hype":"A Western-style stone house from the early 1900s in the woods by Toshogu, known for omurice, Tochigi wagyu steak and cheesecake.","reality":"The food is good and not cheap. The old house among the cedars is the real reason to come. Weekends mean a queue and no bookings.","tip":"Finish with the house cheesecake, it's what everyone orders.","baby_notes":"Kids welcome, 100 seats, no smoking.","price":"¥3,000-4,000 per person","serves":"Yoshoku, Japanese-style Western food: omurice (omelette over fried rice), steaks and hamburg steak from Tochigi wagyu.","dishes":["Omurice","Tochigi wagyu steak","Cheesecake"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":"Beef steak and hamburg are the safe picks; ask what goes into the omurice.","plan_line":"No bookings on weekends or at lunch, arrive at 11:00","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Gourmands Wagyu","name_ja":"グルマンズ和牛","city":"nikko","area":"Around Nikko","category":"food","lat":36.7665,"lng":139.6185,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בית סטייקים קטן בדרך לקירִיפוּרִי שמגיש וואגיו מטוצ'יגי, מאזאווה ומצוקה, מהדירוגים הגבוהים בניקו בטאבלוג.","reality":"סטייק ברמה גבוהה במחיר של ארוחה חגיגית. רק 11 מקומות ליד שולחנות וכמה חדרים פרטיים, אז בלי הזמנה קשה להיכנס.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":3.71,"google_score":null,"price":"¥8,000-20,000 לסועד","tip":"בצהריים יש סטים זולים יותר מהערב לאותו בשר.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/tochigi/A0903/A090301/9000108/","https://www.g-wagyu.com"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"ילדים רצויים ויש חדרים פרטיים לזוג או למשפחה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gourmands%20Wagyu%20Nikko","website_url":"https://www.g-wagyu.com","serves":"סטים של סטייק פילה או סירלוין מוואגיו יפני, עם מנות פתיחה וקינוח, ומר