,000-8,000 לסועד","tip":"סטייק דון (סטייק על אורז) הוא הדרך הזולה לטעום את הוואגיו.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/tochigi/A0903/A090301/9018659/","https://myogetsubo.com/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Myogetsubo%20Nikko","website_url":"https://myogetsubo.com/","serves":"סטייקים וגריל, עם יובה (קרום טופו, המאכל של ניקו) במנות שונות, וגם עוגת גבינה אפויה.","dishes":["סטייק וואגיו טוצ'יגי","סטייק דון","המבורגר עם יובה טרייה","יובה דון"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher":"friendly","kosher_note":"רוב המנות בקר ויובה, בלי פירות ים.","address":"2381 Sannai, Nikko, Tochigi","opens":"11:00","closes":"19:30","closed_weekdays":[3],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":75,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"הזמנה רק אונליין, הטלפון לא עונה; סגור ברביעי","baby_block":null,"tags":["steak","wagyu","grill","yuba","tofu skin","steak bowl","donburi","hamburg","cheesecake","temple house","סטייק","וואגיו","גריל","יובה","קרום טופו","דונבורי","המבורגר","עוגת גבינה"],"en":{"hype":"A grill and steak place in an old Rinnoji temple lodging in the woods by Shinkyo Bridge, with Tochigi wagyu and yuba.","reality":"Pretty and quiet, a short walk from Toshogu, better for a long meal than a quick stop. Prices are above the town average.","tip":"The steak don (steak over rice) is the cheaper way to try the wagyu.","baby_notes":null,"price":"¥3,000-8,000 per person","serves":"Steaks and grills, with yuba (tofu skin, Nikko's local food) in different dishes, plus baked cheesecake.","dishes":["Tochigi wagyu steak","Steak don","Hamburg with fresh yuba","Yuba don"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":"Mostly beef and yuba, no seafood.","plan_line":"Book online only, the phone isn't answered; closed Wednesday","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Sakaeya","name_ja":"さかえや","