eserestaurant.ritzcarltonnikko.com/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"תינוקות ועגלות רצויים, יש תפריט ילדים וחדרים פרטיים בתשלום.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=The%20Ritz-Carlton%20Nikko","website_url":"https://www.japaneserestaurant.ritzcarltonnikko.com/","serves":"שני חלקים: דלפק סושי עם דגים ויובה, וטפניאקי של בקר וירקות מקומיים על פלטה.","dishes":["סושי אומקסה","טפניאקי בקר טוצ'יגי","יובה טרייה"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher":"options","kosher_note":"בטפניאקי אפשר להרכיב ארוחה מבקר ודגים, בסושי לבקש בלי פירות ים.","address":"2482 Chugushi, Nikko, Tochigi","opens":"12:00","closes":"22:00","closed_weekdays":[3,4],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":120,"booking":"required","plan_line":"להזמין אונליין; הסושי סגור ברביעי וחמישי, הטפניאקי בשלישי","baby_block":null,"tags":["sushi","teppanyaki","omakase","beef","wagyu","yuba","lake view","fine dining","hotel restaurant","kaiseki","סושי","טפניאקי","אומקסה","בקר","וואגיו","יובה","נוף לאגם","מסעדת מלון","ארוחה חגיגית"],"en":{"hype":"The Ritz-Carlton's sushi and teppanyaki restaurant on Lake Chuzenji, with lake fish, yuba and Tochigi beef.","reality":"Very high level food and a big lake view, at luxury-hotel prices. One special meal for the trip.","tip":"Sushi lunch gives the same view and chef for about a third of dinner.","baby_notes":"Babies and strollers welcome, kids menu, private rooms for a fee.","price":"¥8,000-10,000 at lunch, ¥20,000-30,000 at dinner","serves":"Two parts: a sushi counter with fish and yuba, and teppanyaki of local beef and vegetables on the griddle.","dishes":["Omakase sushi","Tochigi beef teppanyaki","Fresh yuba"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":"Teppanyaki works with beef and fish; at sushi ask for no shellfish.","plan_line":"Book online; sushi closed Wed and Thu, teppanyaki Tue","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_