e paid shrine area, so you can visit separately.","baby_notes":"New building with an elevator, easy with a stroller.","price":"¥1,000, ¥2,400 with the shrine","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"See Ieyasu's armour and swords, shrine treasures, and a short film about his life.","special":null,"highlights":["Ieyasu's armour","Animated film"],"time_needed":"45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"For history fans only, the combo ticket saves ¥200","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Takinoo Shrine","name_ja":"瀧尾神社","city":"nikko","area":"Shrines & Town","category":"sight","lat":36.766,"lng":139.5918,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש קטן ביער מאחורי פוטאראסאן, בסוף שביל אבן עתיק בין עצי ארז.","reality":"הדרך לשם היא העיקר: יער שקט, טחב ומפל קטן, כמעט בלי תיירים. המקדש עצמו פשוט.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"בשער הטוריי יש חור קטן: אומרים שמי שמשחיל דרכו אבן מתוך שלוש, המשאלה שלו מתגשמת.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3800.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Takinoo%20Shrine%20Nikko","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים מאחורי מקדש פוטאראסאן בשביל אבן ביער, כ-20-30 דקות בעלייה קלה, עד המקדש ומפל שירטו ליד.","special":"חלק מדרך העלייה לרגל הישנה, הרבה יותר שקט מהמקדשים הגדולים.","highlights":["שביל האבן ביער","מפל שירטו","טוריי המזל"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי הלוך וחזור","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Sannai, Nikko, Tochigi","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"שביל ביער עם מדרגות אבן, נעלי הליכה ולא בחושך","baby_block":"שביל אבן ביער, אין מעבר לעגלה","tags":["shrine","forest walk","hiking trail","cedar","moss","waterfall","quiet","מקדש","הליכה ביער","שביל","ארז","טחב","מפל","שקט"],"en":{"hype":"A small shrine in the forest behind Futarasan, at the end of an old stone path through cedars.","reality":"The walk is the point: quiet forest, moss and a small waterfall, almost no tourists. The shrine itself is simple.","tip":"The torii gate has a small hole: get one of three pebbles through it and your wish comes true, they say.","baby_notes":null,"price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk behind Futarasan Shrine on a forest stone path, 20-30 minutes gently uphill, to the shrine and Shiraito falls nearby.","special":"Part of the old pilgrim route, far quieter than the big shrines.","highlights":["Forest stone path","Shiraito falls","Lucky torii"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours round trip","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Forest path with stone steps, wear walking shoes, not after dark","baby_block":"Forest stone path, no stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hongu Shrine","name_ja":"本宮神社","city":"nikko","area":"Shrines & Town","category":"sight","lat":36.7543,"lng":139.6018,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המקדש הראשון של ניקו, מהמאה ה-8, ממש מעל הגשר האדום, וליד מקדש שיהונריוג׳י והפגודה הקטנה שלו.","reality":"שקט וכמעט ריק, עצירה של רבע שעה בדרך מהגשר. לא מרשים כמו הגדולים, אבל זו נקודת ההתחלה ההיסטורית.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"עולים במדרגות מימין לגשר האדום, לפני שממשיכים לרינוֹג׳י.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3800.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hongu%20Shrine%20Nikko","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במדרגות מהכביש, רואים את המקדש ואת פגודת שיהונריוג׳י, וממשיכים בשביל לרינוֹג׳י.","special":null,"highlights":["פגודת שיהונריוג׳י","מקדש בתוך היער"],"time_needed":"15-20 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Sannai, Nikko, Tochigi","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":20,"booking":"no","p