","baby_block":null,"tags":["castella","sponge cake","cake","sweets","souvenir","gift","קסטלה","עוגת ספוג","עוגה","מתוקים","מזכרות","מתנה"],"en":{"hype":"Nikko's local castella (Japanese sponge cake) chain, with a branch by the shrine entrance.","reality":"A tasty souvenir that's easy to carry. Free samples, so no blind buying.","tip":"The Nishisando branch is handy after Toshogu.","baby_notes":null,"price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Taste castella in a few flavours and pick up a gift box.","special":null,"highlights":["Classic castella","Gift boxes"],"time_needed":"15 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Free samples, buy at the end of the day so you don't carry it","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kegon Falls","name_ja":"華厳滝","city":"nikko","area":"Lake Chuzenji & Okunikko","category":"sight","lat":36.7381,"lng":139.5017,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מפל בגובה 97 מטר שיוצא מאגם צ׳וזנג׳י, נחשב לאחד משלושת המפלים היפים ביפן.","reality":"מרשים באמת, במיוחד מהתצפית התחתונה. בחורף חלק מהמפלים הקטנים מסביב קופאים, וזה יפה במיוחד.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥600 למעלית, התצפית העליונה בחינם","tip":"המעלית יורדת 100 מטר בתוך הסלע לתצפית מול המפל, שווה את ה-¥600.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3812.html","https://kegon.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"המעלית והתצפית נגישות לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kegon%20Falls%20Nikko","website_url":"https://kegon.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יורדים במעלית לתצפית בבסיס המפל, מצלמים, ועולים חזרה. אפשר גם לראות מלמעלה בחינם, מכמה דקות הליכה.","special":"המים נופלים בבת אחת מקצה האגם, ובחורף נוצרים לידו עמודי קרח.","highlights":["תצפית תחתונה","המפלים הקפואים בחורף"],"time_needed":"30-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2479-2 Chugushi, Nikko, Tochigi","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"5 דקות הליכה מתחנת Chuzenji Onsen, משלבים עם האגם","baby_block":null,"tags":["waterfall","falls","kegon","observation deck","elevator","frozen waterfall","lake chuzenji","מפל","מפלים","תצפית","מעלית","מפל קפוא","אגם"],"en":{"hype":"A 97-meter waterfall pouring out of Lake Chuzenji, counted among Japan's three most beautiful.","reality":"Truly impressive, especially from the lower deck. In winter the smaller falls around it freeze, which looks great.","tip":"The elevator drops 100 m through the rock to a deck facing the falls, worth the ¥600.","baby_notes":"Elevator and deck are stroller-friendly.","price":"¥600 elevator, upper deck free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Take the elevator down to the deck at the base, take photos, come back up. You can also see it from above for free, a few minutes' walk away.","special":"The water drops in one go off the lake's edge, and icicle columns form beside it in winter.","highlights":["Lower deck","Frozen falls in winter"],"time_needed":"30-45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"5 minutes' walk from Chuzenji Onsen bus stop, pair with the lake","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Lake Chuzenji","name_ja":"中禅寺湖","city":"nikko","area":"Lake Chuzenji & Okunikko","category":"sight","lat":36.735,"lng":139.465,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אגם הרים גדול בגובה 1,269 מטר, למרגלות הר נאנטאי, עם וילות שגרירים ישנות על החוף.","reality":"יפה ושקט, בעיקר בשלכת. בדצמבר קר מאוד, הסירות לא שטות וחלק מהאתרים סגורים, אבל הנוף נשאר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"האוטובוס מניקו לוקח כ-45 דקות בעליית אירוהאזקה, ועולה ¥1,250 לכיוון.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3806.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"טיילת לאורך החוף ליד העיירה, נוחה לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lake%20Chuzenji%20Nikko","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מטיילים על החוף ליד צ׳וזנג׳י אונסן, נכנסים למקדש צ׳וגושי ולמפל קגון, ובעונה עולים על סירה או הולכים לווילות השגרירים.","special":"בתחילת המאה ה-20 היה כאן אזור הקיץ של שגרירויות זרות.","highlights":["נוף להר נאנטאי","מפל קגון","וילות השגרירים"],"time_needed":"חצי יום","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Chugushi, Nikko, Tochigi","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":180,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בחורף קר מאוד בגובה, לבוא עם מעיל חם ולצאת בבוקר","baby_block":null,"tags":["lake","mountain lake","chuzenji","nantai","scenery","autumn leaves","lakeside walk","אגם","אגם הרים","נוף","שלכת","הליכה","הר נאנטאי"],"en":{"hype":"A large mountain lake at 1,269 m, below Mount Nantai, with old embassy villas on its shore.","reality":"Pretty and calm, best in autumn. December is very cold, the boats stop and some sights close, but the view is still there.","tip":"The bus from Nikko takes about 45 minutes up Irohazaka and costs ¥1,250 each way.","baby_notes":"Lakeside promenade by the town, fine for a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the shore at Chuzenji Onsen, see Chugushi shrine and Kegon Falls, and in season take a boat or visit the embassy villas.","special":"In the early 1900s this was the summer retreat for foreign embassies.","highlights":["Mount Nantai view","Kegon Falls","Embassy villas"],"time_needed":"Half a day","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Very cold up here in winter, bring a warm coat and go early","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Chuzenji Temple","name_ja":"日光山中禅寺 立木観音","city":"nikko","area":"Lake Chuzenji & Okunikko","category":"sight","lat":36.7305,"lng":139.493,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש על שפת האגם, עם פסל קאנון בגובה שישה מטר שגולף מעץ שעדיין נטוע באדמה.","reality":"הפסל מיוחד והמרפסת משקיפה יפה על האגם. קטן, מספיקה חצי שעה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥500","tip":"20 דקות הליכה מתחנת Chuzenji Onsen לאורך החוף, הליכה יפה בפני עצמה.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3820.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש מדרגות לקומה השנייה ולמרפסת.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Chuzenji%20Temple%20Nikko","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"רואים את הקאנון העצום, עולים לקומה השנייה לחמשת מלכי הדווה ויוצאים למרפסת מעל האגם.","special":"הפסל גולף ישירות בעץ חי, לפי המסורת בידי המייסד של ניקו.","highlights":["קאנון העץ","מרפסת מעל האגם"],"time_needed":"כחצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2578 Chugushi, Nikko, Tochigi","opens":"08:30","closes":"15:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בדצמבר נסגר ב-15:30, כניסה אחרונה 15:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["temple","kannon","buddhist","statue","lake view","tachiki kannon","מקדש","קאנון","בודהיסטי","פסל","נוף לאגם"],"en":{"hype":"A lakeside temple with a 6-meter Kannon carved from a tree still rooted in the ground.","reality":"The statue is unique and the veranda has a fine lake view. Small, half an hour is enough.","tip":"A 20-minute walk from Chuzenji Onsen bus stop along the shore, a nice walk in itself.","baby_notes":"Stairs to the second floor and veranda.","price":"¥500","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"See the huge Kannon, go up to the five Deva Kings on the second floor, and step out on the veranda over the lake.","special":"The statue was carved straight into a living tree, by Nikko's founder as tradition says.","highlights":["Tree Kannon","Lake veranda"],"time_needed":"About 30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"In December it closes at 15:30, last entry 15:00","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Futarasan Shrine Chugushi","name_ja":"日光二荒山神社 中宮祠","city":"nikko","area":"Lake Chuzenji & Okunikko","category":"sight","lat":36.7413,"lng":139.49,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המקדש האמצעי של פוטאראסאן על שפת האגם, נקודת ההתחלה לטיפוס להר נאנטאי.","reality":"שער טוריי יפה מול האגם ומקדש שקט. עצירה קצרה אם כבר נמצאים בצ׳וזנג׳י.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"הטוריי על החוף נותן צילום טוב עם האגם וההר.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3806.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"הכניסה במדרגות, החצר עצמה שטוחה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Futarasan%20Shrine%20Chugushi%20Nikko","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בטוריי מול האגם, מסתכלים על המקדש, ובעונה רואים את השער לשביל של הר נאנטאי.","special":null,"highlights":["טוריי מול האגם","שער שביל נאנטאי"],"time_needed":"20 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2484 Chugushi, Nikko, Tochigi","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":20,"booking":"no","plan_line":"10 דקות הליכה מתחנת Chuzenji Onsen, לאורך האגם","baby_block":null,"tags":["shrine","shinto","torii","lake","nantai","מקדש","שינטו","טוריי","אגם","הר נאנטאי"],"en":{"hype":"Futarasan's middle shrine on the lake shore, the starting point for the Mount Nantai climb.","reality":"A nice torii facing the lake and a quiet shrine. A short stop if you're already at Chuzenji.","tip":"The lakeside torii makes a good photo with the lake and mountain.","baby_notes":"Steps at the entrance, the courtyard is flat.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk through the torii facing the lake, see the shrine, and in season the gate to the Nantai trail.","special":null,"highlights":["Lakeside torii","Nantai trail gate"],"time_needed":"20 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"10 minutes' walk from Chuzenji Onsen bus stop along the lake","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
