12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור מדצמבר עד מרץ. כרטיס משולב עם הבריטית ב-¥450","baby_block":null,"tags":["villa","embassy","italian","lakeside","architecture","cedar bark","history","וילה","שגרירות","איטליה","אגם","ארכיטקטורה","היסטוריה"],"en":{"hype":"The Italian ambassador's 1928 summer villa on the lake, clad in cedar bark.","reality":"Lovely, with a deck on the water and an unusual wooden building. Closed all winter, December to March.","tip":"The deck with wicker chairs facing the lake is the place to sit and look.","baby_notes":"Forest path with steps down to the shore.","price":"¥300, ¥450 with the British villa","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go into the villa, see the cedar bark walls, and sit on the deck facing the lake.","special":"Every wall is covered in cedar bark in geometric patterns.","highlights":["Lakeside deck","Cedar bark walls"],"time_needed":"40 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Dec to March. Combo with the British villa ¥450","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"British Embassy Villa Memorial Park","name_ja":"英国大使館別荘記念公園","city":"nikko","area":"Lake Chuzenji & Okunikko","category":"sight","lat":36.7262,"lng":139.486,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"וילת הקיץ של שגרירות בריטניה על שפת האגם, עם קפה ותה אנגלי בחלון לאגם.","reality":"קטנה ונעימה, השילוב עם הווילה האיטלקית השכנה עובד טוב. סגורה בחורף.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥300, ¥450 כולל הווילה האיטלקית","tip":"הקפה בקומה הראשונה מגיש תה וסקונס, שווה לשבת מול החלון.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3806.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מדרגות פנימיות לקומה השנייה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=British%20Embassy%20Villa%20Memorial%20Park%20Nikko","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין החדרים עם תמונות מהתקופה, ויושבים לתה בחדר מול הא