to Musasabi bridge for the gorge view.","special":"Three sections in three rock colours, white, blue-green and purple.","highlights":["Nijimi falls","Musasabi bridge","Autumn leaves"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Train to Ryuokyo, two stops past Kinugawa-Onsen","baby_block":"Steep steps down to the river"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kinugawa Koen Iwaburo","name_ja":"鬼怒川公園岩風呂","city":"nikko","area":"Kinugawa Onsen","category":"experience","lat":36.829,"lng":139.7145,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מרחץ ציבורי של העירייה בקינוגאווה, עם אמבטיות סלע פתוחות בתוך יער.","reality":"הדרך הזולה לטבול בקינוגאווה בלי ללון בריוקן. פשוט, לא מפואר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"לבוא עם מגבת, או לקנות שם.","sources":["https://www.tobu.co.jp/en/sightseeing/news/1213.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kinugawa%20Koen%20Iwaburo%20Nikko","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"משלמים בכניסה, מתקלחים וטובלים באמבטיות הסלע הפתוחות מוקפות עצים.","special":null,"highlights":["אמבטיות סלע בחוץ"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Kinugawaonsen Ohara, Nikko, Tochigi","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"אונסן זול בקינוגאווה, לבדוק שעות לפני שמגיעים","baby_block":"מים חמים, לא לתינוק","tags":["onsen","hot spring","public bath","outdoor bath","rotenburo","day use","cheap","אונסן","מעיין חם","מרחץ ציבורי","אמבטיה בחוץ","זול"],"en":{"hype":"A city-run public bath in Kinugawa, with open-air rock baths in the woods.","reality":"The cheap way to soak in Kinugawa without staying at a ryokan. Simple, not fancy.","tip":"Bring a towel, or buy one there.","baby_notes":null,"price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Pay at the entrance, shower, and soak in the open-air rock baths among the trees.","special":null,"highlights":["Outdoor rock baths"],"time_needed":"An hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Cheap onsen in Kinugawa, check the hours before going","baby_block":"Hot water, not for a baby"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"SL Taiju Steam Train","name_ja":"SL大樹","city":"nikko","area":"Kinugawa Onsen","category":"experience","lat":36.825,"lng":139.714,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רכבת קיטור אמיתית של Tobu בין שימו-אימאיצ׳י לקינוגאווה אונסן, כ-35-40 דקות נסיעה.","reality":"כיף לילדים ולחובבי רכבות, עם קרון בסגנון ישן. אם רק רוצים לראות, את סיבוב הקטר על המסתובבה רואים בחינם בתחנה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"מושב שמור ¥1,000-1,150 מעבר לכרטיס","tip":"הקטר מסתובב על המסתובבה ליד תחנת Kinugawa-Onsen אחרי ההגעה, שווה לחכות לזה.","sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/大樹_(列車)"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש מקום לעגלה מתקפלת, הרעש של הקיטור חזק בתחנה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=SL%20Taiju%20Steam%20Train%20Nikko","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים בשימו-אימאיצ׳י או בקינוגאווה, נוסעים בקרון הישן, וצופים בקטר מסתובב על המסתובבה בסוף הדרך.","special":"אחת הרכבות היחידות באזור טוקיו שעדיין מושכת קטר קיטור כמעט כל יום.","highlights":["נסיעה בקרון הישן","סיבוב הקטר בתחנה"],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Kinugawa-Onsen Station, Nikko, Tochigi","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":60,"booking":"required","plan_line":"כל המושבים שמורים, להזמין באתר Tobu. לא נוסעת כל יום","baby_block":null,"tags":["steam train","train","locomotive","railway","turntable","family","kids","רכבת קיטור","רכבת","קטר","משפחה","ילדים"],"en":{"hype":"A real Tobu steam train between Shimo-Imaichi and Kinugawa-Onsen, about 35-40 minutes.","reality":"Fun for kids and train fans, with old-style cars. If you just want to watch, the turntable at the station is free.","tip":"The engine turns on the turntable by Kinugawa-Onsen Station after arrival, worth waiting for.","baby_notes":"Room for a folded stroller, steam is loud at the station.","price":"Reserved seat ¥1,000-1,150 on top of the fare","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Board at Shimo-Imaichi or Kinugawa, ride in the old car, and watch the engine turn at the end.","special":"One of the few trains near Tokyo still pulled by steam almost daily.","highlights":["Old-style car ride","Engine turning at the station"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"All seats reserved, book on the Tobu site. Not every day","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Heike no Sato","name_ja":"平家の里","city":"nikko","area":"Kinugawa Onsen","category":"sight","lat":36.93,"lng":139.596,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"כפר מוזיאון ביוניושיגאווה אונסן, עם בתי קש של צאצאי שבט הייקה שברחו להרים.","reality":"שקט ויפה, בעיקר בשלג. רחוק מאוד, כשעה באוטובוס מקינוגאווה, אז רק למי שלן ביוניושיגאווה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"בחורף יש ביוניושיגאווה פסטיבל עם מאות בתי שלג קטנים, אבל הוא מתחיל רק בסוף ינואר.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3875.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילי חצץ בין הבתים.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Heike%20no%20Sato%20Nikko","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין בתי הקש, רואים כלים וחפצים מחיי ההר ואת סיפור הבריחה של שבט הייקה.","special":null,"highlights":["בתי הקש","תצוגת חיי הכפר"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Yunishigawa, Nikko, Tochigi","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"שעה באוטובוס מקינוגאווה, מתאים רק עם לינה ביוניושיגאווה","baby_block":null,"tags":["village","museum","thatched houses","heike","history","snow","yunishigawa","כפר","מוזיאון","בתי קש","היסטוריה","שלג"],"en":{"hype":"A village museum in Yunishigawa Onsen, with thatched houses of the Heike clan descendants who fled to the mountains.","reality":"Quiet and pretty, best in snow. Very far, about an hour by bus from Kinugawa, so only if staying in Yunishigawa.","tip":"Yunishigawa's winter festival with hundreds of little snow huts only starts in late January.","baby_notes":"Gravel paths between the houses.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk among the thatched houses, see mountain-life tools and the story of the Heike clan's escape.","special":null,"highlights":["Thatched houses","Village life display"],"time_needed":"An hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"An hour by bus from Kinugawa, only with a stay in Yunishigawa","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kirifuri Falls","name_ja":"霧降の滝","city":"nikko","area":"Around Nikko","category":"sight","lat":36.774,"lng":139.6205,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מפל דו-שלבי בגובה 75 מטר ביער מצפון לעיר, יפה במיוחד בשלכת.","reality":"נוף יפה מהתצפית ובלי המונים, אבל רואים אותו רק מרחוק. השביל לבסיס סגור.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"יש ערפל לפעמים, כדאי לבדוק מזג אוויר לפני שנוסעים.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3821.html","https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/霧降高原"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שביל סלול ברובו מהחניה לתצפית, 10 דקות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kirifuri%20Falls%20Nikko","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יורדים מהאוטובוס, הולכים 10 דקות בשביל לתצפית ומסתכלים על שני השלבים של המפל מעל היער.","special":null,"highlights":["התצפית","שלכת בסוף אוקטובר"],"time_needed":"40 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Tokorono, Nikko, Tochigi","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"אוטובוס כל 2-3 שעות מהתחנות, לבדוק את החזרה לפני","baby_block":null,"tags":["waterfall","falls","viewpoint","autumn leaves","forest","מפל","מפלים","תצפית","שלכת","יער"],"en":{"hype":"A two-tier, 75 m waterfall in the forest north of town, best in autumn.","reality":"A nice view from the deck without crowds, but only from a distance. The path to the base is closed.","tip":"Mist sometimes hides it, check the weather before going.","baby_notes":"Mostly paved 10-minute path from the car park to the deck.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Get off the bus, walk 10 minutes to the deck and see both tiers above the forest.","special":null,"highlights":["Viewing deck","Leaves in late October"],"time_needed":"40 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Buses every 2-3 hours from the stations, check the return first","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kirifuri Kogen Kisugedaira Park","name_ja":"霧降高原キスゲ平園地","city":"nikko","area":"Around Nikko","category":"experience","lat":36.7955,"lng":139.6365,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אתר סקי לשעבר ברמת קיריפורי, עם מדרגות של 1,445 שלבים במעלה ההר ונוף על כל האזור.","reality":"עלייה מתישה אבל מתגמלת, עם נוף עד טוקיו בימים בהירים. ביולי מכוסה פרחים צהובים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"יש ספסלים לאורך המדרגות, ואפשר להסתובב באמצע ולחזור.","sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/霧降高原"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kirifuri%20Kogen%20Kisugedaira%20Park%20Nikko","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים את 1,445 המדרגות בצלע ההר עד התצפית למעלה, ויורדים חזרה למרכז המבקרים.","special":"המדרגות נבנו במקום מסלול הסקי הישן, עם נוף פתוח על כל המישור.","highlights":["1,445 המדרגות","התצפית העליונה","פרחי קיסוגה ביולי"],"time_needed":"שעה וחצי-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Tokorono, Nikko, Tochigi","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":100,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בחורף האוטובוס לא מגיע עד כאן, צריך רכב","baby_block":"מאות מדרגות, בלי עגלה","tags":["stairs","hike","viewpoint","highland","flowers","plateau","day hike","מדרגות","טיול","תצפית","רמה","פרחים","נוף"],"en":{"hype":"A former ski slope on the Kirifuri plateau, with 1,445 steps up the mountain and a view over the whole region.","reality":"A tiring but rewarding climb, with views to Tokyo on clear days. In July it's covered in yellow flowers.","tip":"There are benches along the steps, and you can turn back halfway.","baby_notes":null,"price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Climb the 1,445 steps up the slope to the top lookout, then come back down to the visitor center.","special":"The steps replaced the old ski run, with an open view over the plain.","highlights":["1,445 steps","Top lookout","Kisuge lilies in July"],"time_needed":"1.5-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"In winter the bus doesn't come up here, you need a car","baby_block":"Hundreds of steps, no stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Nikko Cedar Avenue","name_ja":"日光杉並木","city":"nikko","area":"Around Nikko","category":"sight","lat":36.729,"lng":139.687,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שדרה של כ-12,000 עצי ארז עתיקים לאורך הדרכים לניקו, השדרה הארוכה בעולם בספר השיאים.","reality":"הליכה שקטה ומרשימה בין ארזים בני 400 שנה, אבל רק מקטעים קצרים נוחים להליכה, ולאורך חלק מהדרך עוברות מכוניות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"המקטע הנוח מתחיל בפארק סוגי נאמיקי באימאיצ׳י, עם גלגלי מים ובתים ישנים.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3800.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"בפארק השבילים שטוחים, לאורך הכביש אין מדרכה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nikko%20Cedar%20Avenue%20Nikko","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים בשביל לאורך השדרה בפארק באימאיצ׳י, בין העצים הענקיים, ורואים את גלגלי המים בפארק.","special":"העצים ניטעו לפני כ-400 שנה כמתנה לטושוגו.","highlights":["הארזים הענקיים","גלגלי המים בפארק"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Imaichi, Nikko, Tochigi","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לרדת בשימו-אימאיצ׳י ולהתחיל בפארק סוגי נאמיקי","baby_block":null,"tags":["cedar","trees","avenue","walk","forest","guinness","history","ארז","עצים","שדרה","הליכה","יער","היסטוריה"],"en":{"hype":"An avenue of about 12,000 ancient cedars along the roads to Nikko, the world's longest in the record books.","reality":"A quiet, striking walk among 400-year-old cedars, but only short stretches are good for walking, and cars run along parts of it.","tip":"The easy stretch starts at Sugi Namiki Park in Imaichi, with water wheels and old houses.","baby_notes":"Flat paths in the park, no sidewalk along the road.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the path along the avenue in the Imaichi park among the giant trees, and see the park's water wheels.","special":"The trees were planted about 400 years ago as a gift to Toshogu.","highlights":["Giant cedars","Park water wheels"],"time_needed":"An hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Get off at Shimo-Imaichi and start at Sugi Namiki Park","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
where not exists (select 1 from place_library p where p.city = x.city and lower(p.name) = lower(x.name));
