יר.","address":"Shuri Kinjocho, Naha, Okinawa","opens":"10:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[2],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי ג׳. עוצרים כאן באמצע דרך האבנים","baby_block":"דרך אבנים תלולה, קשה עם עגלה","tags":["dessert","sweets","ice cream","shaved ice","zenzai","קינוח","קינוחים","גלידה","קרח גרוס","זנזאי","mango","kakigori","terrace","view","stone path","מנגו","קקיגורי","מרפסת","נוף"],"en":{"hype":"Tea house on the old Kinjo-cho stone path in Shuri, with a terrace looking over Naha.","reality":"The terrace view is the main thing. Simple food, and mango shaved ice is a good break halfway down.","tip":null,"baby_notes":null,"price":"Mango shaved ice ¥750","serves":"Mango shaved ice, zenzai (sweet red beans over ice), Okinawa soba and taco rice.","dishes":["Mango shaved ice","Zenzai","Soba"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"About 45 minutes","kosher_note":"Desserts have no pork; the soba broth is pork.","plan_line":"Closed Tuesdays. Stop here halfway along the stone path","baby_block":"Steep stone path, hard with a stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Yamagusuku Manju","name_ja":"山城饅頭","city":"okinawa","area":"Shuri","category":"cafe","lat":26.2185,"lng":127.719,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"חנות מנג׳ו בת יותר מ-130 שנה בשורי, שמנהלת כבר הדור החמישי והשישי של המשפחה.","reality":"רק מוצר אחד: לחמנייה מאודה דקה עם ממרח שעועית אדומה, עטופה בעלה. נגמר מוקדם.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥140 ליחידה","tip":"אפשר להתקשר לפני (098-884-2343) ולבדוק שנשאר.","sources":["https://oki-islandguide.com/food_and_drink/yamagusuku-manju"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Yamagusuku%20Manju%20Shuri%20Naha%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":"מנג׳ו: בצק דק מאודה עם ממרח שעועית אדומה שמתבשל יותר משלוש שעות.","dishes":["מנג׳ו ש