d flat, but crowded with narrow aisles in parts.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Enter from Kokusai-dori and wander the covered streets down to the Makishi public market.","special":"This is where locals shop, and some shops have been here for decades.","highlights":["Kariyushi shirts","Local sweets","Old shops"],"time_needed":"1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Some shops close early, come before 18:00","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Okinawa Prefectural Museum & Art Museum","name_ja":"沖縄県立博物館・美術館","city":"okinawa","area":"Kokusai-dori & Makishi","category":"sight","lat":26.2268,"lng":127.695,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המוזיאון הגדול של אוקינאווה, על ההיסטוריה של ממלכת ריוקיו, הטבע והמלחמה, ולידו מוזיאון אמנות.","reality":"הדרך הטובה להבין את האי לפני שיוצאים לטייל. מרווח, ממוזג ומעולה ליום גשום.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"בימי שישי ושבת פתוח עד 20:00.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e7126.html","https://okimu.jp/en/art_museum/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעליות, מעברים רחבים וחדר הנקה. נוח מאוד עם עגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Okinawa%20Prefectural%20Museum%20%26%20Art%20Museum%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מתחילים בתצוגה הקבועה של ההיסטוריה, עוברים לאגף הטבע, ומי שיש לו כוח ממשיך למוזיאון האמנות באותו בניין.","special":"התצוגה מסבירה באנגלית את כל הסיפור של ממלכת ריוקיו, שאין לו מקבילה ביפן.","highlights":["התצוגה הקבועה על ממלכת ריוקיו","אגף הטבע","הבית המסורתי בחצר"],"time_needed":"שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-1-1 Omoromachi, Naha, Okinawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"18:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":120,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שני ומ-29 בדצמבר","baby_block":null,"tags":["museum","history","ryukyu kingdom","art museum","culture","rainy day","מוזיאון","היסטוריה","ממלכת ריוקיו","אמנות","תרבות","יום גשום","nature","טבע"],"en":{"hype":"Okinawa's main museum, on the Ryukyu Kingdom, nature and the war, with an art museum alongside.","reality":"The best way to make sense of the island before touring. Roomy, air-conditioned and great on a rainy day.","tip":"Open until 20:00 on Fridays and Saturdays.","baby_notes":"Elevators, wide aisles and a nursing room. Very easy with a stroller.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Start with the permanent history display, move to the nature wing, and carry on to the art museum in the same building if you still have energy.","special":"It tells the whole Ryukyu Kingdom story in English, something you find nowhere else in Japan.","highlights":["Ryukyu Kingdom permanent display","Nature wing","Traditional house in the yard"],"time_needed":"2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays and from 29 December","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"DFS T Galleria Okinawa","name_ja":"Tギャラリア沖縄 by DFS","city":"okinawa","area":"Kokusai-dori & Makishi","category":"shopping","lat":26.224,"lng":127.697,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"קניון הדיוטי-פרי היחיד ביפן שאינו בשדה תעופה, ליד תחנת אומורומאצ'י.","reality":"מותגי יוקרה כמו בכל DFS בעולם. מי שלא בא לקנות מותג מסוים לא יפספס כלום.","verdict":"overhyped","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"קונים עם כרטיס טיסה ואת המוצרים אוספים בשדה התעופה של נאהה ביציאה.","sources":[],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"קניון ממוזג עם מעליות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=DFS%20T%20Galleria%20Okinawa%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מסתובבים בין חנויות המותגים, ומי שקונה מציג דרכון וכרטיס טיסה.","special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"4-1 Omoromachi, Naha, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"c