","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"קונים בסופר, אוכלים במתחם האוכל ומסתובבים בחנויות.","special":null,"highlights":["סופר גדול","חנות תינוקות","מתחם אוכל"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"4-4-9 Omoromachi, Naha, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"המקום לקנות חיתולים ומזון תינוקות בנאהה","baby_block":null,"tags":["mall","supermarket","diapers","baby goods","food court","clothes","קניון","סופר","חיתולים","מוצרי תינוקות","מתחם אוכל","בגדים","rainy day","יום גשום"],"en":{"hype":"Naha's big mall in Omoromachi, with a supermarket, clothes shops and a food court.","reality":"An ordinary local mall, not a sight. Very handy for groceries, diapers, baby food and a rainy evening.","tip":"The ground floor supermarket is far cheaper than souvenir shops for local snacks.","baby_notes":"Baby rooms, changing tables and elevators, very easy with a baby.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Shop the supermarket, eat in the food court and walk the shops.","special":null,"highlights":["Big supermarket","Baby goods shop","Food court"],"time_needed":"1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"The place in Naha for diapers and baby food","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Shurijo Castle Park","name_ja":"首里城公園","city":"okinawa","area":"Shuri","category":"sight","lat":26.217,"lng":127.7195,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"הארמון האדום של ממלכת ריוקיו, אתר מורשת עולמית, שנשרף ב-2019 והאולם המרכזי שלו (סיידן) נפתח מחדש ב-23 בנובמבר 2026.","reality":"עכשיו זה הזמן הטוב לבוא: האולם המרכזי חדש לגמרי ומלא צבע. השערים והחומות מקוריים יותר מהבניינים עצמם.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"החלק בתשלום כ-¥400, שאר הפארק חינם","tip":"מגיעים במונורייל לתחנת שורי ומשם 15 דקות הליכה בעלייה, או מונית קצרה.","sources":["https://goasia.cc/en/news/okinawa-shuri-castle-main-hall-reopens-november-2026","https://visitokinawajapan.com/?p=18945","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e7103.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"הרבה מדרגות ועליות אבן בין השערים, עגלה קלה עוברת בעזרת מסלול צדדי, מנשא נוח יותר.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shurijo%20Castle%20Park%20Okinawa","website_url":"https://oki-park.jp/shurijo/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים בשער שורייימון, עולים בין השערים והחומות לחצר המרכזית ונכנסים לאולם הסיידן. בסוף יורדים לתצפית המערבית על נאהה.","special":"זה הבניין המשוחזר הרביעי במקום, נבנה בשיטות ובצבעים המקוריים, והאולם המרכזי חדש מאז נובמבר 2026.","highlights":["אולם הסיידן החדש","שער שורייימון","התצפית על נאהה","בריכת ריוטאן"],"time_needed":"שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-2 Kinjo-cho, Shuri, Naha, Okinawa","opens":"08:30","closes":"18:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":120,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"אחרי הפתיחה מחדש ייתכן שצריך הזמנה לאולם, לבדוק באתר","baby_block":null,"tags":["castle","palace","world heritage","ryukyu kingdom","seiden","gate","history","טירה","ארמון","מורשת עולמית","ממלכת ריוקיו","שער","היסטוריה","view","תצפית"],"en":{"hype":"The red palace of the Ryukyu Kingdom, a World Heritage site, burned in 2019; its main hall (Seiden) reopens on 23 November 2026.","reality":"Now is the time to go: the main hall is brand new and full of colour. The gates and walls are more original than the buildings.","tip":"Take the monorail to Shuri station, then a 15 minute uphill walk or a short taxi.","baby_notes":"Many stone steps and slopes between the gates; a light stroller gets through on a side route, a carrier is easier.","price":"Paid area about ¥400, rest of the park free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Enter at Shureimon gate, climb through the gates and walls to the main courtyard and go into the Seiden hall. Finish at the west lookout over Naha.","special":"This is the fourth rebuild on the site, made with the original methods and colours, and the main hall is new since November 2026.","highlights":["New Seiden hall","Shureimon gate","Lookout over Naha","Ryutan pond"],"time_needed":"2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"After the reopening the hall may need booking, check the site","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Shuri Kinjo-cho Stone-paved Road","name_ja":"首里金城町石畳道","city":"okinawa","area":"Shuri","category":"sight","lat":26.214,"lng":127.717,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"דרך אבן מימי הממלכה שיורדת מטירת שורי בין חומות אבן ובתים ישנים.","reality":"מהפינות הכי יפות ושקטות בנאהה, וכמעט בלי תיירים. ירידה תלולה, ולעלות בחזרה זה מאמץ.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"כדאי ללכת מלמעלה למטה אחרי הטירה, ולחזור במונית.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e7103.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"אבנים חלקלקות ומדרגות, רק עם מנשא.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shuri%20Kinjo-cho%20Stone-paved%20Road%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יורדים לאט לאורך דרך האבן, עוצרים בעץ הבניאן הענק בצד הדרך ומציצים לחצרות הבתים הישנים.","special":"הקטע שרד את המלחמה, והוא אחד המקומות היחידים בנאהה שנראים כמו לפני מאה שנה.","highlights":["עץ הבניאן הענק","חומות האבן","בתים עם גגות אדומים"],"time_needed":"חצי שעה-שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Kinjo-cho 1-chome, Shuri, Naha, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"האבנים חלקות בגשם, נעליים טובות","baby_block":"מדרגות ואבנים, אין מעבר לעגלה","tags":["stone road","old street","walk","history","banyan tree","ryukyu","דרך אבן","רחוב עתיק","טיול רגלי","היסטוריה","עץ בניאן","שקט","quiet","photo","צילום"],"en":{"hype":"A stone road from the kingdom days running down from Shuri Castle between stone walls and old houses.","reality":"One of the prettiest, quietest corners of Naha, with hardly any tourists. A steep descent, and climbing back is work.","tip":"Walk it top to bottom after the castle and take a taxi back.","baby_notes":"Slippery stones and steps, carrier only.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk slowly down the stone road, stop at the giant banyan tree by the path and peek into the old house yards.","special":"The stretch survived the war and is one of the few spots in Naha that looks like a century ago.","highlights":["Giant banyan tree","Stone walls","Red-roofed houses"],"time_needed":"30-60 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Stones are slick in rain, wear good shoes","baby_block":"Steps and stones, no stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Tamaudun Royal Mausoleum","name_ja":"玉陵","city":"okinawa","area":"Shuri","category":"sight","lat":26.2185,"lng":127.7155,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"קבר המלכים של ממלכת ריוקיו, מבנה אבן גדול דקות הליכה מטירת שורי, אתר מורשת עולמית.","reality":"קצר ומרשים, ושקט הרבה יותר מהטירה. שווה את 20 הדקות בדרך.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥300","tip":null,"sources":["https://japan-guide.com/e/e7129.html","https://www.gltjp.com/en/directory/item/13319/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חצץ ואבנים בחצר, עגלה עוברת בקושי.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tamaudun%20Royal%20Mausoleum%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בתצוגה הקטנה בכניסה, ואז נכנסים לחצר האבן ומסתכלים על שלושת חדרי הקבר.","special":"הקבר בנוי כמו בית אבן עם גג, לא דומה לשום קבר ביפן.","highlights":["חזית האבן","פסלי השיסא על הגג"],"time_needed":"20-30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-3 Kinjo-cho, Shuri, Naha, Okinawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"18:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"משלבים בהליכה מהטירה, חמש דקות ממנה","baby_block":null,"tags":["tomb","mausoleum","royal","world heritage","stone","history","ryukyu","קבר","מלכים","מורשת עולמית","אבן","היסטוריה","ממלכת ריוקיו","שיסא"],"en":{"hype":"The royal tomb of the Ryukyu Kingdom, a big stone structure minutes from Shuri Castle, World Heritage listed.","reality":"Short and striking, and much quieter than the castle. Worth the 20 minutes on the way.","tip":null,"baby_notes":"Gravel and stones in the yard, hard going with a stroller.","price":"¥300","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"See the small display at the entrance, then enter the stone yard and look at the three tomb chambers.","special":"The tomb is built like a stone house with a roof, unlike any tomb in mainland Japan.","highlights":["Stone facade","Shisa statues on the roof"],"time_needed":"20-30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Pair it with the castle, five minutes' walk away","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Shuri Ryusen","name_ja":"首里琉染","city":"okinawa","area":"Shuri","category":"shopping","lat":26.216,"lng":127.7175,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"סדנת צביעת בדים מסורתית (בינגאטה) ליד טירת שורי, עם חנות וסדנה שבה צובעים בעצמם.","reality":"דרך טובה להביא מזכרת שעשו בעצמם. החנות יקרה, הסדנה שווה יותר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":null,"sources":[],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shuri%20Ryusen%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מסתכלים בחנות על הבדים והבגדים, ומי שרוצה מתיישב לסדנה וצובע מטפחת או חולצה בעזרת ענפי אלמוגים.","special":"צובעים בחותמות מאלמוגים, שיטה שמייחדת את המקום.","highlights":["סדנת צביעה באלמוגים","בדי בינגאטה"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-54 Yamagawa-cho, Shuri, Naha, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":75,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"לסדנה כדאי להזמין מראש, במיוחד בסופ\"ש","baby_block":null,"tags":["bingata","dyeing","textile","workshop","coral","craft","scarf","בינגאטה","צביעת בדים","בדים","סדנה","אלמוגים","מלאכת יד","מטפחת"],"en":{"hype":"A traditional bingata dyeing workshop near Shuri Castle, with a shop and a class where you dye your own piece.","reality":"A good way to bring home something you made. The shop is pricey, the class is better value.","tip":null,"baby_notes":null,"price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Look at the cloth and clothes in the shop, then sit down for the class and dye a scarf or shirt using coral stamps.","special":"You dye with coral stamps, the method this place is known for.","highlights":["Coral dyeing class","Bingata cloth"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Book the class ahead, especially on weekends","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Shikinaen Royal Garden","name_ja":"識名園","city":"okinawa","area":"Shuri","category":"sight","lat":26.2045,"lng":127.7135,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גן הקיץ של מלכי ריוקיו, עם אגם, גשרי אבן ווילה מעץ, אתר מורשת עולמית.","reality":"גן יפה ושקט מאוד, כמעט ריק מאנשים. רחוק מתחנות, צריך מונית או אוטובוס.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥400","tip":"נכנסים לווילה וחולצים נעליים, משם הנוף הכי יפה על האגם.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e7104.html","https://japan-experience.com/all-about-japan/okinawa/parks-gardens/shikina-en-garden-naha"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילי חצץ ועליות קלות, עגלה עוברת לאט.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shikinaen%20Royal%20Garden%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים מסביב לאגם, עוברים בגשרי האבן ונכנסים לווילה המלכותית. מסלול אחד מקיף, בלי לפספס.","special":"הגן משלב סגנון סיני ויפני, והמסלול בנוי כך שהנוף משתנה כל כמה צעדים.","highlights":["הווילה המלכותית","גשר האבן הסיני","האגם"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"421-7 Aza Maaji, Naha, Okinawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:30","closed_weekdays":[3],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי רביעי, וכדאי מונית כי רחוק מתחנות","baby_block":null,"tags":["garden","royal villa","pond","stone bridge","world heritage","quiet","גן","גן יפני","אגם","גשר אבן","מורשת עולמית","שקט","ווילה","park","פארק"],"en":{"hype":"The summer garden of the Ryukyu kings, with a pond, stone bridges and a wooden villa, World Heritage listed.","reality":"A lovely, very quiet garden, nearly empty. Far from stations, so take a taxi or bus.","tip":"Go into the villa (shoes off), it has the best view over the pond.","baby_notes":"Gravel paths and gentle slopes, a stroller gets through slowly.","price":"¥400","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk around the pond, cross the stone bridges and go into the royal villa. One loop covers it all.","special":"It mixes Chinese and Japanese styles, and the path is laid out so the view changes every few steps.","highlights":["Royal villa","Chinese stone bridge","The pond"],"time_needed":"1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Wednesdays, and take a taxi as it is far from stations","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Naminoue Shrine","name_ja":"波上宮","city":"okinawa","area":"Naha Port & Tomari","category":"sight","lat":26.221,"lng":127.672,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המקדש החשוב של אוקינאווה, על צוק מעל הים בנאהה.","reality":"המקדש עצמו קטן, אבל המיקום על הצוק מעל החוף יפה, ומשלבים בקלות עם החוף שמתחתיו.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"התמונה הכי טובה של המקדש על הצוק היא מגשר הכביש מעל החוף.","sources":[],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש מדרגות לחצר המקדש, וגם כניסה צדדית שטוחה יותר מהחניה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Naminoue%20Shrine%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים לחצר המקדש, מסתכלים על הים מהמעקה, ויורדים לחוף נמינואה שמתחת.","special":null,"highlights":["המקדש על הצוק","התצפית מהגשר","החוף שמתחת"],"time_needed":"חצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-25-11 Wakasa, Naha, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"משלבים עם חוף נמינואה, שתי דקות הליכה למטה","baby_block":null,"tags":["shrine","shinto","cliff","sea view","temple","prayer","מקדש","שינטו","צוק","נוף לים","תפילה","ocean","ים","photo","צילום"],"en":{"hype":"Okinawa's main shrine, on a cliff over the sea in Naha.","reality":"The shrine itself is small, but the cliff-top spot over the beach is pretty, and it pairs easily with the beach below.","tip":"The best photo of the shrine on its cliff is from the road bridge over the beach.","baby_notes":"Steps up to the shrine yard, plus a flatter side entrance from the car park.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go up to the shrine yard, look out over the sea from the railing, and walk down to Naminoue beach below.","special":null,"highlights":["Shrine on the cliff","View from the bridge","Beach below"],"time_needed":"30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Pair it with Naminoue beach, two minutes' walk down","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Naminoue Beach","name_ja":"波の上ビーチ","city":"okinawa","area":"Naha Port & Tomari","category":"experience","lat":26.2203,"lng":127.671,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"החוף היחיד של נאהה, עשר דקות הליכה ממרכז העיר.","reality":"חוף קטן עם גשר כביש מעליו, לא החוף היפה של אוקינאווה. נחמד לשבת בו חצי שעה כשנשארים בעיר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"בחורף אין מצילים ורחצה רשמית, אבל ההליכה על החול והישיבה נעימות.","sources":[],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חול רך, מקלחות ושירותים ליד הכניסה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Naminoue%20Beach%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יושבים על החול, טובלים רגליים ומסתכלים על המקדש על הצוק.","special":null,"highlights":["המקדש על הצוק מעל החוף"],"time_needed":"חצי שעה-שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-25-11 Wakasa, Naha, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לחוף רחצה אמיתי עדיף לנסוע צפונה או לאיי קראמה","baby_block":null,"tags":["beach","sand","city beach","sea","swim","חוף","חוף ים","חול","ים","רחצה","שקיעה","sunset","naminoue"],"en":{"hype":"Naha's only beach, a 10 minute walk from the center.","reality":"A small beach with a road bridge over it, not Okinawa's pretty beach. Nice for half an hour if you stay in town.","tip":"In winter there are no lifeguards or official swimming, but walking and sitting on the sand is pleasant.","baby_notes":"Soft sand, showers and toilets by the entrance.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Sit on the sand, dip your feet and look up at the shrine on the cliff.","special":null,"highlights":["Shrine on the cliff above"],"time_needed":"30-60 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"For a real swim beach go north or to the Kerama islands","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Fukushuen Garden","name_ja":"福州園","city":"okinawa","area":"Naha Port & Tomari","category":"sight","lat":26.216,"lng":127.6745,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גן סיני בסגנון העיר פוג'ואו, עם מפל, ביתנים ואגם דגים, באמצע נאהה.","reality":"קטן, מטופח ושקט, ועולה גרושים. בערב מאירים אותו ויש בו אווירה אחרת.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥200 ביום, ¥300 בערב","tip":"בערב הגן מואר עד 21:00, שווה לבוא אחרי השקיעה.","sources":["https://okinawa-en.mytabi.net/fukushuen.php","https://www.jeepe.jp/en/articles/fukushuen-naha-garden-1916"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים שטוחים ברובם, גשרים עם כמה מדרגות.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fukushuen%20Garden%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מסתובבים בשבילים, עולים לביתן בראש הגבעה הקטנה, מאכילים את הקרפיונים באגם ועוברים מאחורי המפל.","special":"נבנה בשיתוף העיר התאומה פוג'ואו, בחומרים שהובאו מסין.","highlights":["המפל","הביתן על הגבעה","אגם הקרפיונים","תאורת ערב"],"time_needed":"40 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-29-19 Kume, Naha, Okinawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"21:00","closed_weekdays":[3],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי רביעי, ובערב מואר עד 21:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["chinese garden","garden","waterfall","pond","koi","pavilion","night lights","גן סיני","גן","מפל","אגם","קרפיונים","ביתן","תאורה","ערב"],"en":{"hype":"A Chinese garden in Fuzhou style with a waterfall, pavilions and a fish pond in central Naha.","reality":"Small, well kept and quiet, and it costs almost nothing. Lit up in the evening, with a different mood.","tip":"Lit until 21:00, worth coming after sunset.","baby_notes":"Mostly flat paths, bridges with a few steps.","price":"¥200 by day, ¥300 in the evening","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Wander the paths, climb to the pavilion on the small hill, feed the carp and walk behind the waterfall.","special":"Built with sister city Fuzhou, using materials brought from China.","highlights":["Waterfall","Hilltop pavilion","Carp pond","Evening lights"],"time_needed":"40 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Wednesdays, lit in the evening until 21:00","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kume Shiseibyo (Confucius Temple)","name_ja":"久米至聖廟","city":"okinawa","area":"Naha Port & Tomari","category":"sight","lat":26.218,"lng":127.674,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש קונפוציוס של הקהילה הסינית הוותיקה של נאהה, ליד מקדש נמינואה.","reality":"קטן ושקט, אדום וצבעוני. עצירה של רבע שעה בדרך בין נמינואה לגן פוקושואן.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":null,"sources":[],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חצר שטוחה ומרוצפת.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kume%20Shiseibyo%20(Confucius%20Temple)%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים בשער, מסתכלים על האולם המרכזי ופסל קונפוציוס, ויוצאים להמשך הדרך.","special":"המקדש של צאצאי המהגרים מסין שהגיעו לריוקיו לפני 600 שנה.","highlights":["האולם האדום","פסל קונפוציוס"],"time_needed":"15-20 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-30-10 Wakasa, Naha, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":20,"booking":"no","plan_line":"משלבים בהליכה בין נמינואה לגן פוקושואן","baby_block":null,"tags":["confucius temple","temple","chinese","history","shrine","מקדש קונפוציוס","מקדש","סיני","היסטוריה","שקט","quiet","kume"],"en":{"hype":"The Confucius temple of Naha's old Chinese community, near Naminoue shrine.","reality":"Small, quiet, red and colourful. A 15 minute stop between Naminoue and Fukushuen garden.","tip":null,"baby_notes":"Flat paved yard.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go through the gate, look at the main hall and the Confucius statue, and carry on.","special":"The temple of the descendants of Chinese settlers who came to Ryukyu 600 years ago.","highlights":["Red main hall","Confucius statue"],"time_needed":"15-20 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Walk it between Naminoue and Fukushuen garden","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Tokashiki Island day trip","name_ja":"渡嘉敷島","city":"okinawa","area":"Naha Port & Tomari","category":"experience","lat":26.196,"lng":127.362,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"האי הקרוב מאיי קראמה, 40 דקות בסירה מהירה מנמל טומארי, עם חוף אהארן ומים צלולים במיוחד.","reality":"המים הכי שקופים שאפשר להגיע אליהם ביום אחד מנאהה. בחורף המים קרירים (כ-22 מעלות), אז זה יותר הליכה וצבע מאשר שחייה.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"בחורף הסירה האחרונה חזרה יוצאת מוקדם (אחה\"צ), כדאי לבדוק לוח זמנים לפני.","sources":["https://en.japantravel.com/article/tokashiki-island-ferry/3015","https://oki-islandguide.com/getting-here-and-around/from-tomari-port-naha-city-to-tokashiki-port"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"נסיעה בסירה ואוטובוס באי, אפשרי עם מנשא ביום רגוע בים.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tokashiki%20Island%20day%20trip%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יוצאים בבוקר מטומארי, לוקחים אוטובוס מקומי לחוף אהארן, מטיילים, אוכלים משהו בכפר וחוזרים בסירה של אחה\"צ.","special":"איי קראמה הם פארק לאומי ימי, והמים בצבע טורקיז שקשה למצוא באי הראשי.","highlights":["חוף אהארן","תצפית על האיים","הסירה המהירה"],"time_needed":"יום שלם","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Tomari Port, 3-14-2 Maejima, Naha, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":480,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"מזמינים את הסירה המהירה מראש, והים בחורף מבטל הפלגות","baby_block":null,"tags":["island","day trip","ferry","kerama","beach","clear water","snorkel","אי","טיול יום","מעבורת","קראמה","חוף","מים צלולים","שנורקל","boat","סירה"],"en":{"hype":"The nearest Kerama island, 40 minutes by fast boat from Tomari port, with Aharen beach and very clear water.","reality":"The clearest water you can reach in a day from Naha. In winter the sea is cool (about 22 degrees), so it is more walking and colour than swimming.","tip":"In winter the last boat back leaves early in the afternoon, check the timetable first.","baby_notes":"Boat plus island bus, doable with a carrier on a calm day.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Leave Tomari in the morning, take the local bus to Aharen beach, walk, eat something in the village and come back on the afternoon boat.","special":"The Kerama islands are a marine national park, with turquoise water hard to find on the main island.","highlights":["Aharen beach","Island lookouts","The fast boat"],"time_needed":"Full day","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Book the fast boat ahead, winter seas can cancel sailings","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Okinawa Prefectural Peace Memorial Park","name_ja":"沖縄県平和祈念公園","city":"okinawa","area":"South Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.096,"lng":127.727,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פארק הזיכרון לקרב אוקינאווה במאבוני, מעל צוקי הדרום, עם המוזיאון לשלום וקירות שמות ההרוגים.","reality":"קשה ומרגש, והמקום החשוב ביותר להבין את אוקינאווה. המוזיאון כתוב טוב באנגלית ולא חוסך בפרטים.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"הפארק חינם, המוזיאון בתשלום קטן","tip":"כדאי להתחיל במוזיאון ואז ללכת לקירות השמות ולתצפית על הצוקים.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e7105.html","https://guides.nccjapan.org/researchaccess/okinawa-peace-museum"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שטח פתוח עם שבילים רחבים, המוזיאון עם מעליות. התוכן קשה, לא בשביל ילדים קטנים.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Okinawa%20Prefectural%20Peace%20Memorial%20Park%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים למוזיאון לשלום ועוברים על סיפור הקרב מעדויות ניצולים. יוצאים לקירות האבן עם 240 אלף שמות, ומסיימים בתצפית על הים מהצוק.","special":"על הקירות רשומים כל מי שנהרג בקרב, משני הצדדים ובלי הבדל לאום.","highlights":["המוזיאון לשלום","קירות השמות","התצפית מהצוק"],"time_needed":"שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"614-1 Mabuni, Itoman, Okinawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":120,"booking":"no","plan_line":"המוזיאון סגור מ-29 בדצמבר, הפארק עצמו פתוח","baby_block":null,"tags":["war memorial","battle of okinawa","museum","peace","history","wwii","cliff","אנדרטה","קרב אוקינאווה","מוזיאון","שלום","היסטוריה","מלחמת העולם השנייה","צוק","זיכרון"],"en":{"hype":"The Battle of Okinawa memorial park at Mabuni, over the southern cliffs, with the Peace Museum and walls of names.","reality":"Hard and moving, and the most important place for understanding Okinawa. The museum has good English and spares no detail.","tip":"Start with the museum, then walk to the walls of names and the cliff lookout.","baby_notes":"Open grounds with wide paths, museum with elevators. Heavy content, not for young kids.","price":"Park free, museum small fee","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go through the Peace Museum and the battle told by survivors. Walk out to the stone walls with 240,000 names and finish at the sea view from the cliff.","special":"The walls list everyone killed in the battle, both sides, regardless of nationality.","highlights":["Peace Museum","Walls of names","Cliff lookout"],"time_needed":"2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Museum closed from 29 December, the park stays open","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Himeyuri Peace Museum","name_ja":"ひめゆり平和祈念資料館","city":"okinawa","area":"South Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.1015,"lng":127.697,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המוזיאון לזכר תלמידות התיכון שגויסו כאחיות בקרב אוקינאווה, ליד המערה שבה רובן נהרגו.","reality":"קטן ושובר לב, עם תמונות וסיפורים אישיים של הבנות. אחד המוזיאונים החזקים ביפן.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥450","tip":"מומלץ לבוא אחרי פארק הזיכרון, עשר דקות נסיעה, ולא באותו סדר הפוך.","sources":["https://www.himeyuri.or.jp/info-2/","https://himeyuri.or.jp/EN/info.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"בניין שקט ונגיש, אבל זה מקום של שקט, תינוק בוכה מפריע.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Himeyuri%20Peace%20Museum%20Okinawa","website_url":"https://www.himeyuri.or.jp/en","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מסתכלים על פתח המערה ואנדרטת הימיורי בחוץ, ונכנסים לאולמות עם העדויות והתמונות של כל אחת מהבנות.","special":"העדויות נכתבו על ידי הניצולות עצמן, שהקימו את המוזיאון.","highlights":["אנדרטת הימיורי","אולם התמונות","שחזור המערה"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"671-1 Ihara, Itoman, Okinawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:25","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"כניסה אחרונה ב-17:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["war memorial","museum","battle of okinawa","students","nurses","wwii","peace","אנדרטה","מוזיאון","קרב אוקינאווה","תלמידות","אחיות","מלחמת העולם השנייה","שלום","himeyuri"],"en":{"hype":"The museum for the high school girls drafted as nurses in the Battle of Okinawa, beside the cave where most of them died.","reality":"Small and heartbreaking, with photos and personal stories of each girl. One of the strongest museums in Japan.","tip":"Come after the Peace Memorial Park, a 10 minute drive away.","baby_notes":"Quiet, accessible building, but it is a place of silence where a crying baby stands out.","price":"¥450","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"See the cave mouth and the Himeyuri memorial outside, then go through the halls of testimonies and photos of every girl.","special":"The testimonies were written by the survivors themselves, who founded the museum.","highlights":["Himeyuri memorial","Hall of photos","Cave reconstruction"],"time_needed":"1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Last entry at 17:00","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Former Japanese Navy Underground Headquarters","name_ja":"旧海軍司令部壕","city":"okinawa","area":"South Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.1885,"lng":127.673,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מנהרות המפקדה של הצי היפני בקרב אוקינאווה, חצובות בגבעה בטומיגוסוקו, עשר דקות מנאהה.","reality":"מצמרר ואמיתי: מנהרות צרות, סימני רסיסים על הקירות מהתאבדות הקצינים. קצר וקרוב לעיר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥600","tip":"מהפארק למעלה יש תצפית טובה על נאהה ועל הנמל.","sources":["https://www.oki-islandguide.com/attractions/japanese-navy-underground-headquarters-2","https://kaigungou.ocvb.or.jp/english/facilities"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"יורדים במדרגות רבות למנהרות צרות ולחות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Former%20Japanese%20Navy%20Underground%20Headquarters%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יורדים במדרגות למנהרות, עוברים בחדר המפקד ובחדרי הקצינים, וחוזרים למוזיאון הקטן למעלה.","special":"300 מטר של מנהרות נשארו כמו שהיו, עם סימני הרסיסים על הקירות.","highlights":["חדר המפקד","קירות עם סימני רסיסים","התצפית על נאהה"],"time_needed":"45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"236 Tomigusuku, Tomigusuku, Okinawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עשר דקות במונית מנאהה, משלבים בדרך לדרום","baby_block":"מדרגות רבות ומנהרות צרות","tags":["war","tunnels","bunker","navy","battle of okinawa","wwii","underground","מלחמה","מנהרות","בונקר","צי","קרב אוקינאווה","מלחמת העולם השנייה","תת קרקעי","history","היסטוריה"],"en":{"hype":"The Japanese navy command tunnels of the Battle of Okinawa, dug into a hill in Tomigusuku, 10 minutes from Naha.","reality":"Chilling and real: narrow tunnels, shrapnel marks on the walls from the officers' suicides. Short and close to town.","tip":"The park above has a good view over Naha and the port.","baby_notes":"Many stairs down into narrow, damp tunnels.","price":"¥600","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Take the stairs down, walk past the commander's room and officers' rooms, and come back up to the small museum.","special":"300 m of tunnels are left as they were, shrapnel marks and all.","highlights":["Commander's room","Shrapnel-marked walls","View over Naha"],"time_needed":"45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"10 minutes by taxi from Naha, do it on the way south","baby_block":"Many stairs and narrow tunnels"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Sefa-utaki","name_ja":"斎場御嶽","city":"okinawa","area":"South Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.1725,"lng":127.827,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המקום הקדוש ביותר של ממלכת ריוקיו, חורש וסלעי ענק עם פתח משולש שמסתכל לאי קודקה, אתר מורשת עולמית.","reality":"שקט ומיוחד, בעיקר המעבר בין שני הסלעים הנוטים. בצהריים עם קבוצות זה מאבד מהקסם.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥300","tip":"הכרטיסים נמכרים במרכז המוצרים של נאנג'ו, כ-500 מטר לפני הכניסה, לא בשער.","sources":["https://okinawa-nanjo.jp/sefa/en/","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e7124.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילי אבן חלקלקים ועליות, עגלה לא מתאימה, מנשא כן.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sefa-utaki%20Okinawa","website_url":"https://okinawa-nanjo.jp/sefa/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"צופים בסרט הקצר בכניסה, הולכים בשביל האבן בין מקומות התפילה ומסיימים במעבר המשולש בין הסלעים, עם הנוף לים.","special":"גברים לא הורשו להיכנס לכאן במשך מאות שנים, זה היה מקום הכוהנות.","highlights":["המעבר המשולש בין הסלעים","הנוף לאי קודקה","מקומות התפילה בחורש"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Kugai 270-1, Chinen, Nanjo, Okinawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"כרטיס במרכז המוצרים, ולבוא בבוקר לפני הקבוצות","baby_block":"שבילי אבן חלקים, רק עם מנשא","tags":["sacred site","utaki","forest","rocks","world heritage","prayer","ryukyu","מקום קדוש","חורש","סלעים","מורשת עולמית","תפילה","ממלכת ריוקיו","spiritual","רוחני"],"en":{"hype":"The holiest place of the Ryukyu Kingdom, a grove of huge rocks with a triangle gap facing Kudaka island, World Heritage listed.","reality":"Quiet and special, above all the passage between the two leaning rocks. Midday tour groups take the magic out.","tip":"Tickets are sold at the Nanjo products center about 500 m before the entrance, not at the gate.","baby_notes":"Slippery stone paths and slopes, no stroller, a carrier works.","price":"¥300","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Watch the short film at the entrance, walk the stone path between the prayer spots and end at the triangle passage between the rocks with its sea view.","special":"For centuries men were not allowed in, it was the priestesses' place.","highlights":["Triangle rock passage","View to Kudaka island","Prayer spots in the grove"],"time_needed":"1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Buy tickets at the products center, come before the groups","baby_block":"Slick stone paths, carrier only"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
where not exists (select 1 from place_library p where p.city = x.city and lower(p.name) = lower(x.name));
insert into place_library (name, name_ja, city, area, category, lat, lng, coord_precision, hype, reality, verdict, tabelog_score, google_score, price, tip, sources, audience, baby_notes, local_pick, maps_url, website_url, serves, dishes, todo, special, highlights, time_needed, kosher, kosher_note, address, opens, closes, closed_weekdays, closed_dates, open_dates, best_time, visit_mins, booking, plan_line, baby_block, tags, en, facts_at, facts_sure, active)
select x.name, x.name_ja, x.city, x.area, x.category, x.lat, x.lng, x.coord_precision, x.hype, x.reality, x.verdict, x.tabelog_score, x.google_score, x.price, x.tip, x.sources, x.audience, x.baby_notes, x.local_pick, x.maps_url, x.website_url, x.serves, x.dishes, x.todo, x.special, x.highlights, x.time_needed, x.kosher, x.kosher_note, x.address, x.opens, x.closes, x.closed_weekdays, x.closed_dates, x.open_dates, x.best_time, x.visit_mins, x.booking, x.plan_line, x.baby_block, x.tags, x.en, x.facts_at, x.facts_sure, false from jsonb_populate_recordset(null::place_library, $cards$[{"name":"Okinawa World & Gyokusendo Cave","name_ja":"おきなわワールド 玉泉洞","city":"okinawa","area":"South Okinawa","category":"experience","lat":26.1415,"lng":127.748,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פארק תרבות בנאנג'ו עם מערת נטיפים של כמעט קילומטר, כפר מסורתי, מופע תופי אייסה וסדנאות.","reality":"המערה מרשימה באמת והיא הסיבה לבוא. שאר הפארק מסחרי, אבל מופע האייסה שווה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥2,000 למבוגר, עד גיל 4 חינם","tip":"כדאי לתזמן את הסיור כך שתגיעו למופע האייסה של הצהריים.","sources":["https://en.gyokusendo.co.jp/okinawaworld/?p=635","https://japan-guide.com/e/e7106.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"במערה יש מדרגות ושבילים רטובים, עגלה לא עוברת. בשאר הפארק נוח.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Okinawa%20World%20%26%20Gyokusendo%20Cave%20Okinawa","website_url":"https://en.gyokusendo.co.jp/okinawaworld/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יורדים למערה והולכים כ-890 מטר בין הנטיפים, יוצאים לכפר המסורתי, רואים מופע אייסה ומסתכלים על סדנאות זכוכית וקרמיקה.","special":"המערה ארוכה מחמישה קילומטרים, והחלק הפתוח לקהל מלא נטיפים ובריכות.","highlights":["מערת גיוקוסנדו","מופע אייסה","הכפר המסורתי"],"time_needed":"2-3 שעות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1336 Maekawa, Tamagusuku, Nanjo, Okinawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":150,"booking":"no","plan_line":"כניסה אחרונה ב-16:00, ובמערה צריך מנשא לתינוק","baby_block":"מדרגות ושבילים רטובים במערה","tags":["cave","limestone","stalactites","theme park","eisa","drums","village","glass","מערה","נטיפים","פארק","אייסה","תופים","כפר מסורתי","זכוכית","show","מופע"],"en":{"hype":"A culture park in Nanjo with a nearly 1 km stalactite cave, a traditional village, eisa drum shows and workshops.","reality":"The cave is truly impressive and the reason to come. The rest is commercial, but the eisa show is worth it.","tip":"Time the visit to catch the midday eisa show.","baby_notes":"Steps and wet paths in the cave, no stroller there. The rest of the park is easy.","price":"¥2,000 adults, under 4 free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk about 890 m through the cave, come out to the traditional village, watch an eisa show and look in on the glass and pottery workshops.","special":"The cave is over 5 km long, and the open part is full of stalactites and pools.","highlights":["Gyokusendo cave","Eisa show","Traditional village"],"time_needed":"2-3 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Last entry 16:00, and the cave needs a baby carrier","baby_block":"Steps and wet paths in the cave"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Gangala Valley","name_ja":"ガンガラーの谷","city":"okinawa","area":"South Okinawa","category":"experience","lat":26.143,"lng":127.7465,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"עמק של מערות שקרסו ויער סבוך מול אוקינאווה וורלד, שנכנסים אליו רק בסיור מודרך עם עץ בניאן ענק.","reality":"שקט, ירוק ומיוחד, הרבה פחות מסחרי מהשכן. הסיור ביפנית ברובו, אבל המקום מדבר בעד עצמו.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥2,200-2,500 למבוגר","tip":"הסיור מתחיל בבית קפה בתוך מערה, שווה להגיע רבע שעה לפני.","sources":["https://www.airtrip.jp/travel-column/?p=21695","https://rurubu.jp/andmore/article/15957"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילי עפר ומדרגות, רק עם מנשא.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gangala%20Valley%20Okinawa","website_url":"https://www.gangala.com/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נפגשים בקפה המערה, הולכים עם מדריך כקילומטר דרך היער והמערות עד עץ הבניאן הענק, ומסיימים במערה שבה נמצאו שרידים של אדם קדום.","special":"באחת המערות נמצאו עצמות אדם בני אלפי שנים, מהעתיקות ביפן.","highlights":["עץ הבניאן הענק","קפה בתוך מערה","מערת בוגאידו"],"time_needed":"שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"202 Maekawa, Tamagusuku, Nanjo, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":90,"booking":"required","plan_line":"נכנסים רק בסיור מודרך, להזמין מראש באתר","baby_block":"שבילי עפר ומדרגות, בלי עגלה","tags":["valley","cave","jungle","banyan tree","guided tour","forest","prehistoric","עמק","מערה","ג'ונגל","עץ בניאן","סיור מודרך","יער","פרהיסטורי","nature","טבע"],"en":{"hype":"A valley of collapsed caves and thick jungle across from Okinawa World, open only on guided tours, with a giant banyan tree.","reality":"Quiet, green and special, far less commercial than its neighbour. The tour is mostly in Japanese, but the place speaks for itself.","tip":"The tour starts at a cafe inside a cave, get there 15 minutes early.","baby_notes":"Dirt paths and steps, carrier only.","price":"¥2,200-2,500 adults","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Meet at the cave cafe, walk about 1 km with a guide through forest and caves to the giant banyan, and finish in the cave where early human remains were found.","special":"Human bones thousands of years old, among Japan's oldest, were found in one of the caves.","highlights":["Giant banyan tree","Cafe in a cave","Bugeido cave"],"time_needed":"1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Guided tour only, book ahead online","baby_block":"Dirt paths and steps, no stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Nirai Kanai Bridge","name_ja":"ニライカナイ橋","city":"okinawa","area":"South Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.1665,"lng":127.8105,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גשר מתפתל שיורד מהגבעות של צ'ינן לחוף, עם נוף פתוח על הים ואי קודקה.","reality":"עצירת נוף יפה בנסיעה, לא יותר. התצפית מלמעלה, ליד המנהרה, היא הנקודה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"הכי יפה לנסוע עליו מלמעלה למטה, ולעצור בתצפית בראש הגבעה.","sources":[],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nirai%20Kanai%20Bridge%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוצרים בתצפית מעל הגשר, מצלמים את העיקול מעל הים וממשיכים בנסיעה למטה.","special":null,"highlights":["התצפית מעל המנהרה","הנוף לאי קודקה"],"time_needed":"15 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Chinen, Nanjo, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":15,"booking":"no","plan_line":"נוסעים מלמעלה למטה ועוצרים בתצפית שבראש","baby_block":null,"tags":["bridge","view","drive","sea view","photo","scenic","גשר","נוף","נסיעה","נוף לים","צילום","תצפית","lookout"],"en":{"hype":"A curving bridge dropping from the Chinen hills to the coast, with a wide view over the sea and Kudaka island.","reality":"A pretty viewpoint on a drive, no more. The lookout up top by the tunnel is the spot.","tip":"Best driven top to bottom, stopping at the hilltop lookout.","baby_notes":null,"price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Stop at the lookout above the bridge, photograph the curve over the sea and drive on down.","special":null,"highlights":["Lookout above the tunnel","View to Kudaka island"],"time_needed":"15 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Drive it downhill and stop at the lookout at the top","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Chinen Misaki Park","name_ja":"知念岬公園","city":"okinawa","area":"South Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.1675,"lng":127.8335,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"כף ירוקה מעל הים ליד ספה-אוטאקי, עם שבילים ונוף פתוח לכל הכיוונים.","reality":"שקט, חינם ויפה, עם הרבה פחות אנשים מהאתרים הגדולים. מתאים לזריחה.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"החניה משותפת עם מרכז המוצרים של ספה-אוטאקי, משלבים את שניהם.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e7124.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שביל מרוצף לתצפית, עגלה עוברת.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Chinen%20Misaki%20Park%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים בשביל עד קצה הכף, יושבים על הדשא ומסתכלים על הים ועל אי קודקה.","special":null,"highlights":["הנוף מקצה הכף","זריחה מעל הים"],"time_needed":"חצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Kugai, Chinen, Nanjo, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"חמש דקות הליכה מספה-אוטאקי, שווה לשלב","baby_block":null,"tags":["cape","park","view","sea view","sunrise","walk","כף","פארק","נוף","נוף לים","זריחה","טיול","lookout","תצפית"],"en":{"hype":"A green cape over the sea near Sefa-utaki, with paths and open views all round.","reality":"Quiet, free and pretty, with far fewer people than the big sights. Good at sunrise.","tip":"Parking is shared with the Sefa-utaki products center, so do both.","baby_notes":"Paved path to the lookout, stroller fine.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the path to the tip of the cape, sit on the grass and look out at the sea and Kudaka island.","special":null,"highlights":["View from the tip","Sunrise over the sea"],"time_needed":"30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"5 minutes' walk from Sefa-utaki, pair them","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Ou Island","name_ja":"奥武島","city":"okinawa","area":"South Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.131,"lng":127.772,"coord_preci