ירה"],"en":{"hype":"Okinawa's best preserved castle ruins, curving stone walls on a ridge with views to both sides of the island, World Heritage listed.","reality":"More impressive than Shuri for original walls, and far quieter. No background needed, the walls do the work.","tip":"An electric cart runs from the entrance up to the top, handy with a baby.","baby_notes":"Paths and slopes, with steps between the courtyards. A light stroller gets part of the way.","price":"¥500","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Climb from courtyard to courtyard between the walls, stand on the top wall and look at the Pacific on one side and the East China Sea on the other.","special":"The walls date from the 1400s and came through the war almost untouched; Commodore Perry admired them.","highlights":["Curving stone walls","View of both seas","Arched gates"],"time_needed":"1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Pair with Nakamura House, 5 minutes' drive","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Nakamura House","name_ja":"中村家住宅","city":"okinawa","area":"Central Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.288,"lng":127.798,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בית חווה אוקינאווי מהמאה ה-18 שנשמר בשלמותו, עם גג רעפים אדום, חומת אבן ופסלי שיסא.","reality":"קטן ומעניין, הדרך הכי טובה לראות איך גרו פה פעם. 20-30 דקות מספיקות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":null,"sources":["https://japan-guide.com/e/e7108.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חצר עם חצץ, הבית עצמו בלי נעליים.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nakamura%20House%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בחצר, מציצים לחדרי הבית, למטבח ולדיר החזירים המקורי מאבן.","special":"הבית שרד את המלחמה, נדיר באוקינאווה, והוא מוגן כנכס תרבותי לאומי.","highlights":["גג הרעפים עם השיסא","דיר האבן","חומת העצים נגד טייפונים"],"time_needed":"30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"106 Oshiro, Kitanakagusuku, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"חמש דקות מטירת נקגוסוקו, באים אחריה","baby_block":null,"tags":["traditional house","farmhouse","architecture","shisa","history","heritage","בית מסורתי","בית חווה","אדריכלות","שיסא","היסטוריה","מורשת","old house","בית עתיק"],"en":{"hype":"An 18th century Okinawan farmhouse kept whole, with a red tile roof, stone wall and shisa statues.","reality":"Small and interesting, the best way to see how people lived here. 20-30 minutes is enough.","tip":null,"baby_notes":"Gravel yard, shoes off in the house.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the yard and peek into the rooms, the kitchen and the original stone pig pen.","special":"The house survived the war, rare in Okinawa, and is a national cultural property.","highlights":["Tile roof with shisa","Stone pig pen","Typhoon tree wall"],"time_needed":"30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"5 minutes from Nakagusuku Castle, go after it","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Katsuren Castle Ruins","name_ja":"勝連城跡","city":"okinawa","area":"Central Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.33,"lng":127.879,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שרידי טירה על גבעה גבוהה בחצי האי קאצורן, עם נוף ים פתוח לכל הכיוונים, אתר מורשת עולמית.","reality":"העלייה תלולה ואין צל, אבל הנוף מהראש הוא מהיפים באי. שווה לשלב עם כביש הים לאיקיי.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"מרכז המבקרים בכניסה מסביר את הסיפור של האדון אמאווארי שמרד בשורי.","sources":[],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"עלייה ארוכה במדרגות אבן, רק עם מנשא.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Katsuren%20Castle%20Ruins%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים במרכז המבקרים, עולים במדרגות לשלוש החצרות של הטירה ומסיימים בראש הגבעה מול הים.","special":"הטירה הגבוהה מבין טירות ריוקיו, ומהראש רואים את כל החוף המזרחי.","highlights":["הנוף מהראש","החומות על הרכס","מרכז המבקרים"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3908 Katsuren Haebaru, Uruma, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"אין צל בעלייה, לבוא בבוקר עם מים","baby_block":"עלייה תלולה במדרגות, רק מנשא","tags":["castle ruins","gusuku","world heritage","hilltop","view","history","stairs","שרידי טירה","גוסוקו","מורשת עולמית","גבעה","נוף","היסטוריה","מדרגות"],"en":{"hype":"Hilltop castle ruins on the Katsuren peninsula with open sea views all round, World Heritage listed.","reality":"Steep climb and no shade, but the view from the top is one of the best on the island. Pair it with the sea road to Ikei.","tip":"The visitor center at the entrance tells the story of Lord Amawari who rebelled against Shuri.","baby_notes":"Long climb up stone steps, carrier only.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"See the visitor center, climb the steps through the three castle courtyards and finish on the hilltop over the sea.","special":"The highest of the Ryukyu castles, with the whole east coast in view from the top.","highlights":["View from the top","Walls on the ridge","Visitor center"],"time_needed":"1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"No shade on the climb, come in the morning with water","baby_block":"Steep stone steps, carrier only"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kaichu-doro & Hamahiga Island","name_ja":"海中道路・浜比嘉島","city":"okinawa","area":"Central Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.347,"lng":127.933,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"כביש של חמישה קילומטרים שעובר על הים לאיים הקטנים של מזרח האי, עם מקדשי אגדה בהמהיגה.","reality":"נסיעה יפה מאוד ביום שמש, והאיים שקטים ומקומיים. אין אטרקציה אחת, זה טיול נסיעה.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"עוצרים במרכז המבקרים באמצע הכביש לנוף ולשירותים.","sources":[],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"רוב העצירות ליד החניה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kaichu-doro%20%26%20Hamahiga%20Island%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נוסעים על הכביש מעל הים, ממשיכים בגשר להמהיגה, הולכים לקבר של אמאמיצ'ו ושינריצ'ו על הסלע ליד החוף, וממשיכים לאיי הנזה ואיקיי.","special":"לפי האגדה הזוג הראשון של אוקינאווה, אמאמיצ'ו ושינריצ'ו, גר והוקבר בהמהיגה.","highlights":["הכביש על הים","קבר אמאמיצ'ו","חוף איקיי"],"time_needed":"חצי יום","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Kaichu-doro, Yonashiro, Uruma, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":180,"booking":"no","plan_line":"נוסעים ביום שמש, בגשם זה מאבד הרבה","baby_block":null,"tags":["sea road","drive","islands","bridge","legend","shrine","beach","כביש על הים","נסיעה","איים","גשר","אגדה","מקדש","חוף","scenic","נוף"],"en":{"hype":"A 5 km road across the sea to the small east-coast islands, with legendary shrines on Hamahiga.","reality":"A beautiful drive on a sunny day, and the islands are quiet and local. No single attraction, it is a road trip.","tip":"Stop at the visitor center halfway along for the view and toilets.","baby_notes":"Most stops are next to parking.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Drive the road over the sea, cross the bridge to Hamahiga, walk to the tomb of Amamichu and Shinerichu on the rock by the shore, and carry on to Henza and Ikei.","special":"By legend Okinawa's first couple, Amamichu and Shinerichu, lived and are buried on Hamahiga.","highlights":["Road over the sea","Amamichu tomb","Ikei beach"],"time_needed":"Half a day","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Go on a sunny day, rain takes most of it away","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Zakimi Castle Ruins","name_ja":"座喜味城跡","city":"okinawa","area":"