 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"10 minutes from Yachimun no Sato, pair them","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Cape Zanpa","name_ja":"残波岬","city":"okinawa","area":"Central Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.44,"lng":127.714,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"צוקים של 30 מטר מעל הים ביומיטאן, עם מגדלור לבן שאפשר לעלות אליו.","reality":"פראי ויפה, ופחות צפוף ממנזמו. הגלים מתנפצים על הצוקים בימים סוערים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם, המגדלור בתשלום קטן","tip":"שווה לבוא לשקיעה, הכף פונה מערבה.","sources":[],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שביל לאורך הצוקים, אבל אין מעקה בכל מקום. המגדלור עם מדרגות צרות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Cape%20Zanpa%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים לאורך שפת הצוקים, עולים למגדלור לנוף ונחים בפארק הדשא ליד.","special":null,"highlights":["המגדלור","הצוקים","שקיעה"],"time_needed":"40 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Uza, Yomitan, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בואו לשקיעה, ושמרו מרחק מהשפה, אין מעקה","baby_block":null,"tags":["cape","cliffs","lighthouse","sunset","sea view","waves","כף","צוקים","מגדלור","שקיעה","נוף לים","גלים","yomitan","nature","טבע"],"en":{"hype":"30 m cliffs over the sea in Yomitan, with a white lighthouse you can climb.","reality":"Wild and pretty, less crowded than Manzamo. Waves smash the cliffs on rough days.","tip":"Come for sunset, the cape faces west.","baby_notes":"Path along the cliffs, but no railing everywhere. Narrow stairs in the lighthouse.","price":"Free, small fee for the lighthouse","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the cliff edge, climb the lighthouse for the view and rest in the grassy park nearby.","special":null,"highlights":["Lighthouse","Cliffs","Sunset"],"time_needed":"40 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Come for sunset, keep back from the edge, no railing","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Blue Cave snorkelling at Cape Maeda","name_ja":"真栄田岬 青の洞窟","city":"okinawa","area":"Central Okinawa","category":"experience","lat":26.445,"lng":127.772,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שנורקלינג במערה ימית באונה שבה המים זוהרים בכחול, הפעילות הימית הפופולרית באוקינאווה.","reality":"יפה באמת כשהים שקט, אבל צפוף מאוד ובימים סוערים סוגרים את המערה ומעבירים למקום אחר. בחורף עם חליפה זה עובד.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"סיור מודרך בערך ¥4,000-13,500, תלוי במפעיל ובגודל הקבוצה","tip":"בוקר מוקדם הכי פחות צפוף, ולבדוק מראש מה המדיניות אם המערה סגורה.","sources":["https://pelago.com/en/activity/ps8uda5p6-okinawa-blue-cave-snorkeling-fish-feeding-okinawa","https://www.veltra.com/a/203207"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"פעילות במים פתוחים, לא לתינוקות. מהתצפית למעלה רואים את הכף.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Blue%20Cave%20snorkelling%20at%20Cape%20Maeda%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"פוגשים מדריך, לובשים חליפה, יורדים במדרגות לים ושוחים למערה, מאכילים דגים ומצלמים.","special":"האור שנכנס מתחת למים צובע את המערה בכחול זוהר.","highlights":["האור הכחול במערה","האכלת דגים","הכף למעלה"],"time_needed":"2-3 שעות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"469-1 Maeda, Onna, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":150,"booking":"required","plan_line":"מזמינים סיור, ובים סוער המערה נסגרת","baby_block":"פעילות במים, לא מתאים לתינוק","tags":["snorkeling","snorkel","blue cave","diving","sea cave","fish","tour","שנורקלינג","שנורקל","מערה כחולה","צלילה","מערה ימית","דגים","סיור","sea","ים"],"en":{"hype":"Snorkelling in a sea cave in Onna where the water glows blue, Okinawa's most popular sea activity.","reality":"Truly pretty when the sea is calm, but very crowded, and on rough days the cave closes and tours move elsewhere. In winter it works with a wetsuit.","tip":"Early morning is least crowded, and check the policy if the cave is closed.","baby_notes":"Open water activity, not for babies. The lookout above shows the cape.","price":"Guided tour about ¥4,000-13,500 depending on operator and group size","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Meet the guide, suit up, walk down the steps into the sea and swim into the cave, feed fish and take photos.","special":"Light coming in under the water turns the cave a glowing blue.","highlights":["Blue light in the cave","Fish feeding","The cape above"],"time_needed":"2-3 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Book a tour, the cave closes in rough seas","baby_block":"In the water, not suitable for a baby"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Cape Manzamo","name_ja":"万座毛","city":"okinawa","area":"Central Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.505,"lng":127.85,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"צוק בצורת אף של פיל מעל ים טורקיז באונה, אחד הנופים המצולמים באוקינאווה.","reality":"יפה אבל קצר, עשר דקות של שביל מעגלי, ובצהריים מלא אוטובוסים. שווה כעצירה בדרך צפונה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥100, עד גיל בית ספר חינם","tip":"בשקיעה הכי יפה והאוטובוסים כבר עזבו.","sources":["https://www.gltjp.com/en/directory/item/15041/","https://todolist-japan.com/en/cape-manzamo-guide-en/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שביל מרוצף ושטוח, נוח עם עגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Cape%20Manzamo%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים בשביל המעגלי על הצוק, מצלמים את צוק הפיל ונכנסים לבניין המבקרים.","special":null,"highlights":["צוק הפיל","הים הטורקיז","שקיעה"],"time_needed":"20-30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Onna, Onna-son, Okinawa","opens":"08:00","closes":"19:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בצהריים מלא קבוצות, לבוא בשקיעה","baby_block":null,"tags":["cape","cliff","elephant rock","sea view","sunset","photo","כף","צוק","סלע הפיל","נוף לים","שקיעה","צילום","onna","lookout","תצפית"],"en":{"hype":"An elephant-trunk cliff over a turquoise sea in Onna, one of Okinawa's most photographed views.","reality":"Pretty but short, a 10 minute loop path, and full of buses at midday. Worth a stop on the way north.","tip":"Sunset is prettiest and the buses have gone.","baby_notes":"Flat paved path, easy with a stroller.","price":"¥100, preschoolers free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the loop on the cliff, photograph the elephant rock and look into the visitor building.","special":null,"highlights":["Elephant rock","Turquoise sea","Sunset"],"time_needed":"20-30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Packed with groups at midday, come at sunset","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Yachimun no Sato","name_ja":"やちむんの里","city":"okinawa","area":"Central Okinawa","category":"shopping","lat":26.404,"lng":127.745,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"כפר של סדנאות קרמיקה ביומיטאן, בין עצים ותנור טיפוס ענק, שאליו עברו הקדרים מנאהה.","reality":"שקט, ירוק ומקסים, עם חנויות קטנות של כל סדנה. כאן קונים את הכלים הכי טובים באי.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כלים בערך ¥1,000-6,000","tip":"חלק מהסדנאות סגורות בימים שונים בשבוע, שווה לבוא בבוקר של יום חול.","sources":[],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילי עפר ואבן, עגלה עוברת לאט.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Yachimun%20no%20Sato%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים בשבילים בין הסדנאות, מסתכלים על התנור הגדול ונכנסים לחנויות הקטנות לקנות.","special":"התנור הגדול עם מדרגות של שמונה תאים עדיין עובד, ושורפים בו כמה פעמים בשנה.","highlights":["תנור הטיפוס הגדול","הגלריות של הסדנאות","קערות בעבודת יד"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2653-1 Zakimi, Yomitan, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עשר דקות מטירת זאקימי, משלבים יחד","baby_block":null,"tags":["pottery","ceramics","yachimun","kiln","workshop","village","bowls","קרמיקה","כלי חרס","תנור","סדנאות","כפר","קערות","craft","מלאכת יד","yomitan"],"en":{"hype":"A village of pottery workshops in Yomitan among trees and a huge climbing kiln, where potters moved from Naha.","reality":"Quiet, green and lovely, with a small shop per workshop. This is where to buy the best pottery on the island.","tip":"Workshops close on different weekdays, so come on a weekday morning.","baby_notes":"Dirt and stone paths, a stroller gets through slowly.","price":"Pieces about ¥1,000-6,000","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the paths between workshops, see the big kiln and go into the small shops to buy.","special":"The big eight-chamber climbing kiln still works and is fired a few times a year.","highlights":["Big climbing kiln","Workshop galleries","Handmade bowls"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"10 minutes from Zakimi Castle, pair them","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Futenma-gu Shrine","name_ja":"普天満宮","city":"okinawa","area":"Central Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.279,"lng":127.762,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש עתיק בגינואן עם מערת אבן גיר מאחוריו, שנכנסים אליה עם אישור במשרד המקדש.","reality":"מקדש מקומי קטן, אבל המערה מיוחדת וכמעט אף תייר לא יודע עליה.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"מבקשים במשרד המקדש לראות את המערה, ממלאים טופס קצר ונכנסים.","sources":[],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"המערה עם מדרגות ורטובה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Futenma-gu%20Shrine%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מתפללים או מסתכלים במקדש, נרשמים במשרד ויורדים למערה מאחור עם הנטיפים והמזבח.","special":"המערה באורך כ-280 מטר, והמקדש נבנה סביבה לפני מאות שנים.","highlights":["מערת האבן","המקדש האדום"],"time_needed":"30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-27-10 Futenma, Ginowan, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"המערה פתוחה בשעות המשרד בלבד, לבוא בבוקר","baby_block":null,"tags":["shrine","cave","limestone","shinto","local","stalactites","מקדש","מערה","אבן גיר","שינטו","מקומי","נטיפים","ginowan","quiet","שקט"],"en":{"hype":"An old shrine in Ginowan with a limestone cave behind it, open with a pass from the shrine office.","reality":"A small local shrine, but the cave is special and almost no tourists know it.","tip":"Ask at the shrine office to see the cave, fill a short form and go in.","baby_notes":"The cave has steps and is wet.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Look around the shrine, sign in at the office and go down to the cave behind with its stalactites and altar.","special":"The cave runs about 280 m, and the shrine was built around it centuries ago.","highlights":["Limestone cave","Red shrine"],"time_needed":"30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Cave open during office hours only, come in the morning","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
where not exists (select 1 from place_library p where p.city = x.city and lower(p.name) = lower(x.name));
insert into place_library (name, name_ja, city, area, category, lat, lng, coord_precision, hype, reality, verdict, tabelog_score, google_score, price, tip, sources, audience, baby_notes, local_pick, maps_url, website_url, serves, dishes, todo, special, highlights, time_needed, kosher, kosher_note, address, opens, closes, closed_weekdays, closed_dates, open_dates, best_time, visit_mins, booking, plan_line, baby_block, tags, en, facts_at, facts_sure, active)
select x.name, x.name_ja, x.city, x.area, x.category, x.lat, x.lng, x.coord_precision, x.hype, x.reality, x.verdict, x.tabelog_score, x.google_score, x.price, x.tip, x.sources, x.audience, x.baby_notes, x.local_pick, x.maps_url, x.website_url, x.serves, x.dishes, x.todo, x.special, x.highlights, x.time_needed, x.kosher, x.kosher_note, x.address, x.opens, x.closes, x.closed_weekdays, x.closed_dates, x.open_dates, x.best_time, x.visit_mins, x.booking, x.plan_line, x.baby_block, x.tags, x.en, x.facts_at, x.facts_sure, false from jsonb_populate_recordset(null::place_library, $cards$[{"name":"Sakima Art Museum","name_ja":"佐喜眞美術館","city":"okinawa","area":"Central Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.272,"lng":127.757,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון אמנות קטן צמוד לגדר בסיס פוטנמה, עם הציור הענק 'קרב אוקינאווה' של מרוקי.","reality":"קטן ומטלטל, והגג נותן תצפית על הבסיס האמריקאי בלב העיר. מסביר את הפוליטיקה של האי בלי מילים.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥900","tip":"עולים לגג המדורג: המדרגות מכוונות לשקיעה של יום הזיכרון ב-23 ביוני.","sources":["https://tokyoartbeat.com/en/venues/-/sakima-art-museum","https://okinawahai.com/?p=9595"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"מוזיאון שקט וקטן, מתאים יותר בלי תינוק.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sakima%20Art%20Museum%20Okinawa","website_url":"https://sakima.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עומדים מול ציור הקרב הענק, עוברים על עבודות קטה קולביץ ועולים לגג להסתכל על הבסיס.","special":"בעל המוזיאון החזיר לעצמו את אדמת המשפחה מתוך הבסיס, ובנה עליה את המוזיאון.","highlights":["ציור קרב אוקינאווה","עבודות קולביץ","הגג מול הבסיס"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"358 Ueno, Ginowan, Okinawa","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[2],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שלישי ובחופשת השנה החדשה","baby_block":null,"tags":["art museum","war","painting","marine base","futenma","peace","rooftop","מוזיאון אמנות","מלחמה","ציור","בסיס אמריקאי","פוטנמה","שלום","גג","battle of okinawa","קרב אוקינאווה"],"en":{"hype":"A small art museum against the Futenma base fence, with the Marukis' huge 'Battle of Okinawa' painting.","reality":"Small and shattering, and the roof looks out over a US base in the middle of town. Explains the island's politics without words.","tip":"Go up the stepped roof: the steps line up with the sunset on Memorial Day, 23 June.","baby_notes":"Quiet small museum, better without a baby.","price":"¥900","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Stand before the huge battle painting, see the Kathe Kollwitz works and go up to the roof to look at the base.","special":"The owner won back his family's land from the base and built the museum on it.","highlights":["Battle of Okinawa painting","Kollwitz works","Roof facing the base"],"time_needed":"1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Tuesdays and over the New Year holiday","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Michi-no-eki Kadena","name_ja":"道の駅かでな","city":"okinawa","area":"Central Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.363,"lng":127.768,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"תחנת דרכים עם מרפסת תצפית על בסיס חיל האוויר קדנה, הבסיס האמריקאי הגדול באסיה.","reality":"מוזר ומעניין: רואים מטוסי קרב ממריאים מקרוב. יש בקומה העליונה גם תצוגה קטנה על הבסיס והמלחמה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"יש תמיד צלמי מטוסים על המרפסת, הם יודעים מתי ממריאים.","sources":[],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש מעלית למרפסת, אבל המטוסים רועשים מאוד, כדאי אוזניות לתינוק.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Michi-no-eki%20Kadena%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים למרפסת בקומה הרביעית, מסתכלים על המסלולים ועל המטוסים, ועוברים בתצוגה על ההיסטוריה של הבסיס.","special":null,"highlights":["מרפסת התצפית","מטוסי קרב","התצוגה על הבסיס"],"time_needed":"30-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1026-3 Yara, Kadena, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"רעש חזק של מטוסים, אוזניות לתינוק","baby_block":null,"tags":["air base","planes","fighter jets","observation deck","military","history","בסיס","מטוסים","מטוסי קרב","תצפית","צבא","היסטוריה","kadena","rest stop","תחנת דרכים"],"en":{"hype":"A roadside station with an observation deck over Kadena Air Base, the biggest US base in Asia.","reality":"Strange and interesting: fighter jets take off up close. The top floor also has a small display on the base and the war.","tip":"Plane spotters are always on the deck and know when jets go up.","baby_notes":"Elevator to the deck, but jets are very loud, bring baby ear muffs.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go up to the 4th floor deck, watch the runways and planes, and see the display on the base's history.","special":null,"highlights":["Observation deck","Fighter jets","Base display"],"time_needed":"30-45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Loud jets, bring ear muffs for the baby","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Okinawa Zoo & Museum","name_ja":"沖縄こどもの国","city":"okinawa","area":"Central Okinawa","category":"experience","lat":26.324,"lng":127.807,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גן החיות של אוקינאווה בעיר אוקינאווה, עם חיות מקומיות כמו סוס יונאגוני ומוזיאון מדע לילדים.","reality":"גן חיות פשוט וזול, נחמד עם ילדים קטנים ובלי צפיפות. לא אטרקציה למבוגרים בלבד.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,000 למבוגר, עד גיל 3 חינם","tip":null,"sources":["https://enjoyokinawa.cerulean-blue.co.jp/en/tourism/72","https://www.jeepe.jp/en/articles/okinawa-kodomo-no-kuni-guide-2178"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים רחבים ומרוצפים, עגלה עוברת בכל מקום, יש שירותים עם החתלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Okinawa%20Zoo%20%26%20Museum%20Okinawa","website_url":"https://www.okzm.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים בין מתחמי החיות, רואים את החיות של אוקינאווה ומי שרוצה נכנס למוזיאון המדע (כרטיס נפרד).","special":"יש בו חיות מקומיות נדירות של האיים, כמו סוס יונאגוני הקטן.","highlights":["חיות מקומיות","סוס יונאגוני","מוזיאון המדע"],"time_needed":"שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"5-7-1 Goya, Okinawa City, Okinawa","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:30","closed_weekdays":[2],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":120,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בימי שלישי, כניסה אחרונה בחורף ב-16:30","baby_block":null,"tags":["zoo","animals","kids","family","museum","science","horse","גן חיות","חיות","ילדים","משפחה","מוזיאון","מדע","סוס","baby","תינוק"],"en":{"hype":"Okinawa's zoo in Okinawa City, with local animals like the Yonaguni horse and a kids' science museum.","reality":"A simple, cheap zoo, nice with small kids and never crowded. Not a sight for adults only.","tip":null,"baby_notes":"Wide paved paths, a stroller goes everywhere, toilets with changing tables.","price":"¥1,000 adults, under 3 free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk past the animal areas, see the Okinawan species, and visit the science museum if you like (separate ticket).","special":"It keeps rare island animals such as the small Yonaguni horse.","highlights":["Local animals","Yonaguni horse","Science museum"],"time_needed":"2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Tuesdays, last winter entry 16:30","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Southeast Botanical Gardens Illumination","name_ja":"東南植物楽園 イルミネーション","city":"okinawa","area":"Central Okinawa","category":"experience","lat":26.367,"lng":127.808,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גן בוטני טרופי בעיר אוקינאווה שנדלק בערבים במיליוני נורות, מסוף אוקטובר עד מאי.","reality":"מהתאורות היפות באוקינאווה, בין עצי דקל ואגמים. בערבי חג המולד ובסופ\"ש צפוף והמחירים עולים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כ-¥2,500 למבוגר בערב, ¥900 לילדים 4-14","tip":"מ-19 בדצמבר עד 3 בינואר יש מחירי אירוע, שווה לבוא לפני.","sources":["https://en.japantravel.com/okinawa/okinawa-tropical-illuminations/68131","https://www.southeast-botanical.jp/en/christmas_newyear"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים שטוחים ברובם, עגלה עוברת. בערב קריר, להביא שכבה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Southeast%20Botanical%20Gardens%20Illumination%20Okinawa","website_url":"https://www.southeast-botanical.jp/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים עם רדת החשכה, הולכים בשבילים המוארים בין הדקלים והאגמים, ועוצרים במנהרות האור.","special":"התאורה בתוך יער טרופי של דקלים, לא בעיר.","highlights":["מנהרת האור","האגם המואר","שדרת הדקלים"],"time_needed":"שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2146 Chibana, Okinawa City, Okinawa","opens":"17:00","closes":"22:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"night","visit_mins":90,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"מחירי אירוע מ-19 בדצמבר, כרטיס אונליין חוסך תור","baby_block":null,"tags":["illumination","lights","christmas","botanical garden","night","palms","winter","תאורה","אורות","חג המולד","גן בוטני","לילה","דקלים","חורף","night lights","ערב"],"en":{"hype":"A tropical botanical garden in Okinawa City lit by millions of bulbs in the evenings, late October to May.","reality":"One of Okinawa's best light shows, among palms and ponds. Christmas evenings and weekends are crowded and pricier.","tip":"Event pricing runs 19 December to 3 January, come before.","baby_notes":"Mostly flat paths, stroller fine. Cool in the evening, bring a layer.","price":"About ¥2,500 adults in the evening, ¥900 ages 4-14","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go in at dusk, walk the lit paths between the palms and ponds, and stop in the light tunnels.","special":"The lights are set in a tropical palm forest, not a city.","highlights":["Light tunnel","Lit pond","Palm avenue"],"time_needed":"1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Event prices from 19 Dec, buy online to skip the line","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Ryukyu Mura","name_ja":"琉球村","city":"okinawa","area":"Central Okinawa","category":"experience","lat":26.425,"lng":127.788,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"כפר מסורתי באונה עם בתים ישנים שהועברו מכל האי, מופעי אייסה וסדנאות מלאכה.","reality":"תיירותי, אבל הבתים אמיתיים ומופעי האייסה טובים. מקום סביר לשעה-שעתיים, בעיקר עם ילדים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כ-¥2,000 למבוגר, עד גיל 6 חינם","tip":"מתזמנים את הביקור למופע האייסה, הוא הדבר הכי טוב שם.","sources":["https://japan-guide.com/e/e7121.html","https://okinawa-tourism.pages.dev/en/spots/ryukyu-village/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים לא אחידים בין הבתים, עגלה עוברת ברוב המקומות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ryukyu%20Mura%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים בין בתי העץ עם גגות הרעפים, רואים מופע אייסה בכיכר ומנסים סדנה קטנה כמו צביעה או נגינה בסנשין.","special":"הבתים הם בתים מקוריים בני 100-200 שנה שפורקו והורכבו מחדש כאן.","highlights":["מופע אייסה","הבתים הישנים","סדנאות מלאכה"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1130 Yamada, Onna, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"מופעי אייסה בדרך כלל ב-10, 12, 14 ו-16","baby_block":null,"tags":["village","traditional houses","eisa","dance","drums","culture","crafts","sanshin","כפר מסורתי","בתים עתיקים","אייסה","ריקוד","תופים","תרבות","מלאכת יד","סנשין"],"en":{"hype":"A traditional village in Onna with old houses moved from across the island, eisa shows and craft workshops.","reality":"Touristy, but the houses are real and the eisa shows are good. A fair hour or two, mainly with kids.","tip":"Time your visit for the eisa show, it is the best thing there.","baby_notes":"Uneven paths between houses, a stroller gets through most of it.","price":"About ¥2,000 adults, under 6 free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk between the wooden tile-roofed houses, watch an eisa show in the square and try a small workshop like dyeing or sanshin playing.","special":"The houses are original 100-200 year old homes taken apart and rebuilt here.","highlights":["Eisa show","Old houses","Craft workshops"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Eisa shows usually at 10, 12, 14 and 16","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"AEON Mall Okinawa Rycom","name_ja":"イオンモール沖縄ライカム","city":"okinawa","area":"Central Okinawa","category":"shopping","lat":26.314,"lng":127.796,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"הקניון הגדול באוקינאווה, בקיטה-נקגוסוקו, עם אקווריום קטן בכניסה ומאות חנויות.","reality":"קניון ענק רגיל, טוב ליום גשום, לקניות של בגדים ולתינוק. לא אטרקציה בפני עצמה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"מיכל הדגים הגדול בכניסה הראשית מספיק כדי לשמח תינוק לכמה דקות.","sources":["https://okinawarycom-aeonmall.com/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"חדרי תינוקות, הנקה והחתלה בכל קומה, מעליות, השכרת עגלות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=AEON%20Mall%20Okinawa%20Rycom%20Okinawa","website_url":"https://okinawarycom-aeonmall.com/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מסתובבים בקומות, קונים בגדים ומוצרי תינוקות ואוכלים במתחם האוכל.","special":null,"highlights":["מיכל הדגים בכניסה","מתחם האוכל","חנויות תינוקות"],"time_needed":"שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1 Raika, Kitanakagusuku, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":120,"booking":"no","plan_line":"טוב ליום גשום, עשר דקות מטירת נקגוסוקו","baby_block":null,"tags":["mall","shopping","aquarium tank","baby goods","clothes","food court","rainy day","קניון","קניות","מיכל דגים","מוצרי תינוקות","בגדים","מתחם אוכל","יום גשום","aeon"],"en":{"hype":"Okinawa's biggest mall, in Kitanakagusuku, with a small aquarium tank at the entrance and hundreds of shops.","reality":"A huge ordinary mall, good for a rainy day, clothes and baby shopping. Not a sight by itself.","tip":"The big fish tank at the main entrance keeps a baby happy for a few minutes.","baby_notes":"Baby rooms with nursing and changing on every floor, elevators, stroller rental.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the floors, buy clothes and baby goods and eat in the food court.","special":null,"highlights":["Entrance fish tank","Food court","Baby shops"],"time_needed":"2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Good on a rainy day, 10 minutes from Nakagusuku Castle","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Bios no Oka","name_ja":"ビオスの丘","city":"okinawa","area":"Central Okinawa","category":"experience","lat":26.438,"lng":127.824,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פארק טבע באורומה עם שייט בסירה באגם בין הג'ונגל, רכיבה על עגלת תאו מים ופינת חיות.","reality":"רגוע, ירוק ומתאים מאוד למשפחות. לא מרגש למבוגרים לבד, אבל עם תינוק זה בוקר נעים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"השייט באגם הוא החלק הכי טוב, לבוא אליו קודם.","sources":[],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים מרוצפים ברובם, אפשר לעלות לסירה עם תינוק בידיים.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bios%20no%20Oka%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יוצאים לשייט באגם בין הצמחייה הטרופית, רוכבים על עגלת התאו ומסתובבים בפינת החיות.","special":null,"highlights":["שייט באגם","עגלת תאו המים","סחלבים"],"time_needed":"שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"961-30 Ishikawa Kadekaru, Uruma, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":120,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בוקר שקט עם תינוק, לפני העומס של אחר הצהריים","baby_block":null,"tags":["nature park","boat ride","lake","jungle","water buffalo","animals","family","פארק טבע","שייט","אגם","ג'ונגל","תאו מים","חיות","משפחה","kids","ילדים"],"en":{"hype":"A nature park in Uruma with a boat ride on a jungle lake, water buffalo cart rides and a petting area.","reality":"Calm, green and very family friendly. Not thrilling for adults alone, but a nice morning with a baby.","tip":"The lake boat ride is the best part, do it first.","baby_notes":"Mostly paved paths, you can board the boat holding a baby.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Take the boat ride through the tropical plants, ride the water buffalo cart and walk the petting area.","special":null,"highlights":["Lake boat ride","Water buffalo cart","Orchids"],"time_needed":"2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"A quiet morning with a baby, before the afternoon crowd","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Okinawa Churaumi Aquarium","name_ja":"沖縄美ら海水族館","city":"okinawa","area":"North Okinawa","category":"experience","lat":26.6943,"lng":127.8779,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"האקווריום הגדול של יפן עם מיכל ענק שבו שוחים כרישי לווייתן ומנטות, בפארק אושן אקספו במוטובו.","reality":"עומד בכל ההייפ. המיכל המרכזי עוצר נשימה, וכדאי לבוא בבוקר או אחרי 16:00 כשהכרטיס זול יותר והתורים קצרים.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥2,180 למבוגר, עד גיל 6 חינם","tip":"אחרי 16:00 יש כרטיס מוזל, ובשעות האכלת הכרישים המיכל הכי מרשים.","sources":["https://churaumi.okinawa/en/guide/hour/","https://churaumi.okinawa/en/faq/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"נגיש לגמרי עם עגלה, מעליות וחדרי הנקה. חשוך ליד המיכל הגדול, נעים לתינוק.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Okinawa%20Churaumi%20Aquarium%20Okinawa","website_url":"https://churaumi.okinawa/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יורדים דרך מיכלי האלמוגים והדגים הטרופיים עד המיכל הענק, יושבים מולו בזמן ההאכלה, ויוצאים לפארק לראות את מופע הדולפינים החינמי.","special":"מיכל הקורושיו הוא מהגדולים בעולם, ושוחים בו כמה כרישי לווייתן יחד.","highlights":["מיכל הקורושיו","כרישי הלווייתן","מופע הדולפינים בחוץ","מיכל האלמוגים"],"time_needed":"2-3 שעות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"424 Ishikawa, Motobu, Okinawa","opens":"08:30","closes":"18:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":150,"booking":"no","plan_line":"שעתיים נסיעה מנאהה, לצאת מוקדם או לישון בצפון","baby_block":null,"tags":["aquarium","whale shark","manta","fish","coral","dolphin show","kids","אקווריום","כריש לווייתן","מנטה","דגים","אלמוגים","מופע דולפינים","ילדים","churaumi","baby","תינוק"],"en":{"hype":"Japan's top aquarium with a huge tank of whale sharks and mantas, in Ocean Expo Park in Motobu.","reality":"Lives up to the hype. The main tank is breathtaking; come early or after 16:00 when tickets are cheaper and lines shorter.","tip":"There is a cheaper ticket after 16:00, and the tank is at its best during the shark feeding.","baby_notes":"Fully stroller-accessible, elevators and nursing rooms. Dim by the big tank, calming for a baby.","price":"¥2,180 adults, under 6 free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk down past the coral and tropical fish tanks to the giant tank, sit in front of it at feeding time, then go out to the park for the free dolphin show.","special":"The Kuroshio tank is among the world's biggest, with several whale sharks swimming together.","highlights":["Kuroshio tank","Whale sharks","Outdoor dolphin show","Coral tank"],"time_needed":"2-3 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Two hours' drive from Naha, leave early or stay up north","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Ocean Expo Park & Emerald Beach","name_ja":"海洋博公園・エメラルドビーチ","city":"okinawa","area":"North Okinawa","category":"experience","lat":26.7,"lng":127.877,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"הפארק הגדול סביב צ'וראומי, עם מופע דולפינים חינמי, כפר מסורתי, גן טרופי וחוף אמרלד בקצה.","reality":"רוב הפארק חינם ושווה להקדיש לו שעה אחרי האקווריום. החוף יפה מאוד, ובחורף טוב להליכה בלבד.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"הפארק, מופע הדולפינים והחוף חינם","tip":"רכבת חשמלית קטנה עוברת בין חלקי הפארק, חוסכת הליכה עם תינוק.","sources":["https://churaumi.okinawa/en/faq/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים מרוצפים ורחבים, נוח עם עגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ocean%20Expo%20Park%20%26%20Emerald%20Beach%20Okinawa","website_url":"https://oki-park.jp/kaiyohaku/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"רואים את מופע הדולפינים באוקי-צ'אן, הולכים בכפר המסורתי ומסיימים בהליכה על חוף אמרלד עם הנוף לאי איה.","special":null,"highlights":["מופע הדולפינים","חוף אמרלד","הכפר המסורתי","הנוף לאי איה"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"424 Ishikawa, Motobu, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"משלבים עם צ'וראומי באותו יום","baby_block":null,"tags":["park","dolphin show","beach","emerald beach","village","garden","free","פארק","מופע דולפינים","חוף","כפר מסורתי","גן","חינם","sea view","נוף לים"],"en":{"hype":"The big park around Churaumi, with a free dolphin show, a traditional village, a tropical garden and Emerald Beach at the end.","reality":"Most of it is free and worth an hour after the aquarium. The beach is lovely, for walking only in winter.","tip":"A small electric tram runs between parts of the park, saving a walk with a baby.","baby_notes":"Wide paved paths, easy with a stroller.","price":"Park, dolphin show and beach free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Watch the dolphin show at Okichan theater, walk the traditional village and end with a stroll on Emerald Beach facing Ie island.","special":null,"highlights":["Dolphin show","Emerald Beach","Traditional village","View to Ie island"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Pair with Churaumi on the same day","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Bise Fukugi Tree Road","name_ja":"備瀬のフクギ並木","city":"okinawa","area":"North Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.704,"lng":127.88,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"כפר דייגים ליד צ'וראומי עם שבילי חול בין אלפי עצי פוקוגי ותיקים, שנשתלו נגד טייפונים.","reality":"שקט, מוצל ויפה, והליכה של חצי שעה עד הים מרגיעה אחרי האקווריום. אנשים גרים פה, שומרים על השקט.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"שוכרים אופניים בכניסה לכפר ורוכבים בין השבילים עד כף ביסה.","sources":["https://filmoffice.ocvb.or.jp/en/?p=26517","https://www.jeepe.jp/en/articles/bise-fukugi-namiki-guide-1597"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילי חול מהודק, עגלה עוברת אבל קצת קשה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bise%20Fukugi%20Tree%20Road%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים או רוכבים בשבילים בין העצים, מציצים לבתים הישנים ויוצאים לחוף בכף ביסה.","special":"חלק מהעצים בני יותר מ-300 שנה, וכל הכפר מוסתר מתחתם.","highlights":["שבילי העצים","כף ביסה","הבתים הישנים"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"389 Bise, Motobu, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"חמש דקות מצ'וראומי, טוב אחרי האקווריום","baby_block":null,"tags":["trees","village","walk","bicycle","shade","fukugi","beach","עצים","כפר","טיול רגלי","אופניים","צל","פוקוגי","חוף","quiet","שקט"],"en":{"hype":"A fishing village near Churaumi with sandy lanes under thousands of old fukugi trees planted against typhoons.","reality":"Quiet, shady and pretty, and a half-hour walk to the sea is calming after the aquarium. People live here, keep it quiet.","tip":"Rent bikes at the village entrance and ride the lanes to Cape Bise.","baby_notes":"Packed sand lanes, a stroller works but it is a bit hard.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk or ride the lanes between the trees, peek at the old houses and come out at the shore at Cape Bise.","special":"Some trees are over 300 years old, and the whole village hides beneath them.","highlights":["Tree lanes","Cape Bise","Old houses"],"time_needed":"1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"5 minutes from Churaumi, good after the aquarium","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Nakijin Castle Ruins","name_ja":"今帰仁城跡","city":"okinawa","area":"North Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.6915,"lng":127.929,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שרידי הטירה של ממלכת הצפון, חומות אבן ארוכות על רכס מעל הים, אתר מורשת עולמית.","reality":"החומות הארוכות ביותר מכל הטירות ונוף פתוח לים. פחות צפוף מצ'וראומי ומשתלב בקלות.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"הכרטיס כולל גם מוזיאון קטן בכניסה שמסביר את הסיפור.","sources":["https://japan-guide.com/e/e7110.html","https://okinawa-tourism.pages.dev/en/spots/ruins-of-nakijin-castle/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מדרגות אבן לשער הראשי, אחר כך שבילים ודשא.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nakijin%20Castle%20Ruins%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במדרגות לשער הראשי, הולכים לאורך החומות לקודש הפנימי בראש ומסתכלים על הים.","special":"החומות באורך 1.5 ק\"מ מתפתלות לפי קו הרכס, עם נוף לאי יורון בימים צלולים.","highlights":["החומות המתפתלות","השער הראשי","הנוף לים"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"5101 Imadomari, Nakijin, Okinawa","opens":"08:00","closes":"18:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עשר דקות מצ'וראומי, משלבים באותו יום","baby_block":null,"tags":["castle ruins","gusuku","stone walls","world heritage","view","history","hokuzan","שרידי טירה","גוסוקו","חומות אבן","מורשת עולמית","נוף","היסטוריה","castle","טירה"],"en":{"hype":"The castle ruins of the northern kingdom, long stone walls on a ridge over the sea, World Heritage listed.","reality":"The longest walls of any castle and open sea views. Less crowded than Churaumi and easy to combine.","tip":"The ticket also covers a small museum at the entrance that tells the story.","baby_notes":"Stone steps to the main gate, then paths and grass.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Climb the steps to the main gate, walk along the walls to the inner sanctuary at the top and look out to sea.","special":"1.5 km of walls snake along the ridge line, with a view to Yoron island on clear days.","highlights":["Snaking walls","Main gate","Sea view"],"time_needed":"1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"10 minutes from Churaumi, pair them on one day","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kouri Island & Tinu Beach","name_ja":"古宇利島・ティーヌ浜","city":"okinawa","area":"North Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.706,"lng":128.018,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אי קטן שמחובר בגשר של שני קילומטר מעל מים טורקיז, עם חוף טינו וסלע הלב המפורסם.","reality":"הנסיעה על הגשר היא החלק הכי יפה, באמת. סלע הלב מצטלם טוב בשפל, אבל בצהריים יש תור לתמונה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם, חניה ליד החוף בתשלום","tip":"עוצרים בחוף לפני הגשר בצד של יגאג'י לתמונה הטובה של הגשר.","sources":["https://japanactivity.com/attractions/okinawa/kouri-island","https://www.gltjp.com/en/review/item/12087/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"ירידה לחוף טינו בשביל תלול קצר וסלעי, לא לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kouri%20Island%20%26%20Tinu%20Beach%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נוסעים על הגשר לאי, מקיפים אותו ברכב (8 ק\"מ), ויורדים לחוף טינו לראות את סלע הלב.","special":"הגשר הארוך מעל מים רדודים בצבע טורקיז, מהנופים המצולמים בצפון.","highlights":["הנסיעה על הגשר","סלע הלב בחוף טינו","הקפת האי"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Kouri, Nakijin, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לבדוק שעת שפל לסלע הלב, ושמש לצבע של המים","baby_block":null,"tags":["island","bridge","beach","heart rock","turquoise","drive","photo","אי","גשר","חוף","סלע הלב","טורקיז","נסיעה","צילום","kouri","sea","ים"],"en":{"hype":"A small island reached by a 2 km bridge over turquoise water, with Tinu beach and its famous heart rock.","reality":"The drive across the bridge really is the best part. The heart rock photographs well at low tide, but there is a photo line at midday.","tip":"Stop at the beach before the bridge on the Yagaji side for the best bridge photo.","baby_notes":"Short steep rocky path down to Tinu beach, no stroller.","price":"Free, paid parking by the beach","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Drive across the bridge, loop the island by car (8 km), and walk down to Tinu beach to see the heart rock.","special":"The long bridge over shallow turquoise water is one of the most photographed views in the north.","highlights":["Drive over the bridge","Heart rock on Tinu beach","Island loop"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Check low tide for the heart rock, and sun for the water colour","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kouri Ocean Tower","name_ja":"古宇利オーシャンタワー","city":"okinawa","area":"North Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.704,"lng":128.024,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מגדל תצפית על גבעה באי קורי, עם עגלה חשמלית למעלה ומוזיאון צדפים.","reality":"יקר יחסית לנוף שרואים כמעט אותו דבר מהגשר ומהחוף בחינם. בעיקר חנות וקפה.","verdict":"overhyped","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"את הנוף הכי יפה על הגשר רואים בחינם מהחוף ומהחניה שלפני הגשר.","sources":["https://www.gltjp.com/en/article/item/21589/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש עגלה חשמלית ומעלית, נגיש.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kouri%20Ocean%20Tower%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים בעגלה החשמלית בין הצמחייה, עולים למגדל, עוברים במוזיאון הצדפים ויוצאים דרך החנות.","special":null,"highlights":["התצפית מ-82 מטר","מוזיאון הצדפים"],"time_needed":"45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"538 Kouri, Nakijin, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"אפשר לדלג, את הנוף רואים בחינם מהחוף","baby_block":null,"tags":["observation tower","view","shells","museum","island","cart","מגדל תצפית","נוף","צדפים","מוזיאון","אי","תצפית","kouri","lookout"],"en":{"hype":"A lookout tower on a Kouri island hill, with an electric cart up and a shell museum.","reality":"Pricey for a view you get almost the same from the bridge and the beach for free. Mostly a shop and cafe.","tip":"The best bridge view is free from the beach and car park before the bridge.","baby_notes":"Electric cart and elevator, accessible.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Ride the cart up through the plants, go up the tower, walk through the shell museum and out via the shop.","special":null,"highlights":["View from 82 m","Shell museum"],"time_needed":"45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Skippable, the view is free from the beach","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Junglia Okinawa","name_ja":"ジャングリア沖縄","city":"okinawa","area":"North Okinawa","category":"experience","lat":26.639,"lng":127.97,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פארק השעשועים החדש של הצפון (נפתח ב-2025), בתוך ג'ונגל ליד נאגו, עם ספארי דינוזאורים, כדור פורח וספא.","reality":"גדול ונוצץ אבל יקר, עם תורים ארוכים לאטרקציות הגדולות ותמחור נפרד וגבוה יותר לתיירים. רוב האטרקציות לא לתינוקות.","verdict":"overhyped","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כרטיס יומי בערך ¥8,000 למבוגר לתיירים, יש גם כרטיס קצר בכ-¥2,970","tip":"אם הולכים, לבוא בפתיחה ולהזמין מראש את האטרקציות הגדולות.","sources":["https://unseen-japan.com/?p=82295","https://www.fun-japan.jp/en/articles/14466","https://haveagood-holiday.com/en/articles/junglia-okinawa-royal-ticket-2026"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"רוב המתקנים עם הגבלת גובה, ויש שבילים ארוכים בעליות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Junglia%20Okinawa%20Okinawa","website_url":"https://junglia.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין אזורי הג'ונגל, נוסעים בספארי הדינוזאורים, עולים לכדור הפורח ומסיימים בספא עם נוף ליער.","special":"נבנה בתוך יער טבעי ליד שמורת יאנבארו, לא על מגרש חלק.","highlights":["ספארי דינוזאורים","הכדור הפורח","הספא"],"time_needed":"יום שלם","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Nago, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":420,"booking":"required","plan_line":"כרטיס מראש, ולבוא בפתיחה לפני התורים","baby_block":null,"tags":["theme park","amusement park","dinosaur","jungle","rides","spa","balloon","פארק שעשועים","דינוזאורים","ג'ונגל","מתקנים","ספא","כדור פורח","new","חדש","junglia"],"en":{"hype":"The north's new theme park (opened 2025), set in jungle near Nago, with a dinosaur safari, a balloon ride and a spa.","reality":"Big and shiny but pricey, with long lines for the big rides and separate, higher pricing for tourists. Most rides are not for babies.","tip":"If you go, arrive at opening and book the big rides ahead.","baby_notes":"Most rides have height limits, and paths are long and hilly.","price":"Day ticket about ¥8,000 adults for tourists, short-visit ticket about ¥2,970","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Move between the jungle zones, ride the dinosaur safari, go up in the balloon and end at the spa with its forest view.","special":"Built inside natural forest near the Yanbaru reserve, not on a flat lot.","highlights":["Dinosaur safari","Balloon ride","Spa"],"time_needed":"Full day","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Buy ahead and arrive at opening before the lines","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Nago Pineapple Park","name_ja":"ナゴパイナップルパーク","city":"okinawa","area":"North Okinawa","category":"experience","lat":26.618,"lng":127.965,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פארק נושא של אננס בנאגו, עם נסיעה בעגלת אננס אוטומטית בין שדות וחנות טעימות ענקית.","reality":"בעיקר חנות מזכרות גדולה עם מסלול קצר. מצחיק לרבע שעה, לא שווה נסיעה מיוחדת.","verdict":"trap","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"אם עוברים בנאגו ממילא, הטעימות בחנות הן החלק הכי טוב.","sources":[],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"העגלה האוטומטית מתאימה גם לתינוק בידיים, חנות נגישה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nago%20Pineapple%20Park%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים לעגלת האננס שנוסעת לבד בין הצמחים, ויוצאים לחנות הטעימות של יין, עוגות ומיץ אננס.","special":null,"highlights":["עגלת האננס","חנות הטעימות"],"time_needed":"45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1195 Bibi, Nago, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"אפשר לדלג, עדיף להשקיע את הזמן בצ'וראומי","baby_block":null,"tags":["pineapple","theme park","souvenirs","tasting","cart ride","sweets","אננס","פארק נושא","מזכרות","טעימות","עגלה","ממתקים","nago","tourist trap","מלכודת תיירים"],"en":{"hype":"A pineapple theme park in Nago with a self-driving pineapple cart through the fields and a huge tasting shop.","reality":"Mostly a big souvenir shop with a short ride. Funny for 15 minutes, not worth a special trip.","tip":"If you pass Nago anyway, the tastings in the shop are the best part.","baby_notes":"The self-driving cart works with a baby on your lap, accessible shop.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Ride the pineapple cart that drives itself through the plants, then hit the tasting shop for pineapple wine, cakes and juice.","special":null,"highlights":["Pineapple cart","Tasting shop"],"time_needed":"45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Skippable, better to spend the time at Churaumi","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Orion Happy Park","name_ja":"オリオンハッピーパーク","city":"okinawa","area":"North Okinawa","category":"experience","lat":26.591,"lng":127.977,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מבשלת הבירה של אוריון, הבירה של אוקינאווה, בנאגו, עם סיור במפעל וטעימה בסוף.","reality":"סיור קצר ומסודר שנגמר בשתי כוסות בירה טרייה. ההסבר ביפנית, עם מדריך כתוב באנגלית.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,000 למבוגר, 7-19 ¥350, עד 6 חינם","tip":"הנהג לא שותה, ומקבלים משקה קל במקום.","sources":["https://happypark.orionbeer.co.jp/faq","https://japan-guide.com/e/e7132.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"הסיור במפעל בהליכה, מותר עם ילדים, טעימה רק מגיל 20.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Orion%20Happy%20Park%20Okinawa","website_url":"https://happypark.orionbeer.co.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נרשמים בכניסה, עוברים בסיור של כשעה בקווי הייצור וחדרי הבישול, ומסיימים בבר הטעימות.","special":null,"highlights":["קווי הייצור","בירה טרייה בסוף","חנות המבשלה"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-2-1 Agarie, Nago, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":60,"booking":"required","plan_line":"הזמנה חובה, נפתחת חודש מראש ונסגרת ב-16:00 יום לפני","baby_block":null,"tags":["brewery","beer","orion","factory tour","tasting","nago","מבשלה","בירה","אוריון","סיור במפעל","טעימות","drinks","שתייה","alcohol","אלכוהול"],"en":{"hype":"The brewery of Orion, Okinawa's beer, in Nago, with a factory tour and a tasting at the end.","reality":"A short, tidy tour ending with two glasses of fresh beer. Guided in Japanese, with an English written guide.","tip":"Drivers don't drink and get a soft drink instead.","baby_notes":"The factory tour is on foot and kids are welcome, tasting 20+ only.","price":"¥1,000 adults, ages 7-19 ¥350, under 6 free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Check in at the entrance, take the hour-long tour through the production lines and brewhouse, and finish at the tasting bar.","special":null,"highlights":["Production lines","Fresh beer at the end","Brewery shop"],"time_needed":"1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Booking required, opens a month ahead, closes 16:00 the day before","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hiji Falls","name_ja":"比地大滝","city":"okinawa","area":"North Okinawa","category":"experience","lat":26.721,"lng":128.186,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המפל הגבוה באוקינאווה, 26 מטר, בסוף שביל של קילומטר וחצי ביער של יאנבארו.","reality":"מסלול יפה ולא קשה על שבילי עץ, עם גשר תלוי באמצע. המפל עצמו נחמד, היער הוא העיקר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥500 למבוגר, 6-15 ¥300","tip":"בחורף הכניסה האחרונה ב-15:00, לתכנן להגיע בבוקר.","sources":["https://www.oki-islandguide.com/attractions_categories/at_parks-and-nature-attractions/page/2","https://japan-guide.com/e/e7120.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"שבילי עץ עם הרבה מדרגות וגשר תלוי, רק עם מנשא.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hiji%20Falls%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים כ-40 דקות בשביל ביער, חוצים את הגשר התלוי, נחים מול המפל וחוזרים באותה דרך.","special":"היער של יאנבארו הוא אתר מורשת עולמית טבעית, עם צמחים וציפורים שאין בשום מקום אחר.","highlights":["הגשר התלוי","המפל","יער יאנבארו"],"time_needed":"שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"781-1 Hiji, Kunigami, Okinawa","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":120,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בחורף כניסה אחרונה ב-15:00, נעלי הליכה","baby_block":"הרבה מדרגות וגשר תלוי, רק מנשא","tags":["waterfall","hike","hiking","forest","yanbaru","suspension bridge","nature","מפל","טיול","הליכה","יער","יאנבארו","גשר תלוי","טבע","trail","שביל"],"en":{"hype":"Okinawa's tallest waterfall, 26 m, at the end of a 1.5 km trail through the Yanbaru forest.","reality":"A pretty, not hard trail on boardwalks with a suspension bridge halfway. The fall is nice, the forest is the point.","tip":"In winter last entry is 15:00, plan to arrive in the morning.","baby_notes":"Boardwalks with many steps and a suspension bridge, carrier only.","price":"¥500 adults, ages 6-15 ¥300","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk about 40 minutes through the forest, cross the suspension bridge, rest at the fall and come back the same way.","special":"The Yanbaru forest is a natural World Heritage site with plants and birds found nowhere else.","highlights":["Suspension bridge","The waterfall","Yanbaru forest"],"time_needed":"2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Winter last entry 15:00, wear walking shoes","baby_block":"Many steps and a suspension bridge, carrier only"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"ASMUI (Daisekirinzan)","name_ja":"大石林山 アスムイ","city":"okinawa","area":"North Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.858,"lng":128.258,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שמורת סלעי גיר חדים בקצה הצפוני של האי, עם מסלולי הליכה בין צוקים וג'ונגל ונוף לים.","reality":"נופים מוזרים ויפים, ושקט כי רחוק. מתאים לבוקר בצפון הרחוק, יחד עם כף הדו.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"מתחילים במסלול הקצר עם הנוף לים, הוא הכי משתלם.","sources":["https://hiddenjapan-gems.com/asmui-daisekirinzan-yanbaru-okinawa/","https://www.jeepe.jp/en/articles/asmui-hikes-okinawa-1914"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש מסלול אחד נגיש לעגלה וכיסא גלגלים, השאר עם מדרגות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=ASMUI%20(Daisekirinzan)%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נוסעים בהסעה מהכניסה לנקודת ההתחלה, הולכים אחד המסלולים בין הסלעים ועוצרים בתצפית על הים וכף הדו.","special":"הסלעים הם אבן גיר בת 200 מיליון שנה שנשחקה לצורות חדות, והמקום נחשב קדוש.","highlights":["סלעי הגיר החדים","התצפית לכף הדו","עץ הבניאן הענק"],"time_needed":"שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1241 Ginama, Kunigami, Okinawa","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"כניסה אחרונה ב-16:00, וזה שעתיים וחצי מנאהה","baby_block":null,"tags":["karst","rocks","limestone","hike","trail","view","sacred","nature","סלעים","אבן גיר","טיול","שביל","נוף","קדוש","טבע","yanbaru","יאנבארו"],"en":{"hype":"A reserve of sharp limestone rocks at the island's northern tip, with walking trails among cliffs and jungle and sea views.","reality":"Odd, beautiful scenery and quiet because it is far. Good for a morning in the far north together with Cape Hedo.","tip":"Start with the short trail with the sea view, best value.","baby_notes":"One trail is stroller and wheelchair friendly, the rest have steps.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Take the shuttle from the entrance to the trailhead, walk one of the trails among the rocks and stop at the lookout over the sea and Cape Hedo.","special":"The rocks are 200 million year old limestone worn into sharp shapes, and the place is held sacred.","highlights":["Sharp limestone rocks","Lookout to Cape Hedo","Giant banyan"],"time_needed":"1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Last entry 16:00, and it is 2.5 hours from Naha","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Cape Hedo","name_ja":"辺戸岬","city":"okinawa","area":"North Okinawa","category":"sight","lat":26.872,"lng":128.264,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"הנקודה הצפונית של האי הראשי, צוקים מעל ים פתוח ובימים צלולים רואים את האי יורון.","reality":"פראי, רוחני ושקט, אבל רחוק מאוד. שווה רק כחלק מיום שלם בצפון הרחוק.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"יש בניין מבקרים עם שירותים וקפה ליד החניה.","sources":[],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שביל מרוצף מהחניה לתצפית, ברוח חזקה להחזיק את העגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Cape%20Hedo%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים מהחניה לקצה הכף, מסתכלים על הים ועל הצוקים, וקוראים את האנדרטה לחזרת אוקינאווה ליפן.","special":"האנדרטה כאן מציינת את החזרה של אוקינאווה מהשלטון האמריקאי ב-1972.","highlights":["קצה הכף","הנוף לאי יורון","האנדרטה"],"time_needed":"30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Hedo, Kunigami, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"שעתיים וחצי-שלוש מנאהה, משלבים עם אסמואי","baby_block":null,"tags":["cape","northern tip","cliffs","sea view","monument","wind","כף","קצה צפוני","צוקים","נוף לים","אנדרטה","רוח","yanbaru","nature","טבע"],"en":{"hype":"The northern tip of the main island, cliffs over open sea, with Yoron island in view on clear days.","reality":"Wild, spiritual and quiet, but very far. Only worth it as part of a full day in the far north.","tip":"A visitor building with toilets and a cafe is by the car park.","baby_notes":"Paved path from the car park to the lookout, hold the stroller in strong wind.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk from the car park to the tip, look at the sea and cliffs, and read the monument to Okinawa's return to Japan.","special":"The monument marks Okinawa's return from US rule in 1972.","highlights":["Tip of the cape","View to Yoron island","The monument"],"time_needed":"30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"2.5-3 hours from Naha, pair with ASMUI","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Busena Marine Park","name_ja":"ブセナ海中公園","city":"okinawa","area":"North Okinawa","category":"experience","lat":26.537,"lng":127.969,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מצפה תת-ימי בקצה מזח בנאגו וסירות עם תחתית זכוכית, לראות דגים ואלמוגים בלי להירטב.","reality":"דרך טובה לראות את הים בחורף או עם תינוק. המצפה קטן, הסירה מעניינת יותר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"קונים כרטיס משולב למצפה ולסירה, יוצא זול יותר.","sources":[],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"המזח שטוח, למצפה יורדים במדרגות לולייניות. הסירה בטוחה עם תינוק בידיים.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Busena%20Marine%20Park%20Okinawa","website_url":"https://www.busena-marinepark.com/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים על המזח הארוך למצפה ויורדים חמישה מטרים מתחת למים לחלונות, ואז שטים בסירה עם תחתית זכוכית מעל שונית.","special":null,"highlights":["המצפה התת-ימי","סירת תחתית הזכוכית","המזח מעל הים"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1744-1 Kise, Nago, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בים סוער הסירות לא יוצאות, לבדוק ביום עצמו","baby_block":null,"tags":["underwater observatory","glass bottom boat","fish","coral","sea","pier","מצפה תת ימי","סירת זכוכית","דגים","אלמוגים","ים","מזח","nago","baby","תינוק"],"en":{"hype":"An underwater observatory at the end of a pier in Nago, plus glass-bottom boats, to see fish and coral without getting wet.","reality":"A good way to see the sea in winter or with a baby. The observatory is small, the boat is more interesting.","tip":"Buy the combined ticket for observatory and boat, it is cheaper.","baby_notes":"The pier is flat, spiral stairs down to the observatory. The boat is fine with a baby in arms.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the long pier to the observatory and go 5 m below the surface to the windows, then take the glass-bottom boat over the reef.","special":null,"highlights":["Underwater observatory","Glass-bottom boat","Pier over the sea"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Boats don't run in rough seas, check on the day","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Michi-no-eki Kyoda","name_ja":"道の駅許田","city":"okinawa","area":"North Okinawa","category":"shopping","lat":26.545,"lng":127.98,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"תחנת הדרכים העמוסה בדרך לצפון, עם שוק של פירות, ירקות ומזכרות מקומיות.","reality":"המקום הנוח לעצור בדרך לצ'וראומי, עם פירות טרופיים זולים ושירותים. מקומי ופשוט.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"בחורף יש בשוק תפוזי שיקוואסה ובננות אוקינאוויות קטנות.","sources":[],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שטוח, שירותים עם החתלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Michi-no-eki%20Kyoda%20Okinawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוצרים בדרך, קונים פירות ומזכרות בשוק ונחים לפני ההמשך צפונה.","special":null,"highlights":["פירות טרופיים","מזכרות מקומיות","שיקוואסה"],"time_needed":"20-30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"17-1 Kyoda, Nago, Okinawa","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":25,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עצירת שירותים ופירות ביציאה מהכביש המהיר בקיודה","baby_block":null,"tags":["roadside station","market","fruit","souvenirs","rest stop","local","shikuwasa","תחנת דרכים","שוק","פירות","מזכרות","עצירה","מקומי","שיקוואסה"