"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher":"options","kosher_note":"יש מנות עוף ובקר בלי חזיר. כדאי לשאול על בסיס המרק.","address":"Toshimatsu Bldg 2F, Minami 4-jo Nishi 5, Chuo-ku, Sapporo","opens":"11:30","closes":"21:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"אין אשראי, רק מזומן או PayPay. מגיעים לפני 12:00 או אחרי 14:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["soup curry","סופ קארי","קארי מרק","curry","קארי","spicy","חריף","vegetables","ירקות","chicken leg","שוק עוף","crispy chicken","עוף פריך","lassi","לאסי","beef","בקר"],"en":{"hype":"One of Sapporo's best-loved soup curry places, on a second floor by the Susukino crossing.","reality":"Rich broth, lots of roasted vegetables and crispy chicken served on a skewer. There is a line at mealtimes, but the room is big and it moves fast.","tip":"Pick a dish, a broth, a spice level and a rice size.","baby_notes":"Big room with sofas, and kids are welcome. Second floor.","price":"¥1,300-2,000 per person","serves":"Soup curry (thin, broth-like curry with roasted vegetables and meat, rice on the side). The best known is crispy Shiretoko chicken with vegetables.","dishes":["Crispy chicken and vegetables","Chicken isobe-age (fried in nori)","Beef tendon stew","Berry lassi"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":"There are chicken and beef dishes without pork. Ask about the broth base.","plan_line":"No cards, cash or PayPay only. Go before noon or after 14:00","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Soup Curry Garaku","name_ja":"スープカレー GARAKU","city":"sapporo","area":"Odori & Susukino","category":"food","lat":43.0576,"lng":141.3608,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שם מוכר מאוד בעולם הסופ קארי, עם תורים ארוכים ותפריט באנגלית.","reality":"מרק עמוק ומאוזן, שוק עוף רכה מאוד. התור ארוך ונותנים מספר, אבל יש מקומות טובים באותה רמה עם פחות המתנה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score"