i, Chuo-ku, Sapporo","opens":"08:00","closes":"19:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"נפתח ב-8:00, טוב לארוחת בוקר קלה. אפשר לשלם באשראי","baby_block":null,"tags":["cafe","בית קפה","coffee","קפה","breakfast","ארוחת בוקר","toast","טוסט","sandwich","כריך","coffee roaster","קלייה"],"en":{"hype":"A roomy Morihiko branch at the west end of Odori, open from 8:00.","reality":"The same good coffee as the wooden house, with more space, toast and sandwiches. Less magic than the Maruyama house, but easier to get in.","tip":null,"baby_notes":"28 seats, and kids are welcome.","price":"¥1,000-1,800 per person","serves":"Morihiko's roast, toast, sandwiches and smoothies.","dishes":["French press blend","Honey vanilla toast","Tuna melt sandwich"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":"The tuna sandwich is fine; check the others for meat.","plan_line":"Opens at 8:00, good for a light breakfast. Cards accepted","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Milk Mura Sapporo Honten","name_ja":"ミルク村 SAPPORO本店","city":"sapporo","area":"Odori & Susukino","category":"cafe","lat":43.0556,"lng":141.3547,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקום ותיק בקומה 6 בסוסוקינו, שבו אוכלים גלידת חלב ושופכים עליה ליקרים מתוך מבחר של מאות בקבוקים.","reality":"מוזר ומצחיק: מגש עם גלידה, ליקרים קטנים וקפה, והבעלים מסבירים איך לאכול. משהו שעושים פעם אחת, וזה כיף.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":3.67,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,500-3,000 לאדם","tip":"שופכים ליקר אחד בכל פעם על חלק אחר של הגלידה.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/hokkaido/A0101/A010103/1000194/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Milk%20Mura%20Sapporo%20Honten%20Sapporo","website_url":null,"serves":"גלידת חלב רכה עם מבחר ליקרים לשפיכה, ושימה פרפה בלילה.","dishes":["סט גלידה וליקרים","שימה פרפה"],"todo