Saera%20Sapporo","website_url":null,"serves":"כריכי לחם רך עבים עם מילויים כמו שרימפס מטוגן וקציצה מטוגנת, וקפה.","dishes":["כריך שרימפס מטוגן","כריך מנצ׳י קצו (קציצה מטוגנת)"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher":"options","kosher_note":"בכריכים המפורסמים יש שרימפס או קציצת בשר, כדאי לבדוק בתפריט.","address":"Toshin Bldg B3F, Odori Nishi 2, Chuo-ku, Sapporo","opens":"10:00","closes":"18:00","closed_weekdays":[3],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"רק מזומן, סגור ברביעי. מגיעים לפני 12:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["cafe","בית קפה","coffee","קפה","sandwich","כריך","sandwiches","כריכים","kissaten","קיסאטן","local favorite","אהוב על מקומיים"],"en":{"hype":"A kissaten (old Japanese coffee shop) three floors under Odori, with thick sandwiches locals love.","reality":"Big fresh sandwiches and an old-time feel, and it works. Office workers line up at lunch.","tip":null,"baby_notes":"41 seats, and kids are welcome. Third basement floor.","price":"¥1,000-1,800 per person","serves":"Thick soft-bread sandwiches with fillings like fried shrimp and fried mince cutlet, plus coffee.","dishes":["Fried shrimp sandwich","Menchi katsu sandwich"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":"The famous sandwiches have shrimp or meat cutlet, so check the menu.","plan_line":"Cash only, closed Wednesdays. Go before noon","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Parfaiteria PaL","name_ja":"パフェテリア パル","city":"sapporo","area":"Odori & Susukino","category":"cafe","lat":43.0558,"lng":141.356,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אחת מחנויות פרפה הלילה הגדולות בסוסוקינו, עם פרפה עונתי בצורת \"קופסת תכשיטים\".","reality":"פרפה יפה ומדויק עם חומרים מהוקאידו, מקום גדול עם 72 מקומות. יקר יחסית לקינוח.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":3.59,"google_score":null,"price":"¥2,000-3,000 לאדם","tip":"פרפה לילה (שימה פרפה) הוא מנהג של סאפורו: מסיימים ערב של שתייה או ארוחה בכוס פרפה מעוצבת.","sources":["https://tabelog.com/en/hokkaido/A0101/A010103/1049420/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"ילדים מתחת לגיל 7 רק עד 20:00.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Parfaiteria%20PaL%20Sapporo","website_url":null,"serves":"כ-6 פרפה עונתיים בכל פעם, עם ג׳לטו, מוס אלכוהול וג׳לי, ומשקאות שמתאימים להם.","dishes":["פרפה עונתי","פרפה עם משקה"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher":"friendly","kosher_note":null,"address":"Minami 4 Nishi 2 Bldg 6F, 2-10-1 Minami 4-jo Nishi, Chuo-ku, Sapporo","opens":"18:00","closes":"00:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"night","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"נפתח רק ב-18:00. בשישי ושבת פתוח עד 2:00","baby_block":"ילדים מתחת לגיל 7 רק עד 20:00","tags":["parfait","פרפה","night parfait","פרפה לילה","shime parfait","שימה פרפה","dessert","קינוח","ice cream","גלידה","gelato","ג׳לטו","seasonal fruit","פירות העונה","susukino","סוסוקינו"],"en":{"hype":"One of the big night parfait shops in Susukino, with seasonal \"jewel box\" parfaits.","reality":"Pretty, precise parfaits with Hokkaido ingredients, in a big 72-seat room. Pricey for a dessert.","tip":"Night parfait (shime parfait) is a Sapporo habit: you end a night of drinking or dinner with a designed parfait.","baby_notes":"Kids under 7 only until 20:00.","price":"¥2,000-3,000 per person","serves":"About 6 seasonal parfaits at a time, with gelato, alcohol mousse and jelly, plus drinks to match.","dishes":["Seasonal parfait","Parfait and drink pairing"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":null,"kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Opens only at 18:00. Fri and Sat open until 2:00","baby_block":"Kids under 7 only until 20:00"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Initial Sapporo","name_ja":"イニシャル サッポロ","city":"sapporo","area":"Odori & Susukino","category":"cafe","lat":43.0563,"lng":141