:null,"price":"¥1,200 למבוגר, ¥600 לילדים, עד גיל 6 חינם","tip":"שווה לעלות אחרי החשכה בדצמבר, כשהאורות של אודורי דולקים מתחת.","sources":["https://www.walkerplus.com/spot/ar0101s03872/price.html","https://www.visit-hokkaido.jp/spot/detail_10011.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש מעלית עד התצפית, אפשר להעלות עגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sapporo%20TV%20Tower%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://www.tv-tower.co.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במעלית לתצפית, מסתכלים מערבה לאורך פארק אודורי ועד ההרים. למטה יש חנויות מזכרות של הוקאידו.","special":"המבט הכי טוב על פארק אודורי כולו, ובפברואר רואים משם את פסלי השלג של הפסטיבל.","highlights":["תצפית על פארק אודורי","התאורה בלילה","פסלי השלג בפברואר"],"time_needed":"30-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1 Chome Odorinishi, Chuo-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":"09:00","closes":"22:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לעלות אחרי השקיעה, כשהאורות של אודורי דולקים","baby_block":null,"tags":["observation deck","tower","view","night view","illumination","תצפית","מגדל","נוף","נוף לילה","תאורה","odori park","פארק אודורי","landmark","ציון דרך","souvenirs","מזכרות"],"en":{"hype":"A 1950s tower at the head of Odori Park with a deck 90 m up.","reality":"Not very high, but it gives the best look down the whole length of Odori Park, especially at night with the winter lights.","tip":"Go up after dark in December, when the Odori lights are on below.","baby_notes":"Elevator to the deck, strollers are fine.","price":"¥1,200 adults, ¥600 kids, under 6 free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Ride the elevator to the deck and look west along Odori Park to the mountains. Hokkaido souvenir shops at the bottom.","special":"The best view of Odori Park end to end; in February you see the Snow Festival sculptures from above.","highlights":["Odori Park view","Night lights","Snow sculptures in February"],"time_needed":"30-45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Go up after sunset, when the Odori lights are on","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Odori Park","name_ja":"大通公園","city":"sapporo","area":"Odori & Susukino","category":"sight","lat":43.0598,"lng":141.3466,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רצועה ירוקה באורך 1.5 ק\"מ שחוצה את מרכז סאפורו, הלב של העיר.","reality":"ביום רגיל בחורף זה פארק מושלג ושקט; הוא מתעורר בדצמבר עם האורות ושוק חג המולד, ובפברואר עם פסטיבל השלג.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"משלבים הליכה לאורך הפארק עם מגדל הטלוויזיה בקצה המזרחי ועם הרכבת התחתית מתחת.","sources":["https://www.sapporo.travel/en/event/event-list/","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5311.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים רחבים ושטוחים; בשלג העגלה נתקעת, עדיף מנשא.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Odori%20Park%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://odori-park.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים מערבה ממגדל הטלוויזיה דרך הבלוקים הממוספרים (1-צ'ומה עד 12-צ'ומה). בדצמבר עוצרים בשוק חג המולד ובתאורה, ובקיץ בדוכני התירס.","special":"כל האירועים הגדולים של העיר קורים כאן, והוא מחבר את סוסוקינו, תחנת סאפורו ומגדל הטלוויזיה ברגל.","highlights":["מגדל הטלוויזיה בקצה","תאורת החורף","פסלי השלג בפברואר"],"time_needed":"30-60 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Odorinishi 1-12 Chome, Chuo-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בחורף לבוא בערב, כשתאורת החורף דולקת","baby_block":null,"tags":["park","walk","illumination","snow","fountain","פארק","טיול רגלי","תאורה","שלג","מזרקה","snow festival","פסטיבל שלג","christmas market","שוק חג המולד","green space","גן"],"en":{"hype":"A 1.5 km green strip across central Sapporo, the heart of the city.","reality":"On a normal winter day it is a quiet snowy park; it comes alive in December with the lights and Christmas market, and in February with the Snow Festival.","tip":"Walk it together with the TV Tower at the east end and the subway right underneath.","baby_notes":"Wide, flat paths; in snow a stroller gets stuck, a carrier is easier.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk west from the TV Tower through the numbered blocks (1-chome to 12-chome). In December stop at the Christmas market and the lights; in summer at the corn stands.","special":"All the city's big events happen here, and it links Susukino, Sapporo Station and the TV Tower on foot.","highlights":["TV Tower at the end","Winter lights","Snow sculptures in February"],"time_needed":"30-60 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"In winter come in the evening, when the winter lights are on","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Sapporo Clock Tower","name_ja":"札幌市時計台","city":"sapporo","area":"Odori & Susukino","category":"sight","lat":43.06253,"lng":141.35363,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בניין עץ לבן מ-1878 עם שעון, הסמל הכי מוכר של סאפורו.","reality":"בניין קטן ונמוך בין משרדים, ויפנים עצמם קוראים לו אחד האתרים המאכזבים ביפן; תמונה מבחוץ מספיקה לרוב.","verdict":"overhyped","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כניסה בתשלום קטן, מתחת לגיל 18 חינם","tip":"מצלמים מהמרפסת בבניין שממול, ממנה רואים אותו בלי הכביש.","sources":["https://www.sapporo.travel/?p=12104","https://www.city.sapporo.jp/ncms/reiki/d1w_reiki/H410901010011/H410901010011_j.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"הקומה השנייה במדרגות בלבד.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sapporo%20Clock%20Tower%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://sapporoshi-tokeidai.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מצלמים מבחוץ בדרך בין תחנת סאפורו לאודורי. מי שנכנס רואה תערוכה קטנה על ההיסטוריה של העיר ואולם עם השעון המקורי בקומה העליונה.","special":"השעון עדיין מצלצל כל שעה מאז 1881.","highlights":["החזית הלבנה","הצלצול בשעה עגולה","האולם בקומה השנייה"],"time_needed":"10-30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2 Chome Kita 1 Jonishi, Chuo-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":"08:45","closes":"17:10","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":20,"booking":"no","plan_line":"מספיקה תמונה מבחוץ בדרך לאודורי","baby_block":null,"tags":["clock tower","historic building","landmark","wooden building","museum","מגדל שעון","מבנה היסטורי","ציון דרך","בניין עץ","מוזיאון","bell","פעמון","meiji","history","היסטוריה"],"en":{"hype":"An 1878 white wooden building with a clock, Sapporo's best-known symbol.","reality":"A small, low building squeezed between offices, often called one of Japan's most disappointing sights; a photo from outside is usually enough.","tip":"Take the photo from the viewing deck in the building across the street, where the road is out of the shot.","baby_notes":"The second floor is stairs only.","price":"Small entry fee, under 18 free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Snap it from outside on the walk between Sapporo Station and Odori. Inside is a small exhibit on the city's history and a hall with the original clock upstairs.","special":"The clock has rung every hour since 1881.","highlights":["White facade","The hourly chime","Second-floor hall"],"time_needed":"10-30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"A photo from outside on the way to Odori is enough","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Former Hokkaido Government Office (Akarenga)","name_ja":"北海道庁旧本庁舎（赤れんが庁舎）","city":"sapporo","area":"Sapporo Station","category":"sight","lat":43.06417,"lng":141.34795,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בניין לבנים אדום מ-1888 בסגנון אמריקאי, שנפתח מחדש ב-2025 אחרי שיפוץ של שנים.","reality":"מבחוץ, עם הגן והבריכה, הוא אחד המבנים היפים בעיר; בפנים תערוכות על הוקאידו, חנות וקפה בקומת הקרקע.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥300, עד כיתה ט' חינם; קומת הקרקע חינם","tip":"פתוח עד 21:00, אז אפשר להשאיר אותו לערב כשהבניין מואר.","sources":["https://www.sapporo.travel/?p=111017","https://news.allabout.co.jp/articles/o/121657/","https://www.pref.hokkaido.lg.jp/sm/zsk/fm/akarengarenewal/top.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Former%20Hokkaido%20Government%20Office%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://hokkaido-redbrick.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בגן הקדמי עם שדרת העצים, נכנסים לאולמות ההיסטוריים ולתערוכות. אפשר לעלות בתוספת למרפסת במגדל המתומן.","special":"בניין לבנים של 2.5 מיליון לבנים, מהתקופה שבה יפן בנתה את הוקאידו בעזרת יועצים אמריקאים.","highlights":["החזית והגן","המגדל המתומן","הקפה בקומת הקרקע"],"time_needed":"45-60 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"6 Chome Kita 3 Jonishi, Chuo-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":"08:45","closes":"21:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":50,"booking":"no","plan_line":"5 דקות הליכה מתחנת סאפורו, פתוח עד 21:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["red brick","historic building","museum","garden","architecture","לבנים אדומות","מבנה היסטורי","מוזיאון","גן","אדריכלות","government office","meiji","history","היסטוריה","octagon tower","מגדל"],"en":{"hype":"An 1888 red-brick building in American style, reopened in 2025 after years of renovation.","reality":"From outside, with its garden and pond, it is one of the prettiest buildings in town; inside are exhibits on Hokkaido plus a shop and cafe on the ground floor.","tip":"Open until 21:00, so it can wait for the evening when the building is lit.","baby_notes":null,"price":"¥300, middle school and younger free; ground floor free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk through the front garden and tree-lined path, then the old halls and exhibits. For an extra fee you can go up to the balcony in the octagonal tower.","special":"2.5 million bricks, from the era when Japan built up Hokkaido with American advisors.","highlights":["Facade and garden","Octagonal tower","Ground-floor cafe"],"time_needed":"45-60 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"5 minutes' walk from Sapporo Station, open until 21:00","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Mt. Moiwa Ropeway","name_ja":"札幌もいわ山ロープウェイ","city":"sapporo","area":"Odori & Susukino","category":"sight","lat":43.0383,"lng":141.3222,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רכבל ואחריו קרונית קטנה לפסגת הר מויווה, עם תצפית לילה על כל סאפורו.","reality":"נוף הלילה הכי טוב בעיר, ממש שווה את המחיר; בערב קר מאוד למעלה ויש תור לרכבל בסופי שבוע.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כ-¥2,100 הלוך-חזור לרכבל ולקרונית יחד, חצי מחיר לילדים","tip":"להגיע בחשמלית לתחנת Ropeway Iriguchi, ומשם שאטל חינם לתחנת הרכבל.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5309.html","https://www.gutabi.jp/spot/detail/2939","https://www.timesclub.jp/benefit/shop/leisure/detail.jsp?shop=S000000610"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"הרכבל והקרונית מתאימים לעגלה; למעלה קר ויש רוח, צריך לעטוף טוב.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Mt.%20Moiwa%20Ropeway%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://mt-moiwa.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים ברכבל לתחנת הביניים, עוברים לקרונית הקטנה (מוריס קאר) עד הפסגה, ויוצאים למרפסת התצפית. יש למעלה גם מסעדה ופעמון של אוהבים.","special":"כל רשת האורות של סאפורו פרושה למטה עד הים; ביפן הוא נבחר לאחד מנופי הלילה החדשים הכי יפים.","highlights":["נוף לילה על העיר","הקרונית לפסגה","פעמון האוהבים"],"time_needed":"שעה וחצי-שעתיים כולל הדרך","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"5-3-7 Fushimi, Chuo-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":"11:00","closes":"22:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"night","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לבדוק באתר שפועל, במזג אוויר סוער הרכבל נעצר","