null,"price":"חינם","tip":"בפברואר נמצא כאן אתר פסלי הקרח של פסטיבל השלג, לאורך אקימאה-דורי.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5305.html","https://www.sapporo.travel/en/event/event-list/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"עמוס בלילות סופ״ש, עדיף מוקדם בערב.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Susukino%20Crossing%20Sapporo","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עומדים בפינה מול שלט הניקה ומצלמים, ממשיכים לרחובות הצדדיים ולסמטת הראמן הסמוכה.","special":"השלט עם הסבא מניקה הוא אחד הסמלים של סאפורו כבר עשרות שנים.","highlights":["שלט ניקה","אורות הניאון","פסלי הקרח בפברואר"],"time_needed":"15-30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Minami 4 Jonishi 4 Chome, Chuo-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":20,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לבוא אחרי החשכה, כשכל השלטים דולקים","baby_block":null,"tags":["neon","crossing","intersection","nightlife district","sign","ניאון","צומת","רובע בילויים","שלט","nikka","ניקה","whisky","ויסקי","photo spot","מקום לצילום","ice sculptures","פסלי קרח"],"en":{"hype":"The main crossing of the Susukino entertainment district, with the famous Nikka whisky sign.","reality":"A few minutes for a photo in the evening when the signs are lit; around it are mostly bars, karaoke and adult clubs.","tip":"In February the Snow Festival's ice sculptures line Ekimae-dori here.","baby_notes":"Packed on weekend nights, better early evening.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Stand on the corner facing the Nikka sign for the photo, then wander the side streets and the nearby ramen alley.","special":"The sign with the Nikka old man has been a Sapporo symbol for decades.","highlights":["Nikka sign","Neon lights","Ice sculptures in February"],"time_needed":"15-30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Come after dark, when all the signs are on","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"