ly impressive, especially the big sculptures at night with projections; very crowded, very cold, and hotels fill up months ahead.","tip":"In 2027 it runs 4-11 February; book a hotel as early as you can.","baby_notes":"A stroller in snow and crowds is very hard, use a carrier and proper winter gear.","price":"Free entry","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk Odori Park between the snow sculptures and stay until dark for the lights and projections on the big ones. Walk on to Susukino for the ice sculptures; with kids, go to the Tsudome site with its slides.","special":"Sculptures the size of buildings that take weeks to build, plus hundreds of small ones.","highlights":["Big snow sculptures at Odori","Ice sculptures in Susukino","Hot street food stalls","Snow slides at Tsudome"],"time_needed":"Half a day","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"4-11 Feb 2027, book a hotel months ahead","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Sapporo White Illumination","name_ja":"さっぽろホワイトイルミネーション","city":"sapporo","area":"Odori & Susukino","category":"experience","lat":43.06,"lng":141.35,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"תאורת חורף לאורך פארק אודורי ורחובות המרכז, מאז 1981.","reality":"יפה בהליכת ערב, אבל צנוע יותר מהתאורות הגדולות של טוקיו; עובד הכי טוב יחד עם שוק חג המולד.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"באודורי התאורה רק עד 25 בדצמבר; ברחוב אקימאה-דורי היא נמשכת עד מרץ.","sources":["https://www.sapporo.travel/en/event/event-list/","https://www.sapporo.travel/white-illumination/event/munich/?stt_lang=ko"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מדרכות מחוממות חלקית, אבל יש קרח; מנשא נוח יותר מעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Odori%20Park%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://white-illumination.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים בערב מתחנת סאפורו לאורך אקימאה-דורי עד אודורי, ושם עוברים בין הבלוקים המוארים.","special":"התאורה על רקע שלג אמיתי, מה שאין ברוב ערי יפן.","highlights":["פארק אודורי 1-5 צ'ומה","אקימאה-דורי","הכיכר מול תחנת סאפורו"],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Odorinishi 1-5 Chome, Chuo-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":["2026-12-12","2026-12-13","2026-12-14","2026-12-15","2026-12-16","2026-12-17","2026-12-18","2026-12-19","2026-12-20","2026-12-21","2026-12-22","2026-12-23","2026-12-24","2026-12-25","2026-12-26","2026-12-27","2026-12-28","2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"באודורי עד 25.12 בלבד, ברחוב אקימאה-דורי עד מרץ","baby_block":null,"tags":["illumination","lights","christmas lights","winter lights","night walk","תאורה","אורות","אורות חג המולד","תאורת חורף","הליכת ערב","christmas","חג המולד","snow","שלג","free","חינם"],"en":{"hype":"Winter lights along Odori Park and the central streets, running since 1981.","reality":"Pretty on an evening walk but more modest than Tokyo's big displays; works best together with the Christmas market.","tip":"At Odori the lights end on 25 December; on Ekimae-dori they run until March.","baby_notes":"Some sidewalks are heated but there is ice; a carrier is easier than a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk in the evening from Sapporo Station down Ekimae-dori to Odori, then through the lit blocks.","special":"Lights against real snow, which most Japanese cities do not have.","highlights":["Odori Park blocks 1-5","Ekimae-dori","Sapporo Station south plaza"],"time_needed":"About an hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"At Odori only until 25 Dec, on Ekimae-dori until March","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
where not exists (select 1 from place_library p where p.city = x.city and lower(p.name) = lower(x.name));
insert into place_library (name, name_ja, city, area, category, lat, lng, coord_precision, hype, reality, verdict, tabelog_score, google_score, price, tip, sources, audience, baby_notes, local_pick, maps_url, website_url, serves, dishes, todo, special, highlights, time_needed, kosher, kosher_note, address, opens, closes, closed_weekdays, closed_dates, open_dates, best_time, visit_mins, booking, plan_line, baby_block, tags, en, facts_at, facts_sure, active)
select x.name, x.name_ja, x.city, x.area, x.category, x.lat, x.lng, x.coord_precision, x.hype, x.reality, x.verdict, x.tabelog_score, x.google_score, x.price, x.tip, x.sources, x.audience, x.baby_notes, x.local_pick, x.maps_url, x.website_url, x.serves, x.dishes, x.todo, x.special, x.highlights, x.time_needed, x.kosher, x.kosher_note, x.address, x.opens, x.closes, x.closed_weekdays, x.closed_dates, x.open_dates, x.best_time, x.visit_mins, x.booking, x.plan_line, x.baby_block, x.tags, x.en, x.facts_at, x.facts_sure, false from jsonb_populate_recordset(null::place_library, $cards$[{"name":"Munich Christmas Market in Sapporo","name_ja":"ミュンヘン・クリスマス市 in Sapporo","city":"sapporo","area":"Odori & Susukino","category":"experience","lat":43.0601,"lng":141.353,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שוק חג מולד בסגנון גרמני בפארק אודורי, עם דוכני קישוטים, יין חם ונקניקיות.","reality":"קטן, כמה עשרות דוכנים, אבל האווירה בשלג עם התאורה מסביב עובדת; בסופי שבוע בערב צפוף.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כניסה חינם","tip":"עד 25 בדצמבר בלבד, 11:00-21:00; בצהרי יום חול הכי פנוי.","sources":["https://www.visit-hokkaido.jp/event/detail/142","https://www.sapporo.travel/white-illumination/event/munich/?stt_lang=ko"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש מקום לעגלה בין הדוכנים בשעות שקטות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Odori%20Park%202%20Chome%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://www.sapporo.travel/white-illumination/event/munich/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין הדוכנים באודורי 1-2 צ'ומה, קונים קישוטים מעץ ושותים משהו חם מתוך ספל מזכרת. אחר כך ממשיכים לתאורה ולמגדל הטלוויזיה הסמוך.","special":"סאפורו ומינכן הן ערים תאומות, והשוק מביא מוכרים וקישוטים בסגנון בווארי.","highlights":["קישוטי עץ","יין חם בספל מזכרת","מגדל הטלוויזיה המואר מעל"],"time_needed":"30-60 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Odorinishi 2 Chome, Chuo-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":"11:00","closes":"21:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":["2026-12-12","2026-12-13","2026-12-14","2026-12-15","2026-12-16","2026-12-17","2026-12-18","2026-12-19","2026-12-20","2026-12-21","2026-12-22","2026-12-23","2026-12-24","2026-12-25"],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עד 25.12 בלבד, 11:00-21:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["christmas market","market","german","ornaments","mulled wine","שוק חג המולד","שוק","גרמני","קישוטים","יין חם","christmas","חג המולד","glühwein","stalls","דוכנים","winter","חורף"],"en":{"hype":"A German-style Christmas market in Odori Park with ornament stalls, mulled wine and sausages.","reality":"Small, a few dozen stalls, but the snow and lights around it make it work; weekend evenings get crowded.","tip":"Only until 25 December, 11:00-21:00; a weekday midday is quietest.","baby_notes":"Room for a stroller between the stalls at quiet hours.","price":"Free entry","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Browse the stalls in Odori blocks 1-2, buy wooden ornaments and drink something hot from a souvenir mug. Then carry on to the lights and the TV Tower next door.","special":"Sapporo and Munich are sister cities, and the market brings Bavarian-style sellers and decorations.","highlights":["Wooden ornaments","Mulled wine in a souvenir mug","The lit TV Tower above"],"time_needed":"30-60 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Only until 25 Dec, 11:00-21:00","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Sapporo Streetcar Loop","name_ja":"札幌市電","city":"sapporo","area":"Odori & Susukino","category":"experience","lat":43.0553,"lng":141.3519,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"חשמלית עירונית שעושה לולאה מסוסוקינו דרך מרכז העיר ולמרגלות הר מויווה.","reality":"דרך זולה ונעימה לראות את העיר בשלג, וגם הדרך הנוחה להגיע לרכבל של מויווה; לא מהירה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥230 לנסיעה; כרטיס יומי ¥570","tip":"בסופי שבוע ובחגים כרטיס דוסנקו פאס ב-¥460 מכסה מבוגר ושני ילדים ליום שלם.","sources":["https://www.sapporo.travel/spot/feature/sapporo-streetcar-sightseeing-how-to-ride/","https://allabout.co.jp/gm/gc/471830/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"רוב הקרונות החדשים נמוכים ונוחים לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Susukino%20streetcar%20stop%20Sapporo","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים בתחנת סוסוקינו ועושים את כל הלולאה, או יורדים ב-Ropeway Iriguchi לרכבל של מויווה. משלמים ביציאה, גם בכרטיס IC.","special":"חשמלית שעובדת כל החורף בשלג, ובחורף יוצאת גם קרונית המטאטא המיוחדת שמפנה שלג מהפסים.","highlights":["לולאה מלאה","התחנה לרכבל מויווה","נוף עירוני בשלג"],"time_needed":"כשעה ללולאה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Susukino Station, Minami 4 Jonishi 4 Chome, Chuo-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בסופ״ש ובחגים כרטיס יומי ב-¥460 לכל המשפחה","baby_block":null,"tags":["streetcar","tram","loop line","public transport","ride","חשמלית","טראם","תחבורה ציבורית","נסיעה","sightseeing","סיור","day pass","כרטיס יומי","snow","שלג"],"en":{"hype":"The city streetcar, running a loop from Susukino through downtown to the foot of Mt. Moiwa.","reality":"A cheap, pleasant way to see the city in snow and the easy way to the Moiwa ropeway; not fast.","tip":"On weekends and holidays the Dosanko Pass for ¥460 covers one adult and two kids for the day.","baby_notes":"Most newer cars are low-floor and easy with a stroller.","price":"¥230 a ride; day pass ¥570","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Board at Susukino and ride the whole loop, or get off at Ropeway Iriguchi for Mt. Moiwa. Pay when you get off, IC cards work.","special":"It runs all winter in the snow, and in winter the special broom car comes out to sweep the tracks.","highlights":["Full loop","Stop for the Moiwa ropeway","City views in snow"],"time_needed":"About an hour for the loop","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"On weekends a ¥460 day pass covers the family","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"nORIA Ferris Wheel (Norbesa)","name_ja":"ノルベサ 観覧車ノリア","city":"sapporo","area":"Odori & Susukino","category":"experience","lat":43.056,"lng":141.3538,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גלגל ענק על גג בניין בלב סוסוקינו, עד גובה 78 מטר מעל הרחוב.","reality":"סיבוב של כ-10 דקות עם נוף נחמד על אורות סוסוקינו; לא דרמטי כמו מויווה, אבל קרוב ומהיר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"פתוח עד מאוחר בלילה, טוב לסיום ערב בסוסוקינו.","sources":["https://www.sapporo.travel/find/shops/norbesa/?lang=ja","https://bestcalendar.jp/press/125693"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"תאים סגורים ומחוממים; העלייה בקומה 7 במעלית.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Norbesa%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://www.norbesa.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים במעלית לקומה 7 של בניין נורבסה וקונים כרטיס לסיבוב. התאים סגורים, אז עובד גם בשלג.","special":"גלגל ענק שיוצא מגג בניין באמצע רובע הבילויים.","highlights":["אורות סוסוקינו מלמעלה","תאים סגורים בשלג"],"time_needed":"כ-20 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"5-1-1 Minami 3 Jonishi, Chuo-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":"11:00","closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"night","visit_mins":20,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עדיף בלילה, כשסוסוקינו מוארת","baby_block":null,"tags":["ferris wheel","night view","rooftop","ride","גלגל ענק","נוף לילה","גג","מתקן","view","נוף","susukino lights","אורות","city view","תצפית"],"en":{"hype":"A Ferris wheel on a rooftop in the middle of Susukino, up to 78 m above the street.","reality":"A ride of about 10 minutes with a nice look over the Susukino lights; not as big a view as Moiwa, but close and quick.","tip":"Open late, a good end to an evening in Susukino.","baby_notes":"Closed, heated cabins; the boarding floor is 7F by elevator.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Take the elevator to 7F of the Norbesa building and buy a ticket for a loop. The cabins are enclosed, so it works in snow too.","special":"A Ferris wheel sticking out of a building roof in the middle of the nightlife district.","highlights":["Susukino lights from above","Enclosed cabins in snow"],"time_needed":"About 20 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Best at night, when Susukino is lit up","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Tanukikoji Shopping Street","name_ja":"狸小路商店街","city":"sapporo","area":"Odori & Susukino","category":"shopping","lat":43.0573,"lng":141.351,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מדרחוב מקורה באורך כ-900 מטר בין אודורי לסוסוקינו, הוותיק בהוקאידו.","reality":"מקורה, אז נוח בשלג; הרבה חנויות מזכרות, תרופות ודון קיחוטה, ופחות חנויות מיוחדות ממה שמצפים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"הקצה המערבי (7 צ'ומה) שקט יותר ויש בו חנויות ישנות ומעניינות יותר.","sources":["https://www.visit-hokkaido.jp/spot/detail_10002.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מקורה ושטוח, עובד טוב עם עגלה גם כשיורד שלג.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tanukikoji%20Shopping%20Street%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://www.tanukikoji.or.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים לאורך הבלוקים הממוספרים מ-1 צ'ומה מערבה, עוצרים בחנויות מזכרות, קוסמטיקה ופארמה, ונכנסים לסמטאות האוכל.","special":"רחוב קניות מקורה מאז תקופת מייג'י, שמחבר בין אזורי הקניות לבילויים בלי לצאת לשלג.","highlights":["חנויות מזכרות של הוקאידו","פארם וקוסמטיקה","הקצה המערבי הוותיק"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Minami 2-3 Jonishi 1-7 Chome, Chuo-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"מקורה, טוב ליום של שלג; הקצה המערבי מעניין יותר","baby_block":null,"tags":["shopping street","arcade","covered","souvenirs","drugstore","רחוב קניות","מדרחוב","מקורה","מזכרות","פארם","cosmetics","קוסמטיקה","don quijote","shops","חנויות","rainy day","יום גשום"],"en":{"hype":"A 900 m covered shopping street between Odori and Susukino, the oldest in Hokkaido.","reality":"Covered, so handy in snow; lots of souvenir shops, drugstores and Don Quijote, and fewer special shops than you would expect.","tip":"The west end (7-chome) is quieter and has older, more interesting shops.","baby_notes":"Covered and flat, works well with a stroller even when it snows.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the numbered blocks west from 1-chome, stopping at souvenir, cosmetics and drugstores, and duck into the food alleys.","special":"A covered shopping street since the Meiji era, linking the shopping and nightlife areas without going out in the snow.","highlights":["Hokkaido souvenir shops","Drugstores and cosmetics","The old west end"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Covered, good for a snowy day; the west end is more interesting","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Nijo Market","name_ja":"二条市場","city":"sapporo","area":"Odori & Susukino","category":"shopping","lat":43.0583,"lng":141.3577,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שוק דגים ופירות ים ותיק במרכז סאפורו, עם סרטנים, אוני וסלמון.","reality":"קטן, כ-25 דוכנים, ומכוון לתיירים עם מחירים בהתאם; שווה בעיקר לבוקר מוקדם ולהסתכלות.","verdict":"overhyped","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"לבוא בבוקר, רוב הדוכנים פתוחים בערך 07:00-18:00 וחלקם נסגרים מוקדם.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5310.html","https://www.ana.co.jp/ja/au/japan-travel-planner/hokkaido/0000003.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעברים צרים ורטובים, עגלה עוברת בקושי.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nijo%20Market%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://nijomarket.com/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין הדוכנים עם הסרטנים הענקיים, האוני וביצי הסלמון, ומסתכלים על פירות ומלונים של הוקאידו. מי שרוצה ארוחת דונבורי יושב באחת המסעדות הקטנות בשוק.","special":"שוק בלב העיר, 5 דקות ברגל מאודורי, בלי צורך לנסוע לשוק הסיטונאי.","highlights":["סרטני הוקאידו","דוכני פירות","דונבורי בוקר"],"time_needed":"30-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Minami 3 Johigashi 1-2 Chome, Chuo-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":"07:00","closes":"18:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לבוא בבוקר; המחירים פה גבוהים משוק הקרב","baby_block":null,"tags":["fish market","seafood market","crab","sea urchin","salmon roe","שוק דגים","שוק","סרטן","אוני","ביצי סלמון","market","fruit","פירות","melon","מלון","scallops","צדפות"],"en":{"hype":"An old fish and seafood market in central Sapporo with crab, sea urchin and salmon.","reality":"Small, about 25 stalls, aimed at tourists with prices to match; worth it mainly early in the morning and for looking.","tip":"Come in the morning; most stalls run roughly 07:00-18:00 and some close early.","baby_notes":"Narrow, wet aisles, a stroller barely fits.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk past stalls of huge crabs, sea urchin and salmon roe, and look at Hokkaido fruit and melons. For a rice bowl breakfast, sit at one of the small restaurants inside.","special":"A market right in the city, 5 minutes' walk from Odori, no trip to the wholesale market needed.","highlights":["Hokkaido crabs","Fruit stalls","Breakfast rice bowls"],"time_needed":"30-45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Come in the morning; prices are higher than at Curb Market","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Sapporo Underground Shopping Mall (Pole Town & Aurora Town)","name_ja":"さっぽろ地下街 ポールタウン・オーロラタウン","city":"sapporo","area":"Odori & Susukino","category":"shopping","lat":43.058,"lng":141.354,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שני רחובות קניות תת-קרקעיים, מסוסוקינו לאודורי ומאודורי למגדל הטלוויזיה.","reality":"לא יעד בפני עצמו, אבל מציל ימים של סופה: הולכים ברגל מתחנת סאפורו עד סוסוקינו בלי לצאת לשלג.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"מתחבר למעבר התת-קרקעי צ'יקהו לתחנת סאפורו, כ-25 דקות הליכה בחום.","sources":["https://www.sapporo-chikagai.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מעליות בכניסות, חם ונוח לעגלה כשבחוץ שלג.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Pole%20Town%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://www.sapporo-chikagai.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יורדים בתחנת אודורי והולכים דרומה בפול טאון עד סוסוקינו או מזרחה באורורה טאון למגדל הטלוויזיה, עם חנויות בגדים, מזכרות וקפה לאורך הדרך.","special":"רשת המעברים מתחת לעיר, שבחורף כל סאפורו הולכת בה.","highlights":["פול טאון לסוסוקינו","אורורה טאון למגדל","חיבור לצ'יקהו"],"time_needed":"30-60 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Minami 1 Jonishi 3 Chome, Chuo-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":"10:00","closes":"20:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"ביום סופה הולכים מהתחנה לסוסוקינו מתחת לאדמה","baby_block":null,"tags":["underground mall","shopping","walkway","indoor","shops","קניון תת קרקעי","קניות","מעבר תת קרקעי","מקורה","חנויות","fashion","אופנה","souvenirs","מזכרות","snow day","יום שלג"],"en":{"hype":"Two underground shopping streets, Susukino to Odori and Odori to the TV Tower.","reality":"Not a destination, but a lifesaver on a stormy day: walk from Sapporo Station to Susukino without going outside.","tip":"It links to the Chikaho underground walkway to Sapporo Station, about 25 minutes' warm walk.","baby_notes":"Elevators at the entrances, warm and easy with a stroller when it snows outside.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go down at Odori Station and walk south through Pole Town to Susukino, or east through Aurora Town to the TV Tower, with clothes, souvenir shops and cafes on the way.","special":"The network of passages under the city that all of Sapporo uses in winter.","highlights":["Pole Town to Susukino","Aurora Town to the tower","Link to Chikaho"],"time_needed":"30-60 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"On a stormy day walk station to Susukino underground","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hokkaido University","name_ja":"北海道大学","city":"sapporo","area":"Sapporo Station","category":"sight","lat":43.0707,"lng":141.3445,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"קמפוס ענק וירוק ממש ליד תחנת סאפורו, עם שדרות צפצפה וגינקו ובניינים ישנים.","reality":"טיול נעים וחינמי, יפה במיוחד בסתיו עם הגינקו הצהובים; בחורף מושלג ושקט, פחות מרשים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"נכנסים מהשער הראשי, 7 דקות ברגל מהיציאה הצפון-מערבית של התחנה.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e2163.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים רחבים ושטוחים, נוח לעגלה כשאין שלג.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hokkaido%20University%20Main%20Gate%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://www.hokudai.ac.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים מהשער הראשי לפסל של ד״ר קלארק, ממשיכים לשדרת הצפצפות ולשדרת הגינקו, ועוצרים במוזיאון האוניברסיטה.","special":"אחת האוניברסיטאות הראשונות ביפן, שהוקמה ב-1876 בעזרת מרצים אמריקאים, ואנשי העיר באים לטייל בה כמו בפארק.","highlights":["שדרת הגינקו","שדרת הצפצפות","פסל ד״ר קלארק"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Kita 8 Jonishi 5 Chome, Kita-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"נכנסים מהשער הראשי, 7 דקות מהתחנה","baby_block":null,"tags":["university","campus","ginkgo","poplar","autumn leaves","אוניברסיטה","קמפוס","גינקו","צפצפה","שלכת","walk","טיול רגלי","clark statue","פסל","historic buildings","מבנים היסטוריים"],"en":{"hype":"A huge green campus right by Sapporo Station, with poplar and ginkgo avenues and old buildings.","reality":"A nice free walk, at its best in autumn with yellow ginkgo; in winter it is snowy and quiet, less impressive.","tip":"Enter at the main gate, 7 minutes' walk from the station's northwest exit.","baby_notes":"Wide, flat paths, easy with a stroller when there is no snow.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk from the main gate to the Dr. Clark bust, on to the poplar and ginkgo avenues, and stop at the university museum.","special":"One of Japan's first universities, founded in 1876 with American teachers; locals walk here like it is a park.","highlights":["Ginkgo avenue","Poplar avenue","Dr. Clark bust"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Enter at the main gate, 7 minutes from the station","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hokkaido University Botanic Garden","name_ja":"北海道大学植物園","city":"sapporo","area":"Sapporo Station","category":"sight","lat":43.0636,"lng":141.3433,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גן בוטני מ-1886 במרכז העיר, עם שארית של היער שכיסה פעם את המישור.","reality":"נעים מאוד מאביב עד סתיו; מ-4 בנובמבר עד סוף אפריל פתוחה רק החממה, ואז לא שווה את הדרך.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"קיץ ¥420, חורף (חממה בלבד) ¥120","tip":"בחורף לדלג; בעונה מגיעים בבוקר, הסגירה ב-16:30.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5304.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילי עפר ודשא, עגלה עם גלגלים גדולים עוברת.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hokkaido%20University%20Botanic%20Garden%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://www.hokudai.ac.jp/fsc/bg/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מטיילים בשבילים בין המדשאות, גן הצמחים האלפיניים ושארית היער, ונכנסים למוזיאון האינו הקטן ולחממה.","special":"פיסת יער מקורית של מישור אישיקרי באמצע 