ם פארק מרויאמה והגן החיות באותו בוקר; בתוך המתחם יש בית תה של רוקאטיי עם עוגיות אורז צלויות.","sources":["https://www.hokkaidojingu.or.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילי חצץ ושלג, עגלה עם גלגלים גדולים עוברת לאט.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hokkaido%20Jingu%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://www.hokkaidojingu.or.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים דרך שער הטוריי הגדול, הולכים בשביל היער אל אולם התפילה, וקונים קמע או פתק מזל. בדרך החוצה עוצרים בבית התה לעוגיית מוצ'י צלויה.","special":"מקדש בתוך יער אמיתי באמצע העיר, ובחורף הכל מכוסה שלג.","highlights":["שביל היער","אולם התפילה בשלג","עוגיות המוצ'י בבית התה"],"time_needed":"45-60 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"474 Miyagaoka, Chuo-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":50,"booking":"no","plan_line":"רכבת תחתית למרויאמה קואן ו-15 דקות ברגל דרך הפארק","baby_block":null,"tags":["shrine","shinto","forest","torii","amulets","מקדש","שינטו","יער","טוריי","קמעות","snow","שלג","new year","ראש השנה","mochi","מוצ׳י","temple","מקדש יפני"],"en":{"hype":"Hokkaido's main Shinto shrine, in a forest by Maruyama Park.","reality":"A quiet, pretty shrine among tall trees, especially in snow; not as grand as Kyoto's shrines but with a good feel. Very crowded at New Year.","tip":"Pair it with Maruyama Park and the zoo in one morning; inside the grounds is a Rokkatei teahouse with grilled rice cakes.","baby_notes":"Gravel and snow paths, a big-wheeled stroller manages slowly.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk in through the big torii gate, along the forest path to the main hall, and buy an amulet or fortune. On the way out stop at the teahouse for a grilled mochi.","special":"A shrine in a real forest in the middle of the city, all under snow in winter.","highlights":["Forest path","Main hall in snow","Mochi at the teahouse"],"time_needed":"45-60 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Subway to Maruyama-koen, then 15 minutes' walk through the park","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Maruyama Park","name_ja":"円山公園","city":"sapporo","area":"Maruyama","category":"sight","lat":43.053,"lng":141.313,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פארק יער גדול למרגלות הר מרויאמה, בין המקדש לגן החיות.","reality":"פארק שכונתי נעים עם סנאים ועצים עתיקים, שווה כדרך למקדש ולא כיעד בפני עצמו; באביב מלא פריחה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"השכונה מסביב מלאה בבתי קפה טובים, שווה לעצור לפני או אחרי.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5316.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים שטוחים ליד הכניסה, בעלייה להר יש מדרגות.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Maruyama%20Park%20Sapporo","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים מתחנת מרויאמה קואן דרך הפארק אל המקדש, ומחפשים סנאים בין העצים. מי שיש לו כוח עולה בשביל להר מרויאמה, כשעה הלוך-חזור.","special":"יער עירוני שהסנאים בו רגילים לאנשים.","highlights":["סנאים","יער עצים עתיקים","פריחת הדובדבן באביב"],"time_needed":"30-60 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Miyagaoka, Chuo-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עוברים בו בדרך למקדש הוקאידו","baby_block":null,"tags":["park","forest","squirrels","walk","hiking","פארק","יער","סנאים","טיול רגלי","מסלול","cherry blossom","פריחת דובדבן","nature","טבע","maruyama","מרויאמה"],"en":{"hype":"A big forest park at the foot of Mt. Maruyama, between the shrine and the zoo.","reality":"A pleasant neighbourhood park with squirrels and old trees, worth it as the way to the shrine rather than on its own; full of blossom in spring.","tip":"The area around is full of good cafes, stop before or after.","baby_notes":"Flat paths near the entrance, stairs on the trail up the hill.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk from Maruyama-koen Station through the park to the shrine, looking for squirrels in the trees. With energy, take the trail up Mt. Maruyama, about an hour return.","special":"A city forest where the squirrels are used to people.","highlights":["Squirrels","Old-growth trees","Cherry blossom in spring"],"time_needed":"30-60 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Walk through it on the way to Hokkaido Shrine","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Sapporo Maruyama Zoo","name_ja":"札幌市円山動物園","city":"sapporo","area":"Maruyama","category":"sight","lat":43.052,"lng":141.3055,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גן החיות של סאפורו, עם דובי קוטב, פילים ובית חדש לבעלי חיים של אזורים קרים.","reality":"גן חיות מודרני ומטופל, ודובי הקוטב בשלג הם הסיבה לבוא; בחורף נסגר ב-16:00 וחלק מהחיות בפנים.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥800 למבוגר, ילדים עד כיתה ט' חינם","tip":"בחורף להגיע בבוקר, הכניסה האחרונה ב-15:30.","sources":["https://www.city.sapporo.jp/zoo/info/kaienzikan-kyuenbi/20210311.html","https://www.gutabi.jp/spot/detail/32"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מבנים מחוממים עם מקום לעגלה; השבילים בחוץ בעלייה ומושלגים.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sapporo%20Maruyama%20Zoo","website_url":"https://www.city.sapporo.jp/zoo/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מתחילים בבית דובי הקוטב עם המנהרה שמתחת למים, ממשיכים לבית הפילים ולבעלי החיים של הוקאידו. בחורף נכנסים בין המבנים המחוממים כדי להתחמם.","special":"דובי קוטב ששוחים מעל המבקרים, ובחורף רואים את החיות של הצפון בשלג אמיתי.","highlights":["דובי הקוטב","בית הפילים","חיות הוקאידו"],"time_needed":"2-3 שעות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-1 Miyagaoka, Chuo-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":"09:30","closes":"16:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-23","2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":150,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור ברביעי השני והרביעי בחודש; בחורף סוגר ב-16:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["zoo","polar bears","elephants","animals","kids","גן חיות","דובי קוטב","פילים","בעלי חיים","ילדים","snow","שלג","family","משפחה","indoor","מקורה"],"en":{"hype":"Sapporo's zoo, with polar bears, elephants and a newer home for cold-region animals.","reality":"A modern, well-kept zoo, and polar bears in the snow are the reason to come; in winter it closes at 16:00 and some animals are indoors.","tip":"In winter come in the morning, last entry 15:30.","baby_notes":"Heated buildings with room for strollers; outdoor paths are uphill and snowy.","price":"¥800 adults, kids through middle school free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Start at the polar bear house with its underwater tunnel, then the elephant house and the Hokkaido animals. In winter hop between the heated buildings to warm up.","special":"Polar bears swimming over your head, and northern animals in real snow in winter.","highlights":["Polar bears","Elephant house","Hokkaido animals"],"time_needed":"2-3 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed 2nd and 4th Wednesdays; closes 16:00 in winter","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Okurayama Ski Jump Stadium","name_ja":"大倉山ジャンプ競技場","city":"sapporo","area":"Maruyama","category":"sight","lat":43.045,"lng":141.294,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"קפיצת הסקי האולימפית מ-1972, עם רכבל כיסאות לראש הקפיצה ומוזיאון אולימפי למטה.","reality":"מלמעלה מבינים כמה זה מפחיד, והנוף על העיר יפה; המוזיאון עם הסימולטורים כיף גם למבוגרים.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"רכבל כ-¥1,000 הלוך-חזור, מוזיאון כ-¥670, יש כרטיס משולב","tip":"בחורף לבדוק שאין תחרות באותו יום, אז הרכבל לא עובד.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5308.html","https://www.sapporo.travel/?p=49877"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"רכבל כיסאות פתוח, לא מתאים לתינוק; המוזיאון למטה ב