lift does not run, check first","baby_block":"Open chairlift, not for a baby"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Sapporo Bankei Ski Area","name_ja":"さっぽろばんけいスキー場","city":"sapporo","area":"Maruyama","category":"experience","lat":43.048,"lng":141.255,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אתר הסקי הקרוב ביותר למרכז סאפורו, כ-20 דקות במונית מהתחנה.","reality":"אתר קטן ונוח למתחילים ולערב סקי אחרי יום בעיר; מי שרוצה שלג אבקה רציני ייסע לטייני או לקוקוסאי.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"אוטובוס של האתר יוצא מתחנת מרויאמה קואן; מונית משם כ-¥2,000.","sources":["https://www.bankei.co.jp/access","https://www.bankei.co.jp/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sapporo%20Bankei%20Ski%20Area","website_url":"https://www.bankei.co.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"שוכרים ציוד באתר, גולשים במסלולים הקלים והבינוניים, ומי שבא עם ילדים משחק באזור השלג למשפחות.","special":"סקי עם נוף על העיר, בלי יום שלם של נסיעה.","highlights":["מסלולים למתחילים","נוף על העיר","אזור שלג לילדים"],"time_needed":"חצי יום","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"410 Bankei, Chuo-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":240,"booking":"no","plan_line":"הכי קרוב לעיר; אוטובוס מתחנת מרויאמה קואן","baby_block":null,"tags":["ski","skiing","snowboard","ski resort","beginners","סקי","סנובורד","אתר סקי","מתחילים","גלישה","snow","שלג","rentals","השכרת ציוד","winter","חורף"],"en":{"hype":"The closest ski area to central Sapporo, about 20 minutes by taxi from the station.","reality":"A small hill, good for beginners and for an evening of skiing after a day in town; for serious powder go to Teine or Kokusai.","tip":"The resort bus leaves from Maruyama-koen Station; a taxi from there is about ¥2,000.","baby_notes":null,"price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Rent gear on site, ski the easy and middle runs, and with kids play in the family snow area.","special":"Skiing with a view over the city, without a full day of travel.","highlights":["Beginner runs","City view","Kids' snow area"],"time_needed":"Half a day","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closest to the city; bus from Maruyama-koen Station","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Jozankei Onsen","name_ja":"定山渓温泉","city":"sapporo","area":"Jozankei","category":"sight","lat":42.968,"lng":141.164,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"עיירת מעיינות חמים בעמק נהר בהרים, כשעה באוטובוס ממרכז סאפורו.","reality":"עיירה של מלונות גדולים, לא כפר ציורי כמו גינזן; הנוף של העמק בשלג יפה, ושווה לבוא ליום רחצה או ללילה אחד.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"אוטובוס כ-¥1,000 לכיוון מתחנת סאפורו; רחצה יומית ¥800-1,500","tip":"אוטובוס ג'וטצו 7 או 8 מטרמינל האוטובוסים בתחנת סאפורו, כ-75 דקות.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e6745.html","https://jozankei.jp/en/oneday/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"רוב המלונות מאפשרים רחצה רק לילדים שכבר הולכים; אמבטיות הרגליים בחוץ טובות לכולם.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jozankei%20Onsen%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://jozankei.jp/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מגיעים באוטובוס, מטיילים לאורך הנהר לגשר האדום ולאמבטיות הרגליים החינמיות, ומסיימים בטבילה ביומית באחד המלונות.","special":"מעיינות חמים בתוך העיר סאפורו, בלי לצאת להוקאידו העמוקה.","highlights":["אמבטיות רגליים חינם","הגשר התלוי האדום","טבילה יומית במלון"],"time_needed":"חצי יום","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Jozankei Onsen Higashi 3 Chome, Minami-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":240,"booking":"no","plan_line":"אוטובוס 7 או 8 מתחנת סאפורו, כ-75 דקות","baby_block":null,"tags":["onsen","hot spring","bath","spa","foot bath","אונסן","מעיין חם","רחצה","ספא","אמבטיית רגליים","ryokan","ריוקאן","river valley","עמק","snow","שלג"],"en":{"hype":"A hot spring town in a river valley in the mountains, about an hour by bus from central Sapporo.","reality":"A town of big hotels, not a storybook village like Ginzan; the valley in snow is pretty, and it is worth a bathing day or one night.","tip":"Jotetsu bus 7 or 8 from the Sapporo Station bus terminal, about 75 minutes.","baby_notes":"Most hotels let only walking-age kids bathe; the outdoor foot baths work for everyone.","price":"Bus about ¥1,000 each way from Sapporo Station; day bath ¥800-1,500","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Come by bus, walk along the river to the red bridge and the free foot baths, and finish with a day soak at a hotel.","special":"Hot springs inside Sapporo city, without going deep into Hokkaido.","highlights":["Free foot baths","Red suspension bridge","Hotel day bath"],"time_needed":"Half a day","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Bus 7 or 8 from Sapporo Station, about 75 minutes","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Futami Suspension Bridge","name_ja":"二見吊橋","city":"sapporo","area":"Jozankei","category":"sight","lat":42.9705,"lng":141.16,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גשר תלוי אדום מעל נהר טויוהירה בקצה העיירה, מול סלעי פוטאמי ובריכת הקאפה.","reality":"עשר דקות הליכה מהמרכז בשביל לאורך הנהר, והגשר האדום בשלג הוא התמונה של ג'וזנקיי; קצר ונחמד.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"בדרך עוברים באמבטיית הרגליים של פוטאמי ובבריכת קאפה-בוצ'י.","sources":["https://jozankei.jp/en/spot/163/","https://jozankei.jp/en/oneday/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"השביל צר ועם מדרגות, בשלג עדיף מנשא.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Futami%20Suspension%20Bridge%20Jozankei","website_url":"https://jozankei.jp/en/spot/163/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים מפארק פוטאמי בשביל לאורך הנהר, עוברים את הגשר ומסתכלים על הסלעים ועל הבריכה הירוקה של הקאפה.","special":"נקודת הנוף הכי יפה של העמק, ובסתיו העלים סביב הגשר אדומים.","highlights":["הגשר האדום","סלעי פוטאמי","בריכת קאפה-בוצ'י"],"time_needed":"30-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Jozankei Onsen Nishi 4 Chome, Minami-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"נעליים עם אחיזה, השביל לגשר קפוא בחורף","baby_block":null,"tags":["suspension bridge","bridge","river","walk","autumn leaves","גשר תלוי","גשר","נהר","טיול רגלי","שלכת","kappa","קאפה","view","נוף","snow","שלג"],"en":{"hype":"A red suspension bridge over the Toyohira River at the edge of town, facing the Futami rocks and the kappa pool.","reality":"Ten minutes' walk from the center on a riverside path, and the red bridge in snow is the classic Jozankei photo; short and nice.","tip":"On the way you pass the Futami foot bath and the Kappa-buchi pool.","baby_notes":"Narrow path with steps, in snow a carrier is better.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk from Futami Park along the river path, cross the bridge and look at the rocks and the green kappa pool.","special":"The prettiest view of the valley; in autumn the leaves around the bridge turn red.","highlights":["Red bridge","Futami rocks","Kappa-buchi pool"],"time_needed":"30-45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Wear shoes with grip, the path is icy in winter","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Jozankei Gensen Park","name_ja":"定山源泉公園","city":"sapporo","area":"Jozankei","category":"sight","lat":42.9685,"lng":141.166,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פארק קטן במרכז ג'וזנקיי עם אמבטיית רגליים חמה חינם ומקום לבשל ביצים במי המעיין.","reality":"עצירה קצרה וכיפית: יושבים עם הרגליים במים חמים בשלג, וקונים ביצים בחנות כדי לבשל במעיין.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"להביא מגבת קטנה לרגליים, אין שם מגבות.","sources":["https://jozankei.jp/en/spot/103/","https://jozankei.jp/en/oneday/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שטוח ונגיש, טוב להורים לשבת לרגע עם התינוק במנשא.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jozankei%20Gensen%20Park","website_url":"https://jozankei.jp/en/spot/103/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יושבים באמבטיית הרגליים המקורה, טובלים ביצים בסל קטן במעיין החם של אונטמה-נו-יו, ומסתכלים על פסל מייסד העיירה.","special":"מעיין חם רותח שיוצא באמצע הפארק, עם אדים בכל השלג מסביב.","highlights":["אמבטיית רגליים","בישול ביצים במעיין","הפסל של ג'וזן"],"time_needed":"20-30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Jozankei Onsen Higashi 3 Chome, Minami-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":"07:00","closes":"21:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":25,"booking":"no","plan_line":"להביא מגבת קטנה לאמבטיית הרגליים","baby_block":null,"tags":["foot bath","onsen","hot spring","park","onsen eggs","אמבטיית רגליים","אונסן","מעיין חם","פארק","ביצי אונסן","free","חינם","steam","אדים","eggs","ביצים"],"en":{"hype":"A small park in central Jozankei with a free hot foot bath and a spot to boil eggs in the spring water.","reality":"A short, fun stop: sit with your feet in hot water in the snow, and buy eggs at a shop to boil in the spring.","tip":"Bring a small towel for your feet, there are none there.","baby_notes":"Flat and accessible, good for parents to sit a moment with the baby in a carrier.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Sit in the covered foot bath, lower eggs in a little basket into the hot spring at Ontama-no-yu, and see the statue of the town's founder.","special":"A boiling spring coming up in the middle of the park, steaming in the snow all around.","highlights":["Foot bath","Boiling eggs in the spring","Statue of Jozan"],"time_needed":"20-30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Bring a small towel for the foot bath","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Iwato Kannondo","name_ja":"岩戸観音堂","city":"sapporo","area":"Jozankei","category":"sight","lat":42.967,"lng":141.168,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"היכל קטן משנת 1936 עם מערה באורך 120 מטר ובה 33 פסלי קאנון.","reality":"מוזר ומעניין לחצי שעה: מנהרה צרה ולחה עם פסלים לאורכה; לא מרשים, אבל שונה משאר העיירה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥300 למבוגר, ¥100 לילד","tip":"פתוח 07:00-20:00 כל השנה, טוב לערב אחרי הרחצה.","sources":["https://jozankei.jp/en/spot/179/","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e6745.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"מנהרה צרה ונמוכה, אין מקום לעגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Iwato%20Kannondo%20Jozankei","website_url":"https://jozankei.jp/en/spot/179/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים למערה ועוברים לאורך המנהרה בין 33 פסלי הקאנון. בחוץ מסתכלים על ההיכל הקטן.","special":"הוקם לזכר הפועלים שמתו בסלילת הדרך מאוטרו לג'וזנקיי.","highlights":["33 פסלי קאנון","המנהרה","ההיכל משנת 1936"],"time_needed":"20-30 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Jozankei Onsen Nishi 3 Chome, Minami-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":"07:00","closes":"20:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":25,"booking":"no","plan_line":"פונים לרחוב מול מלון שוגטסו גרנד","baby_block":"מנהרה צרה, בלי עגלה","tags":["cave","temple","kannon","statues","tunnel","מערה","מקדש","קאנון","פסלים","מנהרה","buddhist","בודהיסטי","history","היסטוריה","power spot","מקום אנרגיה"],"en":{"hype":"A small 1936 hall with a 120 m cave holding 33 Kannon statues.","reality":"Odd and interesting for half an hour: a narrow, damp tunnel lined with statues; not grand, but different from the rest of town.","tip":"Open 07:00-20:00 all year, good for an evening after the bath.","baby_notes":"Narrow, low tunnel, no room for a stroller.","price":"¥300 adults, ¥100 kids","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go into the cave and walk the tunnel past the 33 Kannon statues. Outside, see the small hall.","special":"Built in memory of the workers who died building the Otaru to Jozankei road.","highlights":["33 Kannon statues","The tunnel","The 1936 hall"],"time_needed":"20-30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Turn off at the Shogetsu Grand Hotel intersection","baby_block":"Narrow tunnel, no stroller"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
