":"אקווריום בינוני, אבל טיול הפינגווינים בשלג בחורף מקסים לילדים; הבריכה החיצונית סגורה בחורף.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חורף ¥1,300 למבוגר, ¥500 לילד, ¥300 מגיל 3","tip":"בחורף פתוח רק מ-12 בדצמבר עד 23 בפברואר, 10:00-16:00.","sources":["https://otaru-aq.jp/","https://summer.walkerplus.com/odekake/detail/ar0101s03754/data.html","https://activityjapan.com/product/139823"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"המבנה הראשי מקורה ונגיש לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Otaru%20Aquarium","website_url":"https://otaru-aq.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין מיכלי הדגים של הים הצפוני, צופים במופעי כלבי הים ובטיול הפינגווינים בשלג.","special":"פינגווינים שצועדים בשלג אמיתי מול הקהל.","highlights":["טיול הפינגווינים בשלג","כלבי ים ואריות ים","דגי הים הצפוני"],"time_needed":"שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"3-303 Shukutsu, Otaru, Hokkaido","opens":"10:00","closes":"16:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":["2026-12-12","2026-12-13","2026-12-14","2026-12-15","2026-12-16","2026-12-17","2026-12-18","2026-12-19","2026-12-20","2026-12-21","2026-12-22","2026-12-23","2026-12-24","2026-12-25","2026-12-26","2026-12-27","2026-12-28","2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":120,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור מסוף נובמבר עד 12 בדצמבר; אוטובוס 25 דקות מתחנת אוטרו","baby_block":null,"tags":["aquarium","penguins","seals","sea lions","fish","אקווריום","פינגווינים","כלבי ים","אריות ים","דגים","kids","ילדים","penguin walk","טיול פינגווינים","otaru","אוטרו"],"en":{"hype":"A seaside aquarium in Otaru, with seals in a natural sea pool and penguins that go for walks in the snow.","reality":"A mid-size aquarium, but the winter penguin walk in the snow is lovely for kids; the outdoor sea pool is closed in winter.","tip":"In winter it is open only 12 December to 23 February, 10:00-16:00.","baby_notes":"The main building is indoor and stroller-friendly.","price":"Winter ¥1,300 adults, ¥500 kids, ¥300 from age 3","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"See the northern sea fish tanks, the seal shows and the penguin walk in the snow.","special":"Penguins marching on real snow in front of the crowd.","highlights":["Penguin snow walk","Seals and sea lions","Northern sea fish"],"time_needed":"2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed late Nov to 12 Dec; bus 25 min from Otaru Station","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Bank of Japan Otaru Museum","name_ja":"日本銀行旧小樽支店金融資料館","city":"sapporo","area":"Around Sapporo","category":"sight","lat":43.197,"lng":140.997,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בניין הבנק המרכזי לשעבר מ-1912 באוטרו, היום מוזיאון כסף חינמי.","reality":"הבניין מבפנים מרשים מאוד, עם האולם הגבוה והכספת, ואפשר להרים ערימה של 100 מיליון ין; עצירה טובה של חצי שעה.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"סגור בימי רביעי, ובחורף נפתח רק ב-10:00.","sources":["https://www.mlit.go.jp/tagengo-db/en/R5-00022.html","https://rurubu.jp/andmore/spot/80000588","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e6704.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bank%20of%20Japan%20Otaru%20Museum","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים לאולם הבנקים הגבוה, יורדים לכספת, ומנסים להרים את הדגם של 100 מיליון ין.","special":"בניין בתכנון של האדריכל של תחנת טוקיו, מימי אוטרו כמרכז הפיננסי של הצפון.","highlights":["אולם הבנקים","הכספת","להרים 100 מיליון ין"],"time_needed":"30-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-11-16 Ironai, Otaru, Hokkaido","opens":"10:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[3],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":40,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור ברביעי; 5 דקות ברגל מהתעלה","baby_block":null,"tags":["museum","bank","money","historic building","architecture","מוזיאון","בנק","כסף","מבנה היסטורי","אדריכלות","free","חינם","vault","כספת","otaru","אוטרו"],"en":{"hype":"The former 1912 Bank of Japan branch in Otaru, now a free money museum.","reality":"Very impressive inside, with the tall banking hall and the vault, and you can lift a stack of 100 million yen; a good half-hour stop.","tip":"Closed Wednesdays, and in winter it opens only at 10:00.","baby_notes":null,"price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk into the tall banking hall, go down to the vault, and try lifting the 100 million yen block.","special":"Designed by the architect of Tokyo Station, from when Otaru was the north's financial center.","highlights":["Banking hall","The vault","Lift 100 million yen"],"time_needed":"30-45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Wednesdays; 5 minutes' walk from the canal","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Otaru Tenguyama Ropeway","name_ja":"小樽天狗山ロープウエイ","city":"sapporo","area":"Around Sapporo","category":"sight","lat":43.1835,"lng":140.9775,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"רכבל להר טנגו מעל אוטרו, עם נוף על העיר, הנמל ומפרץ אישיקרי.","reality":"נוף הלילה על אוטרו והים יפה מאוד; בחורף יש למעלה אתר סקי קטן וקר מאוד בערב.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כ-¥2,000 למבוגר, ¥1,000 לילד","tip":"אוטובוס 9 מתחנת אוטרו לתחנת הרכבל התחתונה, כ-20 דקות.","sources":["https://tenguyama.ckk.chuo-bus.co.jp/","https://www.walkerplus.com/spot/ar0101s05485/data.html","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e6706.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"תא רכבל סגור; למעלה רוח וקור.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Otaru%20Tenguyama%20Ropeway","website_url":"https://tenguyama.ckk.chuo-bus.co.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים ברכבל, יוצאים לתצפית על העיר והנמל, ונוגעים באף של מסכות הטנגו למזל.","special":"אחד משלושת נופי הלילה הגדולים של הוקאידו, ובחורף סקי לילה מעל העיר.","highlights":["נוף הלילה על אוטרו","מסכות הטנגו","סקי לילה בחורף"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-16-15 Mogami, Otaru, Hokkaido","opens":"09:00","closes":"20:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"evening","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"עונת החורף מ-28 בנובמבר, עלייה אחרונה 19:48","baby_block":null,"tags":["ropeway","cable car","night view","mountain","view","רכבל","נוף לילה","הר","נוף","תצפית","ski","סקי","tengu","טנגו","otaru","אוטרו"],"en":{"hype":"A ropeway up Mt. Tengu above Otaru, with views over the town, port and Ishikari Bay.","reality":"The night view over Otaru and the sea is lovely; in winter there is a small ski area up top, and it is very cold in the evening.","tip":"Bus 9 from Otaru Station to the lower station, about 20 minutes.","baby_notes":"Enclosed cabin; windy and cold at the top.","price":"About ¥2,000 adults, ¥1,000 kids","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Ride up, step out to the deck over the town and port, and rub the noses of the tengu masks for luck.","special":"One of Hokkaido's three big night views, and night skiing over the town in winter.","highlights":["Otaru night view","Tengu masks","Night skiing in winter"],"time_needed":"An hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Winter season from 28 Nov, last ride up 19:48","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Otaru City General Museum","name_ja":"小樽市総合博物館 本館","city":"sapporo","area":"Around Sapporo","category":"sight","lat":43.2105,"lng":140.995,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון הרכבות של הוקאידו באתר תחנת טמיה, הקצה של הרכבת הראשונה באי.","reality":"מלא קטרי קיטור וקרונות ישנים שאפשר לעלות עליהם, כיף לילדים; בחורף החלק החיצוני מושלג והקטר החי לא נוסע.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":null,"tip":"סגור בימי שלישי; בפברואר אתר טמיה של שביל האור נמצא ליד.","sources":["https://www.city.otaru.lg.jp/docs/2020111300781/file_contents/event202512.pdf","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e6700.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"האולמות בפנים נגישים, בחוץ שלג.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Otaru%20City%20General%20Museum","website_url":"https://www.city.otaru.lg.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים לאולם עם הקטרים, עולים לקרונות הישנים, ויוצאים לחצר עם המסילות ומחסן הקטרים העתיק.","special":"מחסן הקטרים העתיק ביותר ביפן שעדיין עומד, על הקו הראשון של הוקאידו.","highlights":["קטרי קיטור","מחסן הקטרים העתיק","קרונות לעלות עליהם"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-3-6 Temiya, Otaru, Hokkaido","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[2],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בשלישי; אוטובוס קצר מתחנת אוטרו","baby_block":null,"tags":["railway museum","trains","steam locomotives","museum","history","מוזיאון רכבות","רכבות","קטר קיטור","מוזיאון","היסטוריה","kids","ילדים","otaru","אוטרו","indoor","מקורה"],"en":{"hype":"Hokkaido's railway museum on the old Temiya Station site, the end of the island's first railway.","reality":"Full of steam engines and old carriages you can climb into, fun for kids; in winter the outdoor yard is snowed in and the working engine does not run.","tip":"Closed Tuesdays; in February the Temiya site of the Snow Light Path is next door.","baby_notes":"Indoor halls are accessible, snow outside.","price":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go into the hall of engines, climb into the old carriages, and step out to the yard with its tracks and old engine shed.","special":"Japan's oldest surviving engine shed, on Hokkaido's first line.","highlights":["Steam engines","Old engine shed","Carriages to climb into"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Tuesdays; short bus ride from Otaru Station","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Moerenuma Park","name_ja":"モエレ沼公園","city":"sapporo","area":"Around Sapporo","category":"sight","lat":43.1225,"lng":141.428,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פארק ענק שתכנן הפסל איסאמו נוגוצ'י על אתר פסולת לשעבר, עם פירמידת זכוכית והר מלאכותי.","reality":"מרשים מאוד בגודל ובצורות, ובחורף הגבעות הופכות למגלשות שלג ענקיות; רחוק מהמרכז וחשוף לרוח.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"בחורף רק הכניסה המזרחית פתוחה; מונית מהמרכז כ-¥4,000, או רכבת תחתית ואוטובוס 69/79.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5313.html","https://www.sapporo.travel/find/nature-and-parks/moerenuma_park/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"בתוך הפירמידה חם ונגיש; בחוץ שטח פתוח ומושלג.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Moerenuma%20Park%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://moerenumapark.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מתחילים בפירמידת הזכוכית היכרמי, עולים בשלג להר מואר, ומחליקים במזחלת במדרונות הארוכים.","special":"הפארק כולו הוא פסל אחד של נוגוצ'י, שהושלם אחרי מותו.","highlights":["פירמידת הזכוכית","הר מואר","מגלשות שלג בחורף"],"time_needed":"שעתיים-שלוש","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-1 Moerenumakoen, Higashi-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":"07:00","closes":"22:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":150,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בחורף רק השער המזרחי פתוח; להביא מזחלת או לבוש לשלג","baby_block":null,"tags":["park","isamu noguchi","glass pyramid","sledding","art","פארק","נוגוצ׳י","פירמידת זכוכית","מזחלות","אמנות","snow","שלג","landscape","נוף","architecture","אדריכלות"],"en":{"hype":"A huge park designed by sculptor Isamu Noguchi on a former landfill, with a glass pyramid and an artificial mountain.","reality":"Impressive in scale and shapes, and in winter the hills become giant sledding slopes; far from the center and exposed to wind.","tip":"In winter only the east entrance is open; a taxi from downtown is about ¥4,000, or subway plus bus 69/79.","baby_notes":"Inside the pyramid is warm and accessible; outside is open, snowy ground.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Start at the Hidamari glass pyramid, climb Moere Mountain in the snow, and sled down the long slopes.","special":"The whole park is a single Noguchi sculpture, finished after his death.","highlights":["Glass pyramid","Moere Mountain","Winter sledding"],"time_needed":"2-3 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Only the east gate is open in winter; dress for snow","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Historical Village of Hokkaido","name_ja":"北海道開拓の村","city":"sapporo","area":"Around Sapporo","category":"sight","lat":43.048,"lng":141.495,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון פתוח עם כ-60 מבנים אמיתיים מהתקופה שבה יפנים יישבו את הוקאידו, 1868-1926.","reality":"גדול ומעניין, עם רחוב עיירה, כפר דייגים וחווה; בחורף שקט ומושלג ויפה, אבל חלק מהבתים קרים מאוד.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כ-¥1,000; כרטיס משולב עם מוזיאון הוקאידו כ-¥1,400","tip":"בחורף נסגר ב-16:30 וסגור בימי שני; לבוא לפני הצהריים.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5303.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילי שלג בין הבתים, ובבתים צריך לחלוץ נעליים; מנשא עדיף.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Historical%20Village%20of%20Hokkaido","website_url":"https://www.kaitaku.or.jp/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים לאורך רחוב העיירה עם החנויות, תחנת המשטרה והבנק הישנים, ממשיכים לכפר הדייגים ולחווה, ונכנסים לבתים לראות איך חיו.","special":"מבנים מקוריים שהועברו מכל הוקאידו, לא העתקים.","highlights":["רחוב העיירה","בית דייגי ההרינג","החווה"],"time_needed":"2-3 שעות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"50-1 Konopporo, Atsubetsu-cho, Atsubetsu-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:30","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":150,"booking":"no","plan_line":"רכבת לשינרין-קואן ואוטובוס קצר; סגור בשני בחורף","baby_block":null,"tags":["open air museum","historic buildings","village","history","pioneer","מוזיאון פתוח","מבנים היסטוריים","כפר","היסטוריה","מתיישבים","meiji","מייג׳י","snow","שלג","architecture","אדריכלות"],"en":{"hype":"An open-air museum of about 60 real buildings from the years Japan settled Hokkaido, 1868-1926.","reality":"Big and interesting, with a town street, fishing village and farm; quiet, snowy and pretty in winter, but some houses are very cold.","tip":"In winter it closes at 16:30 and on Mondays; come before noon.","baby_notes":"Snowy paths between houses, and shoes come off inside; a carrier is better.","price":"About ¥1,000; combo with the Hokkaido Museum about ¥1,400","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the town street with its old shops, police box and bank, carry on to the fishing village and farm, and go into the houses to see how people lived.","special":"Original buildings moved from all over Hokkaido, not replicas.","highlights":["Town street","Herring fishermen's house","The farm"],"time_needed":"2-3 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Train to Shinrin-koen then a short bus; closed Mondays in winter","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hokkaido Museum","name_ja":"北海道博物館","city":"sapporo","area":"Around Sapporo","category":"sight","lat":43.049,"lng":141.497,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המוזיאון הגדול של הוקאידו, מהממותות ועד האינו והמתיישבים, ביער ליד כפר המתיישבים.","reality":"מוזיאון טוב ומסודר, עם אגף רציני על תרבות האינו; עובד הכי טוב בכרטיס משולב עם הכפר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כ-¥800; משולב עם הכפר כ-¥1,400","tip":"מתחילים כאן להבין את הרקע, ואז הולכים לכפר הסמוך.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5303.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מוזיאון מקורה ונגיש עם מעליות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hokkaido%20Museum%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://www.hm.pref.hokkaido.lg.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בתערוכה הקבועה בסדר הזה: טבע וממותות, תרבות האינו, תקופת המתיישבים, והוקאידו של היום.","special":"התמונה המלאה של ההיסטוריה של האי, כולל האינו, במקום אחד.","highlights":["שלד הממותה","אגף האינו","תקופת המתיישבים"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"53-2 Konopporo, Atsubetsu-cho, Atsubetsu-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":"09:30","closes":"16:30","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"כרטיס משולב עם כפר המתיישבים; סגור בשני","baby_block":null,"tags":["museum","history","ainu","mammoth","natural history","מוזיאון","היסטוריה","אינו","ממותה","טבע","hokkaido","הוקאידו","indoor","מקורה","culture","תרבות"],"en":{"hype":"Hokkaido's big museum, from mammoths to the Ainu and the settlers, in the forest by the Historical Village.","reality":"A good, well-organized museum with a serious Ainu section; best on the combo ticket with the village.","tip":"Start here for the background, then walk on to the village next door.","baby_notes":"Indoor and accessible, with elevators.","price":"About ¥800; combo with the village about ¥1,400","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the permanent exhibit in order: nature and mammoths, Ainu culture, the settler era and Hokkaido today.","special":"The island's full history, Ainu included, in one place.","highlights":["Mammoth skeleton","Ainu section","Settler era"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Combo ticket with the Historical Village; closed Mondays","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hitsujigaoka Observation Hill","name_ja":"さっぽろ羊ヶ丘展望台","city":"sapporo","area":"Around Sapporo","category":"sight","lat":43.008,"lng":141.412,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גבעה עם פסל ד״ר קלארק המצביע לאופק, נוף על העיר ומוזיאון קטן של פסטיבל השלג.","reality":"הפסל והנוף נחמדים לחצי שעה; יעד קלאסי של קבוצות, לא חובה.","verdict":"overhyped","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,000 למבוגר, ¥500 לילד, גיל גן חינם","tip":"נסגר לשיפוץ מ-1 באפריל 2027, אז מי שרוצה לראות צריך לבוא לפני.","sources":["https://www.hitsujigaoka.jp/"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hitsujigaoka%20Observation%20Hill%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://www.hitsujigaoka.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מצטלמים מול פסל קלארק עם היד המושטת, מסתכלים על העיר, ונכנסים למוזיאון פסטיבל השלג עם תמונות ודגמים מכל השנים.","special":"הפסל של ד״ר קלארק ומשפט הפרידה שלו 'בנים, היו שאפתנים', סמל של הוקאידו.","highlights":["פסל ד״ר קלארק","מוזיאון פסטיבל השלג","נוף על העיר"],"time_needed":"45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1 Hitsujigaoka, Toyohira-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"רכבת תחתית לפוקוזומי ואוטובוס 10 דקות","baby_block":null,"tags":["observation hill","statue","clark","view","snow festival museum","גבעת תצפית","פסל","קלארק","נוף","מוזיאון פסטיבל השלג","sheep","כבשים","landmark","ציון דרך","photo spot","מקום לצילום"],"en":{"hype":"A hill with the Dr. Clark statue pointing to the horizon, a city view and a small Snow Festival museum.","reality":"The statue and view are nice for half an hour; a classic tour-group stop, not a must.","tip":"It closes for renovation from 1 April 2027, so go before then if you want to see it.","baby_notes":null,"price":"¥1,000 adults, ¥500 kids, preschoolers free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Take a photo with the Clark statue and its outstretched arm, look over the city, and visit the Snow Festival museum with photos and models from past years.","special":"Dr. Clark's statue and his parting line 'Boys, be ambitious', a Hokkaido symbol.","highlights":["Dr. Clark statue","Snow Festival museum","City view"],"time_needed":"45 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Subway to Fukuzumi, then a 10-minute bus","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Shiroi Koibito Park","name_ja":"白い恋人パーク","city":"sapporo","area":"Around Sapporo","category":"sight","lat":43.089,"lng":141.272,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המפעל של עוגיות 'שירוי קויביטו' עם בניין בסגנון אירופאי, קו ייצור מאחורי זכוכית וסדנת אפייה.","reality":"קיטשי אבל כיף, בעיקר עם ילדים; עבר שיפוץ ב-2026, והמחיר עלה. הסדנה היא החלק הכי טוב.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,200 למבוגר, ¥600 מגיל 4; סדנה מ-¥1,500 בנוסף","tip":"מזמינים כניסה וסדנה באתר מראש, בעונות עמוסות אין כרטיסים במקום.","sources":["https://news.allabout.co.jp/articles/o/125000/","https://www.gutabi.jp/spot/detail/49","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5307.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מקורה ונגיש לעגלה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shiroi%20Koibito%20Park%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://www.shiroikoibitopark.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בתערוכת השוקולד, מסתכלים על קו הייצור של העוגיות מאחורי הזכוכית, ומקשטים עוגייה בצורת לב בסדנה. בחוץ יש שעון שמופיע בו מופע בובות כל שעה.","special":"מפעל אמיתי של העוגייה הכי נמכרת בהוקאידו, עם סדנה לקשט אחת בעצמכם.","highlights":["סדנת העוגייה","קו הייצור","מופע השעון"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-2-11-36 Miyanosawa, Nishi-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":"10:00","closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":90,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"רכבת תחתית טוזאי למיאנוסאווה ו-10 דקות ברגל","baby_block":null,"tags":["chocolate","cookies","factory","workshop","sweets","שוקולד","עוגיות","מפעל","סדנה","ממתקים","shiroi koibito","שירוי קויביטו","kids","ילדים","baking","אפייה"],"en":{"hype":"The Shiroi Koibito cookie factory, with a European-style building, a glass-walled production line and a baking workshop.","reality":"Kitschy but fun, especially with kids; renovated in 2026 and the price went up. The workshop is the best part.","tip":"Book entry and the workshop online ahead, busy seasons have no tickets at the door.","baby_notes":"Indoor and stroller-friendly.","price":"¥1,200 adults, ¥600 from age 4; workshop from ¥1,500 extra","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk through the chocolate exhibit, watch the cookie line through the glass, and decorate a heart-shaped cookie in the workshop. Outside, a clock puts on a puppet show every hour.","special":"A real factory of Hokkaido's best-selling cookie, with a workshop to decorate your own.","highlights":["Cookie workshop","Production line","Clock tower show"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Tozai subway to Miyanosawa, then 10 minutes on foot","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hokkaido Museum of Modern Art","name_ja":"北海道立近代美術館","city":"sapporo","area":"Maruyama","category":"sight","lat":43.0585,"lng":141.329,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון האמנות של מחוז הוקאידו, עם אוסף זכוכית אמנותית ואמני הוקאידו ותערוכות מתחלפות.","reality":"מוזיאון רגוע ובינוני, טוב ליום שלג; התערוכות המתחלפות משתנות מאוד באיכות, כדאי לבדוק מה מוצג.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"תערוכה קבועה כ-¥510; תערוכות מיוחדות בנפרד","tip":"5 דקות ברגל מתחנת ניש-ג'ו-האצ'ומה בקו טוזאי, בדרך למרויאמה.","sources":["https://www.museum.or.jp/museum/437","https://artmuseum.pref.hokkaido.lg.jp/knb/exhibition/yearly_schedule"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"נגיש לעגלה עם מעליות.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hokkaido%20Museum%20of%20Modern%20Art%20Sapporo","website_url":"https://artmuseum.pref.hokkaido.lg.jp/knb/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים באוסף הקבוע של אמנות מהוקאידו וזכוכית מעוצבת מהאר נובו, ונכנסים לתערוכה המתחלפת.","special":"אוסף זכוכית אר נובו של אמיל גאלה ואחרים.","highlights":["אוסף הזכוכית","אמני הוקאידו","התערוכה המתחלפת"],"time_needed":"שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"17 Kita 1 Jonishi, Chuo-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":"09:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בשני; לבדוק מה התערוכה המתחלפת","baby_block":null,"tags":["art museum","museum","glass art","art nouveau","exhibition","מוזיאון אמנות","מוזיאון","אמנות זכוכית","אר נובו","תערוכה","galle","גאלה","indoor","מקורה","rainy day","יום גשום"],"en":{"hype":"Hokkaido's prefectural art museum, with art glass, Hokkaido artists and changing shows.","reality":"A calm, mid-size museum, good for a snowy day; the changing shows vary a lot, so check what is on.","tip":"5 minutes' walk from Nishi-18-chome on the Tozai line, on the way to Maruyama.","baby_notes":"Stroller-friendly with elevators.","price":"Permanent collection about ¥510; special shows extra","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the permanent collection of Hokkaido art and Art Nouveau glass, then the changing exhibition.","special":"Art Nouveau glass by Emile Galle and others.","highlights":["Glass collection","Hokkaido artists","Changing exhibition"],"time_needed":"An hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Mondays; check the current special show","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Sapporo Art Park","name_ja":"札幌芸術の森","city":"sapporo","area":"Around Sapporo","category":"sight","lat":42.98,"lng":141.382,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פארק אמנות ביער בדרום סאפורו, עם מוזיאון, סדנאות ומוזיאון פסלים בחוץ.","reality":"הכי יפה מאביב עד סתיו; בחורף העיקר הוא המוזיאון בפנים, והפסלים בחוץ מכוסים שלג.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"כניסה לפארק חינם; מוזיאון הפסלים ¥800, התערוכות בנפרד","tip":"בחורף סגור בימי שני; עד 11 בינואר 2027 מוצגת תערוכת חמשת אמני האוקיו-אה הגדולים.","sources":["https://www.gutabi.jp/spot/detail/170","https://www.artagenda.jp/exhibition/detail/11256"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"המוזיאון נגיש; השבילים בחוץ מושלגים בחורף.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sapporo%20Art%20Park","website_url":"https://artpark.or.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים לתערוכה במוזיאון, ובעונה עוברים בשבילי היער בין הפסלים בחוץ.","special":"פסלים של אמנים מיפן ומהעולם מפוזרים ביער.","highlights":["מוזיאון הפסלים בחוץ","תערוכות המוזיאון","היער"],"time_needed":"שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2-75 Geijutsu-no-mori, Minami-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[1],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":120,"booking":"no","plan_line":"רכבת תחתית למקומנאי ואוטובוס; סגור בשני בחורף","baby_block":null,"tags":["art park","sculpture","museum","forest","exhibition","פארק אמנות","פסלים","מוזיאון","יער","תערוכה","outdoor art","אמנות בחוץ","ukiyo-e","אוקיו-אה","culture","תרבות"],"en":{"hype":"An art park in the forest of south Sapporo, with a museum, craft studios and an outdoor sculpture garden.","reality":"Best from spring to autumn; in winter the indoor museum is the main thing and the outdoor sculptures are under snow.","tip":"Closed Mondays in winter; until 11 January 2027 the museum shows the five great ukiyo-e masters.","baby_notes":"The museum is accessible; outdoor paths are snowy in winter.","price":"Park free; sculpture garden ¥800, shows extra","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"See the show at the museum, and in season walk the forest paths among the outdoor sculptures.","special":"Sculptures by Japanese and international artists scattered through the forest.","highlights":["Outdoor sculpture garden","Museum shows","The forest"],"time_needed":"2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Subway to Makomanai then a bus; closed Mondays in winter","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Nikka Whisky Yoichi Distillery","name_ja":"ニッカウヰスキー 余市蒸溜所","city":"sapporo","area":"Around Sapporo","category":"experience","lat":43.188,"lng":140.79,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מזקקת הוויסקי הראשונה של ניקה מ-1934, בבנייני אבן ליד תחנת יואיצ'י, עם סיור וטעימה בחינם.","reality":"אחד הסיורים הכי טובים באזור: רואים את הזיקוק על אש פחם, והטעימה בסוף נדיבה; צריך להזמין מראש ובחורף הכל בשלג.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"סיור וטעימה חינם; רכבת מסאפורו כ-¥1,380 לכיוון","tip":"מזמינים את הסיור החינמי באתר 2-4 שבועות מראש; בלי הזמנה אפשר רק את המוזיאון.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e6707.html","https://www.cotaru.co/post/yoichi-nikka-tour-booking","https://www.visit-hokkaido.jp/spot/detail_10170.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nikka%20Whisky%20Yoichi%20Distillery","website_url":"https://distillery.nikka.com/yoichi/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מצטרפים לסיור המודרך בין בית הזיקוק, המחסנים והבית של המייסד מסטאקה טאקטסורו, וממשיכים לחדר הטעימות. אחר כך עוברים במוזיאון ובחנות עם בקבוקים שנמכרים רק כאן.","special":"זיקוק על אש פחם ישירה, שכמעט אף מזקקה בעולם כבר לא עושה.","highlights":["סיור מודרך חינם","טעימה בסוף","בקבוקים בלעדיים למזקקה"],"time_needed":"שעתיים כולל המוזיאון","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"7-6 Kurokawa-cho, Yoichi, Hokkaido","opens":"09:15","closes":"16:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-25","2026-12-26","2026-12-27","2026-12-28","2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":120,"booking":"required","plan_line":"להזמין סיור באתר שבועות מראש; סגור 25.12-7.1","baby_block":null,"tags":["whisky","distillery","tasting","tour","nikka","ויסקי","מזקקה","טעימות","סיור","ניקה","yoichi","יואיצ׳י","day trip","טיול יום","museum","מוזיאון"],"en":{"hype":"Nikka's first whisky distillery from 1934, in stone buildings by Yoichi Station, with a free tour and tasting.","reality":"One of the best tours in the area: you see coal-fired stills, and the tasting at the end is generous; book ahead, and in winter it is all under snow.","tip":"Book the free tour online 2-4 weeks ahead; without a booking you can only do the museum.","baby_notes":null,"price":"Tour and tasting free; train from Sapporo about ¥1,380 each way","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Join the guided tour through the still house, warehouses and founder Masataka Taketsuru's house, then the tasting room. Afterwards see the museum and the shop with distillery-only bottles.","special":"Direct coal-fired distilling, which almost no distillery still does.","highlights":["Free guided tour","Tasting at the end","Distillery-only bottles"],"time_needed":"2 hours with the museum","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Book the tour online weeks ahead; closed 25 Dec-7 Jan","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
where not exists (select 1 from place_library p where p.city = x.city and lower(p.name) = lower(x.name));
insert into place_library (name, name_ja, city, area, category, lat, lng, coord_precision, hype, reality, verdict, tabelog_score, google_score, price, tip, sources, audience, baby_notes, local_pick, maps_url, website_url, serves, dishes, todo, special, highlights, time_needed, kosher, kosher_note, address, opens, closes, closed_weekdays, closed_dates, open_dates, best_time, visit_mins, booking, plan_line, baby_block, tags, en, facts_at, facts_sure, active)
select x.name, x.name_ja, x.city, x.area, x.category, x.lat, x.lng, x.coord_precision, x.hype, x.reality, x.verdict, x.tabelog_score, x.google_score, x.price, x.tip, x.sources, x.audience, x.baby_notes, x.local_pick, x.maps_url, x.website_url, x.serves, x.dishes, x.todo, x.special, x.highlights, x.time_needed, x.kosher, x.kosher_note, x.address, x.opens, x.closes, x.closed_weekdays, x.closed_dates, x.open_dates, x.best_time, x.visit_mins, x.booking, x.plan_line, x.baby_block, x.tags, x.en, x.facts_at, x.facts_sure, false from jsonb_populate_recordset(null::place_library, $cards$[{"name":"Sapporo Teine Ski Resort","name_ja":"サッポロテイネ","city":"sapporo","area":"Around Sapporo","category":"experience","lat":43.075,"lng":141.2,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אתר הסקי של אולימפיאדת 1972, 40 דקות מסאפורו, עם נוף על העיר והים.","reality":"האתר הגדול והקל להגעה ליד העיר: שני אזורים, גבוה למתקדמים ונמוך למתחילים ומשפחות; בסופי שבוע עמוס.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"בעונה שעברה יומי כ-¥9,400 וערב ¥3,800; אוטובוס סקי עם כרטיס כ-¥10,500","tip":"רכבת JR לתחנת טייני ואוטובוס JR לאתר; אזור אולימפיה נפתח בערך מ-5 בדצמבר.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5318.html","https://watabi.org/articles/sapporo-teine-ski-guide","https://weathernews.jp/ski/spot/31401/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sapporo%20Teine%20Ski%20Resort","website_url":"https://sapporo-teine.com/snow/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מתחילים באזור הגבוה הייאלנד למסלולים ארוכים ושלג טוב, או באזור אולימפיה למסלולים רחבים, מגלשות שלג וצינורות לילדים. בערב יש סקי לילה.","special":"גולשים מול נוף של סאפורו ומפרץ אישיקרי, חצי שעה מהעיר.","highlights":["אזור הייאלנד","אזור משפחות עם מגלשות","סקי לילה עם נוף"],"time_needed":"יום שלם","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"593 Teine-ku Teine, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":420,"booking":"no","plan_line":"קונים כרטיס באתר מראש, זול יותר מבקופה","baby_block":null,"tags":["ski","skiing","snowboard","ski resort","olympics","סקי","סנובורד","אתר סקי","אולימפיאדה","גלישה","night skiing","סקי לילה","sledding","מזחלות","snow","שלג"],"en":{"hype":"The 1972 Olympic ski area, 40 minutes from Sapporo, with views over the city and the sea.","reality":"The biggest, easiest-to-reach resort near the city: two zones, high for good skiers and low for beginners and families; busy on weekends.","tip":"JR to Teine Station then a JR bus; the Olympia zone opens around 5 December.","baby_notes":null,"price":"Last season day pass about ¥9,400, night ¥3,800; ski bus with pass about ¥10,500","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Start in the high Highland zone for long runs and good snow, or the Olympia zone for wide runs, sledding and tubing for kids. Night skiing in the evening.","special":"Skiing facing Sapporo and Ishikari Bay, half an hour from the city.","highlights":["Highland zone","Family zone with sledding","Night skiing with a view"],"time_needed":"Full day","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Buy passes online ahead, cheaper than at the window","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Takino Snow World","name_ja":"滝野スノーワールド","city":"sapporo","area":"Around Sapporo","category":"experience","lat":42.926,"lng":141.4,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"פארק השלג של גבעות טאקינו בדרום סאפורו, עם מסלול צינורות של 200 מטר, מגלשות ומדרון סקי משפחתי.","reality":"מקום מעולה למשחקי שלג בלי אתר סקי: הכניסה והצינורות חינם בעונה שעברה, ויש מסלול שלג לנפילי מים קפואים.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"בעונה שעברה כניסה חינם, חניה ¥500","tip":"נפתח ב-23 בדצמבר; מסלול הצינורות הארוך נפתח רק כשיש מספיק שלג, בדרך כלל בינואר.","sources":["https://takinopark.com/","https://www.gutabi.jp/event/detail/3375"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"יש אזור מגלשות מתון ושקט לפעוטות; לתינוק, מנשא ובגדי שלג.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Takino%20Suzuran%20Hillside%20National%20Government%20Park","website_url":"https://takinopark.com/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מחליקים בצינורות במסלול הארוך, משחקים בשלג במדרון המשפחות, ומי שיש לו כוח הולך בנעלי שלג לראות את מפל אשיריבטסו הקפוא.","special":"מסלול צינורות של 200 מטר, מהארוכים ביפן, בתוך פארק לאומי.","highlights":["מסלול הצינורות","מפל קפוא","מגלשות לקטנים"],"time_needed":"חצי יום","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"247 Takino, Minami-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":["2026-12-23","2026-12-24","2026-12-25","2026-12-26","2026-12-27","2026-12-28","2026-12-29","2026-12-30","2026-12-31"],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":180,"booking":"no","plan_line":"נפתח 23.12; רכבת תחתית למקומנאי ואוטובוס לפארק","baby_block":null,"tags":["snow park","tubing","sledding","snowshoe","frozen waterfall","פארק שלג","צינורות","מזחלות","נעלי שלג","מפל קפוא","kids","ילדים","family","משפחה","snow","שלג"],"en":{"hype":"The snow park of Takino Hills in south Sapporo, with a 200 m tubing run, sledding and a family ski slope.","reality":"Great for snow play without a ski resort: entry and tubing were free last season, and there is a snowshoe trail to a frozen waterfall.","tip":"Opens 23 December; the long tubing run opens only with enough snow, usually in January.","baby_notes":"A gentle, quiet sledding area for toddlers; for a baby, a carrier and snow clothes.","price":"Last season free entry, parking ¥500","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Tube down the long run, play in the snow on the family slope, and with energy snowshoe out to the frozen Ashiribetsu falls.","special":"A 200 m tubing run, one of Japan's longest, inside a national park.","highlights":["Tubing run","Frozen waterfall","Sledding for little ones"],"time_needed":"Half a day","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Opens 23 Dec; subway 