so steak (Hida beef, vegetables and local miso grilled on a magnolia leaf), charcoal-grilled Hida beef and mountain vegetable dishes.","dishes":["Hoba miso steak","Charcoal-grilled Hida beef","Mountain vegetable set"],"todo":null,"special":null,"highlights":[],"time_needed":"About 1.5 hours","kosher_note":"The main dishes are beef and vegetables.","plan_line":"No bookings, arrive at 17:00, last entry 19:30, closed Tue","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Sanmachi Suji","name_ja":"さんまち通り","city":"takayama","area":"Old Town","category":"sight","lat":36.1409,"lng":137.26,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"שלושה רחובות של בתי עץ מתקופת אדו, עם חנויות, בתי קפה ומבשלות סאקה, הלב של העיר העתיקה.","reality":"יפה באמת, אבל בצהריים הסמטאות מלאות קבוצות; בבוקר מוקדם או אחרי 16:00 הן שקטות ונראות הרבה יותר טוב.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"הכניסה חינם","tip":"רוב החנויות נסגרות סביב 17:00, אז עדיף להגיע בבוקר.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5912_takayama_full.html","https://www.hida.jp/english/touristattractions/takayamacity/historyandculture/4000153.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"הרחובות שטוחים ומרוצפים, עגלה עוברת בקלות; בשלג כדאי מנשא.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sanmachi%20Suji%20Takayama","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מטיילים לאורך קאמיסאנומאצ׳י וקאמינינומאצ׳י, נכנסים למבשלות שמסומנות בכדור ארזים מעל הדלת, וקונים חטיפים קטנים בדרך. משם ממשיכים צפונה לכיוון מקדש סאקוראיאמה.","special":"אחד הרחובות הכי שלמים ביפן מתקופת אדו, עם חזיתות עץ כהות ותעלות מים קטנות לאורך הבתים.","highlights":["קאמיסאנומאצ׳י","מבשלות סאקה","בתי עץ מתקופת אדו"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Kamisannomachi, Takayama, Gifu","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":90,"booking":"no","plan_line":"להגיע לפני 10:00 או אחרי 16:00, בצהריים צפוף מאוד","baby_block":null,"tags":["old town","historic street","edo period","wooden houses","sake","souvenirs","walk","עיר עתיקה","רחוב היסטורי","בתי עץ","סאקה","מזכרות","טיול רגלי","תקופת אדו","sanmachi","סאנמאצ׳י"],"en":{"hype":"Three streets of Edo-era wooden houses with shops, cafes and sake breweries; the heart of the old town.","reality":"It really is pretty, but at midday the lanes fill with tour groups; early morning or after 16:00 it is quiet and looks much better.","tip":"Most shops close around 17:00, so mornings work best.","baby_notes":"Flat paved streets, easy with a stroller; a carrier is better in snow.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk Kamisannomachi and Kaminimachi, step into the breweries marked by a cedar ball over the door, and snack along the way. Then head north toward Sakurayama Hachimangu.","special":"One of the most intact Edo-era streets in Japan, with dark wooden fronts and small water channels along the houses.","highlights":["Kamisannomachi","Sake breweries","Edo-era houses"],"time_needed":"1-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Go before 10:00 or after 16:00, midday is packed","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Takayama Jinya","name_ja":"高山陣屋","city":"takayama","area":"Old Town","category":"sight","lat":36.1393,"lng":137.2577,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"משרד השלטון של השוגון מתקופת אדו, הבניין היחיד מסוגו ששרד ביפן.","reality":"חדרי טאטאמי ריקים ברובם, אבל הם שקטים ויפים, ויש חדר חקירות ומחסן אורז ענק עם מפות ישנות. שווה שעה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥440","tip":"השוק של ג׳ינייה-מאה בדיוק מול השער, אז נוח לשלב בבוקר.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5902.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"בפנים חולצים נעליים והולכים על טאטאמי; את העגלה משאירים בכניסה.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Takayama%20Jinya%20Takayama","website_url":"https://jinya.gifu.jp/en/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים בין חדרי המשרדים, חדר האורחים וחדר החקירות, ומסיימים במחסן האורז עם המפות והמסמכים של האזור.","special":"מחסן האורז מהמאה ה-17 הוא מחסן האורז המסורתי הגדול ביפן.","highlights":["חדר החקירות","מחסן האורז","גן פנימי"],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-5 Hachikenmachi, Takayama, Gifu","opens":"08:45","closes":"16:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-29","2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בחורף נסגר ב-16:30, כניסה אחרונה חצי שעה לפני","baby_block":null,"tags":["government house","edo period","history","tatami","rice storehouse","museum","samurai","בית ממשל","היסטוריה","טאטאמי","מחסן אורז","מוזיאון","תקופת אדו","jinya","ג׳ינייה"],"en":{"hype":"The Edo-era shogunate government office, the only one of its kind left in Japan.","reality":"Mostly empty tatami rooms, but calm and handsome, plus an interrogation room and a huge rice storehouse with old maps. Worth an hour.","tip":"The Jinya-mae morning market is right at the gate, so pair them in the morning.","baby_notes":"Shoes off on tatami inside; strollers stay at the entrance.","price":"¥440","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk through the offices, guest rooms and interrogation room, and finish in the rice storehouse with the regional maps and papers.","special":"Its 1600s storehouse is the largest traditional rice storehouse in Japan.","highlights":["Interrogation room","Rice storehouse","Inner garden"],"time_needed":"About 1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closes 16:30 in winter, last entry 30 minutes before","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
where not exists (select 1 from place_library p where p.city = x.city and lower(p.name) = lower(x.name));
