es","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hirase Sake Brewery","name_ja":"平瀬酒造店","city":"takayama","area":"Old Town","category":"shopping","lat":36.144,"lng":137.2611,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"המבשלה הוותיקה בטקאיאמה, יותר מ-390 שנה, יצרנית ״קוסודאמה״.","reality":"חנות קטנה ורצינית שמכינה רק ג׳ונמאי, גינג׳ו והונג׳וזו. טובה לקניית בקבוק, פחות לטעימות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"בקבוק 720 מ״ל מ-¥1,500 בערך","tip":"יש ליקר שזיפים קטן מסאקה, מתנה קלה למזוודה.","sources":["https://www.mapple.net/article/48538/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"מבשלה צפופה, עם עגלה קשה להסתובב בשעות העומס.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hirase%20Sake%20Brewery%20Takayama","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"נכנסים לחנות, מתייעצים על סוג ובוחרים בקבוק או ליקר שזיפים.","special":null,"highlights":["קוסודאמה","ליקר שזיפים"],"time_needed":"כעשר דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"82 Kamiichinomachi, Takayama, Gifu","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":10,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לקנות בקבוק, לא לטעימות","baby_block":null,"tags":["sake","sake brewery","sake tasting","nihonshu","souvenir","alcohol","סאקה","מבשלת סאקה","טעימות סאקה","טעימות","מזכרת","אלכוהול","sakagura","סאקגורה","junmai","umeshu","ג׳ונמאי","אומשו"],"en":{"hype":"Takayama's oldest brewery, over 390 years, maker of Kusudama.","reality":"A small, serious shop making only junmai, ginjo and honjozo. Good for buying a bottle, less so for tastings.","tip":"A small sake plum liqueur makes an easy suitcase gift.","baby_notes":"Cramped shop, hard to turn a stroller at busy times.","price":"720 ml bottles from about ¥1,500","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Step into the shop, ask about styles and pick a bottle or plum liqueur.","special":null,"highlights":["Kusudama","Plum liqueur"],"time_needed":"About 10 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Go to buy a bottle, not for tastings","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Kawajiri Sake Brewery","name_ja":"川尻酒造場","city":"takayama","area":"Old Town","category":"shopping","lat":36.1432,"lng":137.2605,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מבשלה מ-1839 שמכינה ביד סאקה מיושן, ״טן־און״, ומוכרת אותו רק בטקאיאמה.","reality":"מקום מיוחד למי שמכיר סאקה: טעם עמוק ומיושן ששונה מאוד מהשאר. סט טעימה של שלושה סוגים ב-¥500.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"סט טעימה של 3 ב-¥500","tip":"הסאקה לא נמכר מחוץ לטקאיאמה, אז קונים כאן.","sources":["https://www.mapple.net/article/48538/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"מבשלה צפופה, עם עגלה קשה להסתובב בשעות העומס.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kawajiri%20Sake%20Brewery%20Takayama","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מזמינים סט של שלושה סוגים, משווים בין מיושן לצעיר וקונים בקבוק.","special":"סאקה מיושן בעבודת יד, נמכר רק בחנויות בטקאיאמה ובמשלוח.","highlights":["טן־און מיושן","סט שלושה סוגים"],"time_needed":"כרבע שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"68 Kaminimachi, Takayama, Gifu","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":20,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סט שלושה סוגים ב-¥500, סאקה מיושן שאין במקום אחר","baby_block":null,"tags":["sake","sake brewery","sake tasting","nihonshu","souvenir","alcohol","סאקה","מבשלת סאקה","טעימות סאקה","טעימות","מזכרת","אלכוהול","sakagura","סאקגורה","aged sake","koshu","סאקה מיושן"],"en":{"hype":"An 1839 brewery making hand-crafted aged sake, Ten-on, sold only in Takayama.","reality":"Special for sake fans: a deep aged taste very different from the rest. A three-sake tasting set is ¥500.","tip":"It is not sold outside Takayama, so buy it here.","baby_notes":"Cramped shop, hard to turn a stroller at busy times.","price":"3-sake tasting set ¥500","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Order the three-sake set, compare aged and young, and buy a bottle.","special":"Hand-made aged sake, sold only in Takayama shops and by mail.","highlights":["Aged Ten-on","Three-sake set"],"time_needed":"About 15 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"¥500 for three, aged sake you will not find elsewhere","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hirata Sake Brewery","name_ja":"平田酒造場","city":"takayama","area":"Old Town","category":"shopping","lat":36.1427,"lng":137.2604,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מבשלה מ-1895 שמכינה את ״הידה נו האנה״ ממי באר, עם סאקה מיושן שזכה במדליות זהב.","reality":"טעימות בתשלום של ¥100-600, כולל הסאקה המיושן היקר שקשה לטעום במקום אחר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"טעימה ¥100-600","tip":null,"sources":["https://www.mapple.net/article/48538/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"מבשלה צפופה, עם עגלה קשה להסתובב בשעות העומס.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hirata%20Sake%20Brewery%20Takayama","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"טועמים את ג׳ונמאי הידה נו האנה, ואם רוצים להתפנק גם את הסאקה המיושן ״סוי־או״.","special":null,"highlights":["הידה נו האנה","סוי־או מיושן"],"time_needed":"כרבע שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"43 Kaminimachi, Takayama, Gifu","opens":"08:00","closes":"16:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":15,"booking":"no","plan_line":"לטעום כאן את הסאקה המיושן, אחד היחידים שאפשר","baby_block":null,"tags":["sake","sake brewery","sake tasting","nihonshu","souvenir","alcohol","סאקה","מבשלת סאקה","טעימות סאקה","טעימות","מזכרת","אלכוהול","sakagura","סאקגורה","aged sake","junmai daiginjo","סאקה מיושן"],"en":{"hype":"An 1895 brewery making Hida no Hana from well water, with an aged sake that has won gold medals.","reality":"Paid tastings of ¥100-600, including the pricey aged sake that is hard to taste anywhere else.","tip":null,"baby_notes":"Cramped shop, hard to turn a stroller at busy times.","price":"Tasting ¥100-600","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Taste the Hida no Hana junmai and, for a treat, the aged Suio.","special":null,"highlights":["Hida no Hana","Aged Suio"],"time_needed":"About 15 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Taste the aged sake here, one of the few places you can","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hands-On Town Interaction Center of Hida Takayama","name_ja":"飛騨高山まちの体験交流館","city":"takayama","area":"Old Town","category":"experience","lat":36.1437,"lng":137.2617,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מרכז עירוני שבו מכינים בעצמם בובת סארובובו, גילוף עץ איצ׳יי איטובורי או כף עץ, בהדרכת אומנים.","reality":"הכניסה חינם ומשלמים רק על הסדנה. דרך טובה להביא הביתה מזכרת שעשיתם לבד, ויש בית קפה במקום.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"הכניסה חינם, הסדנאות בתשלום","tip":"חלק מהסדנאות בלי הזמנה, לאחרות כדאי לשריין באתר.","sources":["https://www.hida.jp/english/touristattractions/takayamacity/historyandculture/4001626.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"מקום מקורה וחם, נוח לעצירה עם התינוק.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hands-On%20Town%20Interaction%20Center%20of%20Hida%20Takayama%20Takayama","website_url":"https://hidatakayama-taiken.com","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"בוחרים סדנה, יושבים ליד שולחן עם אומן ומכינים סארובובו או גילוף קטן, ולוקחים אותו הביתה.","special":null,"highlights":["סדנת סארובובו","גילוף איצ׳יי איטובורי","בית הקפה"],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"35-1 Kamiichinomachi, Takayama, Gifu","opens":"09:00","closes":"19:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":60,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"לבדוק באתר אילו סדנאות צריך להזמין מראש","baby_block":null,"tags":["workshop","crafts","sarubobo","wood carving","ittobori","hands-on","souvenir","סדנה","מלאכות","סארובובו","גילוף עץ","איטובורי","מזכרת","בובה","doll"],"en":{"hype":"A city center where you make your own sarubobo doll, Ichii Ittobori woodcarving or wooden spoon with craftspeople.","reality":"Entry is free and you pay only for the workshop. A good way to take home something you made, and there is a cafe.","tip":"Some workshops need no booking; reserve the others on the website.","baby_notes":"Indoor and warm, an easy stop with the baby.","price":"Free entry, workshops paid","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Pick a workshop, sit at a table with a craftsperson, make a sarubobo or a small carving, and take it home.","special":null,"highlights":["Sarubobo workshop","Ittobori carving","Cafe"],"time_needed":"About 1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Check online which workshops need booking ahead","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hida Kokubunji Temple","name_ja":"飛騨国分寺","city":"takayama","area":"Takayama Station","category":"sight","lat":36.1431,"lng":137.2532,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מקדש עם פגודה בת שלוש קומות ועץ גינקו בן יותר מ-1,200 שנה, חמש דקות הליכה מהתחנה.","reality":"החצר והפגודה חינם לראות מבחוץ, והאולם הראשי הוא המבנה העתיק בעיר. עצירה קצרה בדרך מהתחנה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥300 לאולם","tip":null,"sources":["https://www.hida.jp/english/touristattractions/takayamacity/historyandculture/4000178.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hida%20Kokubunji%20Temple%20Takayama","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בשער מגדל הפעמון, מסתכלים על הפגודה ועל עץ הגינקו, ונכנסים לאולם הראשי.","special":"האולם הראשי מתקופת מורומאצ׳י, בן כ-500 שנה, הבניין העתיק בטקאיאמה.","highlights":["פגודה בת שלוש קומות","עץ הגינקו העתיק","שער מגדל הפעמון"],"time_needed":"כחצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-83 Sowamachi, Takayama, Gifu","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":25,"booking":"no","plan_line":"חמש דקות מהתחנה, טוב לחצי שעה לפני או אחרי רכבת","baby_block":null,"tags":["temple","pagoda","buddhist temple","ginkgo","history","three-story pagoda","מקדש","פגודה","מקדש בודהיסטי","גינקו","היסטוריה","עץ עתיק","kokubunji","קוקובונג׳י"],"en":{"hype":"A temple with a three-story pagoda and a ginkgo over 1,200 years old, five minutes' walk from the station.","reality":"The grounds and pagoda are free to see outside, and the main hall is the oldest building in town. A short stop on the way from the station.","tip":null,"baby_notes":null,"price":"¥300 for the hall","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk through the bell tower gate, look at the pagoda and the ginkgo, and step into the main hall.","special":"The main hall dates from the Muromachi era, about 500 years old, the oldest building in Takayama.","highlights":["Three-story pagoda","Ancient ginkgo","Bell tower gate"],"time_needed":"About 30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Five minutes from the station, good for 30 minutes around a train","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hida Folk Village","name_ja":"飛騨の里","city":"takayama","area":"Takayama Station","category":"sight","lat":36.1355,"lng":137.24,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"כפר פתוח עם יותר מ-30 בתי חווה עם גגות קש, חלקם בתי גאשו שהועברו לכאן, סביב אגם קטן.","reality":"שקט ומרווח הרבה יותר משיראקאווה-גו, ובשלג יפה במיוחד. מי שלא מגיע לשיראקאווה-גו מקבל כאן את התמונה.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥700","tip":"אוטובוס סארובובו מהתחנה, כעשר דקות.","sources":["https://www.hida.jp/english/touristattractions/takayamacity/historyandculture/4000165.html","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5901.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"שבילים רחבים, אבל יש עליות ובשלג עדיף מנשא; בתוך הבתים חולצים נעליים.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hida%20Folk%20Village%20Takayama","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים סביב האגם בין הבתים, נכנסים לבתי הגאשו ומתחממים ליד האח הפתוח, ומסתכלים על הדגמות לכה ואריגה.","special":"בתי חווה אמיתיים מכל אזור הידה, כולל כמה נכסי תרבות לאומיים, עם אח בוערת בחלק מהם.","highlights":["בתי גאשו","האגם","אח איררי בוערת"],"time_needed":"שעה וחצי-שעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-590 Kamiokamotomachi, Takayama, Gifu","opens":"08:30","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":100,"booking":"no","plan_line":"אוטובוס סארובובו מהתחנה, כעשר דקות; להגיע בבוקר","baby_block":null,"tags":["open-air museum","folk village","thatched roof","gassho-zukuri","farmhouses","snow","pond","מוזיאון פתוח","כפר עממי","גגות קש","גאשו","בתי חווה","שלג","אגם","hida no sato","הידה נו סאטו"],"en":{"hype":"An open-air village of over 30 thatched farmhouses, some gassho houses moved here, around a small pond.","reality":"Much quieter and roomier than Shirakawa-go, and especially pretty in snow. If you skip Shirakawa-go, you get the picture here.","tip":"Sarubobo bus from the station, about ten minutes.","baby_notes":"Wide paths but some slopes, a carrier is better in snow; shoes off inside the houses.","price":"¥700","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk around the pond between the houses, step into the gassho houses and warm up by the open hearth, and watch the lacquer and weaving demos.","special":"Real farmhouses from all over Hida, some National Cultural Properties, with fires lit in some hearths.","highlights":["Gassho houses","Pond","Burning irori hearth"],"time_needed":"1.5-2 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Sarubobo bus from the station, about 10 min; go in the morning","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hida Takayama Matsuri no Mori","name_ja":"飛騨高山まつりの森","city":"takayama","area":"Takayama Station","category":"sight","lat":36.119,"lng":137.277,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"אולם תת-קרקעי עם עגלות פסטיבל בגודל מלא, בובות קאראקורי שמופיעות ותופי טאיקו ענקיים.","reality":"פחות היסטורי מאולם העגלות בעיר, אבל ההופעות של הבובות והתופים מרשימות. רחוק מהמרכז.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥1,000","tip":"יש קופון הנחה באתר הרשמי.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5910.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"התופים חזקים מאוד בזמן ההופעה, כדאי להתרחק עם התינוק.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hida%20Takayama%20Matsuri%20no%20Mori%20Takayama","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"יורדים לאולם, מחכים להופעה של בובות הקאראקורי, ומסתכלים על העגלות והתופים.","special":null,"highlights":["הופעת בובות קאראקורי","תופי טאיקו ענקיים","עגלות בגודל מלא"],"time_needed":"30-45 דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1111 Senshimamachi, Takayama, Gifu","opens":"09:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":45,"booking":"no","plan_line":"אוטובוס סארובובו מהתחנה, כרבע שעה, לבדוק שעות הופעה","baby_block":null,"tags":["festival floats","karakuri","puppets","taiko","drums","museum","underground","עגלות פסטיבל","קאראקורי","בובות","טאיקו","תופים","מוזיאון","מצורי","festival"],"en":{"hype":"An underground hall with full-size festival floats, performing karakuri puppets and giant taiko drums.","reality":"Less historic than the floats hall in town, but the puppet and drum shows are impressive. Far from the center.","tip":"A discount coupon is on the official website.","baby_notes":"The drums are very loud during the show, keep the baby back.","price":"¥1,000","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Go down to the hall, wait for the karakuri puppet show, and look at the floats and drums.","special":null,"highlights":["Karakuri puppet show","Giant taiko drums","Full-size floats"],"time_