e usual route","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hida Takayama Museum of Art","name_ja":"飛騨高山美術館","city":"takayama","area":"Takayama Station","category":"sight","lat":36.1375,"lng":137.2445,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון של זכוכית ועיצוב בסגנון ארט נובו וארט דקו, על גבעה מעל העיר עם נוף להרי האלפים הצפוניים.","reality":"אוסף מושקע, אבל יקר (¥2,000) ורחוק מהמרכז; למי שאוהב זכוכית ועיצוב.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥2,000","tip":"אוטובוס סארובובו, כעשר דקות מהתחנה.","sources":["https://www.hida.jp/english/touristattractions/takayamacity/historyandculture/4001695.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hida%20Takayama%20Museum%20of%20Art%20Takayama","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין אולמות הזכוכית והרהיטים ומסתכלים מהחלונות על הנוף.","special":null,"highlights":["זכוכית ארט נובו","נוף להרים"],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"1-124 Kamiokamotomachi, Takayama, Gifu","opens":"10:00","closes":"17:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"קרוב לכפר הידה, לשלב באותו סיבוב","baby_block":null,"tags":["art museum","glass","art nouveau","art deco","design","view","museum","מוזיאון אמנות","זכוכית","ארט נובו","ארט דקו","עיצוב","נוף","מוזיאון"],"en":{"hype":"A glass and design museum in Art Nouveau and Art Deco style, on a hill above town with Northern Alps views.","reality":"A careful collection, but pricey (¥2,000) and far from the center; for glass and design fans.","tip":"Sarubobo bus, about ten minutes from the station.","baby_notes":null,"price":"¥2,000","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the glass and furniture galleries and look out at the view.","special":null,"highlights":["Art Nouveau glass","Mountain views"],"time_needed":"About 1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Near Hida Folk Village, pair them in one loop","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Seto River and White-Walled Storehouses","name_ja":"瀬戸川と白壁土蔵街","city":"takayama","area":"Hida-Furukawa","category":"sight","lat":36.238,"lng":137.187,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"תעלה של כ-400 מטר עם קרפיונים, לאורך מחסנים לבנים ובתי עץ, הלב של העיירה הקטנה הידה-פורוקאווה.","reality":"הגרסה השקטה של טקאיאמה, כמעט בלי תיירים. הכל קטן ונגמר בשעה, אבל שווה חצי יום עם המוזיאונים והמבשלות.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":"רכבת מקומית מטקאיאמה כרבע שעה, ¥240; התחנה היא גם אתר מהסרט ״השם שלך״.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5977.html","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5976.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"רחובות שטוחים, נוח עם עגלה.","local_pick":true,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Seto%20River%20and%20White-Walled%20Storehouses%20Hida%20Furukawa","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"הולכים לאורך התעלה בין המחסנים הלבנים, עוברים במקדש אנקוג׳י, וממשיכים לרחובות איצ׳ינומאצ׳י עם המבשלות וחנות הנרות.","special":"הכל במרחק הליכה של חמש דקות מהתחנה, בלי ההמון של טקאיאמה.","highlights":["מחסנים לבנים","תעלת סטו","רחוב איצ׳ינומאצ׳י"],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Ichinomachi, Furukawa-cho, Hida, Gifu","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"רכבת מקומית מטקאיאמה כרבע שעה, ¥240, חצי יום מספיק","baby_block":null,"tags":["canal","old town","storehouses","carp","white walls","historic street","your name","anime","תעלה","עיר עתיקה","מחסנים","קרפיונים","קירות לבנים","רחוב היסטורי","השם שלך","אנימה","kimi no na wa"],"en":{"hype":"A canal of about 400 m with carp, lined with white storehouses and wooden houses; the heart of small Hida-Furukawa.","reality":"The quiet version of Takayama, with almost no tourists. Everything is small and done in an hour, but worth half a day with the museums and breweries.","tip":"Local train from Takayama about 15 min, ¥240; the station is also a \"Your Name\" film spot.","baby_notes":"Flat streets, easy with a stroller.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk the canal between the white storehouses, pass Enkoji, and carry on to Ichinomachi with its breweries and candle shop.","special":"Everything is within five minutes' walk of the station, without Takayama's crowds.","highlights":["White storehouses","Seto canal","Ichinomachi street"],"time_needed":"About 1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Local train from Takayama about 15 min, ¥240; half a day is enough","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true}]$cards$::jsonb) x
where not exists (select 1 from place_library p where p.city = x.city and lower(p.name) = lower(x.name));
