kawa-cho, Hida, Gifu","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":["2026-12-31"],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":150,"booking":"required","plan_line":"להזמין באתר מראש; פועל עד 30 בדצמבר","baby_block":null,"tags":["walking tour","guided tour","english guide","local culture","town walk","סיור הליכה","סיור מודרך","מדריך באנגלית","תרבות מקומית","סיור","satoyama","סאטויאמה"],"en":{"hype":"A guided English walking tour of Furukawa's streets, by a local company that knows the people and businesses.","reality":"Pricey for a walk, but the guides open doors you would not walk through alone. Their bike rides do not run in December.","tip":"They also run a food and culture walk for ¥11,000, until 30 December.","baby_notes":"Flat streets, fine with a stroller.","price":"From ¥15,400 per person","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Meet the guide at the office near the station, walk the streets, temples and shops, and hear about town life.","special":null,"highlights":["Local English guide","Shops and craftspeople"],"time_needed":"2-3 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Book online ahead; runs until 30 December","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Shirakawa-go Ogimachi Village","name_ja":"白川郷荻町集落","city":"takayama","area":"Shirakawa-go","category":"sight","lat":36.2575,"lng":136.906,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"כפר בתי הגאשו עם גגות הקש התלולים, אתר מורשת עולמית, ובחורף מכוסה שלג עבה.","reality":"יפה כמו בתמונות, אבל בשעות היום עמוס מאוד באוטובוסים של תיירים, ורוב הבתים הם חנויות ומסעדות. בשלג זה שווה את הנסיעה.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"הכפר חינם, הבתים ¥400 כל אחד","tip":"אוטובוס נוהי מטקאיאמה כ-50 דקות; מזמינים מקום מראש בחורף.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5951.html","https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5956.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"בחורף השבילים מושלגים וחלקים, עגלה כמעט לא עוברת; מנשא.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shirakawa-go%20Ogimachi%20Village%20Shirakawa-go","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בגשר דאי-באשי, הולכים בין הבתים והשדות, נכנסים לבית אחד או שניים, ועולים לתצפית שירויאמה לתמונה של כל הכפר.","special":"הגגות התלולים בנויים להחזיק שלג כבד, וחלק מהבתים עדיין מאוכלסים.","highlights":["בית וואדה","תצפית שירויאמה","גשר דאי-באשי"],"time_needed":"חצי יום","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Ogimachi, Shirakawa, Ono District, Gifu","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":240,"booking":"recommended","plan_line":"להגיע באוטובוס הראשון לפני הקבוצות, ולהזמין אוטובוס מראש","baby_block":"שלג וקרח בשבילים, רק עם מנשא","tags":["gassho-zukuri","thatched roof","farmhouse","unesco","world heritage","village","snow","גאשו","גגות קש","בית חווה","אונסקו","אתר מורשת עולמית","כפר","שלג","day trip","טיול יום","ogimachi","אוגימאצ׳י"],"en":{"hype":"The gassho house village with steep thatched roofs, a World Heritage site, deep in snow in winter.","reality":"As pretty as the photos, but packed with tour buses by day, and most houses are shops and restaurants. In snow it is worth the trip.","tip":"Nohi bus from Takayama about 50 min; book a seat ahead in winter.","baby_notes":"In winter paths are snowy and icy; a stroller barely works, use a carrier.","price":"Village free, houses ¥400 each","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Cross Deai-bashi, walk between the houses and fields, go into one or two houses, and climb to Shiroyama Viewpoint for the whole-village shot.","special":"The steep roofs are built to carry heavy snow, and some houses are still lived in.","highlights":["Wada House","Shiroyama Viewpoint","Deai-bashi bridge"],"time_needed":"Half a day","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Take the first bus to beat the groups, and book the bus ahead","baby_block":"Snow and ice on paths, carrier only"},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Shiroyama Viewpoint","name_ja":"荻町城跡展望台","city":"takayama","area":"Shirakawa-go","category":"sight","lat":36.262,"lng":136.9072,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"התצפית מעל הכפר שממנה מצלמים את התמונה המוכרת של בתי הגאשו.","reality":"זו התמונה שבשבילה באים, אבל כולם שם באותו זמן. שאטל ב-¥300 חוסך עלייה של 15-20 דקות.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"שאטל ¥300 לכיוון","tip":"השביל ברגל עלול להיסגר בשלג כבד, ואז רק השאטל.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5951.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"השאטל נוח עם תינוק; השביל ברגל תלול.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shiroyama%20Viewpoint%20Shirakawa-go","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עולים בשאטל ליד בית וואדה, מצלמים את הכפר מלמעלה, ויורדים ברגל אם השביל פתוח.","special":null,"highlights":["נוף על כל הכפר"],"time_needed":"כחצי שעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Ogimachi, Shirakawa, Ono District, Gifu","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":30,"booking":"no","plan_line":"שאטל ¥300 ליד בית וואדה, השביל ברגל נסגר בשלג כבד","baby_block":null,"tags":["viewpoint","observation deck","view","photo spot","village view","snow","תצפית","נקודת תצפית","נוף","מקום לצילום","שלג","shuttle","שאטל","שירויאמה"],"en":{"hype":"The lookout above the village where the famous gassho photo is taken.","reality":"This is the shot people come for, but everyone is there at once. A ¥300 shuttle saves a 15-20 minute climb.","tip":"The footpath may close in heavy snow, leaving only the shuttle.","baby_notes":"The shuttle is easy with a baby; the footpath is steep.","price":"Shuttle ¥300 one way","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Take the shuttle near Wada House, photograph the village from above, and walk down if the path is open.","special":null,"highlights":["View over the whole village"],"time_needed":"About 30 minutes","kosher_note":n