ch is rare.","highlights":["Thatched hall","Bell tower"],"time_needed":"About 30 minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Winter 09:00-16:00, one ticket for temple and house","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Gassho-zukuri Minkaen","name_ja":"合掌造り民家園","city":"takayama","area":"Shirakawa-go","category":"sight","lat":36.256,"lng":136.9032,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מוזיאון פתוח עם בתי גאשו שהועברו לכאן והוצלו מהריסה, מעבר לנהר.","reality":"הרבה יותר שקט מהכפר עצמו, ונכנסים לכמה בתים בכרטיס אחד. בשלג השבילים בו יפים מאוד.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥800","tip":"בחורף סגור בימי חמישי.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5951.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"בחורף השבילים מושלגים וחלקים, עגלה כמעט לא עוברת; מנשא.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gassho-zukuri%20Minkaen%20Shirakawa-go","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"עוברים בין הבתים, נכנסים לכמה מהם, ומסתכלים על בתי החווה הקטנים והמחסנים.","special":null,"highlights":["בתי גאשו שהועברו","שבילים שקטים"],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"2499 Ogimachi, Shirakawa, Ono District, Gifu","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:00","closed_weekdays":[4],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"midday","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בדצמבר-מרץ סגור בחמישי, כניסה אחרונה 20 דקות לפני","baby_block":null,"tags":["gassho-zukuri","thatched roof","farmhouse","unesco","world heritage","village","snow","גאשו","גגות קש","בית חווה","אונסקו","אתר מורשת עולמית","כפר","שלג","open-air museum","מוזיאון פתוח","minkaen"],"en":{"hype":"An open-air museum of gassho houses moved here and saved from demolition, across the river.","reality":"Much quieter than the village itself, and one ticket gets you into several houses. The paths are lovely in snow.","tip":"Closed Thursdays in winter.","baby_notes":"In winter paths are snowy and icy; a stroller barely works, use a carrier.","price":"¥800","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Walk between the houses, go into a few, and look at the small farm buildings and storehouses.","special":null,"highlights":["Relocated gassho houses","Quiet paths"],"time_needed":"About 1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Dec-Mar closed Thursdays, last entry 20 minutes before close","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Deai-bashi Bridge","name_ja":"であい橋","city":"takayama","area":"Shirakawa-go","category":"sight","lat":36.2565,"lng":136.9042,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"גשר תלוי מעל נהר שו, שמחבר את אזור החניה לכפר.","reality":"עוברים בו בכל מקרה, והנוף על הנהר וההרים המושלגים יפה. לא יעד בפני עצמו.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חינם","tip":null,"sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5951.html"],"audience":"baby","baby_notes":"הגשר מתנדנד מעט, בשלג חלק.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Deai-bashi%20Bridge%20Shirakawa-go","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"חוצים את הגשר, עוצרים באמצע לנוף על הנהר ונכנסים לכפר.","special":null,"highlights":["נוף על נהר שו"],"time_needed":"כמה דקות","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Ogimachi, Shirakawa, Ono District, Gifu","opens":null,"closes":null,"closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"any","visit_mins":10,"booking":"no","plan_line":"בדרך לכפר, אין צורך לתכנן","baby_block":null,"tags":["bridge","suspension bridge","river","view","snow","photo spot","גשר","גשר תלוי","נהר","נוף","שלג","מקום לצילום"],"en":{"hype":"A suspension bridge over the Sho River linking the parking area to the village.","reality":"You cross it anyway, and the view of the river and snowy hills is nice. Not a destination on its own.","tip":null,"baby_notes":"The bridge sways a bit and is slippery in snow.","price":"Free","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Cross, stop halfway for the river view, and walk into the village.","special":null,"highlights":["Sho River view"],"time_needed":"A few minutes","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"On the way into the village, no need to plan","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Shirakawa-go no Yu","name_ja":"白川郷の湯","city":"takayama","area":"Shirakawa-go","category":"experience","lat":36.2555,"lng":136.9053,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מרחץ אונסן בתוך הכפר, עם מים חמים אחרי יום בשלג.","reality":"הדרך היחידה לטבול באונסן בכפר בלי לישון בו. פשוט ונקי, לא מקום מיוחד.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥800","tip":"סגור בימי חמישי ובימי רביעי השני והרביעי בחודש.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5951.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shirakawa-go%20no%20Yu%20Shirakawa-go","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"טובלים במרחצאות המופרדים לגברים ולנשים, מתחממים ויוצאים חזרה לאוטובוס.","special":null,"highlights":["מרחץ חם אחרי השלג"],"time_needed":"כשעה","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"337 Ogimachi, Shirakawa, Ono District, Gifu","opens":"07:00","closes":"21:00","closed_weekdays":[4],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":60,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור בחמישי ובשני ימי רביעי בחודש","baby_block":null,"tags":["onsen","hot spring","bath","public bath","sento","winter","אונסן","מעיין חם","מרחץ","מרחץ ציבורי","חורף","רחצה","hot springs","מעיינות חמים"],"en":{"hype":"An onsen bath inside the village, hot water after a day in the snow.","reality":"The only way to soak in the village without staying over. Simple and clean, nothing special.","tip":"Closed Thursdays and the 2nd and 4th Wednesdays.","baby_notes":null,"price":"¥800","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Soak in the gender-separated baths, warm up and head back to the bus.","special":null,"highlights":["Hot soak after the snow"],"time_needed":"About 1 hour","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed Thursdays and two Wednesdays a month","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Shirakawa-go Winter Light-up","name_ja":"白川郷ライトアップ","city":"takayama","area":"Shirakawa-go","category":"experience","lat":36.2575,"lng":136.906,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"בארבעה ערבים בינואר הכפר המושלג מואר בלילה, אחת התמונות הכי מפורסמות של יפן בחורף.","reality":"יפה מאוד, אבל רק בהזמנה מראש, עם חנייה, סיור או לינה, ובלי אוטובוס רגיל. ב-2027 התאריכים 11, 17, 24 ו-31 בינואר, 17:30-19:30, לא בדצמבר.","verdict":"worth_it","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"חנייה ¥7,000-10,000 לרכב; סיורים במחיר נפרד","tip":"הדרך הקלה היא סיור אוטובוס מטקאיאמה; ההזמנות נפתחות באוקטובר.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5956.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":"קור עמוק מתחת לאפס ושבילים חשוכים עם תעלות פתוחות.","local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shirakawa-go%20Winter%20Light-up%20Shirakawa-go","website_url":null,"serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"מגיעים בסיור או ברכב עם חנייה שמורה, מסתובבים בכפר המואר, ומי שיש לו כרטיס עולה לתצפית שירויאמה בזמן שנקבע לו.","special":null,"highlights":["הכפר המואר בשלג","תצפית שירויאמה בלילה"],"time_needed":"כשעתיים","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"Ogimachi, Shirakawa, Ono District, Gifu","opens":"17:30","closes":"19:30","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"night","visit_mins":120,"booking":"required","plan_line":"רק ב-11, 17, 24, 31 בינואר 2027, הזמנה מראש חובה","baby_block":"קור עז ושבילים חשוכים, לא לתינוק","tags":["light-up","illumination","night","winter","snow","event","gassho-zukuri","תאורה","הארה","לילה","חורף","שלג","אירוע","גאשו","lightup","winter illumination"],"en":{"hype":"On four January evenings the snowy village is lit at night, one of Japan's most famous winter images.","reality":"Beautiful, but only with advance booking (parking, a tour or a stay), and no regular 