nsengo, Takayama, Gifu","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:15","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"morning","visit_mins":150,"booking":"no","plan_line":"רק ביום בהיר; אוטובוס מטקאיאמה כשעה וחצי","baby_block":null,"tags":["ropeway","cable car","gondola","mountain","alps","view","snow","observation deck","רכבל","גונדולה","הר","הרים","האלפים","נוף","שלג","מרפסת תצפית","northern alps","האלפים הצפוניים"],"en":{"hype":"A ropeway with double-decker cars up to about 2,150 m, to a deck facing the Northern Alps peaks.","reality":"On a clear day the snowy peaks are stunning; on a cloudy one you see nothing and pay ¥3,800. Very cold up top in winter.","tip":"Check the live camera on the website in the morning; it stops in strong wind.","baby_notes":"Covered cars and stations; very cold up top, dress the baby warmly.","price":"¥3,800 return","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Take the first ropeway, switch to the double-decker second one, and step out on the top-station deck. There is a restaurant and shop up there.","special":"The only ropeway in Japan with double-decker cars.","highlights":["Double-decker car","Observation deck","Alps view"],"time_needed":"2-3 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Clear days only; bus from Takayama about 1.5 hours","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hirayu no Mori","name_ja":"ひらゆの森","city":"takayama","area":"Okuhida","category":"experience","lat":36.1855,"lng":137.5555,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מתחם אונסן ביער בהיראיו, עם הרבה מרחצאות פתוחים ליד תחנת האוטובוס.","reality":"הכי נוח וזול לטבילה בדרך לרכבל או חזרה: ¥700, בלי צורך להזמין. המרחצאות הפתוחים בשלג יפים.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"¥700","tip":"יש גם מרחץ פרטי ב-¥3,000 ל-45 דקות, 12:00-15:00.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5942.html","https://www.hirayunomori.co.jp/"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes":null,"local_pick":false,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hirayu%20no%20Mori%20Okuhida%20Takayama","website_url":"https://www.hirayunomori.co.jp/","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"טובלים במרחצאות הפנימיים, ויוצאים למרחצאות הפתוחים בין העצים המושלגים.","special":null,"highlights":["מרחצאות פתוחים ביער","מרחץ פרטי"],"time_needed":"שעה-שעה וחצי","kosher":null,"kosher_note":null,"address":"763-1 Hirayu, Okuhida Onsengo, Takayama, Gifu","opens":"10:00","closes":"21:00","closed_weekdays":[],"closed_dates":[],"open_dates":[],"best_time":"afternoon","visit_mins":75,"booking":"no","plan_line":"סגור 30.11-11.12; מחוץ לזה פתוח כל יום 10:00-21:00","baby_block":null,"tags":["onsen","hot spring","open-air bath","rotenburo","bath","snow","אונסן","מעיין חם","מרחץ פתוח","רוטנבורו","מרחץ","שלג","מעיינות חמים","hirayu","היראיו"],"en":{"hype":"A forest onsen complex in Hirayu, with many open-air baths near the bus terminal.","reality":"The easiest and cheapest soak on the way to or from the ropeway: ¥700, no booking. The outdoor baths in snow are lovely.","tip":"There is also a private bath, ¥3,000 for 45 minutes, 12:00-15:00.","baby_notes":null,"price":"¥700","serves":null,"dishes":[],"todo":"Soak in the indoor baths, then head out to the open-air baths among the snowy trees.","special":null,"highlights":["Forest open-air baths","Private bath"],"time_needed":"1-1.5 hours","kosher_note":null,"plan_line":"Closed 30 Nov-11 Dec; otherwise daily 10:00-21:00","baby_block":null},"facts_at":"2026-11-09","facts_sure":true},{"name":"Hirayu Minzokukan","name_ja":"平湯民俗館","city":"takayama","area":"Okuhida","category":"experience","lat":36.188,"lng":137.5598,"coord_precision":"approx","hype":"מרחץ פתוח קטן בבית עממי ישן בהיראיו, בתרומה של ¥300 בערך.","reality":"פשוט מאוד, בלי מקלחות, אבל אותנטי וכמעט חינם. טוב לטבילה קצרה בין אוטובוסים.","verdict":"gem","tabelog_score":null,"google_score":null,"price":"תרומה מוצעת ¥300","tip":"אין מקלחות, להביא מגבת.","sources":["https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e5942.html"],"audience":"adults","baby_notes